window.AKK_ANCIENT_MISS_CEO_WIFE_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_ANCIENT_MISS_CEO_WIFE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1,"title":"Chapter 1: Time Travel","paragraphs":["Shen Yin opened her eyes to find herself lying in a large tub filled with water. She coughed a few times, feeling a little disoriented. She remembered jumping into the lake in the back garden of the Duke's Mansion, so how could she have ascended to heaven? She tried hard to recall what had just happened.","She was unwilling to marry the 37-year-old Prince who had a bad temper and had even abused his former wife. She planned to threaten her father with death in order to make him change his mind. She had arranged for people to be by the lake to save her, hoping to use a desperate measure to appeal to her father's conscience. She didn't expect to really die.","Shen Yin was unclear about where she was. The water in the white tub was cool. She dragged her heavy body up with difficulty and stood up. A few images instantly flashed through her mind - a woman with a graceful figure and delicate features lying in a white tub, slowly submerging her head in the water. Her face was full of anguish and some bubbles emerged from the water. Soon, the water surface became still and the woman was completely immersed in the water without moving.","Shen Yin was a little shocked. This woman was clearly drowning herself. This was the same tub she had just been lying in. She was puzzled again, unsure of where she was and whether there was any danger. She walked forward a few steps and saw a mirror that was brighter and clearer than the copper one in her bedroom.","The woman in the mirror had delicate features and skin as smooth as cream. She was clearly the woman Shen Yin had just seen in her mind. Shen Yin touched her own face and the woman in the mirror made the same movement. She thought she must be dreaming and pinched her arm, feeling obvious pain. It took her a long time to realize that her spirit had possessed this woman's body, just like in the stories.","It took Shen Yin a very long time to force herself to calm down and accept this fact.","She vaguely heard a knock on the door. Shen Yin fumbled to put on the white bathrobe next to her and went to open the door. Just like when she opened the bathroom door, she tried pushing the door handle down but still couldn't open it. After studying it for a while, she saw a button below the handle. She turned it for a long time before the door finally opened.","\"Mistress, I called you so many times this afternoon but you didn't open the door. You haven't eaten anything all day. Please come down and eat something,\" said the woman in her forties at the door, dressed neatly with her hair pinned strictly at the back.","Having lived 16 complicated years in the Duke's Mansion, Shen Yin still had some judgement. She nodded and closed the door. Looking around, the room was very messy with bedding and pillows scattered on the floor. Turning her head, she saw another door beside the bathroom. Driven by curiosity, she went over and opened it. The closet was filled with clothes and some strange bags at the bottom. But she didn't recognize any of these things. Everything here was unfamiliar to her. The life here was completely different than her own.","Recalling what the woman at the door was wearing, Shen Yin took out a long dress from the closet and put it on. It exposed her arms and legs and the bulge across her chest was too pronounced for her, a young unmarried girl, to accept.","She then found a white overcoat in the closet and put it on before feeling satisfied to go out.","The house was huge. Shen Yin walked down the stairs to the living room and saw people talking in a large black frame. Shen Yin was afraid; she didn't know how they had gotten in there. She stood stiffly by the sofa to appear calm.","\"Mistress, I have the TV remote control here. Let me know if you want to watch something different and I'll change the channel,\" Aunt Song handed her the remote control. Shen Yin took it but didn't change the channel.","Reasons: She didn't know how to use it and didn't dare to act rashly. Besides, Shen Yin was very curious about how those people had managed to enter the large black box called a television.","\"Mistress, let's eat. I'll go upstairs to bring the young master down,\" Aunt Song said before heading upstairs.","The kitchen auntie brought dinner of four dishes and one soup to the dining table.","Sitting at the dining table, Shen Yin was trying to adapt to this new environment. She sat with a dignified posture and graceful manners.","Although she was not favored by her stepmother, Shen Yin received all the etiquette and treatment due to a young lady in a duke's household as fitting to her mother's noble family background. Her uncle had been framed by villains two years ago, leading her grandfather to decide that the entire family would resign from government service and return to their hometown. Otherwise, how could her stepmother Xu Zhen dare to target her?","When Aunt Song carried the 2-year-old Xu Yunzheng down the stairs, she saw Shen Yin sitting at the dining table as if waiting to eat together.","Aunt Song felt this was strange since Shen Yin would never wait for people to eat. Shen Yin always gave a haughty impression with a gloomy expression, ignoring her servants and unwilling to dine with the young master. Whenever Aunt Song called her for a meal, Shen Yin either didn't come or left immediately after eating. Shen Yin rarely even spoke to her husband Xu Xiuhe. Except for having a child, the married couple basically had no connection.","However, Aunt Song knew one thing: Shen Yin greatly disliked Yunzheng, one could even say she hated him.","Xu Xiuhe had attempted to make Shen Yin assume some maternal responsibility, but it seemed to have had the opposite effect.","Aunt Song placed Yunzheng in the highchair beside the dining table. Shen Yin curiously looked at him and their eyes met, prompting Shen Yin to give a slight smile which scared Aunt Song immensely.","For some unknown reason, the 2-year-old milk baby suddenly burst into loud cries. Her cries were so distressing that Aunt Song hurriedly picked Yunzheng up from the chair to soothe him.","It was difficult to endure the meal. Shen Yin ate a few bites and then returned to the sofa to watch television. Aunt Song carried Yunzheng upstairs to his nursery and didn't come out.","After the meal, Shen Yin seemed to have a clearer grasp of her own identity—she was married with a child; but it was obvious that she wasn't well-liked in this family. Shen Yin could clearly feel Aunt Song's dislike of her, yet she had to pretend all was normal.","She believed that this thing called television could provide more knowledge for her to better understand this world, so Shen Yin planned to make up for her lack of knowledge.","At two o'clock in the morning, having watched television dramas, advertisements and so on for six or seven hours, Shen Yin had gained much more understanding about this era. She learned that what she lived in previously—the Dasheng Dynasty—was termed \"ancient\" for them, while this modern era had far more advanced things like the television and mobile phones on television.","Shen Yin now knew how to use the remote control to switch channels one by one. Just then the front door was opened by someone outside and a man dressed in black came in.","The man seemed surprised to see Shen Yin and gave no greeting before heading upstairs.","Upstairs had many rooms. The huge master bedroom had an ensuite bathroom, walk-in closets, a dressing room, and direct access into the nursery, which also had an outer door. After the incident two months ago, Xu Xiuhe had someone block off the outer nursery door so that the only way to enter the baby's room was through the master bedroom.","When Xu Xiuhe entered the master bedroom, he saw that the open door led to the nursery and Aunt Song immediately came out after hearing his door open.","\"Aunt Song, why aren't you sleeping this late? What is going on with my wife sitting in the living room so late?\"","\"Sir, you're back! Today the mistress was acting a bit strange. She smiled at the young master again. Last time she did that she then abused the young master. His pinch marks had just disappeared. Don't tell me new ones are going to be added!\" Aunt Song anxiously replied.","Xu Xiuhe let Aunt Song return to rest and pondered for a moment. His marriage to Shen Yin was a commercial arrangement. When his company was just starting out, Shen Yin's family proposed a mutually beneficial marriage alliance which Xu Xiuhe accepted.","Shen Yin had an older brother. In Xu Xiuhe's view, it was tragic that a woman had to marry a stranger for her family's benefit. Just after their wedding, he had thought that aside from lacking love, Shen Yin would have everything a wife should have. But now, he had to reconsider divorcing her.","Xu Xiuhe dialed his phone, \"Hello Dad, I think you should bring Shen Yin to see a psychologist again tomorrow.\"","\"Xiuhe, why are you calling so late? Did Shen Yin make trouble again?\" Shen's Father asked without a trace of sleepiness and a tinge of wariness.","\"Not yet, but no guarantee nothing will happen later.\"","Xu Xiuhe walked into Xu Yunzheng's room. The little milk baby was sleeping soundly on the bed. Yunzheng's nose looked a lot like Shen Yin's, straight and refined. His eyebrows and eyes were all in his image. Xu Xiuhe squatted down and stroked Yunzheng's forehead.","The little milk baby whimpered twice, pursed his lips, then quietly went back to sleep. The two-year-old darling had just learned to walk by himself recently. He could say some simple words, call out \"daddy\", say that he wanted to eat, ask to be held, but he had never called out \"mommy\" before.","Xu Xiuhe felt a little distressed for Yunzheng. His company was no longer what it used to be. Others only saw that his company had surpassed many large enterprises and conglomerates in three years, but they did not know that he often worked overtime until one or two o'clock in the morning before going home, and naturally did not spend much time accompanying Yunzheng.","Ever since giving birth to Yunzheng, Shen Yin had depression and never cared about or asked about the child. She even felt disgusted by her own son. So from his birth until now, only Aunt Song had been taking care of Yunzheng. Xu Xiuhe kissed the baby's forehead and quietly left the room without closing the door.","Shen Yin was clever to begin with. After watching TV all night, she also had some understanding of this era. Around 6 am, Shen Yin really could not stay awake any longer and wanted to go back to the room to sleep. When she went upstairs, she saw Aunt Song coming out of the room.","\"Madam, have you been up all night? Do you want something to eat?\" Although reluctant, Aunt Song still asked.","\"No need, thanks.\" Shen Yin replied.","Now it was Aunt Song's turn to be surprised. It was the first time in three years that the madam had said \"thank you\" to her.","Aunt Song was still stunned when Xu Xiuhe came downstairs and asked what had happened.","Aunt Song told Xu Xiuhe about what had just occurred.","Xu Xiuhe thought for a moment: “Aunt Song, pay more attention. This afternoon, her father should come to pick up the madam to see the doctor.\"","\"Yes, sir.\" Aunt Song responded.","\"Are you having breakfast at home, sir? Health is important. Drink less coffee, or you'll ruin your health.\" Aunt Song nagged.","Thinking of the two-year-old little milk baby, Xu Xiuhe decided to have breakfast with him at home this morning.","In the dining room, Yunzheng sat in a baby chair, babbling sounds from his mouth “Daddy, daddy, want meat, no veggies.\" The little darling shook his head while his eyes looked at the meat on the plate.","Hearing the little milk voice, Aunt Song's heart almost melted. Xu Xiuhe also shed his usual coldness and used chopsticks to put a shrimp ball into Yunzheng’s small bowl.","Seeing this, Aunt Song sighed to herself again. If only the madam did not dislike the young master."]},{"number":2,"title":"Chapter 2: See a Doctor","paragraphs":["At two o'clock in the afternoon, Aunt Song knocked on Shen Yin's door, knocking for a good while before Shen Yin groggily opened the door.","\"Sorry, I fell asleep,\" Shen Yin rubbed her eyes to wake up.","These words frightened Aunt Song again, and she forgot what she was knocking on the door for. She stood there in a daze for a few seconds before remembering.","\"Madam, your brother is waiting for you downstairs. You need to go see the doctor today.\" As Aunt Song spoke, she glanced at the room and noticed it was tidier than usual.","After Aunt Song left, Shen Yin contemplated for a moment. The doctor was probably Dasheng's physician. Could it be that she had some incurable illness, so she went to seek death?","Shen Yin went to the wardrobe, unsure of what to wear. She tried hard to remember the outfits worn by women on TV. She took off the dress she had worn yesterday, put on a bra and white shirt, black skinny jeans, then put on a khaki coat before going downstairs.","As soon as she got downstairs, she saw the brother Aunt Song had mentioned. Shen Yin didn't know what the previous Shen Yin was like, so she didn't dare greet him first just to be safe.","\"You're down. Let's go,\" Shen Lv said expressionlessly.","Shen Yin followed behind Shen Lv, intending to head out.","\"Madam, madam, change your shoes!\" Aunt Song called out from behind.","Shen Yin looked at her slippers. She had seen shoes on TV that were all kept in shoe cabinets by the door, but there was no cabinet near the front door here. She didn't see any shoes in her room either. However, there was a small door beside the main door. Shen Yin carefully opened it and indeed, inside were many, many shoes.","It seemed this family was very wealthy to have a dedicated shoe room. Shen Yin picked a pair of white high heels to put on before leaving the shoe room.","\"Didn't you always dislike high heels before?\" Shen Lv asked.","In Shen Lv's impression, Shen Yin never wore high heels. At 168 cm tall, once Shen Yin put on high heels she was immediately 175 cm. High heels didn't really suit her.","\"I felt like it,\" Shen Yin replied.","Before Shen Yin came to this place from Dasheng, women in Dasheng wore shoes with wooden heels. So when she was picking shoes earlier, she chose a high-heeled pair.","Shen Yin followed Shen Lv into the car. She had seen this kind of car on TV that could go very fast and carry several people.","Sitting in the back seat, Shen Yin looked around eagerly. As the car drove along, Shen Yin gained new insights. This car was much faster and more stable than the carriages of Dasheng Dynasty, without any bumps.","Shen Yin couldn't help but marvel at the advanced technology of this era. Outside the car windows were tall buildings and many cars filling the wide roads. She didn't know if she could return to Dasheng. If not, she wanted to live in this era and would need to learn many things, like driving this car.","As he drove, Shen Lv observed Shen Yin from the rearview mirror in the top right corner. He didn't dare speak much, afraid of agitating her.","The car stopped in an underground parking lot beneath a tall building. After parking, Shen Lv got out and opened the rear door.","\"Ancestors! Now you won't even open a car door yourself?\" Shen Lv said, looking helpless.","Shen Yin got out of the car and followed Shen Lv towards the elevator entrance. Arriving at the elevator, Shen Lv glanced at Shen Yin's outfit today which finally resembled her pre-wedding style.","Ever since marrying, Shen Yin had let herself go, not to mention after getting pregnant. She hardly looked like a woman anymore.","Shen Lv knew Shen Yin resented him for forcing her to marry Xu Xiuhe together with her father, and for knowing her father had drugged her on their wedding night but not telling her.","In the elevator, Shen Yin was still observing these modern things while Shen Lv observed her. He could clearly sense Shen Yin's animosity wasn't as heavy today. She didn't glare at him or argue with him.","48th floor, Counseling Office.","Seeing these five words, Shen Yin was a little confused. Wasn't it said they were seeing a doctor, so why were they here? It seemed she still didn't understand this era. She must watch more TV when she gets back to gain knowledge.","\"Go into this room. I'll wait out here for you. Come out when you're done,\" Shen Lv said before sitting on a chair outside the door, crossing his legs and taking out his phone.","That morning by the bedside, Shen Yin had seen her own mobile phone and knew it would be very convenient for communicating with people far away, but she didn't really know how to use it. So instead of going straight into the room, she stood by Shen Lv's side watching him play on his phone.","\"Madam! You standing here scared me to death. Why don't you go in?\" Shen Lv immediately covered his phone. He was instantaneously a little guilty.","\"Did you see anything?\" Shen Lv asked again. He was afraid Shen Yin had seen him chatting with several women.","Shen Yin didn't reply but turned and entered the room.","Shen Yin tried her best not to look around and kept reminding herself that this wasn't Dasheng. Don't speak, or you'll easily give yourself away.","She did her utmost to conceal her nervousness, but Ji Qingyan still noticed.","\"We meet again, Miss Shen.\" The corners of Ji Qingyan's mouth turned up slightly as she tried to appear gentler.","\"I feel Miss Shen is in much better condition today, so much better than last time. Have you come to terms with some things?\" Ji Qingyan asked again.","Xu Xiuhe realized Shen Yin needed to see a psychologist a month after Xu Yunzheng was born. At first he just noticed Shen Yin was unhappy, often crying alone and prone to throwing things. Later he discovered Shen Yin was extremely averse to Zhengzheng, in an unhealthy way.","So Xu Xiuhe contacted Shen Yin's father to ask why she detested Zhengzheng so much, wondering if she disliked having a child.","Upon hearing this, the Shen family was so frightened they immediately brought Shen Yin back home to see a psychologist.","The Shen family brought Shen Yin here once a month, except the first time when Shen Yin's father accompanied her. All other times it was the family driver who picked her up and dropped her off.","Ji Qingyan had seen Shen Yin over 20 times. Shen Yin was resistant towards Ji Qingyan at first, then resigned and compromised. It wasn't until a year ago that Shen Yin first spoke.","Ji Qingyan had only met Shen Yin's father once, when he told her Shen Yin's mind went abnormal after giving birth. She initially thought it was simply postpartum depression.","But Shen Yin didn't speak for a whole year, and Ji Qingyan was about to give up, feeling her presence was just to offer some encouraging words.","A year of companionship can truly move someone. Shen Yin said, \"I don't like men. My father forced me to marry a man.\"","Only then did Ji Qingyan have a sudden realization. So Shen Yin was a lesbian. She slowly counselled her and conducted psychological treatment. Shen Yin gradually improved as she spoke more and more.","For instance, Shen Yin said she liked a woman and they were about to be together when Shen Yin's father found out. With his traditional, conservative beliefs, he absolutely refused to agree. So he schemed for ways to prevent it.","In the end, he found a decent man to marry her off to. If word got out that a daughter of the prestigious Shen family of Rong City was a lesbian, how would Shen Yin's father keep face?","Afterwards, afraid Shen Yin would disobey, her father drugged her on her wedding night and had Shen Lv get some friends to get Xu Xiuhe drunk. And so Zhengzheng was conceived.","When Ji Qingyan learned the full reasons, she counselled Shen Yin on fundamental issues and provided psychological treatment. The effects gradually improved, though seemed to regress slightly the last two times.","Ji Qingyan felt Shen Yin's condition today was truly better, so she asked again, \"Miss Shen, how have you been feeling lately?\"","Hearing the repeated questioning, Shen Yin finally responded, \"Alright.\"","\"Next, just like before, I'll ask questions and you answer them,\" said Ji Qingyan.","Hearing to answer questions like before, Shen Yin grew nervous. After all, she wasn't the real Shen Yin and knew nothing. What could she do?","She tried hard to conceal her anxiety but Ji Qingyan still noticed.","\"Don't be nervous, Miss Shen. The questions will be like before, not difficult. Just answer according to your own thoughts. I'm going to start asking now,\" said Ji Qingyan.","Shen Yin nodded in agreement.","\"What does Miss Shen enjoy doing lately?\"","Shen Yin contemplated. She didn't know what the previous Shen Yin liked doing, but having watched TV all of last night until now, she answered that she enjoyed watching TV.","Hearing this reply astonished Ji Qingyan. Shen Yin's previous responses were always that there was nothing she enjoyed.","\"What programs does Miss Shen watch?\" Ji Qingyan asked again.","\"Look at everything.\"","\"So Miss Shen, have you opened up now and let go of that girl?\"","When Shen Yin heard these words, she obtained a lot of information. It turned out the original Shen Yin had someone she liked, and it was even another woman. This was a bit beyond Shen Yin's cognitive range.","There were men in the Dasheng Dynasty who liked other men, but she had never heard of women liking other women.","Shen Yin was still digesting this issue and didn't hear what Ji Qingyan said next.","In Ji Qingyan's eyes, Shen Yin was still contemplating this problem.","\"Let me put it another way, do you have hope for your future life? Do you want to live a normal life?\" Ji Qingyan kept observing Shen Yin's facial expressions.","\"I want to live a normal life.\" Shen Yin replied.","Ji Qingyan already felt victory was right in front of her. She asked some more questions before ending the questioning.","Shen Yin's performance this time made Ji Qingyan feel like her condition was slowly improving. Next she did some other psychological treatments before ending the session.","Ji Qingyan decided to meet Shen Yin's family this time. So she escorted Shen Yin to the door.","At the door, Shen Lv was playing games on his phone. Seeing the door open, he immediately stood up.","\"Are you Shen Yin's...?\" Ji Qingyan paused for a moment to avoid embarrassment from asking the wrong thing, so she only asked half the question.","When Shen Lv saw Ji Qingyan he instantly felt this trip hadn't been a waste of time. He really liked beautiful women.","\"Hello, I'm Shen Lv, her older brother,\" he said, stretching out his hand to shake hers.","\"What do I call you?\" Shen Lv asked again.","\"Ji Qingyan.\"","\"Doctor Ji! I'd like to ask about my sister's condition,\" Shen Lv said while looking at Ji Qingyan's face.","Ji Qingyan felt a little flustered by his gaze. Shen Lv's eyes were too ill-intentioned. She was thinking about how to make her words sound more professional.","\"Doctor Ji, how about this. I also have something to do later, could I add your WeChat? We can talk about Shen Yin's matters tonight.\" Shen Lv took out his phone and opened up the scan code function.","Although Ji Qingyan didn't want to add Shen Lv, he was still a patient's family member asking about conditions, so she couldn't refuse. She opened up her QR code.","Shen Yin didn't know what they were doing. She only knew that cell phones could make transmitting messages more convenient. It seemed that when she returned, she would have to thoroughly research cell phones and watch more TV."]},{"number":3,"title":"Chapter 3: Eat","paragraphs":["In the CEO's office, Xu Xiuhe was reviewing documents when Liu Assistant walked in.","\"Boss, Aunt Song just sent word that Madam has seen the doctor and returned home,\" said Liu Assistant.","\"Did she say anything else?\" asked Xu Xiuhe.","\"She said that it wasn't the Shen family's driver who took Madam to see the doctor today, but Shen Lv's older brother,\" Liu Assistant replied.","\"Alright, take the documents out with you,\" Xu Xiuhe continued instructing.","The spacious office was left with only Xu Xiuhe again. He took out his phone and dialed.","\"Hello, Chairman Shen. I heard you personally took Shen Lv to the hospital today,\" said Xu Xiuhe.","\"Oh, Chairman Xu's information is indeed well-informed,\" Shen Lv's voice over the phone was mocking.","\"Let's be serious. How is Shen Lv's condition?\" Xu Xiuhe's expression was solemn.","Shen Lv also became serious and relayed the news Ji Qingyan had just given him.","After listening, Xu Xiuhe still couldn't quite believe it. He didn't notice Shen Lv's condition improving, nor did he believe she could recover after a few more treatments.","Still not understanding, Xu Xiuhe nevertheless decided to go home and see for himself. He put on his coat, picked up his briefcase, and headed out.","\"Liu Assistant, I'm leaving,\" said Xu Xiuhe.","Liu Assistant thought he was leaving briefly for something and didn't have time to ask if he needed anything prepared. Just as he was about to ask,","Xu Xiuhe saw Liu Assistant's confusion and said, \"No need to prepare anything, I'm going home.\"","\"Yes, boss,\" Liu Assistant replied, but he was already shocked 180 times over. When did the CEO ever leave work at 3pm?","\"On second thought, give me the keys. I'll drive myself home,\" said Xu Xiuhe, taking the keys from Liu Assistant's hands and leaving.","In the Weiyuan Group work chat:","[Did I see wrongly? Did the CEO just go home?]","[But why didn't Liu Assistant leave too?]","[Could it be the CEO went back to handle extremely private matters?]","[Why didn't he bring Liu Assistant? I totally ship them! Liu Assistant is super meticulous, the CEO is so domineering!]","[Ahem ahem, watch your words. The CEO is a married man.]","[Speaking of which, what does the CEO's wife look like? Is she pretty?]","[Liu Assistant has probably seen her since he often goes to the CEO's house to pick him up.]","[Who's close with Liu Assistant? Can someone try asking him sometime?]","Liu Assistant had previously joined this chat under a pseudonym. Seeing the messages becoming more outrageous and being dragged into it, he had to defend himself with the pseudonym:","[Don't you guys think Liu Assistant is also very handsome? And very coldly arrogant.]","Right after sending it, the message got flooded away. No one agreed with his opinion at all.","Annoyed, he went out directly to monitor them working diligently.","Xu Xiuhe had already arrived home. After parking the car and going inside, he saw Shen Lv sitting on the living room sofa watching TV again.","Xu Xiuhe went into the kitchen and saw Aunt Li washing vegetables. \"Auntie Li, why aren't Aunt Song and Ziyue in the living room?\" he asked.","\"They were at first, but after Madam came back, Young Master saw Madam and cried again. So Aunt Song took Young Master upstairs,\" explained Aunt Li.","Xu Xiuhe went upstairs to play with Ziyue for a while before going to the study to continue working.","But when he turned on the computer, he couldn't get into a working mood at all. He might as well go accompany Ziyue instead.","Carrying Ziyue to the living room, Xu Xiuhe was about to put him down on the carpet when Ziyue saw Shen Lv sitting on the sofa and clung to Xu Xiuhe in fear.","Shen Lv didn't understand why the baby was so afraid of her. Could she have done something before to traumatize him?","But the baby was so cute. She wanted to pinch his chubby little cheeks.","\"It's okay, Ziyue. Daddy's here,\" said Xu Xiuhe, patting Ziyue's head.","Ziyue looked at Shen Lv again before feeling assured enough to play with his toys on the carpet.","Xu Xiuhe built blocks with Ziyue on the carpet while Shen Lv sat on the sofa watching TV. The family of three presented a harmonious and beautiful scene in the living room.","Watching them, Aunt Song standing in the kitchen doorway felt a little dizzy. If only it could always be like this, how wonderful would that be?","In the kitchen, Aunt Li had started cooking more dishes since Xu Xiuhe came home early today.","Sour and spicy cucumber strips, scallion oil lettuce, shrimp and winter melon shreds, fish head beancurd soup, sweet and sour pork ribs, and brown stewed chicken. All were ordinary home cooked dishes.","Not having eaten all day except for some fruit after seeing the doctor and returning home in the afternoon, Shen Lv was starving by now.","\"Sir, Madam, dinner is ready,\" Aunt Song called out from the dining room.","Shen Lv got up and walked to the dining room, looking over the dishes on the table. She didn't pick up her chopsticks until Xu Xiuhe and Ziyue were seated in the dining room.","Xu Xiuhe noticed this detail. Indeed, Shen Lv was no longer the sort to only think of herself yet be extremely decadent, as Shen Lv had said.","Ziyue's little voice kept asking for \"meat meat\" as usual.","\"Ziyue, you've already eaten a lot of meat. Eating more greens is good for your health,\" said Xu Xiuhe with a serious expression.","Standing by the side, Aunt Song felt distressed again, wanting to just let Ziyue eat as much as he wanted. But the master and mistress were present so she didn't dare speak up.","\"Aunt Song, who usually cooks?\" Shen Lv put down her chopsticks and asked.","\"It's Aunt Li. She's in charge of buying groceries and cooking usually. I mainly take care of Young Master,\" Aunt Song replied.","\"Aunt Li, this lettuce is stir-fried quite old and bitter. No wonder Ziyue doesn't like eating it,\" said Shen Lv, looking towards Aunt Li who had just come out of the kitchen.","Xu Xiuhe didn't know what Shen Lv was thinking, but since she was willing to manage these things it was for the best. He focused on eating.","\"Also, for buying groceries, isn't it always Aunt Li? How come you're buying all these less fresh ingredients now? They're quite expensive,\" Shen Lv questioned again.","Aunt Li was flustered now. She had never liked Shen Lv in the first place, shirking her wifely and motherly responsibilities every day, throwing tantrums about not eating, and putting on airs to everyone. She disliked her even more now.","\"Madam, these are all fresh. Since you don't go out, you may not know, but I buy the best at the supermarket,\" Aunt Li replied.","Shen Lv didn't know what to do next. Xu Xiuhe had stopped eating as soon as he heard the ingredients weren't fresh. He had also picked out all the dishes for Ziyue.","\"Aunt Song, calculate Aunt Li's pay and find a new cook. What should we do with these dishes?\" said Xu Xiuhe.","\"Should we dump them?\" asked Aunt Song.","\"Yes, dump them,\" said Xu Xiuhe. Then picking up Ziyue, he added \"I'm taking Ziyue out to eat. Are you coming or not?\"","Shen Lv was nearly frenzied internally. She hadn't eaten all day and was starving to death. Now the food was being dumped while he was asking if she wanted to go out to eat instead of directly taking her along. Shen Lv got up from her chair, not wanting to humor this man. She walked towards the front door to get her shoes on.","Xu Xiuhe also went out carrying Ziyue.","Only Aunt Song and Aunt Li were left in the kitchen.","\"Auntie Li, your pay isn't low, is it? Why are you still trying to skim money from buying groceries? How could you be so unwise?\"","\"Sister, please help me. I beg you. I feel like the ingredients weren't spoiled and were cheap. Please help me just this once. I won't do it again,\" pleaded Aunt Li, grabbing Aunt Song's arm.","\"The master is good to us, providing food and lodging. You brought this upon yourself. I can't help you. Pack up and get ready to leave,\" said Aunt Song resolutely.","Outside the villa,","\"You wait here. I'll bring the car around,\" said Xu Xiuhe.","Carrying Ziyue, Xu Xiuhe went to the garage and picked a car with a baby seat. He secured Ziyue in the baby seat before driving over.","He stopped the car next to Shen Lv and opened the passenger door for her to get in.","This was a villa district with only 5 villas. Not many people lived here, just one supermarket selling daily necessities. It was a city built specifically for Ziyue Manor residents. The entire district was very big with even better green spaces and facilities than a public park.","Xu Xiuhe drove for quite a long time before stopping at the opening of an alleyway. Carrying Ziyue, he walked into the alley.","Shen Lv didn't know where this was and silently followed behind father and son. After making a turn, she saw a sign for \"Private Cuisine\".","Ziyue had just learned to talk not long ago and many words were still pronounced inaccurately.","\"We're eating here,\" said Xu Xiuhe.","\"Eat, eat food,\" said Ziyue, clapping his little hands.","Seeing this scene, Shen Yin felt a little emotional. Her father must have held her like this when she was little too. But why did he treat her like that afterwards? She was his dear daughter whom he had cherished for so many years. How could he bear to do that? If he had stopped Xu Zhen later on, would she not have jumped into the water? Would she not have come to this unfamiliar place so different from everything she knew before?","Tears actually flowed from her eyes. This was the first time Shen Yin had cried since coming to the modern era.","\"Shen Yin, come in,\" Xu Xiuhe still did not understand what this woman was thinking. She was crying just standing outside the restaurant door when he hadn't mistreated her at all.","Xu Xiuhe got a private room and handed a menu to Shen Yin.","Shen Yin took the menu and looked at the words on it. She found the writing of this era was similar to Dasheng's, and some characters were even simpler than Dasheng's.","\"Order whatever you want,\" the man said and then rattled off a long string of dish names to the server.","When they were almost done with the meal, a man came in. From the way he greeted Xu Xiuhe, it was clear the two men were very familiar.","\"This must be sister-in-law. I'm Chen Siming. No wonder Xiuhe doesn't bring you out to introduce to everyone. You're too pretty. He must be reluctant to share you,\" Chen Siming teased while looking meaningfully at Xu Xiuhe.","\"Weren't you at our wedding?\" Xu Xiuhe replied calmly.","\"How can you say that? We brothers went through so much trouble to get you drunk that day. Fortunately Shen Lv and some of his friends were there to help out.\"","Shen Yin smiled. \"I'm Shen Yin.\"","Very few people knew that Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin were married, let alone that they had a child together. Apart from the Shen family and Aunt Song and a few others, no one else knew the status of their relationship.","Listening to their casual chat, Shen Yin gathered one piece of information - this restaurant belonged to Chen Siming. That was why Xu Xiuhe received preferential treatment here.","She was bored. Much of what the two men talked about was currently beyond her comprehension.","Zheng Zheng sat in his high chair having just finished gnawing on an ear of corn. Now he wanted more meat.","Preoccupied with his conversation, Xu Xiuhe didn't hear him. Shen Yin picked up a shred of meat and put it in Zheng Zheng's little bowl.","Perhaps this was the first time Zheng Zheng had seen Shen Yin's face without a fierce expression on it. She had given him meat too. He stared at Shen Yin for a long, long time.","On the way back, Xu Xiuhe could no longer restrain himself and finally spoke up."]},{"number":4,"title":"Chapter 4: Dreamland","paragraphs":["\"I don't know what you are thinking, but if you do anything to hurt Zhengzheng again, I won't let you off easy.\" Xu Xiuhe moved closer to Shen Yin, his tone fierce as he issued a warning.","This was the closest Shen Yin had ever been to a man, and she couldn't help backing away instinctively.","The man's face was right in front of her. To be honest, the man's face was quite good-looking - sharp, angular features and nice skin, except for some dark eye circles.","\"You have dark circles under your eyes.\" Shen Yin blurted out what she was thinking.","Xu Xiuhe was momentarily at a loss for words because of the dark circles comment. His expression turned serious again as he emphasized, \"Remember what I said.\"","Shen Yin suddenly thought of going back to the Dasheng Dynasty. At worst she could just run away from the marriage; at worst she could hide away in the countryside with her grandfather and uncle's family.","Thinking of her uncle and grandfather, Shen Yin became even more determined to go back.","After Shen Yin got home and out of the car, she headed straight for her room and turned on the tap in the bathroom, filling the white bathtub with water.","Shen Yin lifted one foot and stepped into the tub, causing some water to splash over the sides.","She leaned back according to the mental image that had flashed through her mind when she first arrived here. She felt her vision go dark as she slowly lowered her head into the water.","Maybe this way she could get back to the Dasheng Dynasty.","\"Madam, sir, madam seems to be awake.\"","When Shen Yin woke up, she could hear Aunt Song calling by the bedside.","Shen Yin had had a very long dream. In the dream, she saw that after she fell into the water, the people she had arranged to rescue her did not come.","She was already dead in the Dasheng Dynasty. She also heard a voice saying, \"Since you have come here, settle in. The skills you learned in the Dasheng Dynasty will be amplified in this time.\"","\"Aunt Song, how long was I asleep?\"","\"Madam, you fainted while bathing yesterday. I happened to come to your room to tidy up the laundry and saw you. The doctor said it was because of your irregular diet and lack of sleep, your health couldn't take it.\" Aunt Song explained.","\"Aunt Song, from today onwards, strictly monitor the madam's diet and schedule.\"","\"Yes sir.\"","After saying this, Xu Xiuhe left for work.","Lying in bed, Shen Yin thought back to those words.","Since you have come here, settle in.","Does it mean I should live properly in this time?","\"Aunt Song, what time is it now?\"","\"Time?\" Aunt Song repeated the question back.","Shen Yin suddenly realized that unlike the Dasheng Dynasty, she would need to pay attention when speaking here.","\"Madam, it's 7 o'clock in the morning now. Do you still feel uncomfortable anywhere?\"","\"No more.\"","\"Then madam, call me if you need anything. Zhengzheng should be awake now. I made breakfast earlier, the newly hired cook hasn't arrived yet.\" Aunt Song made to leave.","Shen Yin nodded.","How to live from now on was entirely up to her.","Firstly, she was already married here, though the marriage did not seem ideal.","Secondly, no matter where, she would need money. She didn't recognize the money in this time period. She knew there was money in the phone, but didn't know how to use it.","Thirdly, although she had no relationship with Zhengzheng, she was undeniably his mother in this body.","If Xu Xiuhe did not divorce her, she would have to continue living here. If he did divorce her, where would she go?","Shen Yin's original home?","Shen Yin stopped her train of thought. The most important thing now was for her to understand this time period and learn to use many things.","To avoid arousing suspicion, she had to be cautious. She had no one trustworthy around her, so she would need to find ways to learn - watch TV, read books.","\"Madam, time for breakfast.\" This time Aunt Song came in holding Zhengzheng.","Zhengzheng's little eyes blinked curiously at Shen Yin, full of curiosity.","\"Zhengzheng, that's your mommy. Mommy is sick.\" Aunt Song held one of Zhengzheng's little hands and pointed at Shen Yin.","Although her face was very pale, Shen Yin still managed a smile. This time, Zhengzheng did not cry.","Wrapped in a coat, Shen Yin followed behind Aunt Song and Zhengzheng downstairs.","Breakfast was simple - milk, bread, eggs.","\"Madam, the new auntie I hired hasn't arrived yet.\"","Shen Yin looked at the food on the table, not used to eating this kind of stuff.","Under Aunt Song's expectant gaze, Shen Yin ate nevertheless.","After the meal, Shen Yin continued watching TV in the living room.","Come lunchtime, the cook still had not arrived.","\"Hello sir, the auntie you hired to cook yesterday has something come up and can't make it.\" Aunt Song called Xu Xiuhe.","\"Contact Wang Driver to come pick you up and eat out.\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","Xu Xiuhe was very busy and rarely came home for lunch. He couldn't rush back now either, so this was the only solution he could think of.","\"Aunt Song, the cook didn't come?\" Shen Yin asked, turning her head from the sofa.","Aunt Song stammered a reply that she hadn't come.","Shen Yin thought for a moment, then told Aunt Song, \"From now on, don't hire a cook anymore, I'll do it.\"","Aunt Song was somewhat surprised.","\"But madam, the sir probably won't agree.\"","\"I'll explain it to him tonight. First teach me how to use the appliances in the kitchen.\"","Hearing Shen Yin say this, Aunt Song was momentarily flustered.","\"Madam, why don't we still hire one? Cooking is very tiring.\"","\"No need.\" Shen Yin got up and walked into the kitchen.","After watching so much TV, she mostly knew what the stuff in the kitchen was.","\"Aunt Song, demonstrate the on and off for the stove.\" Aunt Song did as told.","Shen Yin was clever to begin with. After watching once, she mostly understood.","\"Madam, sir said Wang Driver is waiting outside to take us out to eat.\" Aunt Song said gingerly by Shen Yin's side.","It was the same private kitchen as yesterday, only Xu Xiuhe was now Aunt Song.","Seeing this place, Zhengzheng became happy again.","\"You just know this place has yummy food huh.\" Shen Yin stroked the soft, fair skin of Zhengzheng in Aunt Song's arms.","She was reluctant to remove her hand from the baby's face.","Over the past few days, Zhengzheng could see that Shen Yin no longer meant him harm, and was no longer afraid of her.","His big eyes were full of curiosity.","\"Zhengzheng, this is mommy. Answer mommy, you want to eat yummy food right?\" Aunt Song patiently said.","Shen Yin found it incredible - she wasn't even married in the Dasheng Dynasty, yet in this time she already had a child, despite not having gone through labor or having any emotional attachment. It was an indisputable fact that this body was his mother.","Xu Xiuhe had already called to notify Chen Siming.","A server from the private kitchen walked over upon seeing them at the door.","\"Madam, please come in.\"","Shen Yin's impression was that the food at this restaurant was average, a bit tastier than Aunt Li's cooking.","After eating a little without feeling hungry anymore, Shen Yin stopped eating.","Most of the time she watched Aunt Song feeding Zhengzheng.","The little one was adorable, eating seriously and intently. The more Shen Yin looked, the more she liked him. She just couldn't understand why he was so afraid of her at first.","Shen Yin's mind kept analyzing, combining what Ji Qingyan had said. The previous Shen Yin disliked men, yet had a child with a man.","So the previous Shen Yin must have disliked Zhengzheng? The more she thought about it, the more she felt it was so.","Shen Yin felt a little heartache for Zhengzheng upon seeing him eat happily. She was somewhat gratified watching him.","Aunt Song had already noticed Shen Yin was very different from before.","\"Madam, you didn't eat much, have some more.\"","\"Aunt Song, I'm full.\"","\"Madam, don't take this the wrong way, but I still have to say it. I've worked for sir for several years too. Sir is really a great person. It'd be good to just live well together. Think positively. Otherwise you'll just torment each other, not to mention Zhengzheng is still so young. You see how poorly you treated Zhengzheng before, yet sir didn't divorce you. Frankly speaking, there are swarms of women outside who want to marry sir. \" Aunt Song finally uttered what she had been holding in for a long time.","Shen Yin looked up at Aunt Song.","Aunt Song continued, \"Madam, I know maids like me shouldn't say such things, but as someone older with experience, I still want to say it. People should think positively. Otherwise life will be too tiring. Living well is the most important thing. And look how cute and obedient this child is, how blissful.\"","Shen Yin didn't expect Aunt Song to say so much to her. Other than the doctor, this was the first time someone had spoken to her at such length, and with kind intentions at that. Shen Yin took it to heart.","\"Aunt Song, I understand. I was foolish and mentally unstable before, couldn't think positively. But now I've come to my senses and will live well.\"","Shen Yin had arrived here now, not knowing anyone. With no money and unfamiliar with the rules of this world, if she wanted to survive, she could only continue with her original identity as Shen Yin.","\"Thank you,\" Shen Yin said gratefully, and Aunt Song instantly felt a sense of achievement.","\"That's better.\"","\"Hug, hug,\" Zhengzheng called out in his soft, tender voice, sounding as if he was about to cry.","\"Madam, you didn't bring Zhengzheng with you before, you can try doing so from now on. He's very well behaved and you can ask me about anything you don't understand. Take a guess what Zhengzheng wants to do now.\"","\"He probably feels uncomfortable and needs his diaper changed,\" explained Aunt Song.","After finishing their meal, Aunt Song notified the driver to head to the nearby supermarket to buy some ingredients to bring home.","\"Madam, if this doesn't work out, we should hire someone to cook for us.\" Aunt Song still had some doubts about Shen Yin's culinary skills.","\"Aunt Song, I can't trust other people's cooking.\"","Hearing Shen Yin say so, Aunt Song decided not to mention it any further.","There were all sorts of goods available at the supermarket, and Shen Yin followed behind Aunt Song while Zhengzheng was in the arms of Aunt Song. He exchanged looks with Shen Yin again.","Shen Yin smiled and clapped her hands at Zhengzheng. Aunt Song understood what she meant.","\"Come, Zhengzheng, let mummy hold you.\"","The little bundle of joy in her arms was soft and fragrant. Shen Yin suddenly felt how magical it was that this child was hers.","\"Aunt Song, you go ahead and choose the freshest ingredients.\"","Shen Yin had lost interest in grocery shopping, incredibly satisfied just holding Zhengzheng in her arms.","Suddenly, a woman in her forties walked over, seemingly about to speak to her."]},{"number":5,"title":"Chapter 5: Cooking","paragraphs":["“Zhengzheng ah, let grandma hold you for a bit.”","Shen Yin did not recognize this person, but she observed that this person had an air of nobility about her. She called herself grandma, could she be Xu Xiuhe’s mother?","Just as she was at a loss, Aunt Song came over.","“It’s Mrs. Xu, we should head back now.” Aunt Song said.","“When Xiuhe has time, have him come home for a meal. He hasn’t been home for so long, his dad misses him.”","On the way back, Shen Yin wanted to ask but hesitated.","“Madam, you probably want to ask who she is. You didn’t pay attention to these things before, so it’s normal you don’t recognize her.”","“She is the young master's stepmother. Just one look and you know nothing about the young master. When the young master was very little, his mother passed away. Not long after, he brought back a woman and a two-year-old child. That woman on the surface treated the young master very well, doing everything in the young master's best interest, but in reality, when no one was looking, she mistreated him. After the young master went to university, he moved out. Using the little savings left by his mother, he started his business and endured a lot before becoming as successful as he is today.\"","\"How does Aunt Song know so clearly?” Shen Yin asked curiously.","“I used to work in their household. His mother treated me very well. After she passed, I worked there for another two years. Seeing my close relationship with the young master, that woman found an excuse to dismiss me. This time, right after you married the young master, he hired me back.\" Aunt Song continued explaining.","\"That woman is no good. Avoid her when you see her in the future.\"","Zhengzheng in her arms yawned and rubbed his eyes.","Aunt Song smiled and said, \"Our Zhengzheng is sleepy, let's head home first.\"","That night, Shen Yin was in the kitchen, organizing the vegetables bought today, preparing to cook. When Aunt Song offered to help, Shen Yin declined.","\"It's okay Aunt Song, just watch over Zhengzheng.\"","After speaking, Shen Yin continued working in the kitchen, pairing dishes and sauces. In her past life, Shen Yin was very picky about food. Her uncle had specially requested imperial chefs for her from the emperor. Later, when her stomach was spoiled by the fine cuisine, and the imperial chefs were bestowed to her uncle’s estate and could no longer come to Shen Yin at the Prime Minister’s estate, Shen Yin started following the imperial chefs to learn cooking skills.","After Shen Yin returned to the Prime Minister’s estate, she built a kitchen in her own courtyard. She pondered daily on how to eat well, reading many books about cuisines. She dared say even the imperial chefs could not cook better meals than her with a wider repertoire.","Seeing the eggplants and other vegetables Aunt Song bought today, Shen Yin decided she could make a pot of braised eggplant.","She cut the eggplants into cubes, diced the mushrooms, scallion stalks, and lean meat, then mixed them into the seasoned sauce. Finally, she stuffed the mixture into the eggplant cubes. She dipped each eggplant cube in egg wash then pan-fried until golden brown before plating.","She also stir-fried a homestyle green vegetable dish and a cashew shrimp dish. Seeing there was still time, Shen Yin took out the chicken from the fridge she had bought earlier. After washing it, lacking some ingredients for her ideal recipe, Shen Yin tried her best to create the most delicious dish possible with the limited ingredients on hand.","By the time she finished cooking this dish, the previously simmering braised pork ribs and lotus root soup was also ready. Shen Yin lifted the lid of the soup pot, and the wonderful aroma immediately filled the air. She had used her secret recipe for this soup.","Xu Xiuhe had just returned and as soon as he opened the door, he could smell the fragrant aroma. He thought the chef they hired this time was really not bad.","After changing his shoes, Xu Xiuhe went upstairs directly to check on Zhengzheng.","Zhengzheng had just woken up and was being carried by Aunt Song.","\"Aunt Song, where did you find the cook for the kitchen this time? I could smell the fragrance as soon as I entered the door.” Xu Xiuhe took Zhengzheng from Aunt Song's arms.","\"Master, it was the mistress who cooked.”","Xu Xiuhe was really shocked to hear this.","\"I was going to hire someone, but the mistress said she could do it herself and it would be more reassuring.\"","Aunt Song continued explaining.","Going downstairs, the dining table was already set with the dishes – braised eggplant, cashew shrimp, garlic sautéed greens, soy sauce chicken, and pork ribs lotus root soup.","When Xu Xiuhe took the first bite of eggplant, Shen Yin immediately watched his expression. As expected, Shen Yin knew her cooking skills could win over many.","\"Shen Yin, let's still hire a cook aunty.\" Xu Xiuhe spoke first.","\"What, is my cooking not delicious? That's not possible!\" Shen Yin immediately took a piece of eggplant herself.","\"No problem, very delicious! Here Zhengzheng, eat more.\" He took a piece of eggplant and fed Zhengzheng.","\"It's not that, it's very delicious, but doing all the cooking yourself will be tiring.\"","\"It's fine, only shopping for groceries is a bit troublesome. I'm not too familiar with buying vegetables.\"","Xu Xiuhe thought for a moment.","\"From now on, write down what you want to buy, and I'll have someone purchase it.\"","\"Okay. Aunt Song, let me cook the rice from now on. After eating, can you teach me how to use the rice cooker?\"","After Shen Yin spoke these words, both Xu Xiuhe and Aunt Song didn't know how to respond. If they said she knew how to cook, she didn't know how to use anything and was learning as they went. If they said she didn't know how to cook, these delicious dishes were right in front of them on the table.","Aunt Song, Xu Xiuhe, and even Zhengzheng all ate a lot more than usual this meal. It was probably the most delicious and tasty meal they've had in many years.","They were simple, ordinary dishes, yet incredibly delicious. The meals made by those Michelin-starred chefs couldn't compare in flavor to this meal.","Office.","Xu Xiuhe called Assistant Liu in.","\"Assistant Liu, transfer 5% of the shares to my wife.\"","Assistant Liu was stunned for a moment. \"Transfer to the mistress?\"","\"Yes. Do as I said.\"","\"Then Boss, the lunch you booked as usual? Or the cafeteria?\"","Xu Xiuhe looked at the time, it was 11am.","\"I'm going home.\" He took the car keys and left the office, leaving Assistant Liu in disorder behind him.","As soon as Xu Xiuhe entered the door, he saw Aunt Song coming over.","\"Master, there's something I forgot to tell you yesterday. The mistress and I saw Yang Cui at the supermarket.\"","\"She didn't say anything, did she?\"","\"She wanted to hold Zhengzheng but I didn't allow it.\"","\"Hmm, avoid her if you see her in the future. Where is the mistress?\"","\"Cooking in the kitchen.\"","After changing shoes, Xu Xiuhe walked to the kitchen door.","Shen Yin was gradually getting used to this body. Lately there were often flashes of scenes surfacing in her mind.","Fragments of the original host's memories.","Having these memories made her understand the original host and this world much better.","The original Shen Yin did not live in this country. She studied abroad in France and also cooked for herself there.","With these memories, Shen Yin was no longer worried about exposing herself.","Four dishes with one soup.","When Shen Yin brought the dishes to the dining room, she saw Xu Xiuhe and was surprised. She didn't expect him to come home for lunch, so there may not be enough rice.","\"You're back?\" Shen Yin greeted him.","\"You guys eat first.\" Shen Yin said and went back to the kitchen to cook some noodles.","At the dining table, they were all waiting for her. Zhengzheng shook his little spoon, mouth babbling \"eat eat\".","Crab-stuffed orange, honey tofu, fish soup, pan-fried taro, and black chicken with red dates soup.","A table full of appetizing dishes.","Shen Yin brought out a bowl of noodles and set it on the table.","\"Mistress, how could I have forgotten, I'm really getting old, mind not working well. Fortunately the mistress cooked noodles, otherwise there wouldn't have been enough rice.\" Aunt Song blamed herself.","The noodles looked perfectly cooked, with ample ingredients mixed in. Shen Yin had used her special homemade seasoning, and cooked it in chicken broth, emitting a tempting aroma that seduced the others.","\"Does Zhengzheng want to eat noodles?\" Seeing Zhengzheng's impatient little hands, Shen Yin asked aloud.","Zhengzheng's expression and actions clearly showed his anticipation.","Shen Yin used chopsticks to place some noodles from the bowl into Zhengzheng's small bowl, then spooned in some soup.","Zhengzheng immediately started eating eagerly.","\"You eat the rest of the noodles.\" Shen Yin placed the bowl in front of Xu Xiuhe.","Looking at the table of dishes, especially the crab-stuffed orange, Xu Xiuhe knew they were complex to make.","The dishes were delicious. Zhengzheng ate a lot of crab and kept asking for more, but was stopped by Shen Yin.","\"Zhengzheng, too much crab is not good for you. Have some fish instead.\" Shen Yin scooped some fish soup into Zhengzheng's small plate.","Despite being four dishes and one soup, everything was finished. Partly because it was truly tasty that Aunt Song and Xu Xiuhe ate a lot, and partly because Shen Yin's judgment on portions was perfect.","After the meal, Xu Xiuhe finally could not resist asking.","\"Shen Yin, did you study cooking before?\"","Shen Yin had already prepared her response.","\"When I studied abroad, I cooked for myself. Since I love eating, I taught myself and read many books.\"","\"The food was very delicious, thank you for your hard work. If there is anything you need to buy, just let me know and I'll arrange for someone to go buy it,\" Aunt Song said while standing to the side, revealing a gratified smile.","\"Sir, there are some things I want to discuss with you.\"","\"Aunt Song, just go ahead and say it directly, and keep calling me Xiúhé.\"","\"You told me to call you Xiúhé before, but I just can't get used to changing it.\"","\"Sir, I've been wanting to talk to you about this matter for a while now.\""]},{"number":6,"title":"Chapter 6: Stepmother","paragraphs":["Aunt Song said everything she wanted to say. The gist was that she had wanted to resign for a while now, but didn't feel at ease leaving Zhengzheng. Now that Madam's condition had improved so much, she felt reassured about leaving.","\"Why does Aunt Song want to resign?\"","\"Oh, I almost forgot to mention, my daughter-in-law is seven months pregnant and about to give birth soon. As the mother-in-law, I need to be there to take care of her.\"","\"It's okay, Aunt Song. Don't worry about us. We'll take good care of ourselves.\"","\"I've taken care of Zhengzheng for two years, since he was born, watching him grow from an infant, learning to walk and talk. Leaving him now, I can't help but feel reluctant.\"","\"It's not like we'll never see each other again. Feel free to come back and visit whenever you miss us.\"","In the afternoon, Xu Xiuhe told Liu Assistant to deposit 200,000 RMB into Aunt Song's bank account. He then asked Liu Assistant to find a reliable nanny.","Shen Yin was now familiar with this world. She took another look around her room and found her bank card and ID card in the closet.","Xu Xiuhe drove to Shen Yin's doctor's office.","\"Hello Dr. Ji, I'm Xu Xiuhe, Shen Yin's husband.\" Xu Xiuhe reached out his hand.","Dr. Ji Qingyan sized him up and shook his hand.","\"I came to consult you about my wife's condition.\"","\"Mr. Xu looks quite familiar. I often see you on magazine covers.\"","\"No, no.\"","\"Let me put it this way. Your wife's condition has greatly improved. Since she was last here, I noticed her yearning to return to normal life again. Her change in mentality is key. Did something happen for you to come today?\"","\"I'll be frank. I was considering divorce not long ago. But she has changed tremendously lately. She even cooks and shows care for our child now. I'm wondering if this change is some kind of scheme.\"","\"Mr. Xu, you should know Shen Yin didn't want this marriage. If she knew you wanted a divorce, she wouldn't have made a fuss.\"","Dr. Ji Qingyan told Xu Xiuhe her opinion. After a word of thanks, Xu Xiuhe left.","From her recent interactions with Xu Xiuhe, Shen Yin could see he had no feelings for her. But he clearly cared deeply for Zhengzheng.","She felt relieved knowing that divorce was common nowadays. It would be easier than in ancient times. She planned to become more familiar with this world first. Once she gained a foothold, she would divorce Xu Xiuhe.","There was a lot of money in her WeChat and bank account that she didn't know how to check the balance of.","In one of the bags she found a diploma written in English. From her search, she gathered that the original owner was a fashion designer.","Shen Yin could also design clothes. The clothes she wore in her past life were designed by her and were able to lead trends in the capital.","While organizing these things, Shen Yin heard her phone ding.","[Meet at the usual place]","Seeing this text, Shen Yin had no memory of a \"usual place.\"","Shen Yin checked the time. It was 3 pm. She needed to make dinner in two hours.","She figured two hours should be enough time. After tidying up, she prepared to head out.","Downstairs, she saw Aunt Song playing with Zhengzheng in the living room.","\"Madam, there's something I need to tell you.\"","\"Just go ahead, Aunt Song.\"","\"Madam, I told Sir two days ago that I want to resign. My daughter-in-law is due to give birth soon, so I need to go back and care for her. I'll be leaving tomorrow.\"","Hearing this, Shen Yin roughly understood that Aunt Song probably wanted to brief her on some matters before leaving.","She sat down on the sofa and casually replied to the text she just received.","[I'm not free today]","\"Madam, Zhengzheng is two years old now. He still walks a bit unsteadily and can only say some simple words. He's a bit behind other children his age in development.\"","\"He usually needs to be coaxed to sleep around 8 pm. He wakes up at 7 am, so he's still quite regular.\"","\"Ever since he was little, he's only drunk one brand of milk. Now that he eats solid food, he drinks less milk, just one bottle in the morning.\"","\"His room is inside Sir's room. Sir takes care of putting him to bed at night.\"","\"Also when giving him a bath, he doesn't like getting his hair washed first. You need to put bath toys in the water.\"","\"Most importantly, Zhengzheng takes after Sir in that he's allergic to mangoes. That fruit must not appear in the house.\"","Aunt Song briefed Shen Yin one thing after another as she took mental notes. After they finished, she couldn't help but sigh at the difficulty of raising children.","\"Alright, I've said everything I needed to say. I'll be leaving tomorrow.\"","Shen Yin still felt a little sad. Although Aunt Song was unfriendly to her at first, she later helped Shen Yin with everything from cooking to showing her how to use the appliances. With her leaving, it somehow felt like something was missing.","Her phone received another text.","[Tomorrow morning, 8 am, Blue Mountain Café]","\"Hug hug.\" Little Zhengzheng got tired playing on the floor and reached out his arms for Aunt Song to carry him.","\"Madam, it's your turn. Get used to it early since I need to go pack.\"","Before Shen Yin could think about the meaning of the text, she picked up Zhengzheng.","The little milk baby in her arms pouted.","Shen Yin was instantly at a loss.","\"What's the matter, Zhengzheng?\" Shen Yin gently asked.","\"Flower flower\"","Flower Flower was a big dog Xu Xiuhe had raised for years. After the original owner married over, she extremely opposed it. The dog was chased from the house to the yard outside.","But Zhengzheng liked the dog and liked going out to find Flower Flower. Shen Yin was also afraid of dogs, but remembering the martial arts Uncle taught her in her past life, she instantly became fearless. Carrying Zhengzheng, she went out to the yard.","Aunt Song watched this scene from the window and felt completely satisfied.","Inside Blue Mountain Café, Shen Yin sat on a chair. She arrived early, half an hour before 8 am. Not long after, a woman came over and sat down.","Shen Yin recognized this person, Yang Cui, Xu Xiuhe's stepmother. Shen Yin had always detested stepmothers.","\"How's it going with the thing I told you to do?\"","\"You haven't started yet, have you? If you still won't make a move, I'll do it myself and you won't accomplish your wish.\" Yang Cui spoke viciously.","\"Oh, what wish is that?\"","\"Aren't you trying to divorce him and run off with Zhou Manyuan?\"","\"Tell me, how will you help me succeed?\"","The original Shen Yin had been lovesick and foolish. But Shen Yin was no fool. How could she possibly believe the words of a woman like this? She could only slowly draw out information from this woman.","\"As long as Zhengzheng is gone, Xu Xiuhe won't have an advantage over Xu Zhengyang in his father's eyes.\"","Hearing this, Shen Yin nearly cursed. How could there be such vicious women, comparable to her own stepmother! She actually wanted her to harm her own child.","Although the original owner disliked Zhengzheng, it would still be difficult for her to personally make a move. No, Shen Yin suddenly thought, the original owner truly detested Zhengzheng. She had already abused him. She was close to taking action.","Fortunately the original owner had died.","\"You only care about your own child. Yet you want to harm a less than two week old baby. I'm also Zhengzheng's mother. Don't I care about my child too? I was foolish before but that doesn't mean I still am. If you dare hurt Zhengzheng, don't blame me for what I might do!\" After speaking, Shen Yin picked up the untouched coffee on the table and splashed it directly on Yang Cui's face.","\"You crazy woman! Do you want a miserable life? Just you wait!\" Yang Cui stood up and grabbed at Shen Yin's hair.","Shen Yin pushed down Yang Cui's head. With a shove, Yang Cui plopped down on the ground, screaming and shouting like a shrew.","\"Remember what I said. Don't set your sights on me, or I won't let you get away easily.\"","Shen Yin didn't understand why the original owner had promised to help such a vicious woman back then. She must have been out of her mind.","\"Sir, Madam went out today?\" Assistant Liu gave his usual report.","\"It was after Madam returned that the driver sent Aunt Song to the train station.\"","\"Where did Madam go so early?\"","Assistant Liu handed the tablet over to Xu Xiuhe. The video was shot by Xu Xiuhe's man.","In the video, Shen Yin could be seen pouring coffee on Yang Cui's face, then pressing Yang Cui's head down to the ground.","The cameraman was far away so no audio was captured. Xu Xiuhe played the video again from the start, pondering the relationship between Shen Yin and Yang Cui.","\"What are you watching so intently?\" Chang Zhiyuan walked in to see Xu Xiuhe concentrating hard on the video on the tablet.","Xu Xiuhe looked up to see Chang Zhiyuan's disgusted expression. \"Why do you keep entering without knocking?\"","Chang Zhiyuan waved his hand in response: \"What kind of relationship do we have? There are no women in your office. Besides Liu Bo, I'm the only one who comes into your office.\"","\"That's right, Liu Assistant,\" he deliberately asked Liu Assistant to prove that what he said was right.","Liu Bo realized the problem had shifted to him, and immediately reacted, knowing full well who paid his salary.","Liu Bo smiled and replied, \"We're not the same. I have the president's permission, but you broke in on your own.\"","Chang Zhiyuan was rendered speechless. He quickly changed the subject, \"What are you watching so intently? Let me see too.\"","He then stuck his head out, \"Wow, two women together is always exciting. But these two seem very familiar to me.\"","Xu Xiuhe was still concentrated on the video, unwilling to respond to Chang Zhiyuan. Liu Bo answered his question: \"It's the Madam and Yang Cui.\"","Chang Zhiyuan, Xu Xiuhe and a few others had been good friends since childhood, so they could barge into each other's offices without worry. Of course Chang Zhiyuan knew about the relationship between Xu Xiuhe and Yang Cui, and he also knew there were no feelings between Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin. So seeing these two women together was quite intriguing.","\"Old Xu, what's going on between you and Shen Yin? Many women in Rong City want to marry you. You don't like her and she doesn't care for you either. Why bother and exhaust each other? Weren't you planning a divorce earlier, how come there's no news now? Wouldn't it be better to marry an obedient wife who loves you?\"","Xu Xiuhe frowned, \"You think everyone has as simple a mind as you.\"","\"Hey, why the personal attack?\" Chang Zhiyuan didn't want to discuss whether his mind was simple or not. He earnestly said, \"I actually have business with you. My company is shooting a drama and needs a child actor to play my son. Can Zhengzheng help out?\"","Even as he spoke, Chang Zhiyuan was nervous inside.","Who was Xu Xiuhe? In just a few years, he had grown his business tremendously, even surpassing many family enterprises. No one in Rong City's business circle did not know of him. At the mention of \"Xu Xiuhe\", people would praise him and size themselves up against him.","So how could Xu Xiuhe possibly allow his two-year-old son to act?","Sure enough, Xu Xiuhe declined: \"Aunt Song resigned. We haven't found a new nanny yet. Zhengzheng is being taken care of by Shen Yin now. Do you think Shen Yin would take Zhengzheng to the drama set?\"","Chang Zhiyuan considered this. Indeed, who was Shen Yin? The young miss of the prominent Shen family in Rong City. How could she be willing to go to a drama set?","Suddenly, Chang Zhiyuan realized something else: \"Shen Yin? Shen Yin is willing to bring my godson along? Didn't you plan to divorce her? Besides, she dislikes you so much, she probably ignores Zhengzheng too.\"","Chang Zhiyuan had only met Shen Yin twice, once at their wedding and once at Zhengzheng's one month celebration. But both times, Shen Yin had looked unhappy and ignored everyone. Their unhappy marriage was common knowledge, since Shen Yin never appeared in public. That was why outsiders felt they were incompatible as a couple, and many women hoped to replace her.","Xu Xiuhe asked, \"Why must it be Zhengzheng?\""]},{"number":7,"title":"Chapter 7: Zheng Zheng","paragraphs":["Chang Zhiyuan's eyes lit up. Feeling there was hope, he continued: \"I've been pursuing Shu Yi from our company recently, right? She's the female lead in this TV series and needs a boy to play her son for two weeks.\"","Xu Xiuhe knew that Chang Zhiyuan had been pursuing Shu Yi recently, and thought Chang Zhiyuan had succeeded.","Chang Zhiyuan went on: \"This woman doesn't give in no matter what I try. It's so frustrating that I can't even get an artist from my own company when I'm the boss.\"","Xu Xiuhe ...","He knew Chang Zhiyuan's character all too well. Up until now, the girlfriends he had talked about could be counted on one hand.","\"Find Shen Yin yourself and see if she's willing to go to the set. That's all that matters.\" Xu Xiuhe casually threw out this line. But he thought to himself, what ghost would make Shen Yin agree.","Chang Zhiyuan didn't have high hopes either, but he didn't want to give up even a glimmer of opportunity: \"Thanks, brother. Give me Shen Yin's phone number.\"","Xu Xiuhe was holding a pen and paused for a moment: \"Go find her yourself.\" Only then did Xu Xiuhe realize they had been married for three years but didn't have each other's phone numbers.","Chang Zhiyuan readily agreed and drove straight to Ziyue Manor.","When Shen Yin came back from Blue Mountain Café, it was already 9 p.m. Aunt Song's luggage was in the living room. She was holding Zhengzheng in the living room waiting for Shen Yin.","Aunt Song handed Zhengzheng into Shen Yin's arms, teaching her how to hold him: \"Madam, hold one hand under Zhengzheng's bottom and the other supporting his back.\"","Aunt Song was reluctant to leave. Before departing, she exhorted Shen Yin again.","Shen Yin did as told, holding Zhengzheng in her arms.","Aunt Song instructed further: \"Madam, Zhengzheng is very well behaved and can say a lot now. Sometimes he likes looking at books. If you're busy, just let him sit there and read the picture books on the shelf. My number is on the sticky note behind the door. Call me if anything comes up.\"","Aunt Song bowed her head again: \"Zhengzheng, Granny Song has to go home. Say goodbye to Granny.\"","The two-year-old child could understand words now. Zhengzheng's expression clearly showed incomprehension: \"Granny is not leaving. Granny plays with Zhengzheng.\"","As soon as Zhengzheng finished speaking, his eyes became wet.","Aunt Song instantly felt distressed too, with traces of tears at the corners of her eyes: \"Zhengzheng, what did Granny teach you? Boys can't easily shed pearls.\" After speaking, Aunt Song turned her face to cover her nose. Pulling her suitcase, she left.","Seeing Aunt Song leave, Zhengzheng finally couldn't hold back and burst into loud crying.","Shen Yin had no experience with children and didn't know how to soothe him. She could only hold him gently in her arms, patting his back lightly while murmuring: \"Good boy Zhengzheng, don't cry. Boys can't easily shed pearls.\"","Shen Yin actually couldn't understand why it hurt so much to see Zhengzheng cry. There were clearly no feelings before. The original Shen Yin had an iron heart towards Zhengzheng. Why did she feel so bad now, watching him cry fiercely? Shen Yin's nose soured and her eyes glistened with tears.","It just so happened Chang Zhiyuan arrived at Ziyue Manor at this moment. He parked in Xu Xiuhe's yard and as soon as he opened the car door, he heard a child's crying.","The crying was so loud and miserable. Could they be abusing the child? As soon as this thought emerged, Chang Zhiyuan immediately called Xu Xiuhe: \"Xiuhe, I'm in your yard now. The living room window is open and I can hear a child crying from inside. Listen.\" As he spoke, he took out his phone and walked closer to the window.","Xu Xiuhe could vaguely hear it too and felt somewhat flustered inside: \"Go knock on the door first. I'm on my way back now.\"","Chang Zhiyuan went to ring the doorbell at the entrance, but no one answered.","Shen Yin was upstairs with Zhengzheng. He had cried so hard she didn't know how to soothe him. She could only carry him upstairs to change his clothes, planning to take him out for a walk to distract him.","She placed Zhengzheng on the bed, turned around to his closet to find some clothes. It was her first time dressing a child and she wasn't very skilled, but Shen Yin was clever.","\"Be good, baby. Don't cry anymore. Does my darling want Mommy to take you out to play?\" Shen Yin patiently coaxed, naturally calling herself Mommy.","Zhengzheng sat on the bed. Shen Yin got up and bent over to pick him up, heading downstairs.","Zhengzheng finally stopped crying from exhaustion and asked: \"Where did Granny go and when is she coming back? Doesn't she want Zhengzheng anymore?\"","Shen Yin had complicated feelings, not knowing how to explain. At the same time she was shocked by Zhengzheng's thoughts and verbal expression. So two-year-olds already understood so much and had their own thoughts! In the past...","Shen Yin smiled gently: \"Sweetie, Granny went back home. She has her own things to do. Our Zhengzheng is a big boy now who doesn't need Granny by his side all the time. But didn't Granny promise she would come back to see you?\"","Zhengzheng seemed to understand and nodded in agreement. Seeing this, Shen Yin felt bad again. Such an adorable, sensible darling, how could the original host bear to neglect him and even think of harming him? It was extremely fortunate that Zhengzheng would let her hold him now.","Shen Yin kissed Zhengzheng's forehead: \"Baby, it was Mommy's fault. Mommy didn't know better before, neglecting Zhengzheng and not treating you well. But Mommy knows she was wrong. Can you forgive Mommy?\"","Zhengzheng nodded again. Putting both arms around Shen Yin's neck, he didn't say anything, but Shen Yin understood this meant he forgave her.","Outside, Chang Zhiyuan had knocked for a long time with no response. He finally gave up and leaned against the wall waiting for Xu Xiuhe to arrive.","In the foyer, Shen Yin put Zhengzheng's shoes on and selected a pair of flats for herself. \"Let's go, take darling Zhengzheng to the supermarket!\"","Shen Yin had just opened the door when she was startled by Chang Zhiyuan again: \"Who are you? Why are you standing outside without knocking?\"","Before Chang Zhiyuan could answer, he immediately grabbed Zhengzheng from Shen Yin's arms: \"Zhengzheng, let Godfather see if it still hurts anywhere?\"","Chang Zhiyuan carefully examined every part of Zhengzheng's body. At this moment Xu Xiuhe arrived, parking his car and striding over: \"Is Zhengzheng alright?\"","Chang Zhiyuan replied: \"I haven't seen any injuries yet, but look how red his eyes are with tears still wet on his face.\"","Shen Yin was stunned for a moment: \"Why are you both back...\"","Before Shen Yin could finish, Xu Xiuhe dragged her arm to the living room. Chang Zhiyuan carrying Zhengzheng also went inside.","Xu Xiuhe's face was livid: \"Speak! What happened this time?\"","Shen Yin still didn't know what was going on. \"What's the matter?\"","\"Aunt Song just left yesterday and you're already treating Zhengzheng like this. We could hear him crying from the yard.\" Xu Xiuhe accused.","Only then did Shen Yin understand Xu Xiuhe and Chang Zhiyuan had wrongly blamed her for abusing Zhengzheng. She wanted to explain but was afraid they wouldn't believe her.","So Shen Yin came in front of Chang Zhiyuan and clapped her hands: \"Zhengzheng, come, Mommy holds you.\"","Indeed Zhengzheng reached out his hands to let her carry him. In fact she was nervous inside, afraid Zhengzheng would reject her. Then she really wouldn't be able to prove her innocence.","Feeling they still didn't believe her, she went on asking Zhengzheng: \"Sweetie, tell Daddy why you were crying.\"","In his tender crying voice, Zhengzheng replied: \"Granny left. Granny doesn't want Zhengzheng anymore.\"","Shen Yin finally heaved a long sigh of relief, giving Xu Xiuhe a look.","Chang Zhiyuan and Xu Xiuhe also knew they had wrongly accused Shen Yin, but Chang Zhiyuan wouldn't admit his mistake openly: \"I knocked for a long time without anyone answering, and hearing a child cry, how could I not overthink?\"","This excuse was reasonable enough. After all, Shen Yin did have a history. Not wanting to argue further, she continued: \"Aunt Song left this morning and Zhengzheng cried badly. I couldn't soothe him no matter what, so I wanted to take him out to play to distract him. When you rang the doorbell I was upstairs changing his clothes.\"","Xu Xiuhe saw that Zhengzheng's clothes had indeed been changed and were different from his usual wear. Aunt Song focused solely on keeping him warm without considering appearance or comfort. But with his high cuteness level, Zhengzheng could still attract looks when out. Shen Yin was clearly different. She had dressed Zhengzheng in a white sweater with a blue gilet over it, pants underneath, and sport shoes - a stylish little man.","Chang Zhiyuan and Xu Xiuhe only now realized that they had wrongly blamed Shen Yin this time. Xu Xiuhe was just about to apologize when Zhengzheng interrupted: \"Dad, did you come home early to take us out to play?\"","Xu Xiuhe looked at Chang Zhiyuan, his eyes clearly saying: You can leave now.","How could Chang Zhiyuan easily give up when his business was not yet finished: \"Does Zhengzheng want a godfather? Godfather will take you out to eat delicious food.\" He had already realized that Shen Yin seemed to care quite a bit about Zhengzheng, which was completely different from what he had heard before. This was interesting - he had decided to use Zhengzheng as an entry point.","Zhengzheng scratched his head and shook it, saying: \"Zhengzheng wants to go out and play, and eat the meals mom makes.\"","Zhengzheng had eaten Shen Yin's cooking for several days and was now completely subdued by her culinary skills.","Xu Xiuhe again glanced at Shen Yin - shocked that Zhengzheng had apparently forgotten his dad now that he had a mother. Although he had to admit that Shen Yin's cooking was indeed delicious.","Standing on the sidelines, Chang Zhiyuan felt like he had discovered some extraordinary secret. How could this Shen Yin be so different from the one he had heard about before? Adhering to his principles of respect, Xu Xiuhe had not had Shen Yin investigated before marriage, only starting the investigation after they wed. Other than a beautiful appearance and great figure, she didn't seem to have any other merits - but had a whole pile of faults. Quick temper and bad personality in college, smoking, drinking and partying abroad, coasting through her studies just enough to graduate, and then coming for the arranged marriage. If one other merit had to be found, it was that she had a clean record with no relationships. Otherwise, Xu Xiuhe would not have allowed her to give birth to Zhengzheng. During the pregnancy, Aunt Song was kept very busy, basically monitoring Shen Yin 24 hours a day to ensure she didn't smoke, drink or even secretly abort the baby."]},{"number":8,"title":"Chapter 8: Consultation","paragraphs":["Shen Yin carried Zhengzheng and went out. The driver had taken Aunt Song back, so Shen Yin planned to walk with Zhengzheng. Even if she got tired, she would carry him if he couldn't walk anymore.","Chang Zhiyuan noticed the situation and casually placed his hand on Xu Xiuhe's shoulder, saying, \"Since your wife and child have gone out, why don't you go and see them off?\"","Xu Xiuhe disdainfully removed Chang Zhiyuan's arm from his shoulder and brushed off his own shoulder.","Chang Zhiyuan initially wanted to invite Shen Yin to have a meal to make up for his mistake. But now that he saw the whole family had gone out, he felt like he had come in vain. He followed behind Xu Xiuhe and also went out.","Xu Xiuhe walked briskly to his own car and parked it at the gate of the courtyard.","Shen Yin couldn't believe that this man actually knew to see them off. She held Zhengzheng and sat in the backseat of the car. Without wasting any time, Chang Zhiyuan opened the door of the passenger seat and got in.","Frowning, Xu Xiuhe asked, \"Why did you get in? Aren't you driving back?\"","Chang Zhiyuan, thick-skinned as he was, said, \"I want to accompany my godson.\" He crossed his legs and added, \"Can I come along, sister-in-law?\"","Shen Yin was speechless. He had already gotten in the car, and he was still asking. She replied calmly, \"I mind.\"","Upon hearing this, Chang Zhiyuan's expression cracked open. He never expected Shen Yin to respond so directly. If one observed carefully, they would notice that Xu Xiuhe's lips curled upwards slightly.","But who was Chang Zhiyuan? He didn't care about Shen Yin's opinion. Lowering his head, he persisted, \"Zhengzheng, it's been a long time since your godfather played with you. Can your godfather go out with you?\"","Zhengzheng nodded.","\"Looks like my godson treats me well,\" Chang Zhiyuan said, looking at Xu Xiuhe with a smug expression.","Xu Xiuhe ignored him and turned to ask Zhengzheng and Shen Yin where they wanted to go.","\"Let's go to the supermarket,\" Shen Yin replied.","Upon arriving at the supermarket, Shen Yin grabbed a shopping cart and placed Zhengzheng inside. Then she went to the children's snack section and picked out some snacks for Zhengzheng. She thought that with two big men following behind her, they wouldn't let her pay, would they? She had come once before with Aunt Song, and although she had a rough idea, going through the whole process by herself was still a bit challenging. Free labor and a free wallet should not go to waste.","With these thoughts, Shen Yin's mood improved, and she had a smile on her face. She lowered her head and asked the little sweetheart in the shopping cart what he wanted to eat.","This scene happened to be seen by Xu Xiuhe and Chang Zhiyuan who were following behind.","Chang Zhiyuan was even more shocked and moved closer to Xu Xiuhe, asking, \"Didn't you say that Shen Yin has severe depression? I also heard from Liu Bo that she even abused my godson some time ago. Isn't she depressed? Isn't she suffering from schizophrenia?\"","Xu Xiuhe had also had doubts, so he personally asked Shen Yin's psychologist, Ji Qingyan, who clearly told him that Shen Yin's condition had greatly improved and she had basically recovered to normal.","Perhaps psychological illnesses were strange, or perhaps Shen Yin had truly found a way to let go.","Chang Zhiyuan paused for a moment and asked, \"Are you still planning to get a divorce? I saw the divorce agreement in your office last time.\"","Xu Xiuhe had considered divorcing before, but now that Shen Yin had become so important to him, he couldn't bring himself to present the divorce agreement. After all, there was still a blood relationship between them.","Chang Zhiyuan continued, \"Qi Yan is coming back next week.\"","Xu Xiuhe's expression noticeably changed, and he replied, \"Hmm, please don't mention her in front of me again.\"","Sensing that this topic was sensitive, Chang Zhiyuan tried to change the subject, \"Did she really cook lunch today?\"","Shen Yin's shopping cart was already filled with many things: cooking condiments, vegetables, and the fish Zhengzheng wanted to eat. She also bought some fruits.","When they reached the checkout counter, it was evident that the cashier didn't understand the relationship between two grown men accompanying a woman and a child in the supermarket.","Leaving the supermarket, it was already noon, and they headed back the same way.","Shen Yin carried Zhengzheng into the living room and placed him on the floor, while Chang Zhiyuan brought the groceries into the kitchen.","After settling Zhengzheng, Shen Yin headed straight to the kitchen. Xu Xiuhe had already entered the house, and Chang Zhiyuan, noticing Shen Yin's cooking skills, asked Xu Xiuhe, \"Should I order some takeout? It's been a long time since I last visited Chen Siming's restaurant. I can call and have them deliver it here.\"","As he said this, Chang Zhiyuan took out his phone. Xu Xiuhe changed his shoes and said to Chang Zhiyuan, \"You can go eat at his restaurant now. No one is stopping you. It's your own choice to stay here.\"","Chang Zhiyuan felt hurt and ran toward Zhengzheng, with a teary voice, \"Zhengzheng, look, your dad is bullying your godfather again.\"","Xu Xiuhe went to the kitchen and offered to help with cooking, but he couldn't distinguish anything. Shen Yin found him to be in the way and asked him to leave.","Shen Yin busied herself in the kitchen, preparing a meal for Zhengzheng. Considering his young age, she made the dishes milder in flavor. She cooked steamed perch, garlic spare ribs, soy sauce beef, stir-fried oil greens, broccoli with wood ear mushrooms, and a fresh shrimp and mushroom soup.","Chang Zhiyuan caught a whiff of the aroma and exclaimed, \"Wow, what dish smells so good?\"","Shen Yin just finished scooping the rice from the pot and couldn't bring the dishes to the dining room, so she turned to Chang Zhiyuan and said, \"Bring these dishes out.\"","Chang Zhiyuan did as he was told and saw that Xu Xiuhe had already seated Zhengzheng.","At the dining table, Chang Zhiyuan seemed as if he hadn't eaten for days. He forgot about everything else and became unusually quiet. Shen Yin placed a piece of fish on her own plate, broke it into small pieces with her chopsticks, carefully inspected it to make sure there were no bones, and then fed it to Zhengzheng.","Although Xu Xiuhe also fed Zhengzheng, there was still a difference between men and women. He thought the fish had bones and believed it wasn't suitable for Zhengzheng to eat.","After taking a bite of the fish, Zhengzheng licked his lips and said to Shen Yin, \"The fish is delicious, Zhengzheng wants more.\"","Shen Yin initially thought that fish wasn't suitable for children as it could easily get stuck in their throats. While at the supermarket, Shen Yin asked Zhengzheng what he wanted to eat, and he said fish. So Shen Yin bought some fish and steamed it.","Shen Yin replied, \"Alright, if Zhengzheng likes it, then let's eat more.\" When there was a big serving, Shen Yin's grandfather used to enjoy fishing and would have the chef prepare various kinds of fish. He would also tell her that eating fish is good for becoming smarter. Shen Yin continued to pick out the fish bones and fed the fish to Zhengzheng.","Zhengzheng's little mouth didn't stop moving, and he was thoroughly enjoying the meal. Shen Yin was worried that he might choke, so she scooped a small spoonful of fresh shrimp and mushroom soup and fed it to Zhengzheng, saying, \"Here, Zhengzheng, have some soup and eat slowly.\"","Chang Zhiyuan spoke up, raising his head and finally stopping Shen Yin. \"Sister-in-law, can we discuss something?\"","Shen Yin now understood that this person named Chang Zhiyuan had a good relationship with Xu Xiuhe and was Zhengzheng's godfather. She could understand the misunderstanding and responded graciously, \"You may speak.\"","Chang Zhiyuan saw a glimmer of hope and eagerly said, \"Our company is working on a play, and we need a child actor. I want Zhengzheng to give it a try.\"","Shen Yin now had a better understanding of this world and knew that actors are those people on TV. She was quite interested and found it enjoyable. At the same time, she was puzzled as to why Chang Zhiyuan approached her for discussion instead of directly involving Xu Xiuhe. Shen Yin looked confused.","Xu Xiuhe noticed Shen Yin's confusion and explained, \"Zhengzheng has been under your care during this time, and if he goes to the filming location, he needs you to accompany him. They need your input and ideas.\"","Shen Yin, with a look of understanding, asked, \"So, do I need to go to the filming location with Zhengzheng?\"","Thinking that Shen Yin didn't want to go to the filming location, Chang Zhiyuan quickly reassured her, \"Sister-in-law, don't worry, I will arrange a dedicated assistant for you. You won't suffer.\"","Shen Yin felt tempted and looked at Xu Xiuhe, wanting to know his thoughts. But Xu Xiuhe was engrossed in devouring spare ribs.","Chang Zhiyuan spoke again, but this time, he addressed Zhengzheng, \"Zhengzheng, can your godfather ask you for a favor? If you agree, your godfather will fulfill many of your small wishes.\"","Xu Xiuhe couldn't bear it any longer and kicked Chang Zhiyuan's foot under the table, saying, \"That's enough, don't deceive my son in front of me. I can fulfill his wishes.\"","Chang Zhiyuan awkwardly smiled.","Shen Yin, of course, noticed it and asked Zhengzheng with a lowered head, \"Zhengzheng, do you want to go and play at the filming location?\"","Zhengzheng shook his head and replied with enthusiasm, \"I want to.\"","Chang Zhiyuan chuckled, \"As expected of my godson. And sister-in-law, why is the food you cooked so delicious?\"","Shen Yin's cooking was undoubtedly delicious. She dared to say that there weren't many people with culinary skills surpassing hers. Chang Zhiyuan thought to himself that he couldn't rely on Chen Siming for meals anymore.","After finishing the meal, Shen Yin took Zhengzheng to the bathroom to wipe his mouth and wash his face. Chang Zhiyuan and Xu Xiuhe remained seated at the dining table, and Shen Yin didn't plan on cleaning up. Since she had cooked the meal, whoever wanted to wash the dishes could do it.","Sure! Here's the translation of the Chinese novel into English:","Sure enough, men lack this self-awareness. Shen Yin had already finished washing her hands, but the two of them hadn't made a move yet.","Shen Yin had a touch of OCD and a slight cleanliness obsession. She couldn't stand it when the dining table wasn't cleaned after a meal. In her mansion, with four maids, everything was always in perfect order. Unless she wanted to do something herself, she didn't have to do anything.","Unable to bear it any longer, Shen Yin walked into the dining room and said to the two of them, \"Which one of you has time to clean up the table and wash the dishes?\" After saying that, she picked up Zhengzheng and went upstairs.","Xu Xiuhe and Chang Zhiyuan sat there without moving, looking at each other. Chang Zhiyuan, in need of help and lacking hands, obediently cleaned up the table and went into the kitchen to wash the dishes. This was probably one of the few times he had entered the kitchen.","Seeing this, Xu Xiuhe curled his lips and went upstairs. The villa had a total of three floors. The first floor consisted of the living room, dining room, kitchen, bathroom, and cloakroom. The second floor had the master bedroom, two guest bedrooms, and a study. Xu Xiuhe entered the study and continued working.","Suddenly, someone knocked on the door of the study. Xu Xiuhe thought it was Chang Zhiyuan, but when he opened the door, he was surprised to see Zhengzheng. \"Zhengzheng, what's the matter?\"","Zhengzheng took small steps and hugged Xu Xiuhe's thigh. \"Daddy, I want to read too.\"","Xu Xiuhe carried Zhengzheng into the study and handed him an art book.","When Chang Zhiyuan arrived at the study, he saw this scene: Xu Xiuhe typing on the computer keyboard while Zhengzheng looked at a book. He couldn't help but feel a little envious.","Seeing Chang Zhiyuan enter, Xu Xiuhe said, \"Perfect timing. Zhengzheng going to act has some conditions.\"","\"Tell me, tell me.\"","\"Go and get the documents from the printer.\"","In order to make Xu Xiuhe happy, Chang Zhiyuan hurriedly went to the printer and retrieved the documents.","Xu Xiuhe spoke, \"Take a look for yourself. Can you meet the conditions written on the document?\"","Chang Zhiyuan took a look. It was nothing more than ensuring Zhengzheng's safety and not disclosing his personal information.","\"Don't worry, I will absolutely ensure the safety of my godson. It's just that...\" Chang Zhiyuan paused for a moment.","\"Just say what you want to say.\"","\"We'll be joining the film crew the day after tomorrow.\""]},{"number":9,"title":"Chapter 9: Into the Group","paragraphs":["Xu Xiuhe pondered for a moment and said to Zhengzheng, \"Zhengzheng, can you go and call Mom for Dad?\"","Upon hearing this, Zhengzheng readily agreed and toddled out of the study into Shen Yin's room.","In a soft, childish voice, Zhengzheng said, \"Mom, Dad wants you to come to his room.\"","Shen Yin couldn't help but feel moved upon hearing Zhengzheng call her \"Mom\" once again. It would be insincere to say that she wasn't touched. In this era, she was perhaps regarded as family, and the only one who had sentimental feelings for her was this little darling in front of her.","Shen Yin's eyes were slightly moist as she lifted Zhengzheng up and said, \"Alright, let's go together.\"","Inside the study, Chang Zhiyuan was in conversation with Xu Xiuhe. Even though the door was open, Shen Yin still knocked before entering.","The study was quite spacious, with several large bookshelves, a desk, and an exquisite set of sofas. It was her first time entering the study, and she felt a little unsure.","Xu Xiuhe said, \"Zhengzheng will probably start filming in the next two days. You need to accompany him. Let me know if you need anything.\"","Shen Yin had never been on a film set before and didn't know what was needed. She replied casually, \"I haven't been on a film set either. Just let me know what preparations are necessary.\"","Then she looked at Zhengzheng and asked, \"Zhengzheng, is there anything you want?\"","Understanding her question, Zhengzheng replied, \"I want food.\"","Shen Yin instantly smiled, realizing that she seemed to have a peculiar sense of humor when she was with Zhengzheng.","Xu Xiuhe stared at her for a few seconds and said, \"I'll prepare a room with a kitchen for you.\"","Chang Zhiyuan, who was standing nearby, was truly astonished and felt like a third wheel in this situation. He spoke up, \"You two can continue talking. Just so you know, I'll come to pick you up when it's time to go to the film set. Feel free to ask if you need anything. I'll take my leave now.\"","Chang Zhiyuan's polite words were entirely due to Shen Yin's presence. Normally, he wouldn't be so courteous to Xu Xiuhe.","After Chang Zhiyuan left, there were only the three of them in the room. Zhengzheng sat on the sofa, looking at his own storybook. Shen Yin stood there feeling a bit awkward, thinking of going back to her own room, when Xu Xiuhe spoke up.","\"Zhengzheng, Mom and Dad are going out to have a chat. You stay here and read your book.\"","Zhengzheng nodded, and Shen Yin was curious about what Xu Xiuhe was going to say, so she followed him out.","The room had good sound insulation, so as soon as they left the study and closed the door, they could have their conversation in the hallway.","Xu Xiuhe spoke first, \"I think we need to have a good discussion.\"","Shen Yin also felt that it would be better to clarify certain things. \"I don't know what your situation is right now, but I hope we can continue as we have been. Zhengzheng is still young, and I don't want him to be harmed in any way.\"","Shen Yin had a general idea of what Xu Xiuhe meant. He was telling her not to cause any more trouble in the future.","\"Alright, I understand. It was my fault before, but from now on, I'll treat Zhengzheng well,\" Shen Yin sincerely replied, leaving Xu Xiuhe momentarily at a loss for words. After a few seconds of silence, he finally spoke.","\"Okay, as long as you understand. Let me know if there's anything you want to discuss with me.\"","Shen Yin nodded and returned to her own room.","Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin, upon seeing the situation, didn't say anything. They opened the study door and accompanied Zhengzheng inside.","After returning to her room, Shen Yin fell into deep thought. What should she bring to the set the day after tomorrow? Xu Xiuhe would take care of the other items, but what about her personal belongings?","Identity card, phone charger, change of clothes, and the various bottles and jars on the table.","The original owner's skin was just like hers—flawless, smooth, and fair. She hardly ever wore makeup and could easily outshine many others who did.","Shen Yin looked at herself in the mirror and gently touched her face, marveling at the quality of mirrors in this era. She decided not to bring any cosmetics.","On the day they were to go to the set, Chang Zhiyuan came to pick them up. Xu Xiuhe had deliberately skipped going to the company this morning.","Pointing at the girl who got out of the car with him, Chang Zhiyuan said, \"Sister-in-law, this is the assistant I found for you. She knows how to take care of children.\"","The girl was about 1.6 meters tall and looked honest and sincere.","Shen Yin replied, \"Okay, thank you for your help.\"","Chang Zhiyuan quickly added, \"No trouble at all, really.\"","Xu Xiuhe, holding Zhengzheng in his arms, also chimed in, \"Thank you for your hard work.\" His soft tone amused everyone present.","Looking at Zhengzheng in his arms, Xu Xiuhe turned to Shen Yin and asked, \"Is one assistant enough, or should I arrange for another one?\"","Shen Yin had trusted the people who used to serve her in the past, but they still made mistakes and failed to call for help, leading to her ending up here. Now, the fewer people around her, the better.","\"No need, one is enough. Oh, by the way, what's your name?\" Shen Yin asked.","When the girl heard the question directed at her, she immediately replied, \"Madam, my name is Yan Yan.\"","Shen Yin took Zhengzheng from Xu Xiuhe's arms and settled into the back seat.","\"Yan Yan, you can bring your bag from the suitcase and come up as well.\"","Seeing this, Chang Zhiyuan and Xu Xiuhe immediately moved the two suitcases from the back to the trunk.","Chang Zhiyuan sat in the driver's seat and Xu Xiuhe couldn't help but say, \"Take good care of them.\"","He then turned to Shen Yin and said, \"If there's any situation, call me. Let me know if you need anything.\"","After Shen Yin promised, the car drove away.","Upon arriving at the set, Shen Yin went to the hotel arranged by Chang Zhiyuan, undoubtedly the best in the area.","Chang Zhiyuan said, \"Sister-in-law, I've taken care of everything with the director. Tomorrow, someone will come to pick you up and take you to the shooting location.\"","Shen Yin replied, \"Okay.\"","Chang Zhiyuan escorted Shen Yin, Zhengzheng, and Yan Yan to the entrance of their room.","The room was a suite with two bedrooms, a kitchen, and a living room.","Chang Zhiyuan said, \"Sister-in-law, I have something to take care of, so I'll leave now.\" Then he turned to Yan Yan and added, \"Take good care of them and report any situation to me.\"","When they came, Xu Xiuhe had emphasized on his phone several times to ensure the safety of Shen Yin and Zhengzheng and to pay attention to Shen Yin's condition.","Yan Yan replied, \"Understood, boss. I'll report to you anytime.\"","After Chang Zhiyuan left, Shen Yin held Zhengzheng and took a quick look around the room, saying, \"Yan Yan, you can stay in the other room and tidy up the luggage.\"","Shen Yin: \"Alright, Madam. I see there are vegetables and various fruits in the kitchen. Do you need me to cook?\"","Considering that Zhengzheng has been sitting in the car for a long time and might be tired, Shen Yin agrees because it's not convenient to go out again to get food.","\"Baby, what do you want to eat tonight?\"","Zhengzheng, nestled in Shen Yin's arms, twirls her hair and says, \"I want to eat meat.\"","Shen Yin already had a hunch that this child loves to eat meat.","\"Yanyan, see what kind of meat we have in the refrigerator.\"","Yanyan opens the refrigerator and says, \"We have shrimp, pork belly, beef, eggs, tomatoes, preserved eggs, and some vegetables like broccoli. There's also plenty of fruit, Madam.\"","Shen Yin speculates that this much food must have been prepared by Xu Xiuhe or Chang Zhiyuan.","\"Alright, Yanyan, just follow my instructions later. The three of us can't eat much, so let's make lean pork and preserved egg congee, stir-fried broccoli with shrimp, braised beef with tomatoes, and blanched greens.\"","Yanyan also notices that Shen Yin is a good person, without any airs, and extremely gentle with the baby.","Yanyan has learned how to cook, but she's a bit doubtful when Shen Yin tells her to do it later.","Shen Yin realizes this and says, \"Just follow my instructions step by step.\"","An hour later, on the dining table, there are three dishes, a pot of congee, and two plates of fruit.","Shen Yin sits down with Zhengzheng in her arms since there's no baby chair in the room.","Yanyan says, \"Madam, shall I call someone to bring a baby chair?\"","Shen Yin replies, \"It's fine, I'll hold him. You sit down and eat too.\"","This is the first time Shen Yin has held Zhengzheng while eating. Zhengzheng is well-behaved and everything he eats seems delicious to him.","Yanyan also eats the dishes she made and is amazed after the first bite.","\"Madam, you're really amazing. I've never cooked such delicious food myself.\"","Shen Yin smiles and says, \"You can make more in the future.\"","After the meal, Yanyan tidies up the table and kitchen, and Shen Yin takes Zhengzheng back to the bedroom.","Suddenly, Shen Yin realizes that she has never slept with Zhengzheng before, let alone giving him a bath later.","Shen Yin says, \"Yanyan, after you finish tidying up, come to my room.\"","Yanyan replies, \"I'm almost done. I'll come in a moment.\"","Shen Yin takes off Zhengzheng's shoes and places him on the bed. She takes out two early education picture books from the suitcase and puts them in front of Zhengzheng.","\"Zhengzheng, you can look at the books first. Mommy has prepared the things you need for a bath, okay?\"","Zhengzheng takes the picture books and shows his little milk teeth to Shen Yin, saying, \"Okay.\"","Shen Yin takes out the pajamas Zhengzheng will wear from the suitcase and adjusts the indoor temperature of the air conditioner to a suitable level. She's already quite familiar with this world and has learned various skills.","Baby bath gel, shampoo, baby lotion... Shen Yin realizes that these items are all packed in one bag. It seems that Song Mama has already left, so Xu Xiuhe or Chang Zhiyuan must have prepared them.","It must be said that in Shen Yin's eyes, Xu Xiuhe was indeed a good father.","Soon, Shen Yin felt sentimental again, remembering that her own father had been good to her before Xu Zhen came into the picture.","After tidying up, Yan Yan knocked on Shen Yin's door, bringing her thoughts back.","Shen Yin: \"Come in.\"","Yan Yan pushed the door open and saw Shen Yin taking out the baby's toiletries. She asked, \"Madam, are you going to bathe the baby?\"","Shen Yin: \"Yes, Yan Yan, please go inside and fill up the water, and bring this bag in too. I'll take Zhengzheng in later.\"","Shen Yin stood up and walked to the side of the bed. \"Zhengzheng, we're going to take a bath.\""]},{"number":10,"title":"Chapter 10: Shuyi","paragraphs":["Zhengzheng raised her head, shaking her little head and waving her hands, saying, \"I don't want to take a bath, no baths.\"","This puzzled Shen Yin.","\"Zhengzheng, all the little kids have to take a bath. After bathing, you'll smell nice,\" Shen Yin said.","Zhengzheng blinked her big eyes, seemingly contemplating.","Seeing this, Shen Yin continued, \"Zhengzheng, you can only go to sleep after taking a bath. How about this? If Zhengzheng promises Mommy, Mommy will take Zhengzheng out to play tomorrow, okay?\"","As soon as Zhengzheng heard about going out to play, she immediately agreed. Shen Yin carried Zhengzheng into the bathroom.","Yan Yan had already prepared the bathwater. Shen Yin was still a bit uncertain.","\"Yan Yan, I've never given Zhengzheng a bath before. Can you please help me?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"No problem. Let's start by taking off Zhengzheng's clothes,\" Yan Yan replied.","After saying that, the two of them cooperated. Shen Yin held Zhengzheng in her arms while Yan Yan undressed her.","The baby's skin was simply perfect, so smooth and tender. Yan Yan couldn't help but envy it when she took Zhengzheng from Shen Yin's embrace. She said, \"The skin of children is really amazing.\"","Shen Yin smiled and teased, \"His mommy's skin is not bad either, you know.\"","Yan Yan carefully observed Shen Yin and saw that her skin was fair, with no visible pores, and her features were delicate. She realized that Shen Yin was joking. With that, the tension of the day eased.","Curiously, Yan Yan asked, \"Madam, do you look like you're 18? You seem so young.\"","Shen Yin burst into laughter and said, \"I'm already 24.\"","In her heart, she secretly thought, \"Actually, I'm only 16.\"","One person entertained Zhengzheng while the other washed her hair. Zhengzheng didn't cry or make a fuss; instead, she played with the foam in her hands.","With Yan Yan's assistance, Shen Yin successfully finished bathing Zhengzheng. They blew dry her hair and dressed her in pajamas.","Shen Yin said, \"Yan Yan, please take Zhengzheng outside and apply some baby lotion to her body. Let her play for a while. I'll take a bath and join you later.\"","Yan Yan loved children, especially adorable ones like Zhengzheng. She was eager to accompany Zhengzheng and play with her.","After Shen Yin finished bathing and came out, she saw Yan Yan and Zhengzheng happily laughing.","Shen Yin said, \"It's getting late. Zhengzheng needs to sleep. Yan Yan, you can go take a bath and rest. He will sleep with me tonight.\"","Yan Yan replied, \"Okay then, I'll go first.\"","Zhengzheng also grew tired from playing and lay on the bed, squinting her eyes. Shen Yin covered her with a blanket and lay down beside her. She kissed Zhengzheng's forehead. In this world, Zhengzheng was the person she loved most.","After returning to her own room, Yan Yan made a phone call to report everything that happened today to Xu Xiuhe. Initially, she had been reporting to her employer, Chang Zhiyuan, but then she received a phone number from him and was instructed to report to that number instead.","In the morning, Shen Yin was awakened by Zhengzheng. Zhengzheng lay in her arms, reaching out to touch Shen Yin's face.","As soon as Shen Yin opened her eyes, she saw this adorable little Zhengzheng with an innocent expression. She said, \"Baby, are you awake?\"","Zhengzheng replied, \"Yes, Zhengzheng wants to get up.\"","Shen Yin said, \"Okay, Zhengzheng, wait for Mommy for a moment. Mommy will get up first and then change your clothes, alright?\"","Zhengzheng nodded eagerly.","Shen Yin got up and went to the bathroom to change clothes before returning to the bedside where Zhengzheng was already standing.","At the age of two, a toddler can already walk, run, hop, sway, imitate adult speech, and even think. However, the previous host disliked Zhengzheng. Children are the most perceptive and sensitive beings, and Zhengzheng could sense that his mother didn't love him, so he wasn't happy. His father was often absent, leaving only Song Ma to take care of him.","A child who lacks love is fundamentally different. They don't speak much, don't want to walk, lack a sense of security, and feel nervous and uneasy when facing Shen Yin.","But now, things are different. After spending a few days together, Zhengzheng could feel that his mother no longer disliked him and treated him well.","The thoughts of a young child are pure, and once they feel loved, the whole world seems brighter to them.","Shen Yin also noticed that Zhengzheng seemed a little different these past few days.","After changing his diaper, putting on clothes, and wearing shoes, Zhengzheng sat at the edge of the bed, wanting to come down. However, his little legs were struggling to reach the ground, but he never gave up.","Shen Yin found it amusing as Zhengzheng's two eyes looked at her, like a clueless little deer, as if saying, \"Help me.\"","Shen Yin picked up Zhengzheng.","As soon as Zhengzheng reached the ground, he happily shook his head and stamped his feet, heading towards the door.","\"Sweetie, you can't go out yet. Zhengzheng hasn't washed his face,\" Shen Yin said.","Shen Yin herself hadn't realized that she had unconsciously become gentler in her speech these past few days because of the baby, even using a gentle tone.","When Zhengzheng heard this, he turned around and returned to Shen Yin's side. Shen Yin lifted him up and went to the bathroom.","Zhengzheng: \"I need to pee.\"","Shen Yin took off Zhengzheng's pants and remembered that the diaper was still clean when she changed it in the morning. During the day, when Zhengzheng wanted to use the toilet, he would say so. So, maybe he didn't need the diaper anymore? After all, wearing it might be uncomfortable.","Shen Yin: \"Is Zhengzheng growing up?\"","Zhengzheng nodded: \"Mm-hmm, Zhengzheng is growing up. Dad says Zhengzheng is a little man.\"","Shen Yin started to think that Xu Xiuhe was a good father.","Shen Yin: \"A little man doesn't need to wear diapers. So, from now on, Zhengzheng won't wear them either, okay?\"","Zhengzheng: \"Zhengzheng is a little man, Zhengzheng doesn't want to wear diapers.\"","The expression on the little one's face was determined, and there was even a hint of disdain as he looked at the removed diaper. It truly made Shen Yin find it adorable.","Shen Yin: \"Good, starting today, Zhengzheng won't wear diapers anymore. If you need to use the toilet, just tell Mommy, okay?\"","Zhengzheng: \"Okay.\"","Shen Yin: \"After using the toilet, Zhengzheng needs to brush his teeth.\" Shen Yin squeezed some toothpaste onto a baby toothbrush and put it in Zhengzheng's mouth, gently brushing it, making Zhengzheng rinse his mouth. Then she wiped his face with warm water.","After Zhengzheng finished getting ready, Shen Yin began her own preparations.","Once the mother and son were done, they went to the dining room and found that Yan Yan had already prepared breakfast.","Yan Yan had just come out of the kitchen. \"Madam, Zhengzheng, breakfast is ready. The driver is downstairs, so you can go down after eating.\"","Shen Yin replied, \"Great, Yan Yan, please sit down and have breakfast too.\"","Yan Yan said, \"You go ahead and eat. I'll tidy up the milk powder and snacks Zhengzheng needs during the day.\"","In that moment, Shen Yin realized how helpful it was to have an assistant. Being a mother was something she hadn't experienced before, and she knew she had to continue striving to be a good one.","Upon entering the film set, Shen Yin felt a sense of novelty. It was surprising to see how many people aspired to be actors in this era.","\"Hello, are you this young actor's mother?\"","Shen Yin turned around and saw a woman dressed in blue, with delicate features that could instantly captivate anyone.","\"Yes, I am Zhengzheng's mother. You can call me Shen Yin.\"","\"I'm Shu Yi, the actress playing Zhengzheng's mother in the drama.\"","Shu Yi looked at Shen Yin, and she found her to be perfect in both temperament and appearance. In the entertainment industry, there were few actresses who could surpass her.","Shu Yi knew that Chang Zhiyuan, the CEO of Chongzhi Media, was pursuing her, but she hadn't responded to his advances. Everyone knew that Chang Zhiyuan had had several ex-girlfriends. Shu Yi, being a small actress with a low status, only had her looks to rely on. She knew exactly what Chang Zhiyuan wanted from her. Moreover, she was used to her freedom and living as she pleased. If she became someone's kept woman, she would lose everything.","She had her own acting skills, and if there was no other way out, she would quit the entertainment industry.","But Chang Zhiyuan told her that he wouldn't suppress her just because she refused to be his girlfriend. On the contrary, he had been treating her exceptionally well lately, taking her out for meals and drinks and occasionally visiting her on set.","During his last visit, she overheard the director saying that they needed a young actor to play Shu Yi's son in the drama, but they hadn't found a suitable one yet.","Shu Yi felt nervous. She had been acting for several years, mostly in youth campus dramas. This historical drama, \"The Legend of Yan Xi,\" was very important and challenging for her.","Particularly, when the main character, Yan Xi, gave birth to a child while her husband, Jiang Yuyang, went off to war, and at that time, there was a coup in the court. There were rumors that Jiang Yuyang had died in battle, and Yan Xi had to single-handedly support their family with the child.","The timeline of this drama was quite long, covering Yan Xi's life from marriage to old age. Therefore, the role of Yan Xi's son was crucial, especially during the two-year-old period. Different actors were needed for different stages of the character's life.","As a new mother, Yan Xi had to learn how to take care of her child, educate him, and manage a family. It was a true test of an actress's skills.","Chang Zhiyuan could tell that Yan Xi was feeling nervous and uneasy. Other stages of the character's life were easier to find actors for. A newborn baby could be replaced with a fake one that didn't need to appear on screen. For the teenage years, they could select from young actors. However, finding a suitable two-year-old actor was a bit challenging.","Chang Zhiyuan pondered for a moment and thought of his godson, who was intelligent, clever, and incredibly handsome. So he told the director and Shu Yi that he would find the actor from his childhood.","Shu Yi carefully observed Zhengzheng and noticed that despite his young age, he was well-behaved, neither crying nor making a fuss. His appearance was also remarkably outstanding, and his attire didn't resemble that of an ordinary child.","Zhengzheng, too, looked at Shu Yi and became a bit shy, burying his face on Shen Yin's shoulder. But he couldn't resist stealing glances at Shu Yi. After a while, he removed his little hand and revealed his big eyes, sneakily watching Shu Yi.","All these little gestures melted Shu Yi's heart. Judging from the mother's demeanor, it seemed that their family background must be very affluent.","At that moment, the director approached. Chang Zhiyuan had already informed Wang Ming in advance. Wang Ming was a veteran director and highly respected in the industry.","\"So, this is the young actor. We'll be shooting the scene in the afternoon, but let's have lunch first,\" Wang Ming said to Shen Yin.","\"The costume department should prepare the costumes and props for the young actor,\" Wang Ming ordered the other staff members after speaking.","The food on the set couldn't compare to what they had at home, and Shen Yin couldn't eat much during lunch with Zhengzheng.","\"Be good, Zhengzheng. When we go back tonight, Mommy will cook something delicious for you.\""]},{"number":11,"title":"Chapter 11: Filming","paragraphs":["Shen Yin started to regret not waking up early in the morning to prepare lunch for her child and bring it along.","After finishing lunch, Yan Yan led Shen Yin and Zhengzheng into the dressing room.","Zhengzheng had hair that was neither too long nor too short, perfectly suitable for a child's hairstyle. His fair and tender skin didn't require any makeup artist's touch.","However, there was a slight issue with the costumes. The props team had no concept of clothing sizes for a two-year-old child. Shen Yin and Yan Yan dressed Zhengzheng in the clothes, only to realize that they were quite oversized.","Zhengzheng stood up from the chair, clapping his little hands, resembling someone about to perform on stage. It seemed like the only thing missing was a theater stage.","The members of the costume and props team also became worried. What could they do? They couldn't grasp the sizes correctly, and it was their mistake. Considering Wang Ming's directorial seriousness when it came to filming, he would surely criticize them.","As if on cue, Director Wang pushed open the door of the dressing room, smiled at Shen Yin, and turned to ask about the progress of the costume team.","\"Is everything ready? If it's ready, we can start shooting.\"","The members of the costume team became nervous. One of them stammered, \"I'm sorry, Director. The size of the costumes for the young actor is a bit inappropriate.\"","After saying that, the entire costume team became even more anxious, standing there uneasily. The room fell into silence, with everyone waiting for Wang Ming's scolding.","Wang Ming turned his head to look at Zhengzheng, who was still touching his own clothes, his face full of curiosity.","Perhaps afraid of startling Zhengzheng with his loud voice, Wang Ming didn't react as they had expected. He simply said, \"You have two hours to figure out a solution. We'll start shooting at four o'clock sharp.\"","The costume team faced another dilemma. \"Director, these clothes were custom-made from an external factory. Chen Jie, who is responsible for altering the sizes, took a leave today.\"","Misfortunes never come singly.","Upon hearing this, Wang Ming became even angrier. This was irresponsibility! He was about to reprimand them when he heard Shen Yin speak up.","\"Wang Director, how about this? I can make the modifications to the clothes. It will take about half an hour. You can focus on other things for now.\"","\"Is that possible?\" Wang Ming was skeptical. After all, Chang Zhiyuan had already informed him. Zhengzheng was the son of the CEO of Yuan Corporation.","And Shen Yin was the wife of the CEO. Leaving aside whether the wife of a CEO would alter clothes, he, as a director, couldn't let her do the work for his crew.","Shen Yin noticed Wang Ming's concerns.","\"Don't worry, Director. I studied costume design. It's quite easy, and it won't be much trouble.\"","Only then did Wang Ming feel relieved. He said, \"Thank you for the trouble,\" and left.","The members of the costume team were immensely grateful to Shen Yin. After Wang Ming left, they busied themselves preparing things for her.","Two men directly brought Chen Jie's sewing machine and plugged it in front of Shen Yin.","Others brought scissors. Some found a measuring tape.","Yan Yan changed Zhengzheng's clothes and handed them to Shen Yin.","Shen Yin had been holding Zhengzheng for the past couple of days, so she didn't need to measure. She knew how to modify the sizes.","As for the sewing machine in front of her, Shen Yin, despite having the memories of the previous owner, had never actually practiced using it. Trying something new at this time would certainly be too late.","So, she decided to sew by hand instead. Shen Yin took apart all the threads from the clothes, which were made up of several pieces of fabric stitched together. The original patterns were already set, so all she had to do was cut each piece of fabric to the right proportions and then sew them together.","Soon, the clothes were almost finished. Shen Yin felt that the fit of the clothes was still not aesthetically pleasing enough, so she decided to make some further adjustments. The fabric was still good, so she fixed the fit and added some small patterns to the cuffs.","When Zhengzheng put on the clothes again, everyone present was shocked. They didn't expect it to fit so perfectly.","\"Madam, you're amazing. You didn't even measure the size, yet it turned out to fit so well,\" Yan Yan couldn't believe it.","\"Truly impressive, Madam. Thank you,\" the members of the costume team echoed.","Yan Yan looked at her phone and reminded, \"Madam, it's time. Zhengzheng needs to go out for the shoot.\"","Shen Yin picked up Zhengzheng from the chair and walked towards the door, with Yan Yan following along with all the bags.","\"Oh, you're done. I was just about to go in and see how the alterations were going,\" Wang Ming approached them.","\"Yes, we're done. You can go in, but Zhengzheng has never acted before, so please be understanding, Director,\" Shen Yin said calmly.","\"I understand, I understand,\" Wang Ming nodded, knowing that he couldn't say much as the son of the CEO of Yuan Corporation, even if Zhengzheng caused trouble on set.","Wang Ming led Shen Yin to a quaint room. Shen Yin saw a group of people gathered around several screens, with some racks in front.","The previous owner's memories had these things, and now she was witnessing how these people ran into the TV through the screens and made the show.","\"Shuyi, Zhengzheng is here,\" Wang Ming called out to Shu Yi.","After finishing her makeup, Shu Yi walked over to Shen Yin and gently touched Zhengzheng's little face, saying, \"Son, Mommy is here.\" Then she smiled apologetically at Shen Yin.","Shen Yin smiled back, understanding that she needed to get familiar with Zhengzheng for their roles later.","\"Who is Mommy?\" Zhengzheng still looked confused. He didn't understand why this person called Mommy had arrived and called him her son. Usually, he heard people call him son, like his godfather.","Everyone present couldn't help but laugh at Zhengzheng's question.","\"Zhengzheng, Mommy is another word for Mom. Later, in the show, this beautiful auntie will be your Mommy, okay? Just pretend we're playing house,\" Yan Yan patiently explained.","Zhengzheng seemed to grasp the idea but held onto Shen Yin's arm tighter and said, \"But I already have a Mommy.\"","Wang Ming and the others felt awkward, not knowing how to explain this to a young child.","Shen Yin smiled helplessly and said, \"It's just acting. I'm still your Mommy, but for this period of time, you have another Mommy in the show. Can you pretend to play along with this Mommy? Like playing make-believe?\"","Shen Yin was still afraid that Zhengzheng wouldn't understand, so she continued, \"Zhengzheng, do you have a godfather? Godfather means the same as a father, right?\"","Zhengzheng nodded.","\"Is your godfather good to you?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Then, can Zhengzheng consider this beautiful aunt as your godmother? She will treat you well just like your godfather. Can you listen to her and obey her?\"","\"Okay! Dad said Zhengzheng is a brave little man who should listen to Mom.\" The two-year-old boy looked determined.","The logic of having both a godfather and a godmother was indeed strange, but Zhengzheng firmly believed in this logic. Everyone present found it ridiculous, but fortunately, Zhengzheng had become familiar with Shu Yi, making communication easier.","The first scene was Shu Yi feeding Zhengzheng.","Wang Ming explained the scene to Shu Yi, emphasizing the need to portray Yan Xi's patience. This patience involved slowly feeding Zhengzheng.","Yan Xi single-handedly supported a large family and was truly busy. Despite her numerous responsibilities, she never neglected her son, Jiang Yu.","Wang Ming, Shu Yi, and the assistant director gathered around Zhengzheng and spoke to him, teaching him what to say during the scene.","On the table prepared by the props team, there were four dishes. Originally, considering the status and power of the Jiang family, there should have been eight dishes. However, Yan Xi reduced the number by half.","Two dishes were props, and two were edible.","Wang Ming asked, \"Is everyone ready?\"","\"We're ready.\"","\"Action!\"","Zhengzheng sat on a chair, with Shu Yi sitting beside him.","The camera was rolling.","\"Jiang Yu, shall we eat our meal obediently?\"","After Shu Yi finished speaking, she picked up a piece of green vegetable and brought it to Zhengzheng's mouth.","After eating it, Zhengzheng's face showed a hint of distress. It was the most unpleasant vegetable he had ever tasted.","But then he remembered what his mom had said about cooperating with his godmother. Well, he would endure it.","Seeing Zhengzheng's expression, Shu Yi couldn't help but smile. She guessed that the little darling probably found the vegetable unappetizing.","The vegetable was put together from a lunchbox, which was quite unfair to Zhengzheng.","There was nothing they could do; it was acting after all, and the conditions on the set were like this.","Shu Yi focused on the performance, looking at Jiang Yu with a smile.","\"Jiang Yu, do you not like eating green vegetables?\"","Zhengzheng nodded, practically writing his agreement on his face. Not only did he dislike eating green vegetables, but he also detested eating such unpalatable ones.","\"Then, Yu'er, eat another bite of the green vegetable, alright? After finishing the vegetable, we can eat the meat.\"","\"Mom, when will Dad come back?\"","Yan Xi fell into contemplation and replied, \"Dad is a man who protects the family and the country. When Yu'er grows up, Dad will come back.\"","Zhengzheng nodded as if he understood but not really.","\"Then, Yu'er will also protect the family and the country in the future.\"","\"Click.\"","The scene was over.","Wang Ming and the assistant director were ecstatic. They had managed to complete the scene in one take.","\"Fantastic, Shu Yi! You handled the details exceptionally well!\" praised Wang Ming.","\"Thank you, director.\"","\"Zhengzheng is amazing, such a young child, yet able to remember lines and catch Shu Yi's scenes.\"","\"Yes, the pacing is also very well executed,\" the assistant director chimed in.","Shen Yin walked over and lifted Zhengzheng up, while Yan Yan held a cup of water and offered it to Zhengzheng's lips.","\"You've worked hard, Zhengzheng. Mommy will make some meat for you to eat when we go home tonight.\"","\"Okay, meat! No vegetables! Those vegetables are so difficult to eat! They taste bitter,\" Zhengzheng said, pointing at the greens on the table with a disgusted look on his face.","Shen Yin took out a tissue and wiped the corners of Zhengzheng's mouth.","Director Wang Ming walked over.","\"Zhengzheng is truly amazing. If we continue at this pace, Zhengzheng will have a total of ten scenes, and we should be able to film another one this afternoon.\"","\"Alright, I'll take Zhengzheng out for a walk. Let us know when you're ready, and we'll come back,\" Shen Yin replied."]},{"number":12,"title":"Chapter 12: The Personality","paragraphs":["One afternoon, Zhengzheng successfully finished filming two scenes.","In the evening, a driver picked up Zhengzheng and took him to the hotel.","As soon as they entered the hotel, Shen Yin noticed that something was different from the morning. There seemed to be more hotel staff.","25th floor, manager's office. Xu Xiuhe received the news that Shen Yin and Zhengzheng had returned to the hotel.","The hotel was owned by Yuan Group, and when it opened, Xu Xiuhe came once, but he hadn't been involved since then. This time, the entire atmosphere of the hotel had changed.","Knock, knock, knock.","\"Come in.\"","\"CEO, the dishes are ready downstairs.\" The manager received a call from Liu Assistant and learned that Xu Xiuhe was coming, so he started preparing the food.","\"I won't go. Select a few of the best-tasting dishes and send them to Room 2001.\"","Xu Xiuhe didn't even lift his head as he replied.","Suite 2001.","\"Zhengzheng, you've worked hard today. I've prepared something delicious for you.\" Shen Yin placed Xu Zhengzheng on the sofa.","\"Yan Yan, get the ingredients ready. I'll come over and cook later.\"","\"Wife, why don't I do it?\" Yan Yan felt that as an assistant, she should do more.","\"No need. I promised Zhengzheng that I would cook for him. You stay with him for a while.\"","Yan Yan walked out of the kitchen and watched Zhengzheng play beside the sofa.","Knock, knock, knock. Someone was at the door.","Yan Yan was a bit suspicious and ran to the kitchen to ask Shen Yin if she should open it.","\"Open it.\"","Yan Yan followed Shen Yin's instructions and cautiously opened the door.","\"Hello, madam. This is dinner sent to you by the hotel.\"","Yan Yan fully opened the door, and the waiter pushed the cart into the room and placed the dishes on the table.","\"Please enjoy.\" After the waiter finished speaking, he left the room.","Shen Yin guessed that it should be the food sent by Xu Xiuhe. He probably knew that the food on the set wasn't good.","\"Wife, what is this?\" Yan Yan pointed to the dishes on the table and asked.","\"It's fine. It should be sent by his father. I still have soup cooking in the kitchen.\"","Shen Yin looked at Zhengzheng happily playing on the sofa and smiled. Then she went into the kitchen.","Since Xu Xiuhe had sent the food, she wouldn't cook the next dishes. A pot of soup, along with the freshly cooked tomato beef stew, and the table full of dishes sent by Xu Xiuhe were already enough. It's better not to waste it.","\"Yan Yan, bring out the soup and dishes from inside, and also the rice you cooked earlier.\" After washing her hands, Shen Yin came out and picked up Zhengzheng.","Yan Yan went into the kitchen, and Shen Yin carried Zhengzheng to the dining table. At that moment, there was another knock on the door.","\"Zhengzheng, let's open the door first.\"","As soon as the door opened, Zhengzheng clapped his hands cheerfully.","\"Daddy, daddy.\"","Xu Xiuhe reached out, and Zhengzheng's hand reached for his neck.","\"Do you miss Daddy, Zhengzheng?\"","\"Miss Daddy, Zhengzheng misses Daddy.\"","Xu Xiuhe carried Zhengzheng into the room, and Shen Yin closed the door.","\"I had something to do over here, so I thought I'd come and see you.\" Xu Xiuhe explained his visit to Shen Yin.","Shen Yin didn't know how to respond. The situation was a bit awkward, but coincidentally, Yan Yan brought three bowls of rice out from the kitchen.","\"Sir, you're here. I just finished cooking, come and eat. I have something to attend to, so I'll step out for a moment.\"","In fact, Yan Yan knew last night that Xu Xiuhe and Shu Yi were coming over.","When she was discussing work with Xu Xiuhe last night, he mentioned that he might come over today.","Since they're having a family dinner, she definitely had to come out. She still had some foresight.","\"Yes, sure. Come back early,\" Shen Yin expressed her concern.","Xu Xiuhe placed Zhengzheng on the chair and sat down himself.","Shen Yin went into the kitchen and brought out the dishes and soup that Yan Yan hadn't served yet.","\"You've been working hard these past few days.\"","\"It's fine. Zhengzheng is also my child. It was my fault before, so there's no hardship.\"","At the dining table, it quieted down again, with only Zhengzheng eating the rice in his own bowl.","\"Daddy, Zhengzheng wants to eat meat.\"","\"Alright, eat meat. Has Zhengzheng been well-behaved today?\"","\"Yes, Zhengzheng listened. Today, Zhengzheng's name is Jiang Yu, and Auntie Shu is his godmother. She fed Zhengzheng vegetables, but those vegetables taste really bad. They're so bitter.\"","As the child spoke, his facial expressions matched his words.","Xu Xiuhe looked puzzled and turned to look at Shen Yin.","\"Well, in the play, Zhengzheng's name is Jiang Yu, and Auntie Shu is his godmother, Shu Yi. Initially, we just used the term 'godfather' to refer to Xu Xiuhe, but it turned out he really became Zhengzheng's godmother,\" Shen Yin explained.","Xu Xiuhe smiled and said, \"I see. Our Zhengzheng is really clever. Your godfather will be thrilled when he finds out.\"","\"Why would godfather be happy?\" Zhengzheng asked in confusion.","This question struck a chord with Shen Yin as well. Why would Chang Zhiyuan be happy when calling Shu Yi godmother?","Zhengzheng already resembled Shen Yin, and at this moment, their facial expressions were even more similar.","\"Why? Let Daddy think about it,\" Xu Xiuhe deliberately kept them in suspense.","Seeing Zhengzheng starting to get anxious, Xu Xiuhe finally spoke.","\"Because, well, your godfather likes Shu Yi. He wants Shu Yi to become your godmother.\"","Shen Yin suddenly realized. So, Chang Zhiyuan had Zhengzheng act in the play to get closer to Shu Yi.","\"What does 'liking' mean? Does Daddy like Mommy too?\" Zhengzheng still had a puzzled look. There are many things that children don't understand, such as liking, death, and faith.","The situation became awkward again; the two adults didn't know how to answer this question.","\"Zhengzheng, it's like this. Liking someone is a magical thing. Zhengzheng is still young and doesn't understand, but when Zhengzheng grows up, you'll understand,\" Shen Yin broke the awkward silence.","What is liking, Shen Yin didn't understand either. In Dashing Dream, her skills would be infinitely amplified, so she could do so many things here: horseback riding, martial arts, cooking, brewing wine, playing musical instruments, calligraphy and painting, embroidery, traditional Chinese medicine... She wasn't proficient in all of them, but she had a basic understanding.","Skills are amplified infinitely. Has she mastered them all by now? She hasn't had a chance to try yet; for now, she only changed her clothes and doesn't need any skills.","Shen Yin doesn't understand what \"liking someone\" means, but Xu Xiuhe does. Xu Xiuhe had a first love, but he was hurt, and now he doesn't want to like anyone anymore, nor does he have any feelings for the word \"liking.\"","\"Zhengzheng, liking someone means wanting to be good to them, just like how Dad likes Zhengzheng.\"","Zhengzheng nodded and said, \"Then Zhengzheng also likes Dad and Mom.\"","Shen Yin's eyes became moist. Children are really innocent. If you treat them well, they will like you, even if you've hurt them before.","\"Mom also really, really likes Zhengzheng.\"","Xu Xiuhe doubted this statement. Can a person really change so much?","Oh well, as long as she doesn't hurt Zhengzheng, everything is fine.","After dinner, Xu Xiuhe left because there were still many things waiting for him at work.","Before leaving, he wanted to say something to Shen Yin, but ultimately couldn't bring himself to.","\"Hello, I'm Xu Xiuhe.\"","\"Hello, is there something wrong with Shen Yin since you called me so late?\" Ji Qingyan had just come out of the bathroom when she received Xu Xiuhe's call.","\"Shen Yin is doing well. There's nothing wrong. I just don't understand how someone can undergo such a big change in just half a month.\"","\"Mr. Xu, your concern is understandable. Shen Yin has indeed undergone a significant transformation. From my perspective, she has recovered remarkably well. Healing a troubled heart requires the touch of another heart. She has managed to come out on her own, which is not easy. You should consider her as a changed person, reborn. Perhaps, it's time for you to get to know her again.\"","Ji Qingyan has encountered many patients, but very few recover as quickly as Shen Yin. In her conversations with Shen Yin, she noticed a significant difference since her improvement. She couldn't comprehend such a thing and could only consider it as a complete recovery. The world is full of unsolved mysteries. Perhaps, she has another personality."]},{"number":13,"title":"Chapter 13: Zhou Man","paragraphs":["The third scene of the vibrant play was filmed outdoors.","Shen Yin woke up early and received a message in a group chat.","Zhengzheng was still asleep. In the kitchen, Shen Yin was alone, simultaneously tending to several pots.","\"If only I could come back by noon,\" Shen Yin sighed.","In April, the weather could be described as hot, where one would feel warm even in short sleeves and shorts, or cold enough torequire a coat and autumn trousers at times.","When Shen Yin woke up in the morning, she felt that today's weather was hot. She checked her phone and saw that the temperature would reach a maximum of 32 degrees Celsius.","Fortunately, Shen Yin had brought some summer clothes when she came. This era was quite nice, with ice and air conditioning to combat the heat, allowing her to wear shorts and short sleeves.","Shen Yin prepared breakfast and placed it on the table: preserved egg and lean meat congee, a serving of egg custard, steamed dumplings with chicken and mushrooms. She didn't have time to make more.","While thinking about preparing lunch, she also considered the hot weather. She wondered if the food would spoil if they ate it at noon.","The phone on the nearby table rang, displaying \"Shen Lv\" on the screen.","\"Hello, what's up?\" Shen Yin answered.","\"Yinyin, today is the day for your follow-up check-up,\" Shen Lv said.","\"Brother, the doctor already said that I've recovered, and besides, I'm not in Rongcheng right now.\"","Shen Lv grew suspicious. \"You're not at home? Then where are you?\"","Shen Lv was genuinely afraid that Shen Yin would do something abnormal. From the time Shen Yin got married until now, he thought he knew her well. She had no friends and rarely left the house. It was surprising that she wasn't at home today.","Shen Yin replied calmly, \"I'm at the film and television studio near Rongcheng. Zhengzheng is filming here.\"","Shen Lv was greatly shocked. \"Filming? How could my nephew be filming? What's the situation with Xu Xiuhe?\"","\"He's just helping his friend out. It'll only be for a few days. I'll hang up now; I have to go to the set.\"","After Shen Yin finished speaking, she didn't wait for Shen Lv's reply and ended the call.","Shen Lv couldn't sit still. He had heard from Ji Qingyan that Shen Yin's condition had improved, and she could even be considered mostly recovered. Today, he wanted to take Shen Yin for a check-up to confirm it again. He also wanted to see Ji Qingyan.","Since Shen Yin wasn't at home, he would go by himself. He was always the kind of person who did whatever he thought of. Shen's father and Shen's mother had worried about him a lot, but fortunately, although he seemed unconventional and unreliable, he was still responsible when it came to work.","Shen Lv put his phone in his pants pocket and grabbed his jacket before heading downstairs.","Shen's father was sitting on the sofa in the living room, reading the newspaper. He glanced up and saw Shen Lv coming down from upstairs.","Shen's father adjusted his glasses and asked, \"It's the weekend today. Why are you up so early?\"","Shen's mother came out of the kitchen. \"Today is the day for Shen Yin to see the doctor. But why did you wake up so early? It's been a year or two since you last went.\"","Shen Lv felt wronged. \"Is it because I didn't take her before? You both know what her attitude has been toward the three of us. After getting married, has she ever come back? Is she willing to see us? The last time I went was because the driver took a day off.\"","Shen's father and Shen's mother remained silent.","Shen Lv realized that her words were heavy, then continued, \"The doctor said last time that she has made significant progress and is basically cured. She is currently accompanying Zhengzheng in the film and television city shooting!\"","\"Ah, Shen Lv, it's been so long, why haven't you mentioned it before? Has your sister really improved?\" Shen's Mother held Shen Lv's arm.","Shen's Father had been watching Shen Lv attentively. \"She's in the film and television city now, what do you want to do?\"","\"I'll go find her doctor first and talk to her.\" Shen Lv put on her coat.","\"Great, we'll go too. It's a good opportunity to thank the doctor and then visit your sister at the film and television city.\" Shen's Father put down the newspaper.","Shen Lv looked hesitant. \"Is it appropriate?\"","\"Why not? If you go, can't your mother and I go? Is the doctor a young girl around your age?\" Shen's Father looked inquisitive.","Shen's Father knew Shen Lv very well, not at all reluctant to accompany her. Luckily, he had a sense of propriety, or else he would have prevented Shen Lv from leaving the house.","\"Alright, as your father said, come over for dinner first.\" Shen's Mother couldn't wait.","At 9 o'clock, on the 48th floor, Shen Lv knocked on Ji Qingyan's office door.","\"Come in.\" Ji Qingyan looked up.","\"Dr. Ji, we meet again.\" Shen Lv greeted with a smile.","\"Mr. Shen, it's you. Shen Yin didn't come today, right?\" Although it was a question, Ji Qingyan's tone was firm.","\"Doctor, hello. I'm Shen Yin's mother. I want to ask, is my daughter really almost cured?\" Shen's Mother walked up to Shen Lv.","\"Auntie, please have a seat.\" Ji Qingyan saw a man around 50 years old behind Shen Lv and got up to bring a chair.","\"Auntie, Uncle, Shen Yin's illness is a mental one. When a mental illness persists for a long time, it will affect the nerves and gradually become psychologically distorted. Anxiety disorder and depression may also occur, which could harm others or even lead to suicide.\"","Shen's Mother looked a bit scared and glanced at Shen's Father.","\"Doctor, please continue.\" Shen's Father remained relatively calm.","\"Shen Yin's condition is relatively rare, but I could tell from our conversations that she longs for a normal life. May I ask a question?\"","\"Go ahead.\"","\"How is Zhou Man doing now?\"","Shen's Father and Shen's Mother looked at each other. Shen's Father said, \"It was me who forced Shen Yin to get married. Three years ago, Shen Yin was still young, only 21 years old, and couldn't distinguish between good and bad people. Not to mention, I'm old and conservative, I couldn't accept that she liked women. Can she distinguish between good and bad people?\"","Shen's Mother continued, \"This girl named Zhou Man is someone Yin Yin (Shen Yin) met online during her high school years. Yin Yin is a bright student who could have attended any prestigious university in China. However, during her senior year, she suddenly expressed her desire to study abroad. Her father and I disagreed because she had never traveled far from home before, so naturally, we were concerned. But Shen Yin was adamant. She said that if we didn't agree, she wouldn't go to school at all. Her brother tried to persuade her, but it was in vain. Eventually, we sent her abroad, and we would visit her regularly because we worried that she wouldn't have enough money. Every month, we would send her one million yuan for her living expenses.","Then one time when we went to visit her, we met Zhou Man. Yin Yin introduced her as her friend from high school who had gone abroad a year earlier. Her father and I assumed that Yin Yin wanted to study abroad because she had friends studying abroad, so we didn't ask too many questions. But later, this Zhou Man person messaged us, saying that she and Shen Yin were together and if we wanted her to leave Shen Yin, we had to give her 20 million yuan. It was clear that she didn't really like our Yin Yin; she was just after the money. I don't know what methods she used to deceive Yin Yin into falling for her.\" Shen's Mother's expression was filled with anguish as she spoke.","Shen Lv couldn't stand by and watch any longer and interjected, \"Let me explain. We did transfer the 20 million yuan to her. But she told Yin Yin that we forced her to leave and even gave her 20 million yuan as a breakup fee. Yin Yin came back and caused a scene. Coincidentally, at that time, my father was in talks with Xu Xiuhe for a business collaboration and thought Xu Xiuhe was quite good, so he forced Shen Yin to marry him.\"","Ji Qingyan listened quietly to the whole story. Based on Shen Yin's account, it was Shen's Father and Shen's Mother who forced Zhou Man to leave and forced her to marry Xu Xiuhe.","\"So, what happened to Zhou Man later?\" Ji Qingyan asked."]},{"number":14,"title":"Chapter 14: Crouching","paragraphs":["\"Afterwards, after Shen Yin got married, Zhou Man tried to contact her, but I took all of Shen Yin's contact information. Shen Yin and her have had no contact since then,\" explained Shen Lv.","After thinking for a few seconds, Ji Qingyan said, \"Do you remember a few months ago when Shen Yin suddenly became irritable and even abused the child? I think it might be related to Zhou Man. Is it possible that Shen Yin still has some connection with Zhou Man or knows about her situation?\"","Shen Lv was a little annoyed. \"Zhou Man got married a year ago. She married Guo Wei, the CEO of Peicheng Guo Group.\"","\"In that case, let's not bring up anything about Zhou Man for now. Shen Yin is mostly recovered, so you can try to communicate with her and see what her attitude towards you is like. But be careful not to upset her,\" Ji Qingyan said in a serious tone.","\"Alright, thank you, doctor,\" Shen's mother nodded and thanked her.","Upon hearing this, Shen Lv smiled and said to Ji Qingyan with narrowed eyes, \"You've worked hard. We'll go and see Shen Yin today, and she'll come over another day to thank you properly.\" He even winked.","In the car, Shen's father and mother sat in the back seat, while Shen Lv drove. Shen's father said, \"Shen Lv, Dr. Ji is a good girl. She treated your sister's illness. If you have any thoughts of playing around, get rid of them. You're all grown up now, and your sister even has a child. As for you, if things don't work out, consider a marriage of convenience.\"","\"Okay, okay, Dad, I understand. I'm not that interested in Ji Qingyan,\" Shen Lv replied.","Upon hearing this, Shen's mother immediately perked up. \"Not interested? Are you serious? Let me tell you, that girl is more than suitable for you. She's beautiful, she has a good job. By the way, does she have a partner? Is she married? Where is she from?\"","Shen's mother bombarded Shen Lv with several questions, leaving him at a loss. He realized that he didn't know much about Ji Qingyan, except that she was good-looking and a psychiatrist.","In the film and television city, under the studio, Shen Yin was watching Xu Yunzheng drink water. After Shen Lv called in the morning, she felt it was hot, and if she brought lunch, it might not stay fresh until noon. So she prepared a big bottle of cooling tea. If it was too hot, they probably wouldn't feel hungry.","\"Yunzheng, after one more scene, we'll be done. What do you want to eat for lunch?\"","Xu Yunzheng held his water cup and looked up. \"I want to eat ice cream.\"","Shen Yin took out a tissue from her pocket and wiped the sweat off Xu Yunzheng's forehead. She felt a little distressed. \"Okay, after shooting, let's go buy ice cream. You've gotten so tanned. You've really worked hard, Yunzheng.\"","This scene happened to be seen by Shen Lv, Shen's father, and Shen's mother, who came to visit the set. Without seeing it with their own eyes, they wouldn't have believed that the gentle girl in front of them was Shen Yin.","Shen Lv was about to go over, but Shen's mother stopped him. \"Why are you in such a hurry? Let's find a place and watch them from there.\"","Shen's father looked around and said, \"There's a room over there with no one in it. Let's go in. We'll have a good view of Yunzheng filming.\"","Director Wang approached Zheng Zheng and said, \"Little one, are you ready? The next scene is a bit challenging.\"","\"I'm ready,\" Zheng Zheng replied confidently.","\"Great. Is everyone in position? In this scene, Yan Xi is teaching martial arts to Jiang Yu, who is only two years old. Yan Xi has both a caring side and a strict side. The strict side is because Yan Xi wants Jiang Yu to be able to protect himself and not be bullied, so she found him a master even at such a young age. Chen Yang, you will play the role of Jiang Yu's master. Are you ready?\"","\"Director, I'm ready.\"","\"Scene four, action.\"","Shen Yin watched quietly from under the studio, Chen Yang's tone was a bit harsh, and Zheng Zheng became afraid, glancing at Shen Yin from time to time.","\"Zheng Zheng, when you're scared, look at Shu Yi, that is your godmother. Remember, we are acting, this is not real, understood?\" Director Wang tried to soften his tone.","The scene resumed, and Chen Yang remained somewhat harsh. Shu Yi stood behind Zheng Zheng, and this time Zheng Zheng remembered what Director Wang had said: when he's scared, he should look at his godmother.","Chen Yang instructed Zheng Zheng to stand firmly with a strong posture. His voice was loud, and Zheng Zheng looked a bit aggrieved as he turned to look at Shu Yi, who showed no intention of stopping him, tears welling up in his eyes.","Everyone present couldn't help but feel sorry for him. That tender little face, with an expression of both grievance and determination, truly immersed people in the scene.","\"Jiang Yu, focus. You are a young man, you mustn't shed tears,\" Shu Yi said with a pained expression, but she had to say those harsh words.","In order to capture the martial arts scenes more precisely, the director arranged several different shots.","However, Zheng Zheng was too young. He could barely run and was unsteady on his feet, let alone assume a horse stance, so they had to cancel those shots.","\"Cut! The morning session is over. Zheng Zheng and Shu Yi did really well, very few NGs. It's rare!\" Director Wang's shout of \"Cut!\" made Shen Yin feel relieved. She was afraid that if she continued watching Zheng Zheng's expression, she wouldn't be able to resist rushing over and hugging him.","\"Mama.\" Zheng Zheng stood in place and looked at Shen Yin, extending his arms, gesturing for a hug.","Shen Yin rushed over and embraced him, patting his head. \"It's over now. Zheng Zheng, you were amazing, a real young man who didn't shed any tears.\"","Because it was hot, Shen Yin was worried that Zheng Zheng might be uncomfortable, so she carried him to a spot under the studio. \"Yan Yan, get me a cup of water.\"","Shen Yin received the cup of water and opened the lid. Zheng Zheng must have been thirsty too, as he drank it down with gulps.","\"Slow down, don't choke. Yan Yan, hold the bag. Let's go change Zheng Zheng's clothes first. If we're having lunch, let's contact the driver and go back to the hotel.\"","Shen Yin changed Zheng Zheng's clothes: a white short-sleeved shirt with a small bear on the back, black pants, and he switched from the cloth shoes he wore during filming to little sandals. Zheng Zheng had fair skin, big eyes, a nose like Shen Yin's, and eyes like Xu Xiuhan's. He could be cute and handsome at the same time.","As Shen Yin stepped out, she encountered Shen Lv, Shen's Father, and Shen's Mother.","Ever since Shen Yin married, Shen's Mother and Shen's Father had not seen her. Firstly, Shen Yin refused to meet them, and secondly, they knew that Shen Yin resented them.","Shen's Mother cautiously asked, \"Are you finished with the shoot?\" Shen Lv and Shen's Father observed Shen Yin's expression, afraid that she would get angry.","Knowing Shen Yin's attitude towards them, she wouldn't willingly greet them warmly. Nevertheless, she couldn't be too distant either, considering the original host's treatment of them, and now she was almost fully recovered. So she replied calmly, \"Yes, it ended this morning.\"","Only after she answered did the three people in front of her relax, and the tension between them finally eased.","\"Shen Yin, I just made a reservation at a restaurant. Let's go eat together,\" Shen Lv tentatively asked.","Coincidentally, Shen Yin was worried about going back to the hotel. If she were to cook again, she might not have enough time. Besides, her parents and brother were inviting her for a meal. How could she be overly coy?","\"Yan Yan, are you going back or staying on the set for lunch, or will you come eat with us?\" Shen Yin asked.","Yan Yan was perceptive. Since Shen's family was going out to eat, she didn't need to join in the fun. \"Madam, I'll stay on the set. You don't need to worry about me.\"","Shen Lv instantly understood that Shen Yin had agreed to his suggestion. \"Great, I'll go bring the car over.\"","Shen's Father and Shen's Mother were also pleased. Finally, they could have a meal together as a family. \"Is this little one Xu Yunzheng? Come, let Grandma hold you.\"","Xu Yunzheng didn't recognize Fang Yue, so naturally, he didn't dare let her hold him.","After the original host got married, not only did she avoid Shen ZhengTian and Fang Yue, but she also prevented Xu Yunzheng from seeing them, even though she disliked him.","Fang Yue extended her hand, slightly hopeful."]},{"number":15,"title":"Chapter 15: Clear the Misunderstanding","paragraphs":["\"Zhengzheng, this is grandma, mommy's mommy,\" Shen Yin said gently.","\"Grandma?\" Zhengzheng was puzzled, he seemed to have never heard this word before.","Fang Yue was anxious, \"Zhengzheng, I am grandma, your mommy's mommy. Can I hug you? Grandma just wants to hug you.\"","Zhengzheng stretched out his arms, Fang Yue hugged him, with a satisfied expression on her face. Shen Tianzheng was anxious beside them, he also wanted to hug Zhengzheng.","\"Come here, let me hug you too, Zhengzheng, I am grandpa.\" Shen Tianzheng reached out.","\"Why are you in such a hurry?\" Fang Yue hugged Zhengzheng and turned around to reject Shen Tianzheng. \"I just got to hug him, don't rush, let me hug him first.\"","But Shen Yin felt that Shen Tianzheng and Fang Yue were quite good. If it wasn't for the original host choosing the wrong path herself and falling for the wrong person, she would have been very happy.","The car arrived, Shen Lv parked the car and got off to open the rear door, \"You and Zhengzheng and mom should sit in the back.\"","Shen Tianzheng had no choice but to sit in the front passenger seat.","The restaurant was not far, just a 10 minutes drive. Fang Yue was busy getting close with her grandson.","\"Zhengzheng, call grandma,\" Fang Yue had a big smile on her face.","Sitting in the front passenger seat, Shen Tianzheng saw Fang Yue's smile from the rearview mirror, and the corners of his mouth also curled up. In the past two years, Fang Yue had complained about him a lot because of Shen Yin's situation. Moments of happiness like this were few and far between.","They arrived at the restaurant at dinner time. After parking the car, Shen Lv opened the rear door. Fang Yue was still reluctant to let go of Zhengzheng, \"Zhengzheng, grandma ordered so many dishes, what do you want to eat?\"","\"I love to eat meat,\" Zhengzheng said.","\"You little glutton,\" Fang Yue gently poked Zhengzheng's nose with her finger.","Sure enough, when people got old, they really liked little kids. When Fang Yue gave birth to Shen Lv and Shen Yin, she didn't feel kids were so cute and well-behaved. Shen Tianzheng felt the same way too. \"A Yue, let me hold him for a bit.\"","Fang Yue said unhappily, \"Wait for your turn, Zhengzheng is having fun playing with me now.\"","The server led the five people to a small private room. Shen Tianzheng kept actively talking to Shen Yin, with a tone of guilt.","Shen Yin also felt it was about time to move on. She thought Shen Tianzheng was decent, much better than her own father, who wanted her to marry a 37-year-old prince. In comparison, marrying Xu Xiuhe with Shen Tianzheng's consent made him seem like a good father.","\"Dad, you don't have to be like this. I was immature in the past.\"","Shen Tianzheng froze for a moment, then said excitedly, \"Yin Yin, you finally forgave me, you finally called me dad.\"","\"Dad, it was my fault, I'm sorry, let's let bygones be bygones.\"","Yes, Shen Yin's life was really good now. She was a CEO's wife, although she rarely interacted with Xu Xiuhe, Xu Xiuhe always treated her well, and she had such a cute and handsome son. She didn't die from drowning, which was a win by itself, not to mention the advanced technology and improved status of women in this modern era. How wonderful was that? What more could she ask for?","\"Yin Yin, dad was too impulsive in the past, but I absolutely didn't intend to harm you. Zhou Man, she...\"","Before he could finish speaking, he was interrupted by the fake coughs from Shen Lv and Fang Yue. Shen Lv and Fang Yue desperately signaled Shen Tianzheng with their eyes.","Zhengzheng was attracted by Fang Yue's coughing. \"Grandma, why do you keep blinking?\"","Only then did Shen Tianzheng realize he was being indiscreet and forgot Doctor Qingyan's warning to not stimulate her.","\"Nevermind, let's let bygones be bygones. Come on, let's eat.\" Shen Tianzheng changed the topic.","At the mention of Zhou Man, Shen Yin became interested. But eating was more important, so she decided to look for a chance to ask about it later.","Shen Tianzheng and Fang Yue competed to feed Zhengzheng. Shen Lv also asked Zhengzheng to call him uncle from time to time. Shen Yin didn't get a chance to cut in at all. She lowered her head to focus on her own food while the three people across the table, although busy feeding and coaxing Zhengzheng, still kept sneaking glances at Shen Yin to observe her state.","\"I'm almost done eating. Can I ask some questions?\" Shen Yin put down her chopsticks.","The three people across from her immediately became apprehensive. \"Ask whatever you want.\"","\"Dad, you didn't finish just now. What happened to Zhou Man?\"","The three of them exchanged glances, both nervous and afraid. They were afraid of stimulating Shen Yin and didn't know how to answer. Finally, Shen Tianzheng spoke.","\"Zhou Man, she never liked you at all. She was just trying to scam money from you.\"","This answer was completely unexpected for Shen Yin. There was no such information about Zhou Man scamming her in the original host's memories.","\"What do you mean? Why didn't you tell me earlier?\"","\"Yin Yin, we told you before, advising you two to break up. Not only because your dad felt embarrassed that you were a lesbian, but also because she didn't really like you, she just wanted to scam money from you.\"","\"Didn't you give her money to make her leave me?\" In the original host's memories, that was indeed what happened. Zhou Man told Shen Yin that her parents gave her 20 million to leave Shen Yin.","This was getting more complicated. Shen Yin thought for a moment then said, \"When did you tell me this?\"","\"When Zhou Man came to us asking for money, 20 million, and she would leave you.\"","Shen Yin sorted through the memories. After Zhou Man told Shen Yin that Shen's parents forced her to leave Shen Yin, Shen Yin cut off contact with her parents - no replies, no picking up calls, and even got very angry, simply throwing her phone to Zhou Man.","\"But I didn't answer your calls. I was angry then, annoyed that you kept calling me, so I threw the phone to Zhou Man.\" The original host had to explain what she did.","\"So this was all a misunderstanding? This misunderstanding caused Yin Yin to suffer so much and resent us for so many years.\" Shen Lv said.","\"Now that you've mentioned Zhou Man, there's another thing. Why did your condition get worse a few months ago, even abusing Zhengzheng?\" Shen Lv hadn't forgotten what Doctor Qingyan said.","Shen Yin thought about it. The original host's condition worsened because she received a message that roughly said Zhou Man was not doing well in France, and as long as she agreed to remove Zhengzheng, Zhou Man could take her away to start a new life together.","Thinking back now, the sender of the message was Yang Cui, wanting her son Xu Zhengyang to obtain the heir position in the Xu Corporation.","\"It was Yang Cui who sent me the message, saying she could let me run away with Zhou Man if I removed Zhengzheng.\" Shen Yin truthfully recounted.","Shen Lv asked, \"Who is Yang Cui?\""]},{"number":16,"title":"Chapter 16: The Bright Breeze","paragraphs":["\"Yang Cui is Xu Xiuhe's stepmother. She came to see me a few days ago, still wanting me to harm Zhengzheng,\" Shen Yin said.","\"What? Does Xu Xiuhe know about this?\" Shen Lv was a bit angry. Who does Yang Cui think she is? Does she think she can bully the Shen family? Although the Shen family was not as powerful as the Xu's Enterprise in the past, they have gained some recognition in Rong City. Moreover, the Xu's Enterprise is not only strong because of its long history, but also because of the dowry that Sun Wenting, Xu Guimin's father and Xu Xiuhe's mother, brought when they got married.","Shen's mother was also furious. She knew Sun Wenting, who was a gentle and kind woman. Who knew that she had left nearly 20 years ago?","\"Shen Lv, investigate this matter further. Find out why Yang Cui knows about Zhou Man, and if necessary, inform Xu Xiuhe,\" Shen's father said sternly.","\"Shen Yin, there's something else you need to know,\" Shen's father continued.","Shen Yin became interested. Is there something she doesn't know?","Shen's father noticed Shen Yin's expression and said, \"Zhou Man got married too, a year after you got married. She married Guo Wei, the president of Peicheng Group, who is even older than me.\"","Hmm, this completely left Shen Yin speechless. It was even more outrageous than in Dasheng, where her stepmother forced her to marry a 37-year-old man. In Dasheng, it's not uncommon for older men to have younger wives. Many men in their 50s have 18-year-old mistresses, but can it be compared? Dasheng men have multiple wives and concubines.","Suddenly, Shen Yin realized something, \"So you mean Yang Cui was deceiving me?\"","The other three remained silent. They had almost finished eating.","Considering that Zhengzheng still had to continue filming in the afternoon, Shen Lv decided to take him and Shen Yin to the set.","Although Shen Tianzheng and Fang Yue were upset by Yang Cui and Zhou Man, they couldn't resist the genuine happiness in their hearts because, finally, their Yin Yin was willing to see them and had returned to normal.","After Shen Yin and Zhengzheng arrived at the set, the Shen family of three had to leave. They had met, and now they could rest assured.","Before leaving, Fang Yue reminded, \"Yinyin, take care of Zhengzheng, don't tire yourself out. Come home when you're done with your busy schedule, alright?\"","At that moment, Shen Yin felt the love of a mother. \"Alright, Mom, don't worry. Zhengzheng's scenes will probably be finished by tomorrow night. He won't be too tired.\"","\"Then let's go,\" Shen Lv said as he started the car.","On the way, Fang Yue still felt a bit unsatisfied and suggested coming again tomorrow. But Shen Lv immediately rejected, \"No, no, there's always another day.\"","Fang Yue glanced at Shen Lv, unwilling to give up. \"Fine, then be more careful and investigate Yang Cui.\"","Zhengzheng successfully finished filming two scenes in the afternoon, and Wang Ming was very satisfied with him. Wang Ming, who was usually very serious as a director, was now coaxing a 2-year-old child.","Just as they finished work, Wang Ming's phone in his pocket rang. He opened it and saw \"Chang Zhiyuan\" displayed on the screen.","Chang Zhiyuan was an investor and had collaborated with Wang Ming several times. They were also considered friends.","\"Wang director, finished work?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","Wang Ming smiled and said, \"Well, there's nothing that doesn't bring you to my doorstep. So, what's the matter with the phone call reaching me?\"","\"Haha, Director Wang, you truly live up to your reputation. I wanted to ask how my godson Zhengzheng is doing?\"","Wang Ming found it hard to believe. \"You're only asking about Zhengzheng? What about the others?\"","Chang Zhiyuan felt guilty. \"Who? How did you figure it out?\"","\"When I mentioned Shu Yi's performance, you acted unnatural and even helped find actors. You were never that kind before, occasionally dropping by the set. I'm not stupid, I could definitely tell. Your true intentions were revealed when we were casting for the female lead. You mentioned Shu Yi, but there are other actresses like Zhang Dai and Mei Shasha who are equally talented. Fortunately, Shu Yi's acting skills are pretty good.\"","Chang Zhiyuan stopped trying to justify himself. \"Now that you know, I won't hide it anymore. I'm pursuing her, but I haven't succeeded yet. Can you help me out?\"","Wang Ming couldn't help but laugh heartily. He never imagined that Chang Zhiyuan hadn't won over the person he was pursuing, especially when she worked for their own company. \"Oh, Chang, I can't help but mock you for this. Hahaha!\"","Although it was meant as a joke, Chang Zhiyuan couldn't accept it. \"Who says I can't win her over? I'll go to the set tomorrow.\"","\"Alright, alright. Just make sure you don't disrupt my filming schedule.\"","A man's competitive spirit isn't just for show. There are plenty of women who want to be with him, but this is the first time someone has rejected him. It's already embarrassing enough, and now he's been mocked by Wang Ming. It leaves a bitter taste in his mouth.","Chang Zhiyuan had to find someone to vent about this incident, so he got in his car and headed to Xue Jingrui's house.","Xu Xiuhe, Xue Jingrui, and Chang Zhiyuan have been friends since childhood. Any one of them is considered influential in Rong City. Xue Jingrui comes from an extraordinary background and lives in a residential compound.","Chang Zhiyuan easily entered the compound and parked his car near Xue Jingrui's house. He took out his phone and called Xue Jingrui.","\"Come downstairs. I'm waiting for you at your doorstep.\"","Without giving Xue Jingrui a chance to respond, Chang Zhiyuan hung up the phone.","Xue Jingrui was used to Chang Zhiyuan's domineering attitude. He changed his clothes and went downstairs.","Leaning against the car, Chang Zhiyuan watched Xue Jingrui approach and glanced at his watch. \"Jingrui, you actually took five minutes. Slower than last time.\"","Xue Jingrui ignored his comment and asked, \"So, what do you want?\"","\"Let's go to Qingfeng Mingyue.\"","Xue Jingrui got into the car, and they sped away from the residential compound.","Qingfeng Mingyue is an entertainment club owned by Xu Xiuhe. It is located on Rongguang Avenue, the most prosperous street in Rong City. It covers an area equivalent to three football fields and offers a wide range of amenities.","The first and second floors are restaurants, the third floor is a venue for evening events, and from the fourth floor upwards, there are private rooms, karaoke, and a hotel on the tenth floor and above.","\"Did you inform Xiuhe?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","\"Not yet. He's probably still at work. You can call him,\" Chang Zhiyuan replied.","Xue Jingrui picked up his phone and dialed Xu Xiuhe's number.","\"Hey, are you off work? Chang Zhiyuan set up a meeting at the usual place.\"","\"Okay, I'll head over after work.\"","A golden sports car drove along the road, attracting many onlookers who even stopped to watch.","Chang Zhiyuan was used to this kind of attention. They say wealth should be low-key, but he almost wore a sign saying \"I'm rich\" on his face.","\"I heard Qi Yan came back yesterday,\" Xue Jingrui said.","\"We're in for some drama. Qi Yan probably still has feelings for Xu Xiuhe. Guess what her reaction would be when she finds out Xu Xiuhe is married and even has a child.\"","Xue Jingrui remained silent. He also wondered what Qi Yan's reaction would be, and this time, would she finally notice him?","The car reached Rongguang Avenue, not far from Xu Xiuhe's company. It was not only bustling but also a paradise for the wealthy, with luxury cars and designer brands everywhere.","The car turned onto an underground parking lot on Qingfeng Mingyue Street. Xue Jingrui and Chang Zhiyuan took the elevator to the 10th floor.","Inside the VIP room, there were genuine leather sofas and a table filled with various fruits and nuts. The liquor shelf was stocked with famous brands.","Chang Zhiyuan reclined on the leather sofa and took out a pack of cigarettes from his pocket, just about to light one.","Xue Jingrui reminded him, \"Put it out quickly. Xu Xiuhe will be here soon, and he'll scold you again.\"","Upon hearing this, Chang Zhiyuan extinguished the cigarette. Xue Jingrui handed him a golden ashtray in front of him, and Chang Zhiyuan threw the whole cigarette into it.","Initially, the three of them used to smoke, with Xue Jingrui being the only non-smoker. Xu Xiuhe used to smoke as a habit, and Chang Zhiyuan had the strongest addiction.","Since Xu Xiuhe got married and Shen Yin became pregnant, Chang Zhiyuan had reduced his smoking. Later, when Zhengzheng was born, he quit smoking altogether, fearing the smell would bother the child. Because both Xue Jingrui and Xu Xiuhe didn't smoke anymore, often citing the reason of having a child in the house and not wanting the smell of smoke, they didn't let Chang Zhiyuan smoke. Gradually, Chang Zhiyuan lost his craving for cigarettes and now only smoked occasionally.","Not smoking, Chang Zhiyuan was restless. He picked up an orange from the table, peeled it, and handed half of it to Xue Jingrui.","Coincidentally, at that moment, Xu Xiuhe walked in and teasingly said, \"What's this? You're peeling it for him, but not for me.\"","Chang Zhiyuan burst into laughter. \"Here, here, here. I treat everyone equally.\" After saying that, he handed his half of the orange to Xu Xiuhe and picked up a strawberry nearby.","\"Who set up this meeting?\" Xu Xiuhe asked after sitting down, eating the orange."]},{"number":17,"title":"Chapter 17: Qi Yan","paragraphs":["Chang Zhiyuan said, \"I'm the one with the most free time every day, so I'll do it.\"","Chang Zhiyuan comes from the Chang family conglomerate, where his sister is in charge. He, on the other hand, started his own media company, which has been growing bigger and bigger. He no longer takes care of trivial matters and delegates them to his subordinates, focusing only on making decisions and signing documents.","\"I called Wang Ming today, and he mocked me,\" Chang Zhiyuan shared his experience.","Xue Jingrui was speechless. \"Who is Wang Ming? Is it such a big deal?\"","Xu Xiuhe chimed in, \"Wang Ming is a director who has been doing very well recently. Zhengzheng is currently filming in his crew.\"","\"What? Zhengzheng is acting? How old is he? Can he handle the hardships of a film crew? How can you, as his father, be at ease with such a young child? Who is taking care of him now?\" Xue Jingrui was astonished and bombarded them with a series of questions.","Xu Xiuhe no longer wanted to explain the matter. He didn't expect it to turn out like this, so he pointed at Chang Zhiyuan and said, \"Ask him.\"","\"Well, here's the thing. I've recently developed feelings for an actress in our company, Shu Yi. The character she plays in the drama is in need of a son, so I thought about making my godson, who would also be my son. I discussed it with Xiuhe, but he wanted to refuse, so I went to talk to Shen Yin. Guess what? Shen Yin agreed. Hahaha,\" Chang Zhiyuan explained, purposely leaving a suspenseful pause.","\"What's the situation with Shen Yin? So many things have happened recently that I'm unaware of,\" Xue Jingrui, now as curious as can be, knew nothing about the recent events.","The outsiders don't know what happened with Shen Yin before, but Xue Jingrui and Chang Zhiyuan, as Xu Xiuhe's best friends, are aware.","There were rumors that Xu Xiuhe was going to marry Shen Yin, but she was so unattractive that she never showed herself. Even Xu Xiuhe's employees at his own company had never seen her. The outside world was even unaware that Xu Xiuhe already had a child.","\"Shen Yin suddenly improved some time ago. She went to see a doctor, who said she was basically cured. She's different now compared to before, as if she's become a different person. The doctor said it might have been due to previous psychological issues that made her abnormal, but now she's normal.\"","\"So, is Shen Yin taking care of Zhengzheng now?\" Xue Jingrui asked further.","The moment Chang Zhiyuan thought of Shen Yin, he thought of food, so he immediately answered, \"Yes, Shen Yin is taking care of him, and she cooks amazingly delicious meals. It's truly incredible, comparable to a five-star chef.\"","\"Didn't Xiuhe consider getting a divorce earlier? I suppose he won't now?\" Xue Jingrui's tone was somewhat probing.","Xu Xiuhe replied, \"Hmm, no, he won't. She treats Zhengzheng well now, after all, she's his biological mother.\"","Chang Zhiyuan and Xue Jingrui understood that the stepmother had caused quite a bit of harm to Xu Xiuhe and expressed their understanding.","Xue Jingrui pondered for a moment and finally revealed what he wanted to say, \"Qi Yan has returned.\"","Xu Xiuhe remained silent, and Chang Zhiyuan quickly intervened to smooth things over, \"She's just back, that's all. She was the one who insisted on leaving in the first place. Xiuhe did try to persuade her to stay, but now he probably doesn't have any feelings left for her.\"","Xu Xiuhe had a romantic relationship with Qi Yan. Qi Yan developed feelings for Xu Xiuhe during their high school years, and after the college entrance examination, she confessed her feelings to him. At first, Xu Xiuhe didn't pay much attention to the young girl's beauty, but she turned out to be quite persistent. She even applied to the university right next to Xu Xiuhe's. She pursued Xu Xiuhe for an entire summer, and finally, they became a couple.","During their college years, Xu Xiuhe attended the best university in the country, Huada, where he studied finance. Qi Yan, on the other hand, went to Huawai and had the opportunity to study abroad in her sophomore year. Without consulting Xu Xiuhe, she went abroad. When Xu Xiuhe managed to catch up to her in the foreign country, he asked her why she didn't inform him.","Qi Yan's response at the time was, \"Even if I had told you, I would still have gone abroad. The outcome would have been the same. It's better this way.\" However, Xu Xiuhe knew the real reason. Since he had cut off ties with his family during his university years and rented a house to live on his own, he faced financial difficulties. He could sense that Qi Yan didn't seem as fond of him as before.","So he asked Qi Yan what they should do next.","Qi Yan replied, \"If you think we can continue, then let's continue. If not, let's break up.\"","At that time, Xu Xiuhe chose to continue. However, as time went on, their relationship deteriorated while Qi Yan was abroad. Many times when he called, she wouldn't answer. Eventually, he stopped calling, and Qi Yan eventually suggested breaking up.","During those times, Xu Xiuhe didn't have the luxury to dwell on it. He focused on studying relentlessly, not only his major but also computer science and various other subjects. In his spare time, he took on part-time jobs.","He worked as a tutor, distributed flyers, and did whatever he could. Chang Zhiyuan and Xue Jingrui were aware of what Xu Xiuhe was going through. Chang Zhiyuan was studying at Rong University in Rongcheng at the time, and Xue Jingrui was forced by his family to attend Huazheng in Huacheng, not far from Xu Xiuhe's university. They wanted to help Xu Xiuhe, but he refused their assistance.","After Xu Xiuhe graduated, representatives from the Sun family in Nancheng came to him. Sun Wenting probably anticipated that her son would have a difficult life after she was gone, so she left a substantial inheritance for Xu Xiuhe.","That's when Xu Xiuhe started his own business, which led him to where he is today.","After listening to Chang Zhiyuan's words, Xu Xiuhe felt it was necessary to express his stance. \"Hmm, Zhiyuan is right. It's been several years, and there's no need to bring up the past.\"","Chang Zhiyuan suddenly realized that the topic seemed to have strayed. \"No, no, I was talking about Wang Ming mocking me.\"","Xue Jingrui asked, \"What did he mock you about?\"","\"Wang Ming mocked me for not being able to win over Shu Yi, and for not being able to surpass the employees in my own company.\"","\"Hahaha, that's hilarious!\" Xue Jingrui burst into laughter, completely disregarding Chang Zhiyuan's feelings.","\"Stop laughing. It's the first time a girl has rejected me. Help me come up with a solution quickly.\"","Among those present, only Xu Xiuhe had gotten married, or rather, formed an alliance. He had no experience in such matters.","Xue Jingrui had been single for twenty-seven years, let alone pursuing girls. If he knew how to do it, he wouldn't have been single for so long.","Xue Jingrui asked, \"Is this serious or just a desire for victory?\"","Chang Zhiyuan pondered for a moment. It should be serious, at least he really likes Shu Yi now.","Xue Jingrui realized that Chang Zhiyuan was serious, so he took out his phone, opened Baidu, and searched for \"Shu Yi.\"","\"She does have good looks, neither too hot nor too cold, and there are no scandals. She seems like a nice girl.\"","Xue Jingrui had heard of the name Shu Yi, but he never watched TV dramas, so he didn't have much impression of her. In this era, there was never a shortage of beautiful women. With a little grooming and packaging, there were no ugly women.","\"So how should I pursue her?\" It used to be Chang Zhiyuan teaching others how to pursue women.","When he pursued women, it was nothing more than giving flowers, bags, cars, spending money. If he lost interest, he would directly give an apartment as a breakup fee. But now, he had exhausted almost all of these tricks.","He gave flowers, Shu Yi accepted them. He gave a bag, Shu Yi directly returned it by express delivery. He gave a car, and Shu Yi was scared and started avoiding him. It made him hesitant to make any moves now.","\"How did you pursue her?\" Xu Xiuhe interrupted and asked.","Chang Zhiyuan truthfully explained the process of how he pursued her and Shu Yi's reactions.","\"Do you always pursue people so directly?\" Xue Jingrui joked after listening.","Xu Xiuhe replied, \"Is there a possibility that this is not the right way to pursue someone?\"","\"What should I do then? If I knew the right way, would I come here and have a drink with you guys?\" Chang Zhiyuan finished speaking, picked up his glass, and drank it all in one gulp.","\"Let me tell you some good news. Zhengzheng now calls Shu Yi 'godmother.'\"","\"Damn, my godson is so clever. I think I know what to do now.\""]},{"number":18,"title":"Chapter 18: Feel the Pulse","paragraphs":["On the third day of joining the crew, as expected, Zhengzheng's scenes would wrap up tonight.","The morning scenes were smoothly filmed, and when Shen Yin was pondering how to solve lunch for today, Chang Zhiyuan came to the rescue like a knight in shining armor.","\"Boss, how did you come over?\" Yan Yan was the first to spot Chang Zhiyuan.","Shen Yin, drawn by the voice, was about to turn and check the situation when Zhengzheng in her arms spoke.","\"It's Dad.\" Zhengzheng's little hand waved towards Chang Zhiyuan, as if saying, \"I'm here.\"","Chang Zhiyuan walked over, \"Sis-in-law, haven't eaten yet, right? I brought some food, though it may not be as delicious as yours, I can guarantee it's better than the crew's food.\"","Due to their not-so-pleasant first meeting, Shen Yin hadn't formed a good impression of him, but since he brought her food, she couldn't keep a frown.","So, she adjusted her attitude and said, \"Thank you.\"","Chang Zhiyuan had the dishes placed on the table in the room and reached out to Zhengzheng with both hands.","Zhengzheng and Chang Zhiyuan were quite familiar, so a hug was only natural.","Shen Yin secretly sighed with relief; lunch was finally sorted. After this scene, Zhengzheng shouldn't participate in filming anymore. He's too young, and filming is too demanding.","While playing with Zhengzheng, Chang Zhiyuan said to Yan Yan, \"Yan Yan, go call Shu Yi over.\"","Yan Yan knew the boss liked Shu Yi and didn't ask much. She went to the set to find Shu Yi.","When she saw Shu Yi, she was drinking water. Shu Yi only knew Yan Yan as Zhengzheng's assistant and was a bit puzzled, furrowing her brows, not clear why Yan Yan was looking for her.","\"Teacher Shu, the boss sent some food over. He asked me to call you to eat together.\"","Shu Yi, a rather shy girl in the industry, usually filmed when there were roles and stayed at home sleeping when there weren't. When well-rested, she would travel, not very acquainted with people in the industry.","Even though Shu Yi was about to refuse, thinking of Zhengzheng being so cute and calling her godmother, she agreed.","The sun was a bit intense, and Shu Yi was afraid of getting sunburnt, so she got on her own RV and grabbed a sun umbrella.","\"Let's go.\" Shu Yi opened the umbrella, speaking gently, and moved it a bit towards Yan Yan's side.","This action surprised Yan Yan. She had been an assistant for several years, encountering many actors, some throwing their weight around, some with bad tempers. She didn't expect Shu Yi to be so friendly.","She didn't have much impression of Shu Yi before. Shu Yi had good acting skills, played supporting roles in several dramas, never did marketing. Only when the drama aired did she have a few days of popularity, disappearing again once it ended. If not for her boss liking her, Yan Yan probably wouldn't have noticed her.","\"Teacher Shu, I haven't seen your assistant these past few days.\"","Shu Yi casually replied, \"I don't have an assistant.\"","\"Ah, shouldn't the company provide assistants?\" Yan Yan couldn't comprehend it. In her understanding, even fourth or fifth-tier female celebrities have assistants, let alone second or third-tier ones. Shu Yi might not be a big star, but with a few supporting roles, she should at least qualify for second or third-tier, so she shouldn't be without an assistant.","\"The company did provide an assistant before, but she went back home to get married and have a child. The company was going to assign me another one, but I wasn't accustomed to it, so I declined,\" Shu Yi explained gently, her tone plain, as if discussing something unrelated to herself.","As they continued chatting, they arrived at Shen Yin's place, and Shu Yi immediately spotted Chang Zhiyuan. She regretted it immensely. She had been careless, forgetting that Zhengzheng was brought here by Chang Zhiyuan.","\"Come on in, let's sit down and eat,\" Shen Yin greeted warmly. For her, nothing was more important than sharing a meal.","Chang Zhiyuan kept staring at Shu Yi, making her feel uneasy.","\"Yan Yan, don't just stand there, come sit here,\" Shen Yin didn't notice anything amiss and invited Yan Yan to sit beside her.","Chang Zhiyuan continued to act as a godson, calling Zhengzheng his godson and occasionally calling Shu Yi \"godmother.\" Shu Yi felt extremely awkward at this moment, hoping that time would pass quickly. She had never felt so agonized over a meal before.","Shu Yi's nervousness and anxiety didn't escape Chang Zhiyuan's gaze. The undercurrent between them was noticed by Yan Yan.","Yan Yan focused on eating the fruit in front of her, while Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan had different thoughts.","Chang Zhiyuan thought, \"This person next to me is really interesting. Clearly nervous and anxious, yet still pretending as if nothing happened. She won't even lift her head when I look at her, so adorable. I'll definitely win her over sooner or later.\"","Shu Yi thought, \"This is bad. What should I do? I can't afford to provoke this person. I can only avoid him. But now, I can't even do that. Is he behind casting me as the leading actress in this drama? It seems like he invested in this drama; is he trying to take care of me?\"","Zhengzheng was too young, only interested in eating, while Shen Yin was too clueless about relationships to notice anything abnormal. The mother and son enjoyed their food.","When Shen Yin had almost finished eating, Chang Zhiyuan said, \"Sister-in-law, I've also had someone buy some sour plum juice. It's in the box behind. It's getting close to summer, so it'll be refreshing.\"","Upon hearing this, Shen Yin thanked him and got up, saying, \"Thank you, you've worked hard.\"","Five cups of chilled sour plum juice. Shen Yin couldn't help but marvel at how convenient this era was. Having ice in the summer was a luxury.","Considering that Zhengzheng couldn't handle the cold, they put his cup back.","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng wants some too,\" Zhengzheng pouted, unhappy.","Shu Yi found Zhengzheng's expression too cute to resist. Since she couldn't drink cold beverages these days, she said, \"Zhengzheng, how about I give you mine?\"","Zhengzheng nodded enthusiastically, revealing a smiling face.","Chang Zhiyuan wasn't too pleased with this, but it wasn't like he hadn't experienced it before. Why not drink? Could it be because he bought it?","\"Well, then, have a sip of mine,\" he said, assertively handing his glass of sour plum juice to Shu Yi.","Shu Yi, startled, quickly waved her hands, \"No, Chang Zong, I'm not thirsty. You go ahead.\"","Seeing this scene, Shen Yin suddenly thought of what Xu Xiu had mentioned—Chang Zhiyuan liked Shu Yi.","She was quite curious, eager to gossip, but couldn't ask directly. Revealing it might make things awkward, so she had to hold back. Perhaps she'd find an opportunity later.","\"Chang Zong, Mrs., I've finished eating. I'll go back to rehearse the script and prepare for the afternoon performance,\" Shu Yi, feeling uneasy, expressed her desire to leave.","Chang Zhiyuan wanted to say something more but was interrupted by Shen Yin, \"Alright, Shu Yi, I'll walk you out.\" Afterward, he turned to instruct Yan Yan to check on Zhengzheng.","Shu Yi picked up an umbrella and left with Shen Yin.","\"Give me the umbrella; I'll hold it for you,\" Shen Yin reached out to take the umbrella.","Shu Yi felt that Shen Yin, standing beside her, had an extraordinary status. She was just a small actress and not acquainted with Shen Yin, so she didn't want to trouble her.","\"It's okay, I'll handle it. If you're uncomfortable, don't force yourself. I'm not just talking about the umbrella,\" Shen Yin insisted.","Shu Yi was surprised and somewhat disbelieving, \"How do you know I'm uncomfortable?\"","\"I can tell. Even with makeup, you can't hide the fatigue on your face, and your expression isn't right.\"","As they spoke, they reached Shu Yi's trailer, and Shu Yi suddenly felt that Shen Yin was quite impressive.","\"Can I come up and take a look?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Of course.\"","Shen Yin entered the trailer; it was her first time in such a vehicle. The space was large, with a bed and a table inside.","\"Are you on your period?\" In a woman's life, menstruation was an extremely private matter. That's why Shen Yin only asked once inside the trailer.","Shu Yi's expression became even more astonished.","Shen Yin took Shu Yi's hand, checked her pulse, and found it a bit slippery with a weak sensation.","\"Your hands and feet must be cold in winter, sensitive to cold, and you're experiencing menstrual cramps now,\" Shen Yin said seriously, presenting herself as an experienced Chinese medicine practitioner.","\"Menstrual cramps, unbearable every time. I was just about to take ibuprofen. Are you a traditional Chinese medicine doctor?\"","\"No, but I've studied it. There's too much cold in your body, affecting both your stomach and uterus. You need to treat it promptly, or it might affect your ability to have children in the future.\"","Shu Yi liked children but had no plans to have them. She hadn't met someone she liked, so having children or not didn't matter to her. However, menstrual cramps were too painful.","\"Have you been relying on painkillers all along? With modern medicine so advanced, haven't you seen a doctor?\""]},{"number":19,"title":"Chapter 19: Turn the Horse","paragraphs":["“I saw a doctor. The Western medicine could only alleviate the pain, and the traditional Chinese medicine prescribed herbal tea for me,” Shu Yi recounted her situation truthfully.","Shen Yin continued to inquire, “Drinking herbal tea should be effective, right? Has it improved?”","“It's somewhat better. In the past two years, during filming, I even fainted from the pain. After taking traditional Chinese medicine for a few months, the fainting stopped, but it's not completely cured yet.”","When Shen Yin was thirteen or fourteen, she also suffered from menstrual pain. Her maternal grandfather arranged for the imperial doctor from the palace to treat her, finding it quite interesting. She followed the imperial doctor to learn some basic Chinese medicine, including pulse diagnosis and some knowledge of herbal medicine. In her dream, it was said that in this era, all the skills she knew would be enhanced, so would she become exceptionally skilled in medicine?","Contemplating this, Shen Yin suddenly made an important decision to try and help Shu Yi.","“Can I give it a try? Try to adjust it for you without the need for medicine,” Shen Yin asked tentatively.","“Really?” Shu Yi couldn't believe it.","“Yes, I'll give it a try, but I can't guarantee a cure.”","Shu Yi expressed deep gratitude.","Zhengzheng has one last scene in the afternoon and will leave the crew. Shen Yin thought it best to treat the illness promptly.","“Shu Yi, when will you finish filming?”","“There's an outdoor scene in the afternoon, probably the last scene with Zhengzheng. It should finish tomorrow. This scene has been filming for a while, and we were missing a small actor. Now that Zhengzheng has come, it's considered a reshoot.”","“Okay, find me after you wrap up. Let's exchange WeChat then.” Shen Yin took out her phone, scanned Shu Yi's QR code, and added her as a friend.","After Shu Yi agreed, Shen Yin was about to leave as Zhengzheng still needed her.","Before leaving, Shen Yin reminded her not to consume cold items, avoid excessive fatigue, and maintain regular sleep patterns.","Shu Yi was deeply moved; someone not very familiar cared so much about her.","The sun outside was scorching. Shu Yi gave her umbrella to Shen Yin, who casually held it on her way to Zhengzheng.","Crew members were busy preparing for the final outdoor scene.","Director Wang Ming hurriedly approached Shen Yin to brief her on the last scene to be filmed in the afternoon.","“In the last scene we're shooting this afternoon, Yixi hears about the return of the army outside the city. She hugs Zhengzheng, mounts a horse, and rides through the entire city to the city gate. It might take a while, so we need the whole afternoon.”","“Alright, I got it. What time does it start?” Shen Yin asked.","“It begins at two o'clock.”","Yan Yan had already prepared Zhengzheng's costumes. Shen Yin had revised several outfits for Zhengzheng's character.","In the outdoor set, resembling an ancient street, camera tracks were already set up. Shu Yi was on location, looking unwell. Shen Yin walked over.","“Shu Yi, feeling any better?”","Shu Yi shook her head. She had just taken a painkiller, and its effects hadn't kicked in yet.","The props team brought a white horse, making Shu Yi's complexion even worse. The director mentioned that this scene was added last minute to make the characters more vivid.","So Shu Yi had no idea that her scene required horseback riding, with not too many lines, just at the doorstep, riding a horse, grabbing Zhengzheng, and riding through the whole street to the city gate.","The extras were already in place, men and women of all ages dressed in costumes coming and going on the street.","Shu Yi was feeling physically uncomfortable and nervous. She had never ridden a horse before, and her lower abdomen was still hurting.","\"I've never ridden a horse before, and I don't know how to. I'm a bit scared,\" Shu Yi voiced her concern.","Coincidentally, Director Wang Ming walked over. \"Shu Yi, are you ready? Don't worry too much. For your safety, we'll put the horse on a cart, and you just need to sit on top.\"","\"Yeah, I'm ready.\" This felt like being thrown into the deep end.","\"Let's start with the scene of you taking Zhengzheng and mounting the horse,\" Wang Ming suggested.","\"All crew members ready, Scene 10.\"","Wang Ming returned to behind the screen, and with the help of the crew, Shu Yi got on the horse. However, she had never ridden before, and she tightly held onto the reins.","\"Action,\" Wang Ming's voice echoed.","Zhengzheng was held by a maid, while Shu Yi, on the horse, loosened the reins and awkwardly took Zhengzheng from the maid's hands.","\"Cut. Your expression isn't right, the action isn't swift, and it lacks the graceful elegance of Yanxi,\" Wang Ming commented.","\"Action.\"","As Shu Yi prepared to mount the horse again, sweat was already forming on her face. Shen Yin couldn't bear to watch anymore and interrupted the director.","\"Wang Director, Shu Yi isn't feeling well, and this action is a bit difficult. Can we shoot the scenes where she needs to show her face, with me mounting the horse instead?\"","It was indeed a good idea, but Shen Yin's position made it awkward for her to be a stand-in. Besides, if Shu Yi couldn't do it, could Shen Yin?","\"Let me try this action first.\"","Wang Ming got up and walked to the horse. Indeed, mounting the horse was quite strenuous for him. He took Zhengzheng and struggled to mount, needing to lean forward, making it difficult to exert force and execute the action smoothly.","Previously, such scenes would utilize a harness, but Zhengzheng was too small, making it impossible to use one, which wasn't safe.","With the help of the crew, Wang Ming got off the horse and walked over to Shen Yin. \"It's really not easy. I guess you can't either.\"","Shen Yin smiled, \"It's okay, I've learned horseback riding. I can do this action.\"","Wang Ming carefully examined Shen Yin. Shen Yin's figure was indeed similar to Shu Yi's. As a stand-in, it wasn't impossible. If it went smoothly, they could just shoot some close-up shots of Shu Yi on the horse later.","\"How about you go change into the costume first, get the makeup done,\" Wang Ming suggested.","With the help of the crew, Shen Yin changed into Shu Yi's costume. The makeup artist tried their best to enhance Shen Yin's facial features, making her look as much like Shu Yi as possible.","Sure enough, the results were as expected. Beauties always have some similarities. With the special effects makeup done, at first glance, Shen Yin really resembled Shu Yi.","\"We can start now. Director Wang, I don't need the cart underneath. I'll just ride the horse. Let the camera crew follow along with the track.\"","As soon as the words were spoken, Shen Yin walked over to the side of the horse and skillfully mounted it. Wang Ming, seeing this, also felt relieved.","\"Action.\"","A maid held Zhengzheng at the entrance, and as Shen Yin rode past, she tilted her body, then turned and placed Zhengzheng on the horse.","\"Drive.\" Shen Yin pulled the reins, making the horse turn, with Zhengzheng sitting in front, and the horse started galloping.","On the street, the extras made way for the horse. Shen Yin, with practiced movements, held the reins in one hand and supported Zhengzheng with the other.","The spirited horse galloped and stopped at the city gate.","The camera captured it all.","Outside the city gate, there were only troops, no sign of Jiang Yuyang.","Yan Xi felt disappointed. On the way back, the horse no longer galloped but leisurely walked to the entrance of Jiang's residence.","\"Fantastic,\" exclaimed Wang Ming.","Shen Yin dismounted with Zhengzheng. Wang Ming hurriedly ran over with concern.","Next, there were close-ups of Shu Yi and details of Zhengzheng. For Wang Ming, these static shots were much easier to film.","Yan Yan also ran over, handing Shen Yin a cup of water, admiringly saying, \"Madam, you looked so handsome riding the horse just now.\"","Shen Yin smiled, thinking to herself, riding a horse was nothing compared to her previous martial arts training on horseback.","\"Zhengzheng, you go with Auntie to shoot other scenes, okay?\" Zhengzheng patiently asked.","\"Is it riding a horse? Zhengzheng wants to ride a horse.\" Zhengzheng looked up.","\"Yes, Auntie will take you riding, but she needs you to say a few lines. She will teach you.\"","\"Okay.\" Zhengzheng, upon hearing that she could ride, became excited, clapped her hands, and walked towards Shu Yi.","With Shen Yin's participation, the scene was smoothly filmed by 4:30.","Wang Ming was especially happy and invited Shen Yin for dinner.","Shen Yin hasn't received any messages from Xu Xiuhe yet, so she agreed.","\"Yan Yan, after dinner, we should go back. Thank you for taking care of Zhengzheng during this time.\" Shen Yin expressed gratitude to Yan Yan.","\"No need to thank me; it's what I should do. How about we go back to the hotel first and then head to the restaurant?\" Yan Yan suggested.","Xu Xiuhe's driver was already waiting.","In the car, Shen Yin asked Yan Yan what her next job was.","\"I was sent by General Chang to assist in taking care of Zhengzheng. I'll follow General Chang's arrangements next, but being an actor's assistant is really challenging. I don't know what to do next.\"","Shen Yin genuinely thought this young girl was nice and suggested, \"Shu Yi needs an assistant. I think she's a good person. How about I mention it to General Chang?\""]},{"number":20,"title":"Chapter 20: Dinner Party","paragraphs":["\"Can we?\" Yan Yan's voice trembled with excitement.","\"Yes, we can,\" Shen Yin began, but her words were interrupted by the ringing of her phone. It was Wang Ming informing her that dinner tonight would be at the hotel where Shen Yin was staying.","Feeling it necessary to call Xu Xiuhe, Shen Yin picked up her phone and scrolled through her contacts. There were only a few, and Xu Xiuhe's name caught her eye immediately.","Xu Xiuhe picked up almost instantly. \"Is it over? I'll come to pick you up.\"","\"Yes, we just finished the last scene this afternoon. The director wants to treat Zhengzheng to dinner tonight. You can come later,\" Shen Yin explained.","\"Alright. Have you both packed up?\" Xu Xiuhe inquired.","\"Yan Yan is packing. I'm watching Zhengzheng. By the way, I wanted to ask, what are your plans for Yan Yan after Chang Zhiyuan?\" Shen Yin ventured.","Xu Xiuhe didn't anticipate Shen Yin's request but replied, \"Just say what you want to say.\"","\"I know an actress who plays Zhengzheng's mother in the drama. I think she's quite good, but she doesn't have an assistant. I also think Yan Yan, this young girl, is quite suitable. If she could go and work as an assistant for Shu Yi, it would be fitting,\" Shen Yin suggested.","Not hearing a response from Xu Xiuhe, Shen Yin continued, \"Shu Yi is really nice. I think she has a good temper. Also, Chang Zhiyuan came to visit the set today at noon. I feel like he might like Shu Yi.\"","Xu Xiuhe hadn't expected Chang Zhiyuan to move so quickly. He had just mentioned it last night, and today he went to visit already. Apparently, when Chang Zhiyuan came to find Zhengzheng to film, Shen Yin wasn't there.","\"Alright, I'll talk to Chang Zhiyuan about it later. I'm going to the studio now,\" Xu Xiuhe said, glancing at his watch. It was 5:10 PM, still 20 minutes before quitting time.","\"Liu Bo, come in,\" Xu Xiuhe called out while grabbing his suit.","Liu Bo, an employee from outside, immediately entered Xu Xiuhe's office. \"CEO, what's up?\"","\"I have something to attend to. I'm leaving early. Take care of the evening meeting for me,\" Xu Xiuhe instructed.","\"Isn't that inappropriate?\" Liu Bo questioned.","Placing a hand on Liu Bo's shoulder, Xu Xiuhe reassured, \"Liu, you've been with me for so many years. I trust you. I have to go pick up my son.\"","Xu Xiuhe grabbed his car keys and headed for the elevator.","\"Hello, CEO,\" a staff member greeted as Xu Xiuhe passed.","Not recognizing the employee, Xu Xiuhe courteously nodded.","Two minutes later, the Heyuan Group's employee chat buzzed with news about Xu Xiuhe.","\"CEO looks so handsome. I greeted him, and he nodded.\"","\"Huh? What time is it? Where did you see him? Did you go to his office?\"","\"In the elevator. He must be heading to the underground parking lot.\"","\"I'm curious, leaving work so early. Rare.\"","\"Maybe going home to accompany his wife?\"","\"Did anyone ask Liu about the CEO's wife? There are rumors that the CEO had an arranged marriage and his wife is ugly, so she never shows her face.\"","\"Our company didn't have any senior employees. Did the CEO not attend the wedding?\"","\"No, the CEO's wedding was extremely simple. Apart from Liu Bo, I don't think anyone from our company attended.\"","\"I'm such a gossip lover, I really want to know what the CEO's wife looks like, sniff.\"","Liu Bo couldn't hold it any longer after seeing so many messages in the group. He sent a message, \"Is it possible that the CEO went home to accompany his son?\"","As soon as Liu Bo's message went out, the group exploded.","Various expressions of shock, shocked words, overflowing the screen.","Liu Bo's alternate account was still quite active in the group. Generally, any message he sent would eventually be criticized, so many people in the group already believed that the CEO had a child.","\"Yeah, it's been rumored online that the CEO got married almost three years ago. With the CEO's physique, he probably has a child.\"","Immediately, a series of lewd expressions followed.","\"It should be possible. Look at his height of over 1.8 meters, look at that figure.\"","\"So, how did the person above know about this?\"","An employee speculated, \"Do you think he's Liu Bo's assistant?\"","Seeing himself almost exposed, Liu Bo immediately sent a message to cover it up, \"I am Liu Bo's assistant's assistant.\"","Heyuan Group is large, with involvement in various fields, mainly focusing on real estate, and there are many employees inside. Liu Bo should have several deputy assistants under him, so the employees in the group expressed understanding.","\"Then can you ask Liu Bo what the CEO's wife looks like?\"","Liu Bo was scared by the near exposure and immediately went offline, causing a wail in the group.","Xu Xiuhe drove his Bentley straight to the film and television city. As soon as he entered the hotel entrance, he was recognized by the employees and immediately reported to the manager.","The manager hurriedly came down to greet him.","Xu Xiuhe gestured for the manager not to make a fuss, \"Just pretend I haven't been here.\"","The manager understood, and Xu Xiuhe entered the elevator alone and went to the 20th floor.","In 2001, everything in Shen Yin's room was arranged neatly.","\"Knock, knock, knock.\"","Yan Yan stepped forward and opened the door, \"Madam, sir is here.\"","\"Daddy, daddy.\" Zhengzheng, who had been playing on the floor, ran to Xu Xiuhe and hugged him.","Xu Xiuhe lifted Zhengzheng up, \"Does Zhengzheng miss daddy?\"","\"Yes.\" Zhengzheng kissed Xu Xiuhe.","Shen Yin didn't expect Xu Xiuhe to arrive so quickly, \"You came so soon.\"","Xu Xiuhe said, \"I came as soon as I got the call.\"","\"We were just about to go to the private room reserved by Wang Ming. You probably haven't eaten yet, so why don't you join us?\"","Shen Yin's invitation surprised Xu Xiuhe a bit.","\"Yeah, let's go then.\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"Eat, eat. Eat meat.\" Zhengzheng became even happier.","Shen Yin thought to herself, Zhengzheng had eaten so much for lunch, and now he's looking forward to dinner so much. Xu Xiuhe wouldn't think she's not feeding Zhengzheng, right?","Xu Xiuhe carried Zhengzheng and entered the elevator first, followed by Shen Yin and Yan Yan, with Shen Yin pressing the button for the 2nd floor.","The elevator stopped on the second floor, and Shen Yin and her group stepped out. They immediately spotted Director Wang Ming along with the lead actors, as well as a few assistant directors.","\"Wang Director,\" Shen Yin called out from behind.","Wang Ming turned around. \"Shen Yin is here, and this must be Mr. Xu.\"","\"Hello, I'm Xu Xiuhe,\" Xu Xiuhe introduced himself.","Wang Ming, pleasantly surprised, quickly responded, \"Nice to meet you. I'm just a small director.\"","In the private room, the others were unaware of Shen Yin's background, so when Xu Xiuhe arrived, some of them finally realized.","One assistant director asked, \"Why does the person outside talking to Director Wang look so familiar?\"","Shu Yi looked up, indeed finding the person familiar.","Another assistant director slapped his thigh and exclaimed, \"I remember now. Doesn't he resemble the president of Heyuan Group?\"","Just as they spoke, Wang Ming led Shen Yin, Zhengzheng, and Xu Xiuhe into the private room.","\"Let me introduce everyone, Mr. Xu Xiuhe, the president of Heyuan Group.\"","Indeed, the actor who had been filming with them for the past few days turned out to be the young prince of Heyuan Group, which certainly added a lot of prestige to the occasion.","Everyone present suddenly realized. Whoever spread the rumor about the wife of the president of Heyuan Group being unattractive clearly hadn't seen her; she could easily outshine many people in the industry with her beauty. Not to mention her equestrian skills; they were clearly well-practiced. And this young prince, he was truly the cutest, most handsome, and smartest baby they had ever seen, wasn't he?","Originally, this dinner was meant as a thank-you gesture from Wang Ming to Shen Yin, but with Xu Xiuhe's presence, the nature of the gathering shifted slightly.","One of the assistant directors was hesitant to speak, unsure of what to say, while Wang Ming and Xu Xiuhe remained courteous. Yan Yan sat next to Shen Yin, diligently serving Zhengzheng with food.","\"It's our first meeting, and Mrs. Xu has helped me immensely. I'll toast to Mr. Xu,\" Wang Ming raised his glass from the table and downed it in one go.","Xu Xiuhe, who had been drinking with Wang Ming and the others, had his mind on Shen Yin and Zhengzheng. He remembered what Shen Yin had told him about Yan Yan in the afternoon.","He spoke up, \"Yan Yan, you'll be Shu Yi's assistant from now on.\""]},{"number":21,"title":"Chapter 21: Drive","paragraphs":["The story begins by saying Shen Yin and Yan Yan were quite surprised, while the others were just confused.","Shen Yin and Yan Yan knew that Yan Yan's boss was Chang Zhiyuan, but the others didn't know. The others all thought that Yan Yan was arranged by Xu Xiuhe for Shen Yin, so now that she was assigned to Shu Yi again, even though her husband and son were still around, was strange.","Shu Yi herself was even more confused, and looked to Shen Yin for help.","Shen Yin explained, \"This was my idea. Zhengzheng has left the crew now, so he doesn't need an assistant anymore. I was quite reluctant to part with her, so when Shu Yi happened to need an assistant, as her company hadn't assigned one yet, I suggested it.\"","Hearing this, the others understood that she was doing a favor for her friend. Plus, in Rongcheng, everyone knew the relationship between Chang Zhiyuan and Xu Xiuhe.","During the meal, Xu Xiuhe had some extra dishes and wine brought out, saying this meal was on him.","Wang Ming had been insisting on paying himself, since Shen Yin had already helped him out, so having someone else pay for the meal would be too embarrassing.","It wasn't until the waiter came to serve the dishes that the manager came along too, bringing them a few more dishes, so Wang Ming didn't say anything further. This restaurant belonged to Xu Xiuhe after all. Indeed, rich people had assets everywhere.","After dinner, Xu Xiuhe had his people move Shen Yin and Zhengzheng's luggage to his car.","\"Yan Yan, you stay here first. Shu Yi will be done tomorrow. After that, just listen to Shu Yi's arrangements.\" Shen Yin instructed as they were leaving the building.","\"Shen Yin, why don't you drive.\" Xu Xiuhe had drunk a little, but wasn't drunk. He adhered to the principle of never driving after drinking, so he chose to let Shen Yin drive.","\"I don't think that's a good idea. I'm not very good at driving. I got my license but barely drove after that.\" Shen Yin said in despair. The original owner had a license and could drive, but she couldn't!","\"Having a license is enough. Put Zhengzheng in the rear baby seat. It's still early so drive slowly, there's no rush. I'll teach you.\" Xu Xiuhe spoke gently.","With the original owner's memories, Shen Yin had no choice but to brace herself and say, \"I'll try.\"","Luckily today Shen Yin was on set for a long time on her feet, so she didn't wear high heels. Getting into the driver's seat, Xu Xiuhe put Zhengzheng into the rear baby seat and got into the passenger seat himself.","Relying on the original owner's memories, Shen Yin depressed the clutch all the way, released the handbrake, and turned the key.","\"What's next?\" Shen Yin asked, turning her head. She really had no idea what to do next.","\"Slowly release your left foot, little by little,\" Xu Xiuhe instructed, still holding onto the steering wheel.","\"OK, I think that's good, now just pay attention to the steering wheel and the cars in front.\"","Shen Yin held the steering wheel while her feet didn't dare move. The car crept along like a snail, with other cars zipping past one by one. Shen Yin started to panic.","\"How can I drive faster?\"","\"Release your foot a bit more.\"","\"Which way should I turn next?\"","\"Right turn.\"","\"What if there's a car in front?\" Shen Yin looked terrified.","\"Hit the brakes, of course.\" Xu Xiuhe sighed.","And so, a drive that should take an hour, Shen Yin painfully stretched to two hours.","By the time they arrived home, Zhengzheng was fast asleep.","The villa was pitch black inside.","Xu Xiuhe took Zhengzheng out and handed him to Shen Yin, then went to park the car himself.","\"Follow me, I'll turn on the lights first.\"","Shen Yin followed Xu Xiuhe inside, they changed shoes, and took off Zhengzheng's little shoes too.","\"Let me carry him upstairs, don't want you to get tired.\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Shen Yin thought about how tired Zhengzheng must be after a long day, all sweaty, and suggested, \"Let's give Zhengzheng a bath first.\"","Xu Xiuhe felt him and agreed he could use one.","\"I'll wash him, it'll be hard with him asleep. Can you help?\"","Shen Yin followed Xu Xiuhe into Zhengzheng's room. Passing Xu Xiuhe's room, she didn't miss the chance to sneak a peek.","Xu Xiuhe's room was simple, black and white styled. But the corners of the bedside tables were padded with white sponge, looking out of place with the overall style, probably to childproof them for Zhengzheng.","In the bathroom, Xu Xiuhe undressed Zhengzheng while Shen Yin got his little tub and filled it with warm water.","When they put him in, he finally stirred, opening his eyes to see Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe, then closing them again.","Shen Yin was endeared and gently squeezed his little nose. \"He's too tired today.\"","\"Yeah, won't agree to Chang Zhiyuan again next time.\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","Working together, they finally got the little guy bathed.","In Rongcheng in April, the temperature was perfect. Xu Xiuhe put Zhengzheng on the bed and seeing him sleep soundly, left the room.","After a long day, Shen Yin now just wanted to shower and sleep. So she returned to her room, showered, blow dried her hair, and just as she was about to get into bed, Xu Xiuhe knocked on her door, with Zhengzheng's cries audible behind him.","\"What's wrong?\" Shen Yin was still in her bathrobe.","\"Zhengzheng wet the bed. Usually Nanny Song puts a diaper on him. We forgot today.\" Xu Xiuhe held a tearful and wronged looking Zhengzheng.","\"Mama, hold.\" The little guy reached for Shen Yin.","Xu Xiuhe felt his two years couldn't compare to Shen Yin's two days. After just a few days apart, waking up crying and asking for mama when papa was right there.","Shen Yin took Zhengzheng. \"Zhengzheng can sleep in my room tonight. The past few nights I was the one who slept with him, so he's used to it. It's my fault too, I weaned him off diapers at night. And didn't have him pee before bed.\"","Holding the child while in a bathrobe was a bit awkward. Zhengzheng grabbed at her chest and she flashed a bit.","Shen Yin said awkwardly, \"Let me change into pajamas first. Hold him for me.\"","In the bathroom mirror, Shen Yin saw her flushed face, not just flushed, but a little hot too.","After quickly changing into pajamas and coming out of the bathroom, Zhengzheng was already lying in her bed.","Xu Xiuhe was still standing next to the bed.","\"You go back to sleep first. You still have work tomorrow. I'll get him to sleep.\"","Xu Xiuhe returned to his room, with the earlier scene and smell still flashing through his mind. And the indecent dream he had...","Early next morning, at first light, Xu Xiuhe got up and showered with warm water. Seeing it was still early and Shen Yin and Zhengzheng weren't awake yet, he went downstairs to the kitchen, fried 3 eggs and poured 3 glasses of milk.","When Shen Yin came down, she saw Xu Xiuhe sitting at the dining table eating breakfast.","\"Isn't work at 8? It's not even 7, how come you're up so early?\" Shen Yin had intended to come down to make breakfast.","\"Yeah, woke up early. Is Zhengzheng up yet?\"","\"Not yet. Children need long sleep times to grow.\"","Neither realized their ordinary, mundane conversation was anything but normal.","\"There's milk and fried eggs in the microwave for you and Zhengzheng.\" Xu Xiuhe said."]},{"number":22,"title":"Chapter 22: Walk in Spring","paragraphs":["\"Hmm?\"","Shen Yin couldn't believe it and let out a soft hum.","Xu Xiuhe didn't hear her, he picked up the empty plates and cups, got up to put them in the sink, and was just turning on the faucet when Shen Yin spoke.","\"You go to work first, I'll wash the dishes.\"","Both of them forgot that they had a dishwasher.","Because of the dream from last night, Xu Xiuhe was still a bit restless and absent-minded now, not wanting to see Shen Yin. So, he put down the plates and left the open kitchen.","\"I'll go to work first.\"","After watching Xu Xiuhe's figure leave, Shen Yin walked to the sink and washed the dishes that Xu Xiuhe hadn't finished.","Shen Yin originally planned to take Zhengzheng out to have a look around and see the world today, but now she seemed to have changed her mind a bit. Reciprocating hospitality, she looked at the eggs and milk in the microwave and decided to make some delicious food for lunch.","The second floor of the villa was semi-open, and Zhengzheng stood by the railing barefoot, stretching out her head and calling, \"Mommy.\"","Shen Yin hurriedly went upstairs and picked up Zhengzheng, \"Is the floor cold? You'll catch a cold if you don't wear shoes.\"","Zhengzheng giggled, showing a few milk teeth.","Shen Yin was in a good mood, the gentle breeze outside was blowing, and many flowers were in bloom. It was a good day for a spring outing.","\"Zhengzheng, let's have breakfast first, then go out for a walk, okay?\"","There were few people living in this villa area, and the greenery was comparable to a park. Shen Yin had been wanting to take a walk for a long time.","Zhengzheng probably had just woken up, she only ate half an egg and drank half a cup of milk before she stopped.","\"Flower is hungry too, let's go see Flower.\" Zhengzheng was thinking about the big dog in the yard.","Shen Yin was a little hesitant; she was really afraid of dogs. But in order to fulfill Zhengzheng's small wish, she decided to go out.","\"Before we go out, let's change clothes.\"","Shen Yin wiped Zhengzheng's mouth with a tissue, carried her up to the second floor, and entered Zhengzheng's own room. She washed Zhengzheng's face and helped her brush her teeth.","\"Zhengzheng, what clothes do you want to wear?\"","There were all kinds of clothes in Zhengzheng's wardrobe. Shen Yin chose a floral blouse, a khaki wide-leg pants, and a black little bag.","\"Let's go feed Flower.\" This time Shen Yin didn't carry Zhengzheng, but let her walk down the stairs by herself while she held her hand.","The villa had an independent yard, with green plants climbing the walls all around. In the yard, there was a place planted with flowers. On the left was Flower's little house and the entrance to the underground garage. On the right was a swing and a small pavilion. The entire structure blended Eastern and Western cultural elements, both unique and romantic.","Shen Yin held Zhengzheng's hand and walked along the stone path laid on the lawn to Flower's little house.","There was some water in Flower's bowl, but no food. Zhengzheng handed the sausage in her hand to Flower's mouth, Flower licked the sausage once, then bit off half of it.","Shen Yin was afraid that Flower would bite Zhengzheng's fingers.","\"Zhengzheng, put the sausage in Flower's bowl. Shall we go out to play?\"","Recently, Zhengzheng has become quite reliant on Shen Yin. He never felt maternal love before, never had many demands, but now it's different. Shen Yin plays with him, tells him stories, and cooks delicious food for him to eat. He's so happy, and his dependence on Shen Yin has grown stronger, naturally he listens to Shen Yin's words.","Zhengzheng grabbed Shen Yin's hand and pulled her towards the gate. Just as they were about to leave, a woman in her forties approached them.","Shen Yin didn't recognize her and thought she might have walked to the wrong door.","The middle-aged woman spoke first, \"Are you the lady of the house? I'm the cleaning lady Mr. Xu hired the other day to clean the house.\"","Shen Yin replied, \"Thank you for your hard work. I'm taking the baby out for a walk.\"","The middle-aged woman nodded quickly.","Since Auntie Li was fired, only Aunt Song was left. She used to take care of the house cleaning. Later, Aunt Song resigned, and Shen Yin joined the drama crew again. They needed someone to clean the house.","The sun wasn't as scorching as it had been in the past few days, the air was sweet, with the distinctive scent of spring. The green grass was lush, and flowers were blooming everywhere. The residential area was quiet, with only five villas, so there weren't many people around.","Zhengzheng was overjoyed, bouncing along the path.","\"Slow down, Zhengzheng, don't fall,\" Shen Yin reminded him.","\"Okay, Mom, where are we going?\" Zhengzheng hopped beside Shen Yin.","\"We're going to buy groceries and cook lunch for Zhengzheng.\"","Shen Yin was afraid Zhengzheng would get tired and couldn't walk anymore, so she picked him up. Since she wasn't wearing high heels, it was more convenient to walk.","\"I want to eat meat and ribs.\"","The little voice melted Shen Yin's heart. Why was he always thinking about food? She thought she was the ultimate foodie, but this little one was even better.","They entered the supermarket, not too big since there were only five households in the neighborhood. However, the quality of the items was good since the audience were affluent, with many luxury and essential items.","Shen Yin put Zhengzheng down and went to the vegetable section. There were various kinds of vegetables, all fresh. Shen Yin carefully selected them.","Zhengzheng saw Shen Yin was busy and didn't bother her, playing by himself. Shen Yin didn't pay attention to him. When she turned around, she realized Zhengzheng wasn't by her side.","Shen Yin felt a bit panicked, leaving the vegetables and searching for Zhengzheng everywhere.","\"Excuse me, have you seen a tall and handsome boy around here?\" Shen Yin gestured with her hands, looking anxious as she asked the staff.","The staff replied, \"I haven't seen him. You might want to check at the cashier.\"","Shen Yin was scared, cold sweat dripping down her back. She was terrified that something might have happened to Zhengzheng. If Zhengzheng got lost because of her, Mr. Xu and Xu Xiuhe wouldn't let her off, and she wouldn't forgive herself either.","Shen Yin rushed to the cashier area, finally breathed a sigh of relief. Thankfully.","“Zhengzheng, why didn't you tell Mom when you left? You scared Mom to death.” Shen Yin hugged Zhengzheng to her chest, thankfully, nothing bad happened.","“Mom is busy, Zhengzheng wanted to take a walk and couldn't find Mom.” Zhengzheng's eyes were moist.","“Miss, are you new to this neighborhood?” A cashier girl asked.","Shen Yin snapped back, “No, I've been here for a few years.”","A slightly older staff member next to them chimed in, “I haven't seen you before, including such a cute little baby.”","Shen Yin smiled and explained, “I haven't been to the supermarket before.”","“Which villa are you in?”","Shen Yin was taken aback by the question; she seemed not to know which one she lived in. The original Shen Yin didn't care, and she hadn't paid attention either. So she mentioned Xu Xiuhe and the approximate location of the villa.","The expressions of several people changed instantly. Those working in this supermarket had some connections; how could they not know Xu Xiuhe? But wasn't there a rumor that Xu Xiuhe was having a marriage of convenience, and his wife wasn't attractive, leading to a strained relationship and keeping her out of public view?","It seems the rumors were wrong; Xu Xiuhe and his wife are quite attractive. A few aunties started gossiping. “Mrs. Xu, is this your child?”","Shen Yin: “Yes, he's two years old this year.”","“This child is too good-looking, takes after you.”","Shen Yin felt proud; after all, she's Zhengzheng's mom now, and she played a big role in how handsome her son turned out. “Thank you, Auntie Zhengzheng praised you for being handsome. Shouldn't you say thank you to Auntie?”","In Shen Yin's arms, Zhengzheng, who got scared from not finding his mom, recovered and, looking at the crowd, suddenly felt shy, burying his face in Shen Yin's shoulder.","“Why are you still shy?” Shen Yin asked.","Upon hearing this, Zhengzheng turned his head, smiled, and said, “Thank you, Auntie.”","Older Aunties love well-behaved kids, and seeing such a sensible child, they liked him even more. Due to their status, they didn't dare to reach out to hold him but praised verbally, “Mrs. Xu, are you here to buy groceries?”","Shen Yin, reminded of her purpose, said, “Zhengzheng, hold Mom's hand, don't let go.”","This time, Zhengzheng firmly held Shen Yin's hand. Shen Yin placed all the groceries she wanted into a small shopping cart and then headed to the cashier.","“Mrs. Xu, the total is 298.” The cashier girl said.","Shen Yin opened the WeChat payment QR code and smoothly paid.","“Mrs. Xu, I see you bought quite a lot. Our supermarket offers delivery services. Would you like us to deliver?”","This supermarket mainly serves a few households in this neighborhood, so it primarily operates online. Shen Yin was wondering how to carry all these groceries back, and now it seemed to be solved."]},{"number":23,"title":"Chapter 23: Food Delivery","paragraphs":["On the way back, Zhengzheng kept holding Shen Yin's hand tightly.","Shen Yin felt quite saddened. She could understand Zhengzheng. Since birth, he had been neglected by his original guardian. His closest people, Xu Xiuhe and Song Ma, were always busy, and his bond with them was not biological. After Song Ma left, he felt even more insecure. So, at the moment when he couldn't find her, he must have felt very helpless.","Before, Shen Yin used to think she was somewhat pitiful. Her mother passed away early, and her stepmother wasn't affectionate. But she still had her maternal grandfather's family.","At the moment when Zhengzheng couldn't be found, Shen Yin even suspected that Yang Cui had something to do with it. She was truly terrified. It seemed necessary to inform Xu Xiuhe about Yang Cui's actions. If Yang Cui confronted her openly, she could handle it with her martial arts. But if she acted covertly, what should she do?","\"Zhengzheng, promise Mommy that you'll never leave Mommy and Daddy's sight again. Don't trust anyone except Mommy and Daddy, okay?\"","Xu Yunzheng nodded as if he understood.","While making lunch, Shen Yin put Zhengzheng on a blanket in the living room, gave him some picture books, and a few toys.","\"Zhengzheng, be good. Mommy is going to cook lunch for Zhengzheng. Can Zhengzheng play here by himself?\"","Shen Yin didn't know if Xu Xiuhe would come back for lunch. If not, she would take Zhengzheng to Xu Xiuhe.","For Shen Yin, cooking was simple, especially with today's advanced technology, it was even easier.","Shen Yin ground the plum meat into filling using a meat grinder, chopped a small piece of yam, and added two dried mushrooms for flavor enhancement. She mixed the ground plum meat with yam and mushroom evenly, added two spoons of starch, one spoon of soy sauce, one spoon of oyster sauce, one spoon of sesame oil, half a spoon of sugar, and finally added chopped green onions. She poured the mixture onto a plate, spread it evenly, and steamed it.","Then, Shen Yin cut the eggplant into long strips, marinated them in her own sauce for 10 minutes, heated oil in a pan, stir-fried the previously set aside ground plum meat until it changed color, added the eggplant strips, poured in the sauce again, stir-fried, and sprinkled with chopped green onions.","Shrimp tofu soup, stir-fried mushrooms with greens, tomato beef brisket, stir-fried fish slices, and locust flower egg dumplings.","In less than two hours, seven dishes were done. It was almost noon, and it seemed like Xu Xiuhe wouldn't be coming back.","Shen Yin cooked a large amount of food, mainly to repay Xu Xiuhe for making breakfast in the morning.","\"Zhengzheng, let's eat first. Can we give Daddy his meal after eating?\"","Zhengzheng clapped his hands. After spending these few days with Zhengzheng, Shen Yin finally understood some of Zhengzheng's small expressions and gestures. Clapping his hands meant he was happy and fully in agreement.","Shen Yin looked in the cabinet below, and sure enough, there were lunch boxes, high-quality ones that were insulated and could hold several layers of food. There was also a bag. Shen Yin took out the lunch box, rinsed and dried it, and packed each dish into it.","\"Zhengzheng, let's eat.\"","How to get to Xu Xiuhe's company was a problem. Although the underground parking lot was full of cars, Xu Xiuhe wasn't in any of them. Shen Yin was too nervous to drive with Zhengzheng in tow.","With the lunchbox in hand, the bag containing Zhengzheng, and holding Zhengzheng, Shen Yin decided to take a taxi.","There weren't many taxis near the upscale neighborhood, so Shen Yin was lucky to find one right after leaving the neighborhood gate.","\"Driver, please take me to Heyuan Group.\"","The driver also felt lucky today. He seldom came to this area to pick up passengers because the nearby neighborhoods were upscale and most people had their own cars. Today, he had come here to drop off a passenger who had some business nearby, never expecting to pick up another fare on the way back.","\"People living in this neighborhood aren't ordinary folks. I suppose you must be the wife of some CEO?\" The driver joked.","Shen Yin didn't catch on and sincerely admired the driver, \"How did you know?\"","The driver didn't expect his words to receive a response.","Shen Yin laughed heartily, \"Anyone living in such a neighborhood must have a company of their own, especially when you're carrying a child.\"","That's true. She indeed needed to adapt to this era, broaden her thinking, and not be like before, constantly competing with her stepmother.","\"Heyuan Group?\" the driver asked again.","\"Yes, Heyuan Group.\"","\"Indeed remarkable. Xu Xiuhe from Heyuan Group is young and talented, self-made, everyone in Rong City knows him.\"","Shen Yin smiled but didn't say anything. Xu Xiuhe was impressive, but she didn't have much to do with him; their relationship was extremely unstable.","Soon, they arrived at the building of Heyuan Group. It was Shen Yin's first time here.","Shen Yin carried two bags and held Zhengzheng's hand, the little one cute, the elder one beautiful, attracting quite a few people.","\"Hello, who are you looking for?\" the receptionist asked.","\"Looking for Daddy.\" It was Zhengzheng's first time here too, his eyes wandering around, thinking his dad was here.","Shen Yin lowered her head, \"Sweetie, who is Daddy? Others don't know. You need to say Daddy's name.\"","\"Looking for Xu Xiuhe.\" Zhengzheng said Xu Xiuhe's name for the first time but stumbled.","The receptionist was completely shocked, her mouth agape. Then, she composed herself and smiled, \"Hello, the CEO is on the top floor.\"","Upon hearing this, Shen Yin, holding Zhengzheng, headed to the elevator.","Little did Shen Yin know, her arrival once again caused a stir among the employees of Heyuan Group.","[Folks, latest gossip, fresh off the press! Just had a woman, tall, elegant, with a child so adorable and handsome, come to see the CEO, and get this, the child claims Xu Xiuhe is his dad!!!!] The receptionist hastily typed and shared the news in the group.","[OMG, the CEO has a child? This can't be some love child scandal, can it?]","[No way, are mistresses nowadays this blatant?]","I think it's about the woman not losing to a celebrity, which is completely opposite to the president's wife, right?","I agree.","@InvincibleBeauty, have you finished sharing the gossip? Where are they now?","The front desk lady clacked away on her keyboard.","Do you think I, a mere front desk attendant, would dare to stop the distinguished Young Prince and his mother? They're in the elevator now.","The group fell silent.","Shen Yin pressed the button for the top floor, the 35th. However, every time the elevator stopped at a floor, it opened, revealing a group of people standing there, not entering.","Several minutes passed, and the elevator still hadn't reached the 35th floor. Each time the doors opened, a crowd stood watching her and Zhengzheng. Initially, she politely smiled, but as time went on, the smiles faded.","Messages in the group started pouring in.","\"OMG, I saw it. So stunning! Her smile is absolutely enchanting. The president has great taste.\"","\"I'm on the 17th floor, and I saw them too. That child is the most handsome I've ever seen.\"","\"Upstairs, aren't you talking nonsense? The president and that woman are a visual match.\"","\"Don't you think the child looks exactly like the president?\"","\"Upstairs, you're the king of nonsense. Everyone says the president is his dad. What son doesn't resemble his father?\"","Liu Bo opened his phone, bewildered by these messages. He rushed into Xu Xiuhe's office without knocking.","\"President, I need to tell you something.\"","Xu Xiuhe looked displeased. \"What's so urgent?\"","\"Madam and Zhengzheng are here,\" Liu Bo replied.","Xu Xiuhe's expression changed momentarily but quickly returned to normal. \"Where are they? Why haven't they arrived yet?\" he asked, leaving the office.","Finally, Shen Yin reached the top floor.","Zhengzheng, upon seeing Xu Xiuhe, became extremely excited. \"Dad, Zhengzheng and Mommy brought you lunch!\"","Xu Xiuhe took Zhengzheng, his gaze shifting to Shen Yin. Indeed, she carried a large lunchbox.","\"Your elevators are so strange. They stop at every floor. Also, your company's people are odd too. Why press the elevator button if they don't come in?\" Shen Yin complained.","Liu Bo, having read the group messages, instantly understood. He looked at Xu Xiuhe, who was also staring at him, as if questioning the situation and why this issue had arisen.","\"Perhaps it's just a busy day today,\" Liu Bo awkwardly smiled, not even believing his own explanation."]},{"number":24,"title":"Chapter 24: The Talk","paragraphs":["Shen Yin did not doubt this explanation. She did not understand the situation with Heyuan Group either, so it was possible they really were busy.","Xu Xiuhe and Liu Bo understood Liu Bo too well, and gave Liu Bo a sharp look. Liu Bo pretended not to see it. He could not directly say it was because the employees wanted to see the boss's wife and that was why they took the elevator layer by layer.","\"Have you eaten?\" Shen Yin was afraid Xu Xiuhe would feel she cared too much about him, so she added, \"Zhengzheng is going to come bring you food.\"","Xu Xiuhe was busy with meetings that did not open last night in the morning and had not had time to eat yet. He usually ate in the employee cafeteria on the second floor. If he missed meal times, it was takeout ordered by Liu Bo. Now, he really was hungry.","\"Not yet.\"","Liu Bo said it was his responsibility that he had not yet bought food for the CEO, but actually he was waiting for Xu Xiuhe to praise him, to praise him that not buying food was the right choice. The food his wife and son brought must be more delicious than anything he could buy!","Liu Bo knew well enough to leave and not disturb the family of three.","Shen Yin put the lunchboxes on the coffee table in the lounge and took out the seven dishes one by one. When Xu Xiuhe sat down, he was attracted by the smell of the food.","The food smelled delicious and looked very appetizing. Xu Xiuhe took a bite and became even hungrier.","\"Dad, Zhengzheng wants a bite.\" Zhengzheng held his little fingers and blinked saying so.","Xu Xiuhe picked up a piece of steamed meat pie for Zhengzheng to take in his hand.","Watching the father and son interact once again reminded Shen Yin of her own father. She had been a child lacking love, now in another world even more lacking in security.","Xu Xiuhe noticed Shen Yin's gaze and thought something was wrong, asking: \"What's wrong?\"","\"Nothing.\"","\"The food is very good, thank you.\" What Xu Xiuhe was thinking to himself was that it would be great if he could eat food like this every day.","After a while, when Xu Xiuhe put down his chopsticks when the food was mostly gone, Shen Yin felt it was time to bring up Zhengzheng.","Shen Yin said, \"Xu Xiuhe, I want to talk to you about something.\"","Xu Xiuhe's expression gradually froze. The happy feeling from enjoying delicious food disappeared instantly. No one does favors without reason. Shen Yin's expression was so serious, could it be she wanted a divorce? If she brought it up, how should he respond? Shen Yin had made a fuss about divorce before, but because of the cooperative relationship with the Shen family and Shen Yin's abnormal mental state, the Shen family and Xu Xiuhe had not agreed.","Now that Shen Yin was normal and getting along well with Zhengzheng, if she brought it up, what should he do?","\"Can you trust that person just now to take Zhengzheng for a bit?\" Shen Yin asked cautiously.","Xu Xiuhe's face became even more ugly upon hearing this. Avoiding looking at Zhengzheng, he guessed what she would say almost exactly.","Xu Xiuhe called Liu Bo's assistant direct line, \"Liu Bo, come in for a moment.\"","When Liu Bo came in, he found the atmosphere between the two people was not right. Could something have happened that would implicate him? So he carefully asked: \"Boss, do you need something?\"","Xiuhe looked at Zhengzheng playing on the sofa and said, \"Take Zhengzheng to go play for a while. Shen Yin and I need to talk about something.\" When he said \"the two of us\" he looked at Shen Yin.","Liu Bo was shocked that he would get to take the little prince of Heyuan out. He had to hurry out of this place of gossip and properly show off the little prince.","Shen Yin patiently said, \"Zhengzheng, go play with this uncle, okay? Mommy and Daddy need to talk.\"","Liu Bo picked up Zhengzheng and left Xu Xiuhe's office.","\"Just say whatever you need to say quickly.\" Xu Xiuhe's tone was impatient, afraid to hear something he did not want to hear.","\"Don't get angry when I tell you, okay?\"","Xu Xiuhe's face was almost black.","\"Say it!\"","\"When my mental state was abnormal, Yang Cui contacted me. She promised that if I helped her with something, she would help me get a divorce.\"","Xu Xiuhe leaned forward, his expression solemn: \"What thing?\"","\"She wanted me to get rid of Zhengzheng.\" Shen Yin was very cautious.","Upon hearing this, Xu Xiuhe's brows furrowed tightly, no longer able to restrain the anger on his face.","\"What exactly was the situation when you met her at Blue Mountain Coffee Shop last time?\" Xu Xiuhe suppressed his anger with great effort.","Shen Yin thought back to what had happened when she went to Blue Mountain Coffee Shop. She did not expect that Xu Xiuhe would know about it.","\"At that time my mental state had just improved a bit. I didn't really understand why she wanted to see me. It was only then that I realized what she had asked me to do before. I didn't remember before because of my mental state. I don't know how she found me. I was afraid if I didn't agree to her, she would find someone else to make a move against Zhengzheng. I was really wrong before to give her the opportunity. It was my fault that almost harmed Zhengzheng and I'm so sorry to you and Aunt Song.\"","Shen Yin had a sincere expression, not seeming to be lying. Xu Xiuhe stared straight at Shen Yin's face.","\"Does anyone else know about this matter?\"","\"I don't know if others knew before. The day before yesterday when my brother and parents came to see me, I mentioned it to them and asked them to keep an eye on Yang Cui. No one else knows.\" Shen Yin truthfully answered Xu Xiuhe's question.","Xu Xiuhe did not speak for the moment, pondering deeply before making a call out.","\"Hello, Chen Siming. Help me with something. Find someone to investigate Yang Cui for me and monitor her whereabouts. Report anything to me.\"","Although Chen Siming also had a good relationship with Xu Xiuhe, it was not as close as the one between Chang Zhiyuan and Xue Jingrui. Of course Chen Siming would agree to help with Xu Xiuhe's request, after all his own business also relied on Xu Xiuhe!","After dealing with this matter, Xu Xiuhe asked, \"Anything else you want to say?\"","Shen Yin felt there was nothing else, but then remembered that Shu Yi was coming tomorrow. Since she was not the mistress of the house, it was necessary to let Xu Xiuhe know.","\"There's one more thing.\" When she said this, Xu Xiuhe's heart thumped again, nervous once more. Could it be she wanted a divorce after all?","\"Is it okay if Shu Yi comes to the house to find me tomorrow?\" Shen Yin's tone held some tentativeness.","When Xu Xiuhe heard this, he let out a breath, and his hanging heart settled down.","\"It's been hard on you, thanks. For bringing Zhengzheng and making food to bring me too.\"","Shen Yin could not bear that. She was currently clinging to Xu Xiuhe's thigh. She had not found a job yet either. She had better flatter Xu Xiuhe well.","\"It's not hard, not hard. It's you who leaves early and comes back late from work everyday.\"","Xu Xiuhe was not used to this kind of Shen Yin. He felt something was off, suspicion showing on his face.","Shen Yin said, \"I'll go out and see how Zhengzheng is doing.\"","\"Okay, come back later and I'll arrange for a car to take you back home. You can drive any of the cars in the underground garage at home.\"","Shen Yin gave an embarrassed smile. \"I still don't really know how to drive.\"","\"I'll teach you another day.\"","After Shen Yin left Xu Xiuhe's office, she looked around but did not see Liu Bo anywhere.","Besides Xu Xiuhe and Liu Bo, the top floor also had some secretaries and assistants. Those in higher positions had their own independent offices. Those in slightly lower positions were all in the lobby. Shen Yin had already attracted the attention of the assistants in the lobby when she came in. Now coming out, many eyes were focused on her.","The anxious Shen Yin looking for her son did not mind at all, and even went up to their desks."]},{"number":25,"title":"Chapter 25: Prove Your Identity","paragraphs":["\"Hello, may I ask where Assistant Liu just went with the baby?\" Shen Yin asked very politely.","Sitting closest, Xiao Lier said, \"Assistant Liu just took the baby downstairs for a walk.\"","\"Okay, thank you!\" Shen Yin said, then turned to head towards the elevator.","Xiao Lier was flattered. The other assistants saw Shen Yin off.","After Shen Yin entered the elevator hall, things were no longer calm in the lobby.","\"Wow, she's so gentle and polite!\"","\"To be honest, even if she was the third, I would still support her. I can't help it, I'm a sucker for beauty.\"","\"Yes, yes, yes, her genes are too strong. I've never seen such a cute baby.\"","\"I also like women like her. If I were the president, I would definitely choose her!\" said a young man sitting in the corner.","\"Wake up, Yihai, stop dreaming,\" everyone else laughed.","Shen Yin went downstairs but didn't find them, so she asked some other employees. Their reactions were all the same as those upstairs.","The small group chat was flooded with so many new messages that she couldn't keep up.","As Shen Yin went down floor by floor, this was getting her nowhere, so she called Xu Xiuhe, \"Hello, can you ask Liu Bo where Yunzheng is now? I can't find him.\"","After hanging up, Xu Xiuhe called Liu Bo.","Liu Bo was holding Yunzheng, circling every floor, and now they were on the 30th floor. After receiving Xu Xiuhe's call, he stopped on the 30th floor and didn't go down any further.","In the office area, the employees were gossiping.","\"Isn't this the president's son?\"","\"Look who's talking rubbish. How could it be Assistant Liu's? He's a bachelor.\"","Liu Bo happened to overhear this. Unable to get angry while holding Yunzheng, he put Yunzheng down and held his hand, feeling aggrieved inside.","Is being single a crime? Everything he did was for work, because Xu Xiuhe was a workaholic, forcing him to work overtime too. His salary was high, sure, but his personal time was minimal. There were plenty of young girls at the company, but they all shipped him with Xu Xiuhe. He should be grateful they didn't make him pay for it, yet here they were looking down on him for being single.","Unable to fully articulate his grievances, Liu Bo led Yunzheng over to the employees and said, \"Yunzheng, they are all aunties and uncles who like you. Say hi to the aunties.\"","Believing Liu Bo, Yunzheng greeted them in his soft voice, \"Hello, aunties,\" even waving his little hand.","This was the scene Shen Yin came upon, smiling as she said, \"Chatting with the sisters?\"","Everything was fine when Yunzheng didn't see Shen Yin, but once he did, he became clingy, toddling towards her on his little legs.","\"Mommy!\"","Hearing this, everyone was certain this young-looking woman was the president's son's mother.","\"Madam, you've come down. The president told me to take you and Yunzheng home later,\" Liu Bo deliberately clarified Shen Yin's identity.","Sure enough, calling her \"Madam\" explained everything. \"Home?\" The employees immediately understood.","\"Madam looks so young, like 20 years old.\"","\"So beautiful. The baby is cute too.\"","The compliments came one after another. Shen Yin knew she was good-looking and beautiful, but the praise from so many people still made her a little embarrassed. After thanking them, she picked up Yunzheng. \"Yunzheng, time to go. What should you say to the sisters?\"","Yunzheng waved his little hand again. \"Bye bye, sisters!\"","The female employees couldn't hold back their auntie smiles, some even wanting to steal the cute toddler away.","\"Madam, please head upstairs first,\" Liu Bo suggested.","After the three left, the office area erupted into lamentations again. Messages poured into the group chat.","[Everyone, Assistant Liu called that woman Madam and is going to take them home.]","[Madam? Could it be the president's wife?]","[She's so gentle and beautiful, so the rumors about the third must be false. Don't spread rumors.]","[Her temperament is amazing. As a woman, even I like her. The key is she got the baby to call us sisters.]","[Sister, me too. She's very polite. I love her!]","[The president must have done good deeds in several lifetimes!!!!]","[I wave the banner for the president's wife. Let's see who dares oppose her!]","Upstairs, Liu Bo saw these messages and was very satisfied to have proven Shen Yin's identity. His goal was achieved, so it was time to report his merit to the president.","Thinking this wasn't enough, he quickly typed a message on his alt account and sent it out.","[Everyone, I'm on the top floor. The missus brought the president a meal, and although I didn't see the food, I'm crying from hunger just thinking about it.]","Someone immediately replied:","[A woman so beautiful can even cook? Heavens be damned!]","[To win a man's heart, first capture his stomach, sisters! Keep working on your cooking skills to become a wealthy madame someday!]","In his office, Xu Xiuhe had already cleaned up his lunchbox and put it in his bag. He had to say this was the most satisfactory meal he'd had in days.","When Shen Yin and Yunzheng came in, Xu Xiuhe was looking over documents.","Hearing them, he looked up and said, \"You're back. Do you want to play here for a bit or head home now?\"","Shen Yin didn't see much to entertain them here and had to go to the herbal medicine shop that afternoon, so she said, \"No need, I have some things to do this afternoon. I'll take Yunzheng home first.\"","Xu Xiuhe: \"Okay, I'll arrange a driver for you. Just tell the driver wherever you need to go. Be safe, and let me know if anything comes up.\"","Shen Yin left with Yunzheng, unaware that her visit had quashed some rumors, earned her a group of fans, and even banner-wavers.","On the ride home, Yunzheng fell asleep. Shen Yin held him in one hand and used the other to search on her phone for \"where to buy Chinese medicine.\"","\"Driver, please go to Renhe Chinese Medicine Pharmacy.\"","Hearing this, driver Old Wang turned around and changed route.","Soon, Old Wang said, \"Madam, we've arrived.\"","Shen Yin wanted to buy herbs to treat Shu Yi's dysmenorrhea, but Yunzheng was still sleeping. It would be inconvenient to take him in, but unsafe to leave him in the car.","After thinking it over, she told Old Wang the herbs she needed and asked him to help buy them."]},{"number":26,"title":"Chapter 26: Applying Ointment","paragraphs":["Old Wang went in to purchase medicinal materials, and Shen Yin also felt tired. She leaned against the back seat and fell asleep, not knowing how long she had slept with Zhengzheng, and when she woke up again, Old Wang had already returned, and a large bag of medicine was placed on the front passenger seat.","\"Madam, do you want to go home now?\" the driver asked.","\"Go home,\" Shen Yin replied.","When they arrived at the gate of the villa, Shen Yin saw a woman with an innocent look.","Zhengzheng had woken up. Xiao Li got out of the car and went to the back to open the rear door.","\"Madam, you can get off now.\"","\"It's hard work. Can you help me take the medicine inside?\" Shen Yin said, holding Zhengzheng as she walked to the innocent looking woman.","When Qi Yan saw the car stop, she started observing the people in the car. She thought Xu Xiuhe would get off the car, but she didn't expect it to be a woman holding a child instead.","\"Who are you looking for?\" Shen Yin asked politely.","Qi Yan took a step back, stumbled a bit, then adjusted her expression and said, \"No one, went the wrong way.\"","Shen Yin always felt something was wrong. She wanted to ask more questions, but the woman in front of her turned and left, leaving Shen Yin with just a back view.","The moment Qi Yan turned around, her expression was full of unwillingness, and her eyes became more fierce. Xu Xiuhe used to like her so much, he would definitely come back, one day, she would get Xu Xiuhe again.","When Shu Yi returned to her residence in Rong City after finishing shooting her scenes, she sent Shen Yin a message.","[My scenes are finished shooting. When do you have time? I'll come to your place.]","Shen Yin had already told Xu Xiuhe that Shu Yi would come home tomorrow.","[Tomorrow, come to Ziyue Manor.]","[OK, see you tomorrow then.]","The chat between the two women was polite.","The next day, when Shu Yi came, she bought a lot of snacks for Zhengzheng, although Zhengzheng didn't lack anything, but it was the thought that counts.","\"Your yard is so beautiful, but I didn't expect you to live in this place.\" Shu Yi said.","This is a place where rich people live, but people with Xu Xiuhe’s status should live in bigger houses. Shu Yi felt that Xu Xiuhe’s home should be in Qingyuan Manor.","Qingyuan Manor has larger plots with more luxurious big manors, even more upscale than Ziyue Manor.","\"I'm not very clear, it was all arranged by Xiuhe. Why did you bring so many things?\" Shen Yin said.","\"What's wrong with buying some snacks for my godson?\" Shu Yi said and teased Zhengzheng.","\"Have you eaten breakfast?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Yes, I bought something on my way down.\"","Shu Yi was fully armed - hat, mask, sunglasses, all worn. She bought some buns and ate them in the car.","Xu Xiuhe left early in the morning, and left eggs and milk for Shen Yin and Zhengzheng again. But Shen Yin felt that eating the same breakfast every day was not very good. She took the chance while Zhengzheng was still asleep to wrap some dumplings.","\"It smells so good, Mrs. Xu.\" Smelling the aroma of dumplings in the air, Shu Yi couldn't help but take a deep breath and ask.","\"Don't call me Mrs., call me Shen Yin or just Yin Yin.\" Shen Yin said. Being called Mrs. felt too awkward, it made her sound very old.","\"Alright, then I'll call you Yin Yin.\"","\"I just cooked these dumplings, do you want to eat some?\" Shen Yin said, leading Shu Yi to the dining room.","Shu Yi had eaten a meat bun in the morning and was no longer hungry, but the aroma of the dumplings was too tempting, she felt she could no longer resist.","\"Can I? They smell so good.\" Shu Yi said embarrassedly.","At the dining table, Shu Yi sat opposite Shen Yin. Shen Yin knew Shu Yi was coming, so she wrapped more dumplings on purpose.","Shu Yi was a rather quiet person, but after taking the first bite, she still couldn't help exclaiming, \"Yin Yin, where did you buy these dumplings? They are so delicious!\"","Shen Yin felt a little proud that her cooking was recognized by others, which made her very happy. \"You can't buy them anywhere. I wrapped the dumplings myself.\"","Shu Yi was even more shocked. She really didn't expect such a beautiful woman to be able to cook, and cook so deliciously.","\"You can come often if you want to eat them in the future.\" Shen Yin really liked Shu Yi a lot. Shu Yi gave her the overall feeling of being quiet and peaceful, with a unique temperament.","After eating, Shu Yi volunteered to wash the dishes herself.","\"The plaster is off your body now, right? Be careful, the water is cold. The cleaning lady will come later, no need to wash. Watch Zhengzheng for me for a bit, I’ll make some medicine for you.\" Shen Yin said.","Shen Yin went upstairs, entered Xu Xiuhe’s study, took some A4 paper and went back downstairs.","When she took Shu Yi’s pulse again, Shen Yin asked, \"No time to drink Chinese medicine, right?\"","Shu Yi had scenes to shoot when there were schedules, and when there weren’t any, she was very free. She didn’t know what the situation would be next, but if she was in the crew, there really was no time to simmer Chinese medicine. At home, although she could simmer it, she especially hated drinking that black smelly stuff. It was extremely bitter. Usually when she drank it, she would hold her nose and drink it down, then eat some candy to mask the taste in her mouth.","\"I don't know the next arrangements yet, but Chinese medicine really doesn't taste good.\" Shu Yi said.","\"Alright then, let's not drink medicine. I’ll make some medicinal plasters for you to apply, but there will be side effects.\" Shen Yin said.","\"What side effects?\"","\"That is, there will be marks left after applying, and the imprints need one or two months to fade away.\"","Shu Yi thought it would be bad for the body. This kind of thing was nothing at all, so she said, \"That's nothing.\"","Shen Yin had prepared the Chinese medicine in advance. She ground them into powder, then stirred them with simmered medicine liquid to make medicinal paste.","\"Lie down on the sofa and lift your top a bit.\" Shen Yin said.","Shu Yi did as she was told. Shen Yin applied the medicinal paste on Shu Yi's two acupoints on the waist, and used a special adhesive to prevent the medicinal paste from rubbing off.","\"Turn over.\"","In the same way, Shen Yin applied one on Shu Yi's lower abdomen.","When the cleaning lady came, this was the scene she saw.","\"Madam, are you a doctor?\" the cleaning lady asked.","\"No, Auntie. I just happen to know a little bit from books, for treating dysmenorrhea. I don't even know if it works or not, this is just a try.\"","\"Shu Yi, I have prepared all these medicines for you, 10 days' worth, change the paste every day.\"","\"Yin Yin, thank you so much, how much do I owe you?\"","\"No need. I still don't know if I can cure it. Treat me to a meal when you are cured.\"","The relationship between women can be very strange, able to become friends in a second. This was Shen Yin's first time really going out after coming to this world. Seeing there was someone in front of her now, she suggested, \"Let's go shopping.\"","Shu Yi herself didn't really like going out. Although she was not very famous, she still had the awareness that should come with being a public figure, such as not going out casually. But Shen Yin had helped her block the paparazzi and was also treating her illness. She could not refuse. Also, she felt that Shen Yin really treated her as a friend.","After gearing up fully, Shu Yi drove and took Shen Yin and Zhengzheng to the most prosperous street in Rong City."]},{"number":27,"title":"Chapter 27: Just In Self-defense","paragraphs":["As women go shopping, what they love to shop for the most are clothes and cosmetics. Shen Yin was not very interested in cosmetics. Instead, she was attracted by the many novel kitchenware in this era.","Zhengzheng sat in the shopping cart while Shen Yin pushed it. Shu Yi accompanied her to stroll around the large supermarket. Shu Yi wore a mask, sunglasses and a hat to cover up. Shen Yin was not a public figure so she did not wear any. Though they had different temperaments, there was no denying they were both gorgeous beauties. Even the little Zhengzheng in the cart attracted quite some eyeballs.","Cute lunch boxes, tableware... Shen Yin absolutely loved them. She wanted to buy whatever she saw. Shu Yi usually shopped online. Taking a rare stroll in the supermarket was quite fun for her. Seeing Shen Yin’s strong desire to shop, she took another cart specially for items.","After one round of sweep, the things Zhengzheng picked filled up her cart. Shen Yin then realized she had gone a little overboard and decided to check out.","“Ma’am, will you be paying by Alipay or WeChat?”","“WeChat.” Shen Yin took out her phone to bring up the payment QR code but it did not scan. She checked carefully and found there were only 8 dollars left in her account.","The situation was a little awkward. Shu Yi asked, “Did your internet crash? Let me pay for you.”","Shen Yin did not feel good letting Shu Yi pay. She opened Xu Xiuhe's chat and sent him a message.","[Can you transfer me some money on WeChat?]","The moment Xu Xiuhe received the message, he happened to be holding his phone. He did not understand why Shen Yin was asking him to transfer money to her when the company deposited money into her account every month.","Without asking, Xu Xiuhe transferred 50,000 yuan to her on WeChat.","Shen Yin accepted the money right away and paid the 3000 yuan for her purchases.","There were a lot of items so they were not easy to carry. Shen Yin looked for supermarket staff to help bring everything to the underground parking garage.","She and Shu Yi also followed the staff with Zhengzheng to the underground parking garage.","When they arrived at Shu Yi's car, Shen Yin thanked the staff and let them leave. Zhengzheng stood on the ground while Shen Yin and Shu Yi put the purchased items into the trunk one by one.","Suddenly, several vicious-looking men in black charged aggressively toward Zhengzheng.","Shen Yin reacted quickly to block them. “Shu Yi, take Zhengzheng into the car.”","Neither Zhengzheng nor Shu Yi had seen something like this before. They were terrified. Shu Yi picked up Zhengzheng and got into the car, covering Zhengzheng's eyes. Just as she was about to call the police on her phone... She realized the situation had changed.","Shen Yin moved swiftly and agilely. Shu Yi could not even see clearly how she did it. She maneuvered among the few men, kicking up, bending back, jumping up, squatting down, dodging, striking out.","The men in black did not expect a woman like Shen Yin to know martial arts and have such quick reflexes. She caught them off guard. Their original mission was to knock this woman unconscious first before kidnapping the child.","Now the circumstances had changed. One man in black took out a dagger. Under the cover of the other men, he charged toward Shen Yin's chest with the dagger.","The moment Shen Yin saw the dagger, her eyes changed. So they intended to kill. She had gone easy on them, not wanting to truly hurt them. Now that they were merciless, she would be ruthless too.","Shen Yin bent back at the waist to slide under the arm of the man wielding the dagger. She turned around and grabbed his wrist, forcing it down powerfully so that the dagger stabbed into the man's thigh.","The man in black let out a cry as blood flowed from his leg. He quickly used his hand to cover the wound and fell to his knees, the dagger dropping to the ground.","Seeing this, the fury of the other four men swelled. They closed in on Shen Yin. Considering that Shu Yi and Zhengzheng had been waiting in the car for quite some time, Shen Yin decided to end this quickly.","So Shen Yin jumped up and kicked one man's chin. With one hand, she warded off another man, then kicked at both their knee joints. She turned and used the same moves on the other two, knocking all five men down.","\"Don't overestimate yourselves. Go back and tell your boss, next time you come, don't think about going back.\" Shen Yin's expression was icy cold.","Shen Yin opened the backseat door and got into the car.","Shu Yi looked worried. \"Yinyin, are you okay? I just called the police.\"","\"What did you say to the police?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I said there was a robbery at the underground parking garage at Rongguang Shopping Mall.\"","\"Okay, it's fine. Let's go.\"","Shu Yi was still nervous and drove the car up.","\"Yinyin, you're so amazing. What kind of celestial treasure are you that you even know martial arts? You're more skilled than the martial arts director in the crew.\"","Shu Yi's expression had changed from anxious to worshipful.","Shen Yin patted her hand. \"I'll teach you one day.\"","The police arrived at the scene and saw five men in black lying motionless on the ground.","Officer Wang turned to ask the junior officers, \"Did you check the surveillance footage?\"","A junior officer replied, \"Officer, we just went to the surveillance room and saw that the cameras in the underground parking garage went out two hours ago.\"","Without surveillance footage, this case would be difficult to investigate.","Officer Wang said, \"Bring these five back to the station for interrogation.\"","\"Officer, their knees are injured,\" the junior officer responded.","\"Is it serious?\"","\"One can't walk. He currently can't stand up.\"","\"Send them to the hospital first.\"","In the interrogation room, the five men in black sat in a row. Officer Wang observed their expressions and asked, \"Tell me what happened.\"","\"Knock knock knock. Officer Wang, come out for a moment.\"","Wang Yupeng came out and asked, \"Any discoveries?\"","\"The five men are respectively Meng Daxing, Zhao Tielei, Wan Xiang, Xu Kaiyuan and Sun Tao. All have prior records. The fingerprints on the dagger belong to Wan Xiang himself. Aside from the deep wound in Wan Xiang's leg, the other four all have knee fractures.\"","\"The caller? Have you called to ask?\"","\"Calling right now.\"","When Shu Yi received the call from the police station, she was anxious and uneasy. \"Yinyin, what should we do? The police called and found me.\"","Shu Yi was an actress who had acted in a lot of youth dramas. She had not experienced something this major before. It was normal to feel afraid.","\"It's fine. Give me the phone.\"","\"Hello, yes I was the one who called the police. Okay.\"","After hanging up the call, Shen Yin passed the phone back to Shu Yi. \"Drive to the Rongguang District Police Bureau in Rong City.\"","At this point, Shu Yi felt like Shen Yin was her backbone. She drove toward the police station.","There were officers already waiting for them at the entrance. Shen Yin carried Zhengzheng as she and Shu Yi walked in together. They entered Officer Wang Yupeng's office.","\"Ma'am, you can take off the mask and hat now.\"","Hearing this, Shu Yi thought there were no paparazzi around and removed her hat, mask and sunglasses.","The junior officer beside immediately recognized Shu Yi. \"Ah, aren't you that campus goddess from the TV show?\"","Officer Wang was slightly older and not familiar with youth dramas. He stared at Shu Yi for a while and said, \"You're an actress?\"","Shu Yi nodded. Officer Wang considered the case and asked, \"What happened with those people?\"","Shu Yi was a little afraid. Noticing Shu Yi's expression, Shen Yin spoke up, \"Those people tried to rob our bags, but they didn't know I practice taekwondo.\"","Shu Yi added, \"It was self-defense. They attacked first, and they even had a knife. To get away, to protect ourselves, we had to fight back. You can check the surveillance footage.\"","Officer Wang and the junior officers exchanged glances. It seemed they did not know the surveillance had been destroyed.","\"Check these two's information.\" Officer Wang instructed.","They did not know until they looked it up. What a shock.","Zhengzheng was not too frightened. She was just sleepy and fell asleep in Shen Yin's arms.","The junior officer served tea to Shu Yi and Shen Yin. His tone had changed.","After a while, someone walked into the office."]},{"number":28,"title":"Chapter 28: Police Station","paragraphs":["Xu Xiuhe wore a black suit, black leather shoes, and exuded an aura that warned others to stay away as he walked into Wang Yupeng's office.","When he reached the sofa, Xu Xiuhe's aura changed, possibly because he was afraid of scaring Zhengzheng. He was no longer as cold, stern, and even angry as before. Shen Yin and Shu Yi were both amazed at how quickly someone could switch their aura.","The district chief of the Public Security Bureau also rushed over after receiving a message from Wang Yupeng, saying, \"Mr. Xu, sorry, sorry, we haven't welcomed you properly.\"","Xu Xiuhe lowered his head to look at Shen Yin and asked, \"How are you, did anything happen to you?\"","Shen Yin did not speak, only shaking her head.","\"Chief Duan, what do you think we should do?\" There was a sense of oppression in Xu Xiuhe's voice.","Duan Hao lowered his head and replied, \"It's been taken care of, just sign and you can go back.\"","Given Xu Xiuhe’s status and position in Rongcheng, few people could match him, plus his connections with Xue Jingrui and Chang Zhiyuan, Duan Hao did not dare to slight him.","Xu Xiuhe signed on the sofa. Shen Yin had been staring at Xu Xiuhe's writing since he sat down to sign. It was strong and powerful, clearly the writing of someone who had practiced calligraphy. As the legitimate daughter of the Marquis's Mansion, Shen Yin had always been supervised by her tutor to practice writing, and she thought herself no amateur. But now, seeing Xu Xiuhe's writing, she felt somewhat ashamed. Shen Yin thought that she didn't know if her skills had been amplified since arriving in this world, and wondered if the calligraphy she could produce now would surpass Xu Xiuhe's. In any case, she felt her martial arts skills were much stronger than in the Dasheng Dynasty.","After Xu Xiuhe finished signing, he took Zhengzheng from Shen Yin's arms and said, \"That's it, let's go back.\"","Under the escort of Chief Duan, Officer Wang, and some junior police officers, the three adults and one child left the police station.","One young officer asked, \"Chief Duan, Teacher, what is that man's background? His aura is so big I didn't even dare to breathe.\"","Wang Yupeng replied, \"Kid, don't get involved in these things. Did any of the five people inside say anything?\"","\"No, they said some random nonsense that didn't match up at all. I could see they were very nervous and didn't dare to tell the truth. It seems like they committed the crime first.\"","Wang Yupeng seemed to have thought of something and said, \"Detain them first, we'll deal with it later.\"","If these people had robbed ordinary people, the case could have been closed immediately. But they happened to provoke the CEO's wife of Zhiyuan Group and a famous actress, so the situation might not be that simple. They needed instructions from above on how to handle it.","Xu Xiuhe handed Zhengzheng to Shen Yin, got in the car, and turned around, \"Get in the car, let's go home first.\"","Shen Yin looked at Shu Yi and said, \"The things I bought are still in Shu Yi’s car.”","Only then did Xu Xiuhe get a clear look at what Shu Yi looked like. He had heard Shen Yin say yesterday that Shu Yi was coming to see her today, so when the police station called him, he passed this news to Chang Zhiyuan, since Shu Yi was an artist under his company after all.","\"I'll go get the stuff from the back of your car.\" Xu Xiuhe got out of the car again and walked to the back of Shu Yi's car.","Shu Yi had calmed down now, not as scared as before, but it was unlikely she felt like nothing had happened.","She thought she would help Xu Xiuhe grab the bags, and was about to go over when a Maserati stopped behind Xu Xiuhe and her cars. Without looking, Xu Xiuhe knew it was Chang Zhiyuan.","Sure enough, one of Chang Zhiyuan's legs stepped out. White trousers, a pink floral shirt, sunglasses... While it looked quite tacky, it had a certain charm when worn by him.","Chang Zhiyuan took off his sunglasses, looking rather anxious as he asked, \"What's the situation, nothing happened right?\" Aside from Shu Yi being an artist under his company that he would need to take responsibility for if something went wrong, he was also interested in her now, so of course he would be worried.","Shu Yi shook her head and said, \"Nothing major happened.\"","\"Then let's go back first,\" Xu Xiuhe suggested.","\"I'll take you home,\" Chang Zhiyuan said to Shu Yi, afraid she was still scared.","\"My things are still at Shen Yin’s house.\"","Shen Yin heard Shu Yi’s words from the car. Looking at her phone, she saw it was almost one o'clock. \"You guys must be hungry. Shu Yi, why don't you come to Ziyue Manor to eat something first before going home?\"","Shu Yi thought about it and agreed. She was still a little shaken by the incident. The dagger in the hands of the man in black had almost injured Shen Yin. But Shen Yin seemed totally unperturbed, as if those men were nothing to her. She was only worried about scaring Zhengzheng.","The three cars raced down the road, arriving at Ziyue Manor in 40 minutes. The few of them entered the villa. Afraid that Zhengzheng was hungry, Shen Yin cooked the leftover dumplings from the morning for him to eat.","After eating, Zhengzheng fell asleep again. Shen Yin still needed to cook, so she placed the sleeping Zhengzheng in the rocking cot in the living room.","She had bought some vegetables in the morning, and there were also some vegetables left at home. Considering everyone was hungry, Shen Yin wanted to simply prepare something to fill their stomachs first. Shu Yi came over to help out as well. Chang Zhiyuan and Xu Xiuhe went upstairs to discuss today’s incident.","\"Xiuhe, what do you make of this? Do you think the attack was aimed at one of those three, or was it just a failed robbery attempt?\"","\"It’s not clear yet. The police said there were five men in black, subdued by Shen Yin and Shu Yi.\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"What the f**k, no way right?\" Chang Zhiyuan was so shocked his mouth fell open. He couldn’t believe that two weak women, plus a child, could subdue five fierce thugs.","\"I'm not sure either, but right now the five men in black are at the Rongguang District police station. According to people at the station, they received a report from Shu Yi and rushed to the underground parking lot of Rongguang Mall, where they found five men already beaten up on the ground while Shen Yin and Shu Yi had left. As for why they were at the police station later, it was because the police called and asked them to go back.\"","\"What about surveillance footage?\"","\"The surveillance cameras happened to malfunction right as Shen Yin entered Rongguang Mall.\"","\"So the only ones who know exactly what happened are the two of them?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","\"Yes. Let's go down, they've probably finished cooking,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Chang Zhiyuan was already hungry and looked forward to the meal cooked by Shen Yin.","Downstairs, with Shu Yi's help, Shen Yin had cooked pepper and beef noodles, stir-fried three dishes—not a lot, but in generous portions, enough for four people.","Shu Yi felt awkward when she saw Xu Xiuhe and Chang Zhiyuan. She wanted to avoid Chang Zhiyuan, but who knew such an incident would happen today.","At the dinner table, Chang Zhiyuan exclaimed that the pepper and beef noodles were the best noodles he had ever eaten. Shu Yi quite agreed with this statement.","\"Shen Yin, Shu Yi, who do you think today's attackers in black were targeting?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Shen Yin and Shu Yi looked at each other and said, \"It seemed they were going for Zhengzheng. At that time, Zhengzheng was standing next to me while we were putting the purchases in the trunk, then they rushed towards Zhengzheng.\"","After Shen Yin finished speaking, it was Xu Xiuhe and Chang Zhiyuan's turn to exchange looks. Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin roughly guessed what was going on.","\"Then how did you escape from their attack?\" Chang Zhiyuan was still most concerned about this.","\"Yinyin fought them off,\" Shu Yi replied.","Xu Xiuhe and Chang Zhiyuan still did not believe that two unarmed women with a child could defeat five brawny men, and even injure them all severely. No matter what, they absolutely did not believe it.","Unless the video evidence was smashed in their faces.","Chang Zhiyuan carefully observed the expressions of Shen Yin and Shu Yi, trying to glean something from their faces. Just then, the phone in his pocket happened to ring.","\"Mr. Chang, bad news!\" his assistant said anxiously on the phone."]},{"number":29,"title":"Chapter 29: Hot Search","paragraphs":["\"What happened, tell me slowly.\" Chang Zhiyuan had seen a lot and dealt with many things. Compared to his assistant, he was much calmer.","\"Shu Yi is trending.\" The assistant said.","Chang Zhiyuan hung up the phone, opened Weibo, and the #1 trending topic was \"Famous actress Shu Yi rumored to have had a child.\"","Xu Xiuhe asked, \"What happened, did something happen?\"","\"Shu Yi is trending.\" Chang Zhiyuan clicked into the trending topic. There was a video inside. The video was blurry and netizens couldn't clearly see the people in it, but Xu Xiuhe and Chang Zhiyuan recognized them clearly. The people in the video were indeed Shu Yi and Shen Yin, and the location was the underground parking garage of Ronguang Shopping Mall.","The video started from when Shen Yin and Shu Yi came down from the mall. Shen Yin and Shu Yi put things in the trunk while Zhengzheng stood to the side. Suddenly, five men in black charged at them.","Next was the fight scene. When the knife came out, it scared the paparazzi and the camera shook. After stabilizing, it continued filming.","The whole video was about 10 minutes, and the most exciting fight scene was recorded in detail.","The police did not expect that the missing part of the surveillance video would be recorded this way. It was clear that the men in black rushed at the child.","The police also contacted the paparazzi immediately and obtained the full video.","The previous video didn't have Shen Yin, but Shu Yi's disguise made it obvious she didn't want to be recognized. The paparazzi had probably been stalking Shu Yi since yesterday, which is why she was followed the day after leaving the drama set. Whether intentionally or not, the title hinted that Shu Yi had a secret child.","When the video showed Shu Yi hugging Zhengzheng into the car, it convinced many netizens that she was a mother with her child. The intense fight also attracted many comments.","The Yanxi Drama Team's wrap-up Weibo from yesterday also rose to #2 on trending.","\"Oh my god, is this Shu Yi? The campus goddess already has a child?\"","\"It should be her. Can't see her face but the figure looks similar.\"","\"Didn't expect she already has a kid.\"","\"The other woman, although you can't see her face clearly, she's obviously a beauty too.\"","\"That's not important. What's important is she's so cool, taking on five guys alone.\"","\"A bodyguard? Bodyguards are that capable these days?\"","\"No need to say more, I like this bodyguard. So awesome. Big sister loves her.\"","\"So, is the child next to her Shu Yi's illegitimate child?\"","One comment after another caused this Weibo post's popularity to continue rising. Shu Yi, Xu Xiuhe, and Shen Yin all saw it.","Xu Xiuhe and Chang Zhiyuan looked at each other. Not because of Shu Yi's scandal, that was easy to refute. But if they didn't see it with their own eyes, they wouldn't have believed Shen Yin was so fierce—gentle on the outside yet able to take on a group alone.","Chang Zhiyuan's phone rang again, the screen showing \"Wang Ming.\"","\"Hello, yes, it's about Shu Yi. My side has started PR already.\"","That was all Shu Yi heard before they ended the call.","\"You can release your drama photos to refute this.\" Xu Xiuhe suggested.","Chang Zhiyuan was surprised. He didn't expect Xu Xiuhe to propose this method of refutation. \"Didn't you say to keep identities secret and not expose them?\"","Xu Xiuhe: \"Don't mention identities, just say the child is a little actor from the crew who is close with Shu Yi. The woman fighting the men in black is the child's mother.\"","After thinking for a bit, Xu Xiuhe added, \"I'll handle the men in black.\" Since Yang Cui made a move, he wouldn't go easy on her people.","Xu Xiuhe and Chang Zhiyuan went upstairs to discuss PR and how to handle this to maximize their interests. After finishing, Chang Zhiyuan said, \"Did you know your wife is so fierce?\"","This struck Xu Xiuhe's sore spot. He really didn't know. Now he felt that after living together for 2-3 years, his understanding of his wife was just the tip of the iceberg. Fortunately Shen Yin was by his side. If it were Macoma from before, Zhengzheng would be in serious danger now.","\"Bro, be careful from now on. You can still consider divorce while you can. Be careful or you'll end up beaten to the ground like those thugs if you don't listen to your wife someday.\" Chang Zhiyuan joked while sitting on Xu Xiuhe's office desk.","\"Say one more word and get out.\" Xu Xiuhe was long used to Chang Zhiyuan's uncensored mouth.","\"Xiuhe, serious talk. Is Ziyue Manor fully occupied?\" Chang Zhiyuan became serious.","Ziyue Manor was a property project of Xu Xiuhe's company. The whole estate was very large, and due to the high prices, two of the five villas remained unsold. It was fair to say the entire Ziyue Manor belonged to Xu Xiuhe.","\"What, you want to buy one?\"","\"About Shu Yi being stalked by paparazzi, I still need to investigate. Her current home is provided by the company, but security is clearly lacking compared to Ziyue Manor. Plus I feel she and your wife get along well now. I've looked into her background—she rarely gets close with people. Having her live there would put my mind at ease. Could you ask your wife to put in a good word for me if possible? Shu Yi has been avoiding me a bit.\"","Xu Xiuhe could hardly believe it. \"You're serious?\"","\"Of course. I used to play around all the time because I hadn't met the right one. Now it's time to settle down.\"","Xu Xiuhe thought quickly and felt it was a good idea. Shen Yin hadn't interacted with outsiders for years until recently after recovering from her illness. She needed friends now. Plus he was really grateful to Shen Yin. Even if they didn't have feelings for each other, staying respectful was good for Zhengzheng.","With PR underway, the online opinion turned positive after the refutation. After the crew photos were released, the Yaxi's Legend Weibo gained many new fans. Shu Yi also successfully gained popularity. Who doesn't like a beautiful, kind-hearted girl next door? And who doesn't like a cute and cool baby?","Most importantly, the cute baby's mother was beautiful and awesome, able to take on five guys alone. The baby's looks were ensured, and the mother must be even more stunning.","\"Don't stop me, I want all the information on this awesome lady in one minute!\"","\"Which brother is so lucky to have such an awesome wife and child?\"","\"The one above, don't guess. Her temperament makes it obvious she has an extraordinary identity.\"","\"Why does she seem kind of familiar?\" The employees of Heyun Group commented online. After sending the Weibo photos to their small work group, the truth came out.","[Wow, isn't this the CEO's wife and the CEO's son?]","[What else don't I know? I didn't expect the gentle, beautiful CEO's wife I saw yesterday to be so capable at fighting.]","[You guys say, if the CEO doesn't listen to her...]","[Simply unimaginable.]","Shen Yin didn't know she had become popular now, with people trying to dig up information about her online. But Shen Li had already scrubbed her information clean when she got married, so netizens couldn't find anything. The Heyun Group employees certainly wouldn't reveal truths online. They greatly admired Shen Yin now.","As for the five men at the police station, with Xu Xiuhe intervening in the investigation and all of them having criminal records, none would get out in less than 10-8 years. They didn't have direct contact with Yang Cui, but went through several middlemen, making things difficult."]},{"number":30,"title":"Chapter 30: Open a Studio","paragraphs":["After coming out of the crew, Shen Yin took care of Zhengzheng at home every day, making all kinds of delicious food for him and teaching him how to speak.","Over a period of time, Zhengzheng had become completely dependent on her, trusting her with his whole heart. The lack of maternal love was made up during this time, but Shen Yin knew this was far from enough. A mother's love flows steadily for a long time, so in the days to come, she would always accompany Zhengzheng. He was the closest person to her in this world. Even if she and Xu Xiuhe really reached the worst stage in the future, she still hoped Zhengzheng’s custody would be in her hands. So she had to do something instead of always relying on Xu Xiuhe.","Shen Yin thought about some of her own skills and combined them with the original owner's major. She decided to start with clothing. The original owner had a studio before. When the original owner was abroad, she had a dream of becoming a fashion designer. Her family was in Rong City, so she built one with the help of Shen Lyu.","However, the studio basically had no customers. Moreover, after the original owner was with Zhou Man, her studies fell behind and her professional knowledge was not up to standard. After the original owner got married, she dismissed the employees of the studio. From then on, the studio was just a decoration. Fortunately, the Shen family was rich. Otherwise, how could the original owner have opened a studio and kept losing money?","Relying on the original owner’s memory, Shen Yin drove with Zhengzheng to the studio on Qinghe Street. It was a retro street with unique buildings.","The original owner's studio was in a three-story small building. The exterior of the building was very delicate, like a Republican-era building. But the entrance of the small building was locked. Shen Yin was well prepared. When she decided to come here, she had already found all the things about this studio that belonged to the original owner, such as relevant information and the keys to the studio.","Shen Yin stopped the car, got out holding Zhengzheng, and fell in love with this street as soon as she got off. A man-made stream ran through the entire street, with clear water in the stream. Pebbles were paved on the bottom of the stream and on both sides. There was a long bench on the pebbled pavement on both sides at intervals. On the outer side of the pebbled pavement were rows of small buildings.","The whole street had a flavor of Jiangnan. Shen Yin had never seen such a scene of small bridges, flowing water, stone roads, and antique small buildings on both sides in Dasheng Dynasty.","The charming Qinghe Street was not as luxurious as Qingshui Avenue, and there were fewer people than that side. The rhythm here was slower than that side. When Shen Yin came, it was morning. There were residents walking slowly on Qinghe Street. Some people were washing vegetables by the stream, some people were selling breakfast at the door of the small building, and some small buildings had just opened for business. The scent of human life here was strong. Shen Yin was in no hurry to open her own studio. Instead, she walked slowly along the street holding Zhengzheng’s hand, feeling the beauty here.","\"Zhengzheng, do you like it here?\" Shen Yin slowed down her pace to cater to Zhengzheng and asked slowly.","\"Like it!\" Zhengzheng jumped for joy. His happiness could be seen at a glance. Although Xu Xiuhe was very rich, he couldn’t accompany Zhengzheng to travel everywhere. Aunt Song rarely took Zhengzheng out either. Since Zhengzheng was born, he seldom went out of Ziyue Manor. It was very rare that Xu Xiuhe took Zhengzheng to see Chang Zhiyuan, Xue Jingrui, and the others at Qingfeng Mingyue.","Seeing Zhengzheng so happy, Shen Yin thought to herself that after her career was stable, she would definitely take Zhengzheng traveling everywhere.","When Shen Yin opened the small building, she was shocked by the layout and environment inside. Although the exterior looked so exquisite and beautiful, why was the interior so messy and dirty? She couldn't clean it alone with Zhengzheng.","The money that Xu Xiuhe had transferred to her on WeChat last time was still there. Shen Yin just thought that all her money was in the bank card when she paid at the supermarket, but the card was not bound to WeChat. In the evening, she fiddled with it for a while and bound the card to WeChat. It was a big deal not knowing it, but it frightened her at a glance after binding it.","She knew she had money in her card, and not a little, but she didn’t expect so much money. Since it wasn't money she earned by her own ability, she could spend it now, but she was still uneasy. So she must have her own business. At present, Shen Yin is a rich lady. Looking at the dirty studio, she didn’t think twice and immediately went online to find a property company to clean it up.","After half a day, under the supervision of Shen Yin and Zhengzheng, the building had been cleaned up neatly by noon. Everything was neat and in place. Shen Yin really liked such a small building. If possible, she even wanted to live here with Zhengzheng for a while, but now there was nothing but machines here.","Shen Yin went up to the third floor and saw that there was even a small kitchen there. Shen Yin was super happy. That way, she could renovate the third floor into a rest and living area.","She was a go-getter and would just get things done. The third floor had a layout of two rooms, one living room and one bathroom. It was decorated and only needed Shen Yin to layout and renovate. Thinking of this, Shen Yin locked the door of the small building and placed Zhengzheng in the rear seat in the infant's safety chair.","During this time, she practiced driving from time to time near Ziyue Manor. There were many cars in the garage. Shen Yin picked a car she liked and drove it out. Her driving skills couldn’t be said to be very good now, but she had no problem driving normally.","Following the navigation, Shen Yin drove to the largest shopping mall in Qinghe District. She decided to select various furniture, and decorations for the small building.","Before picking out the furniture, Shen Yin took Zhengzheng to a sour fish restaurant. Shen Yin loved to eat fish very much. From her observations these days, Zhengzheng also liked it very much.","After eating, Shen Yin first took Zhengzheng to the supermarket. In an hour, Shen Yin bought frying pans, woks, pancake pans, rice cookers, knives, cutting boards and various kitchen utensils. What's more important is that she bought a lot of quirky and cute tableware, as well as some household items. Seeing that more and more things were bought, she simply found a supermarket staff member to help her carry things. After a round of shopping in the supermarket, Shen Yin spent five digits. The supermarket still provided delivery service, but Shen Yin did not let them deliver it immediately, but asked them to send it to her in the evening.","\"Mom, hug.\" Zhengzheng stretched out his little hand.","Shen Yin realized that Zhengzheng had been walking for a long time and should be tired. Then she hugged up Zhengzheng and headed to the furniture city next door.","Curtains, sofas, dining tables, coffee tables, chairs, beds, the furniture she could think of was ordered in the furniture city. However, she felt that the second floor and the first floor, especially the first floor which was the facade, needed some decoration.","After strolling around, Shen Yin discovered a new world in Chinese furniture. She didn't expect people in this era to like these wooden antiquated furniture. She took a look around and found that these furniture were much more expensive than the furniture she had just bought.","\"Miss, what do you need?\" The salesperson of the Chinese furniture asked.","\"Why is this furniture so much more expensive than other furniture?\" Shen Yin asked.","The salesperson looked at Shen Yin and felt that Shen Yin's temperament and image did not seem to be short of money at all, and could definitely afford the Chinese furniture.","\"Miss, because Chinese furniture is very popular nowadays, but the cost of Chinese furniture is extremely high. The shape of these furniture are restored by designers based on many books, and even after running to many museums around the world. For some museums, they have to go many times. The design cost is very high,\" said the salesperson.","After listening to this, Shen Yin carefully observed these Chinese furniture and felt they were just so-so. Compared to those in Dasheng Dynasty, they were not delicate enough, and the appearance was not as good as those in Dasheng Dynasty. No wonder, how could people nowadays make an exact replica of ancient objects?"]},{"number":31,"title":"Chapter 31: Clarification","paragraphs":["Shen Yin had a look of understanding on her face.","\"Ma'am, would you like to take a look?\" the furniture salesperson asked again.","Shen Yin shook her head. She had already bought all the furniture she needed. She was just curious why such ordinary furniture was so expensive. If she wanted Chinese-style furniture, she could simply draw up plans and have a carpenter custom make it, instead of spending so much money on something that wasn't even her preferred style.","Suddenly, Shen Yin had a flash of inspiration. She could become a Chinese furniture designer herself later on, partner with factories or even set up her own factory. That way, all the profits would be hers.","But for now, her clothing studio had just gotten up and running, and her energy was limited, so the furniture factory could wait.","With everything purchased, Shen Yin had the furniture and supplies delivered to Number 5, Qingshui Street, where she still had one very important thing to take care of.","She had noticed the sign above the small building on Qingshui Street at first glance when she arrived. It was called \"Yinman Clothing Studio.\" The mention of Zhou Man gave Shen Yin a headache. She now had to deal with the mess the original host had made. There was no way she was using that name, not just because she found it distasteful herself, but if Shen Li ever found out about it, he would give her hell.","Returning to Qingshui Street, Shen Yin immediately took down the little wooden sign for \"Yinman Clothing Studio\" and had Zhengzheng toss it in the trash can nearby.","\"Young lady, it's been years since I've seen you around here,\" she heard a voice say. Shen Yin turned to see an old woman with silver hair. The original host didn't seem to remember this person.","\"Hello Granny. I've had some things come up these past few years and haven't been around this area,\" Shen Yin replied politely.","The silver-haired granny had an elegant and refined air about her. Shen Yin guessed she was retired and now living in this neighborhood.","\"I see. Young lady, what happened to that other girl who used to come here with you?\"","\"Hm?\" Shen Yin was puzzled. She thought back and remembered the original host had come here twice before with Zhou Man, but they hadn't run into this granny then.","\"You probably all got married. That handsome little boy there is your child, right?\" The silver-haired granny looked at Yun Zheng and asked.","\"Yes, he is.\"","\"I could tell with one look he resembles you. So handsome.\" The granny was very free with her compliments.","\"Thank you, Granny,\" Shen Yin gently taught Zhengzheng the proper response.","\"Thank you, Granny,\" he echoed in his little milk voice without any shyness.","\"Oh, so well-behaved. Just call me Grandma Su,\" the silver-haired granny said with a smile as she stroked Zhengzheng's face.","\"So Granny's surname is Su?\"","\"That's right, young lady. I may not have met you before, but I've seen you. I'm so happy to see you've come on your own this time. That other girl didn't seem to have the best character.\"","Shen Yin was puzzled. \"How did you know we haven't had contact for years? You're right, she's not the best person.\"","\"It's good you're not in contact. Otherwise you would have suffered losses,\" Grandma Su replied enigmatically.","Just as Shen Yin was about to ask more, the silver-haired granny turned and left, saying, \"I'm heading home for dinner now.\"","Shen Yin watched her go into the building next door at Number 4. Speaking of dinner, Shen Yin checked her phone and saw it was almost 6pm. Time to head back.","The furniture and other items had all been delivered. Shen Yin locked up and picked up Zhengzheng, intending to head back to Ziyue Manor. Everything else could wait until tomorrow.","When she reached the villa entrance, she saw Xu Xiuhe's car. With Xu Xiuhe busy at work lately, he had still made sure to come home for dinner every evening. Shen Yin knew the reason—she had thoroughly spoiled his stomach by now.","Sometimes when Shen Yin was free at midday, she would also go over and bring Xu Xiuhe lunch. By now everyone at Far Group knew Shen Yin and Zhengzheng. When they saw Shen Yin, they would greet her warmly, to which she would politely respond.","Lately Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe's relationship was quite stable. They were courteous with each other. Shen Yin would wait for Xu Xiuhe to come home for dinner in the evenings. They had no conflicts. On the contrary, she was rather appreciative of Xu Xiuhe.","\"Sorry I'm a bit late getting back. I had some things to take care of this afternoon and haven't started on dinner yet,\" Shen Yin said as she got out of the car.","Xu Xiuhe was just curious what Shen Yin had been up to and said, \"No problem, come get in my car and we'll eat out.\"","Xu Xiuhe started the car while Shen Yin got in the backseat holding Zhengzheng. \"Daddy, Zhengzheng wants to drive the car,\" the little boy said, full of curiosity about everything as children were.","The corners of Xu Xiuhe's mouth curved up slightly, an expression Shen Yin seldom saw from him. Other than dinner in the evenings and occasionally lunch, they didn't interact much the rest of the time.","\"I took Zhengzheng with me to Qingshui Street today,\" Shen Yin felt she should offer an explanation.","\"Oh?\"","\"I have a studio there. Now that Zhengzheng is a little bigger, and I have nothing else to do, I thought I'd reopen the studio.\"","\"Mm, sounds good. Let me know if you need any help with it.\" Xu Xiuhe was quite supportive of Shen Yin running her own studio. It was good to have something you enjoyed doing that gave life more meaning.","With all the coming and going, it was no surprise their little family of three attracted lots of attention as they walked through Qingyue Shopping Mall near Ziyue Manor. Their combined attractiveness made them unforgettable to passersby.","That night after getting home, Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin discovered they had made the hot search topics again: \"Far Group CEO Seen Out with Wife and Child at Qingyue Mall.\"","Everyone knew the rumors that Xu Xiuhe was in a marriage of convenience and had a bad relationship with his wife. He had never appeared together with her in public before. Now there were photos of them together that even made the hot searches.","Xu Xiuhe was relatively unruffled, but the photos this time showed them face on, with Zhengzheng held in their arms, so his face wasn't visible. The previous stills of Zhengzheng released by the crew only showed his back, while Shen Yin was clearly recognizable.","There were online comments questioning whether the woman in the photo was really Xu Xiuhe's wife, and even speculation she was a mistress and he was cheating.","Xu Xiuhe's phone lit up with an incoming call from Liu Bo: \"CEO, how do you want to handle this?\"","\"Issue a clarification on the company's official account.\"","\"Clarifying what exactly?\" Liu Bo didn't understand.","\"Clarify that the woman and child in the photo are my wife and son. And clarify that I'm not cheating.\"","He had just gotten off the phone when Chang Zhiyuan and Xue Jingrui were tagging him frantically in the group chat.","[Dude, I thought you were always real careful. How'd you get caught this time?]","[I assumed Qingyue Mall would be safe.]","[It's your mall, you can't just assume it's secure!]","Shu Yi also called Shen Yin.","After Far Group's official clarification, Shen Group also issued a post: \"Since when did my daughter Shen Yin become a mistress? And when did my son-in-law cheat on her without my knowing?\"","With this post, the business community and netizens alike were stunned. When did Shen Tianzheng have a daughter? They only knew Xu Xiuhe was in an arranged marriage but didn't know which family it was to. The wedding at the time was small and rushed, with only closest relatives and friends attending. They had no idea at all who Xu Xiuhe's bride was.","Shen Group was quite famous in Rong City, especially in recent years as it was growing rapidly. If people had known there was a daughter in the Shen family, their doorstep probably would have been trampled flat.","When Shen Yin was born, Shen Group was going through financial difficulties, and the family planning policy happened to be rolling out. So Fang Yue secretly gave birth to Shen Yin and registered her under Fang Yue's maiden name. As a result, very few were aware there was a daughter in the Shen family, even with Yang Cui's incomplete investigation."]},{"number":32,"title":"Chapter 32: Khao cp","paragraphs":["Yang Cui's investigation revealed that Shen Yin was sponsored to study abroad, and later married Xu Xiuhe at the sponsor's request, but Yang Cui did not know who the sponsor behind it was.","At this moment, Yang Cui was sitting on the sofa in the living room, extremely angry. Xu Guimin, Xu Xiuhe's father, came back from the Xu Group and saw Yang Cui's unhappy expression. He asked, \"What's wrong? Who made you angry?\"","Yang Cui adjusted her expression and looked worried: \"Guimin, Xiuhe is trending on social media.\"","\"Oh?\" Xu Guimin's action of taking off his suit paused for a moment.","Xu Guimin sat down on the sofa and took out his phone to see the trending news.","Xu Guimin and Xu Xiuhe had a very strained relationship. Xu Xiuhe had an argument with Xu Guimin before his college entrance exam. After the exam, he directly went to become a tutor without setting foot in the Xu family mansion again before going to university. Both father and son had stubborn temperaments and neither was willing to back down. Even when Xu Xiuhe started his company, Xu Guimin was the last to know.","\"Guimin, the child has been away for quite some time and it's been hard on him. Why don't we send someone to bring him back?\" Yang Cui tentatively suggested. In fact, she didn't want Xu Xiuhe to come back at all. She just wanted to see Xu Guimin's reaction now.","\"What's there to pick up? He can come back if he wants.\" Xu Guimin's expression was cold. Seeing this, Yang Cui felt reassured.","She may be reassured, but the netizens were not. They didn't expect Xu Xiuhe's wife to be from the Shen family, which was a marriage of equal elites. Moreover, they didn't expect Xu Xiuhe's previously unrevealed wife to be so beautiful with good temperament and appearance, and couldn't understand why there had been no movement at all previously.","The couple was good-looking, in line with the public aesthetic standards. Overnight, they even had a super-topic on social media, with fans frantically digging up all kinds of clues about their relationship, to no avail as there really wasn't anything previously.","【Forget it, from today onwards I'll start shipping this couple!】","【There's no clue so let's make up our own!】","【Sisters, go to Heyuan Group's official account. There are employees giving out clues there.】","Heyuan's official account gained hundreds of thousands of new followers overnight. Below were fans desperately asking for more clues. Unexpectedly, employees really gave out more:","【It was the lady boss's first time coming to the company to deliver lunch to the CEO. It was a huge lunchbox.】","【Don't mention it. We almost broke the elevator back then just to catch a glimpse of the lady boss.】","Heyuan employees gave out clue by clue.","【Ahhhhh so sweet! What does the lady boss look like in person?】","【She's gentle and charming, even I adore her as a woman.】","【Sisters, has the lady boss dropped by these two days?】","【She hasn't come these two days but did come by earlier.】","The threads grew longer with more and more people coming to eat up the clues. Liu Bo also didn't expect such a huge reaction this time. He thought it was just some rumor about the Heyuan CEO, but this directly confirmed the CEO's marriage. Not only did the stock price not fall, but it kept rising steadily. Liu Bo felt a little proud and thought he should get a bonus from the CEO for this.","Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin were not affected much. Xu Xiuhe was just worried that Shen Yin would be unhappy from having her marriage exposed. After dinner, Xu Xiuhe took the initiative to do the dishes while Shen Yin played with Zhengzheng in the living room.","In fact, Shen Yin didn't care about this trending news at all. She understood that in this day and age, there was no privacy at all. So she just focused on living her own life well and taking care of Zhengzheng. As long as it didn't interfere with her life, she didn't care.","\"I'm sorry, this time it was my fault for letting my guard down and not realizing there would be paparazzi around.\" Xu Xiuhe said to Shen Yin after finishing up the dishes.","\"It's fine, it was just some photos taken and we didn't lose anything.\"","Shen Yin suddenly remembered the wooden boards she bought today that needed calligraphy. So she asked, \"Xiuhe, do you have calligraphy brushes at home?\"","Xu Xiuhe was quite busy normally but still made time to practice calligraphy for half an hour every week as self-cultivation. So not only did he have calligraphy brushes, there were plenty, all kept upstairs in his study.","\"They're in my study upstairs. Are you going to practice calligraphy?\"","\"I want to write some words.\"","\"Alright, let's go upstairs then. It's about time to give Zhengzheng a bath too.\" Xu Xiuhe picked up Zhengzheng and followed behind Shen Yin upstairs.","Shen Yin stood outside the study door instead of going straight in. After all, it was Xu Xiuhe's personal space and she felt it would be inappropriate to enter when the owner was not inside.","Inside the study, there was a work desk. Next to the window was another desk covered in calligraphy paper, with a brush stand holding many brushes.","\"So you practice calligraphy too.\" Shen Yin walked over to the desk, feeling a little surprised. Not many people practiced writing with soft brushes nowadays since technology made typing and printing so convenient. Many people even had poor hard brush penmanship.","Shen Yin took out the small wooden board from her bag. Xu Xiuhe didn't understand - didn't she say she wanted to practice calligraphy? Why did she take out a fancy wooden board?","Xu Xiuhe held Zhengzheng on the sofa and found a children's storybook to read out sentence by sentence for Zhengzheng. But half his attention was still on Shen Yin as he was very curious what she was doing.","Shen Yin dipped and spread the ink with familiar motions. An experienced calligrapher's posture. She laid the board flat and wrote the name \"Yunyin Clothing Workshop\" briskly in one go.","It seemed Zhengzheng noticed his mother was not accompanying him anymore and also wanted to play with the wooden board.","\"Mama, mama, Zhengzheng also wants.\" Zhengzheng was sitting on the sofa but now wanted to get down by himself. Seeing the struggle, Xu Xiuhe went over carrying Zhengzheng towards Shen Yin. It was just as well since if not for his son's sake, he wouldn't have the excuse to go over on his own accord.","Next to Shen Yin, Xu Xiuhe then saw the words \"Yunyin Clothing Workshop\" on the board - probably the new name she came up with for her workshop.","But the calligraphy was extraordinary instead of ordinary. The strokes were strong and vigorous with excellent control of the brush tip that didn't seem like a woman's writing. Clearly she had practiced specifically before. Even seasoned calligraphers would probably feel inferior comparing to this.","Xu Xiuhe felt even more curious about Shen Yin now. He increasingly felt like she still had many secrets. A 24-year old woman with calligraphy like decades of practice.","Shen Yin was also very satisfied looking at her own writing. Superb, much better than what she wrote in Dasheng before. If her old tutor saw her writing like this, he probably wouldn't criticize her anymore for the poor form and penchant to argue with him that led her to always rank at the bottom in calligraphy evaluations at the academy! Shen Yin marveled again that everything in her dream was real. She just had to go along with it and all her skills seemed enhanced.","\"Have you studied calligraphy before?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Wary of exposing herself, Shen Yin replied, \"I practiced for a period when I had nothing to do.\" Only then did she notice several framed calligraphy works on the wall that looked similar to what she produced in Dasheng. She considered her Dasheng work decent enough to show others, just that her tutor always found faults and made her keep practicing.","\"Zhengzheng wants to write too!\" Zhengzheng struggled in Xu Xiuhe's arms towards the desk.","\"Zhengzheng, you're still small. You can write next year.\" Xu Xiuhe tried to dissuade him.","But Shen Yin thought otherwise. How could they extinguish a child's interest because he's too young? A child's interests must be encouraged and supported.","\"It's fine.\"","Shen Yin picked up Zhengzheng and stood him on the chair. She placed paper before him and gave him a brush. She soon regretted her naive thoughts as the disaster unfolded anyway."]},{"number":33,"title":"Chapter 33: The Treat","paragraphs":["Zhengzheng took the pen and drew two strokes on the paper. When she turned around, the pen touched Shen Yin's arm. Shen Yin was wearing a white shirt and instantly felt she had made a wrong decision.","Seeing this, Xu Xiuhe laughed. He was completely oblivious.","\"Zhengzheng, mother is angry. You got mother's clothes dirty. What should you do?\" Shen Yin pretended to be angry and spoke to Zhengzheng expressionlessly.","Zhengzheng realized Shen Yin was angry and did not know what to do. Her eyes were filled with tears as she looked to Xu Xiuhe for help.","\"Zhengzheng, what should you do when you make a mistake?\" Xu Xiuhe patiently taught her.","Zhengzheng blinked and said, \"I'm sorry, Zhengzheng was wrong. Can Zhengzheng wash mother's clothes?\"","This line successfully made Shen Yin break character and laugh out loud. Seeing Shen Yin laugh, Zhengzheng also revealed a few teeth in a smile. Xu Xiuhe was also affected by this atmosphere. It's so nice that Zhengzheng finally has someone who loves her.","The ringing of a cell phone broke this harmonious scene. Xu Xiuhe took out his phone which displayed an unknown caller ID. After thinking for two seconds, Xu Xiuhe still answered the call.","\"Hello, may I ask what you are calling about?\" After Xu Xiuhe answered, the other party did not make a sound.","\"Hello?\"","Still no reply. Faintly, Xu Xiuhe seemed to guess who was on the other end of the call.","Shen Yin had also been busy all day. Carrying Zhengzheng, she left the study, preparing to take a bath and go to sleep. There were still many things to do.","Ever since Zhengzheng returned from the crew, her small room had become purely decorative. She had to find her mother every night. Shen Yin also indulged her. After all, she was only two years old and had lacked maternal love before. Now that she had it, she had to cling to it properly.","Xu Xiuhe was still in the study, sitting at his desk handling documents, but he was still thinking about that phone call. So he sent a message to Xue Jingrui.","[Did you give her my phone number?]","[Did she really call you?]","Xue Jingrui’s reply had already answered what Xu Xiuhe wanted to know.","[There was an unknown number that called me. When I picked up, the other side didn't say anything.]","[Let me ask you one thing, please answer me truthfully.] Xue Jingrui sent out this message.","[Go ahead and ask.] Xu Xiuhe already guessed roughly what it was.","[You and Qi Yan have no future together, right?]","Xu Xiuhe had always known that Xue Jingrui liked Qi Yan. The two had known each other since childhood and could be considered childhood sweethearts. He and Xue Jingrui had been friends since childhood. However, coincidentally, he had only gotten to know Qi Yan in high school.","He found out that Xue Jingrui liked Qi Yan when they were in college. His and Qi Yan’s schools were close to each other, but Xue Jingrui’s school was far from them. Every time Xue Jingrui came to see him, he would bring food for Qi Yan.","Now Xu Xiuhe basically had no feelings left for Qi Yan. Time would dissipate everything. Now he felt that his current life was quite good. Zhengzheng was happy and carefree. He and Shen Yin respected each other, and their days were ordinary.","Having obtained a definite answer, Xue Jingrui felt at ease. Since Xue Jingrui still did not know Shen Yin’s current situation, he felt it necessary to let Xue Jingrui know that he and Shen Yin were doing quite well now. Although there were no feelings between them, they were decent life partners.","[Are you free tomorrow night? Come over for dinner at my place.] Xu Xiuhe replied.","[Great! I’ve long heard from Chang Zhiyuan that the dishes Shen Yin makes are more delicious than those made by a five-star hotel’s master chef.]","The message exchange between Xue Jingrui and Xu Xiuhe ended here. Xu Xiuhe looked at the time and confirmed Shen Yin hadn’t gone to bed yet, so he called Shen Yin.","When Shen Yin received the call, she thought it was preposterous. With only a wall separating them, that man had actually called instead of just knocking on the door.","\"What's the matter? Zhengzheng is asleep already.\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I'm looking for you. Do you have time tomorrow night? We’re having some guests over at home, and might need you to help entertain them.\"","Xu Xiuhe felt a little bad about troubling Shen Yin.","\"Okay, sure.\" Shen Yin thought that as long as he told her to cook, everything else was her own time to be busy with. If Xu Xiuhe had said there were guests coming over for lunch, she would have definitely not agreed.","On the day the guests were coming over, Shen Yin was busy with some matters at her studio in the morning. In the afternoon, she went to the supermarket early to buy all kinds of fruits, vegetables, meat and eggs.","She didn’t know how many people were coming, so she thought she might as well make more just in case there wasn't enough food.","Thinking that she might be a little busy, she remembered Shu Yi had moved into Ziyue Ting but they hadn't had a chance to meet yet. It was just nice timing to ask Shu Yi to come over tonight to lend a hand and help look after Zhengzheng.","When Shu Yi arrived, she brought two bottles of red wine. Shen Yin joked, \"Every time you come, you bring stuff. If you keep doing this, I'll feel too embarrassed to ask you over.\"","\"No way! Shen Yin, I should be the one treating you to dinner. After we left the police station last time, I was busy promoting a movie I did previously in various cities. Like I told you, after sticking on the herbal patch for 10 days, I didn't get a chance to come back. But strangely, when I came back recently, I didn't feel any pain at all. I feel like my condition has improved a lot lately.\" Shu Yi's happy expression was written all over her face.","Upon hearing this, Shen Yin also felt quite amazing herself. She was just a half-baked amateur and had no confidence at all, yet she had succeeded.","\"Let me take a look at you again.\"","Shen Yin took Shu Yi's pulse and said, \"Not bad. The coldness has dissipated almost completely. Remember not to eat cold food, and try to minimize eating chilled stuff too.\"","Shu Yi happily gave Shen Yin a big hug, then felt she had overstepped her bounds and said \"Sorry, I got too excited.\"","Dysmenorrhea had been so painful. Now that she was pain-free, she felt like the whole world had become better, and it was as if she had become a different person. \"Shen Yin, you're too good, too amazing. If you were to open a traditional Chinese medicine clinic, other clinics would go out of business.\"","\"Hahaha, no way. If I opened one, patients would probably ask me to refund their medical fees.\"","Zhengzheng had been very well-behaved in the living room. Shu Yi played with her for a while and felt there was no need to keep her company, so she went to the kitchen to help Shen Yin.","\"Wow, something smells so good!\" Shu Yi smelled a tempting aroma as soon as she entered the kitchen. Shen Yin took out two jars from the bottom cabinet and opened them.","\"Oh, so it's the wine.\"","The two jars contained peach blossom wine and osmanthus wine brewed by Shen Yin herself, filled with fragrance, making Shu Yi even more in awe of her.","\"You're right, I shouldn't have brought red wine. Shen Yin, is there anything you can't do? In my eyes, you're practically omnipotent now.\"","Shu Yi was usually not very talkative, yet she seemed like a different person in front of Shen Yin.","Shen Yin started cooking, mostly dishes she specialized in, plus some dishes she had learned in this time period. In two and a half hours, there were 4 cold dishes, 8 hot dishes, a pot of soup and some snacks on the table.","Shu Yi marveled yet again, \"I wonder how much good fortune your husband Xu accumulated in his previous lives to marry you.\"","Just as she finished talking, the door opened, and in came Xu Xiuhe, Chang Zhiyuan, Xue Jingrui, and an unknown woman."]},{"number":34,"title":"Chapter 34: Women's Sixth Sense","paragraphs":["What a coincidence, Shen Yin had seen this woman before, right at the entrance of this courtyard.","Before Shen Yin could speak, Qi Yan took the initiative to introduce herself, \"Hello everyone, I'm their friend.\" As Qi Yan spoke, she deliberately glanced at Xu Xiuhe.","A woman's sixth sense is always so scary. Shu Yi has been in the entertainment industry for several years and understands women's thoughts very well. Qi Yan's deliberate glance definitely had more meaning behind it.","Shen Yin recalled when she last saw Qi Yan at the courtyard entrance. Qi Yan clearly knew them but still claimed she walked to the wrong place. This residential area is so big yet doesn't have many residents. Shen Yin figured Qi Yan must have deliberately come over that time.","The three women were putting on an act. Chang Zhiyuan clearly had an I-don't-care expression as he walked straight to the dining table and marveled, \"Sister-in-law, you made so many dishes today. We're lucky. But some people, oh well...\"","Shu Yi hugged Zhengzheng and retreated back a little, as she still feared Chang Zhiyuan very much. Some days ago, Chang Zhiyuan said her previous home had poor security and was easy for paparazzi to stalk her. So he moved Shu Yi to live in Ziyue Courtyard instead. Shu Yi was unwilling at first, always feeling like Chang Zhiyuan had ulterior motives. But her agent told her that her status in the entertainment industry had risen considerably, so she did need to be more careful. He said it was the company's arrangement and she had to obey. After thinking about it, Shu Yi admitted Ziyue Courtyard was very nice, plus Shen Yin also lived there, so she decided to just move.","Chang Zhiyuan hated how Shu Yi was avoiding him. He walked up, wanting to hold Zhengzheng, and deliberately said \"Godson, godmother is tired. Let godfather hold you.\"","Shu Yi felt awkward. Shen Yin went into the kitchen, intending to bring out the peach blossom wine and osmanthus wine. Seeing this, Shu Yi considered that with two jars, Shen Yin may not be able to carry both herself. So Shu Yi also went into the kitchen.","\"Yinyin, you've seen Qi Yan before right?\" Shu Yi deliberated for a few seconds then decided to give Shen Yin a reminder. She murmured near Shen Yin.","\"Yeah, I saw her at the courtyard entrance last time. She said she walked to the wrong place.\"","\"Yinyin, the way she looks at your husband seems off. Be careful of this woman. She's not simple.\"","\"Okay, got it.\" Although Shen Yin agreed, this didn't seem to have much to do with her. Her current relationship with Xu Xiuhe could only be described as dining companions, distant and polite. So this matter wasn't hers to handle.","At the dining table, the dishes were full. Shen Yin put down the peach blossom wine and conveniently pulled over the baby chair. \"It's quite tiring to hold him. Let him sit down and get ready to eat.\"","Chang Zhiyuan put Zhengzheng down. He was rather intimidated by Shen Yin now. If Shen Yin got unhappy and directly beat him up again, what would he do? That video had left a trauma on him.","Chang Zhiyuan took out his phone and sent a message in their group of three, \"Dude, how did Qi Yan get here? So awkward.\"","Xue Jingui replied, \"She asked me for Xiuhe's number, so I brought her over to show her that Xiuhe is doing well now. Hopefully she can give up.\"","\"Please, she was the one who abandoned poor Xiuhe first back then. Now that she knows he's successful, she comes back.\"","\"Alright, let's eat first.\" After Xue Jingui sent this message, the group fell silent.","\"Sister-in-law, this wine smells so nice. Where did you buy it?\" Chang Zhiyuan opened the jar and asked.","Just as Shen Yin was about to reply, Shu Yi quickly cut in, \"You can't buy this wine anywhere. Yinyin made it herself!\" The young girl had completely forgotten that she also asked this when eating wontons last time.","Seeing they were ignoring her, Qi Yan felt rather awkward and cut in, \"Sister Yinyin, you're so awesome to even be able to make wine.\"","Things were fine before she spoke up. But now Shu Yi got even angrier. Qi Yan was clearly older than Yinyin, yet she dared call her sister? Acting like she was some amazing character? How shameless to even step through this door!","Shu Yi became unlike herself again and retorted, \"Sister Qi, you don't know our Yinyin's cooking tastes even better!\"","\"Let's not just stand here, sit down everyone.\" Xu Xiuhe came downstairs, apparently having changed into a white t-shirt and gray pants.","Shu Yi first noticed something amiss. Shen Yin wore a white skirt with a smoky grey top. At first glance, the two seemed to be wearing couple outfits. Shu Yi felt she had discovered a sweet treat but there was no one to share it with. So she observed Qi Yan's expression - she refused to believe the cheap tea hadn't noticed anything.","It's said a woman's thoughts are meticulous. The moment Xu Xiuhe came downstairs, Qi Yan's eyes never left him. She probably also noticed how Xu Xiuhe's outfit matched Shen Yin's clothing. Her complexion changed slightly for two seconds before recovering.","At the table, the six people all had their own thoughts. Qi Yan secretly observed Xu Xiuhe's attitude towards Shen Yin. Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan were different - with such delicious food on the table, it'd be a waste not to fully enjoy it. Xue Jingrui occasionally glanced at Qi Yan.","\"Qi Yan, eat more. The sister-in-law's cooking skills are indeed as good as Zhiyuan said.\" Xue Jingrui reminded.","Qi Yan had eaten a few bites and admitted it was delicious. But she had no appetite at all, much less wanting to taste a love rival's cooking.","As Chang Zhiyuan drank the osmanthus wine, he kept praising, \"I've never had such tasty wine before!\"","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe also lifted his cup and gently drank a sip. The osmanthus fragrance flowed into his mouth with the wine. After drinking it, a lingering fragrance remained in his mouth, mixed with a light sweetness.","\"It is quite nice to drink.\" Xu Xiuhe commented.","Shu Yi quickly chimed in agreement, \"So far, the wine Yinyin makes is the most pleasant I've ever had. None sold on the market taste as good.\"","Upon hearing this, Qi Yan felt even more heartbroken. Why did it have to be this way? Xu Xiuhe clearly liked her a lot in the past. She wanted to see just how good this rival's wine actually was that everyone praised it so much.","After one sip, Qi Yan felt it was just ordinary. Why were they all praising it when she was the one who had known them for longer? How could they all commend that other woman?","Qi Yan felt irritated and downed cup after cup of the osmanthus wine. Xue Jingrui noticed something wrong - the wine's alcohol percentage wasn't high compared to others, but it still couldn't withstand such heavy drinking!","\"Qi Yan, stop drinking.\" Xue Jingrui shook Qi Yan.","Qi Yan had already lost most of her sobriety. She stared straight at Xu Xiuhe without bothering to disguise it at all. The other four weren't blind and could tell there was definitely an unusual past relationship between them.","Xue Jingrui had only wanted to bring Qi Yan here to show her that Xu Xiuhe was living well now with a wife and child, hoping she could give up. Before coming, Qi Yan had also promised she would act just as an ordinary friend during the meal. But now Qi Yan was losing control. If Shen Yin lost her mind again because of Qi Yan, Xue Jingrui wouldn't be able to shoulder that responsibility.","\"She's had too much to drink. I'll take her back first.\" Xue Jingrui supported Qi Yan as they headed towards the door.","After Xue Jingrui left with Qi Yan, Shen Yin showed no reaction. She continued eating and drinking, feeding Zhengzheng, acting as if nothing had happened.","Chang Zhiyuan and Xu Xiuhe exchanged a look. Chang Zhiyuan then sent a message in their group, \"Really something, Jingrui. You deal with this situation yourself! I'm out.\"","After the meal ended, Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan left. Xu Xiuhe cleaned up the remaining dishes and placed all the bowls, plates, and chopsticks into the dishwasher.","Shen Yin was still playing with Zhengzheng. Xu Xiuhe felt that he needed to provide an explanation, given that despite having no feelings between each other, they still had to continue living together. Clearing things up would prevent any psychological burden.","\"Shen Yin, I had a previous relationship, that is with Qi Yan, but now I don't have any contact with her anymore. Xue Jingrui is pursuing her, so that's why he brought her over tonight. Also, I didn't know she was coming over, and Jingrui was innocent in this too.\""]},{"number":35,"title":"Chapter 35: Embroidery","paragraphs":["When Shen Yin heard this, she said, \"It's okay, no need to explain.\"","She didn't care anymore.","When Xu Xiuhe saw Shen Yin's attitude, he felt inexplicably angry. How could she act as if nothing had happened? But he didn't know where this anger came from.","Time passed in a flash, and the weather in Rong City was getting hotter and hotter. During this time, Shen Yin had decorated the small building on Qinghe Street nicely. The third floor was furnished very cozily.","The first and second floors were also renovated. The layout of the rooms was personally guided by her for the workers and craftsmen, especially the office on the second floor and the workplace. She chose the best materials and the newest machines.","There was a place on the first floor that was specifically for drinking tea and discussing work. Shen Yin sat on the sofa, checking the materials in her hands, and making phone calls one by one to the newly recruited employees to notify them to come to work on time tomorrow.","In the exhibition hall on the first floor, Shen Yin had put some clothes she had made recently when she had nothing to do. Although Zhengzheng was young, he was very sensible. Not only did he not disturb her work, he would also help Shen Yin fetch things from time to time.","\"Miss Shen, the store is about to open. I've seen you come here often these days,\" Su Jin said, leaning on a cane. But it didn't make her look uncomfortable at all, on the contrary, it made her temperament look even more noble.","\"Granny Su, you're here.\" Shen Yin got up and let Su Jin sit down.","Seeing Shen Yin stand up, Zhengzheng also hurried to Su Jin's side. Su Jin was very happy to see Zhengzheng running and jumping around. \"Slow down, don't fall.\"","\"Oh, I see you've put out a few pieces of clothing here. You must have just made them recently.\" Su Jin pointed to the clothes on the hanger over there and walked over to take a closer look.","\"Yes, Granny, I have to have some clothes to prop up the storefront when opening a studio.\" Shen Yin smiled.","Su Jin stood in front of a big red wedding dress and looked at it closely for a while. She said, \"Miss, did you embroider this yourself?\"","When Shen Yin made this wedding dress, she thought that the studio had to have a decent piece of clothing. In Dashang, the most precious clothing for a woman was the wedding dress she wore when she got married.","She also learned about the Chinese-style wedding dresses of this era, and felt that not only were they expensive, the quality was not very good either when examined closely. If she was going to make one, she had to make a unique one. She spent a long time in the fabric market before finding the right material for this wedding dress based on the specifications for ordinary family women in Dashang getting married.","\"Granny, my skills are not very good. It took me half a month to embroider this.\" Shen Yin answered truthfully.","\"What? Are you saying you embroidered this wedding dress in half a month?\" Su Jin couldn't believe it and asked again to confirm.","Only then did Shen Yin remember that there weren't many embroiderers in this era, only some professional embroiderers, and some even more professional ones who spent their whole lives learning the craft passed down from their ancestors.","\"Yes, Granny. I was interested before, so I learned for a while.\" Shen Yin replied.","She didn't just learn for a while. In Dashang, without electronic devices, let alone so many recreational facilities, women rarely went out, spending all their time learning musical instruments, chess, calligraphy and painting. As the legitimate daughter of the Xiang family, she had been required to learn various skills for women since she was a child. Her father Xiang even wanted to groom her to be the future princess consort, aiming for the position of Empress of the country.","But after her stepmother Xu Zhen was established, Xiang never had this idea again. He didn't know what kind of love potion Xu Zhen had given Xiang, and almost married her off to a bad-tempered old man of 37.","\"Just interested and learned for a while. No one can embroider like this nowadays, let alone embroider so skillfully with such vivid patterns. Even this wedding dress is quite unique.\" Su Jin was even more surprised, reaching out to touch the pattern on the wedding dress.","The other clothes were modern evening dresses. Shen Yin redesigned them based on the original owner's drafts, adding her own ideas. Because they were modern evening dresses, Shen Yin took advantage of modern machines and added some of her own thoughts. They also had their own style, but compared to the wedding dress, the impact was still greater.","\"Miss, when will you open?\" Su Jin asked.","\"Granny, we're opening tomorrow.\"","After saying goodbye, Su Jin was still carefully recalling Shen Yin's embroidery on the way back.","At this moment, Shen Yin knew how valuable this wedding dress was and that she must preserve it well and not sell it lightly.","\"Mommy, hungry, want dinner dinner.\" After playing enough, Zhengzheng looked up at Shen Yin with his hands behind his back.","Shen Yin smiled, \"Okay, take Zhengzheng upstairs, but Zhengzheng has to wait for Mommy for a while. Mommy has to make dinner for Zhengzheng.\"","Because Shen Yin and Zhengzheng had been solving lunch at the small building these days, she had never let the ingredients run out.","Shen Yin made tomato egg drop soup, stir-fried okra with egg, fish slices with sauce, and braised pork ribs.","At 11:50, Shen Yin looked at the time. Her phone hadn't been taken back yet. The screen displayed the three words Xu Xiuhe.","\"Hello, are you still at Qinghe Street?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Well, we're still at the small building.\"","The distance between Qinghe Street and Xu Xiuhe's company was not very far or very close, a 20 minute drive. Because Xu Xiuhe had been working overtime these past few nights, Zhengzheng would already be asleep when he got home. Before when he worked overtime, even if Zhengzheng was sleeping, he could still go in and see him. Now considering that Zhengzheng was with Shen Yin, he hadn't seen Zhengzheng for several days. Shen Yin had been busy these days and hadn't brought Xu Xiuhe lunch for a long time.","There were rumors in the company, wondering if he had offended his wife and that's why his wife stopped coming.","Under the excuse of seeing Zhengzheng, and getting a free meal wasn't too much, right?","When Xu Xiuhe walked into the small building, he saw some clothes right away. He figured their dining area was probably on the third floor, so Xu Xiuhe went straight up.","Zhengzheng saw Xu Xiuhe first. He was very surprised and happy to see Dad after such a long time. \"Dad!\" he said.","Shen Yin's movements paused as she was bringing out dishes. She turned around and saw Xu Xiuhe standing at the top of the stairs: \"What are you doing here?\"","Xu Xiuhe explained, \"I had some things to do around here this morning, so I thought I'd come by to see you guys.\"","\"Have you eaten?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Not yet.\"","Fortunately, Shen Yin had cooked three dishes for lunch today. The rice might not be enough, \"Let me make some noodles for you.\"","Shen Yin went back into the kitchen again. Xu Xiuhe picked up Zhengzheng and stood in the kitchen doorway, watching Shen Yin with her hair in a low bun cooking noodles for him. Xu Xiuhe's heartbeat suddenly slowed down by half a beat. It seemed, possibly, perhaps that he had fallen for Shen Yin.","Xu Xiuhe's mood was a little chaotic. He hurriedly took Zhengzheng to the dining table."]},{"number":36,"title":"Chapter 36: Fever","paragraphs":["During this period of time, he would involuntarily think of Shen Yin when working. He would suddenly wonder what Shen Yin was doing and could even say that he was worried about her.","Shen Yin brought out a bowl of clear noodle soup she just cooked from the kitchen. There was a tea egg in the noodles, as well as some vegetables, and there were some green onion slices sprinkled on top. It looked very appetizing.","\"There's not enough rice, so have some noodles,\" Shen Yin said.","Xu Xiuhe was still immersed in his own thoughts and was disrupted again by Shen Yin's words.","\"What's wrong? If you don't like eating noodles, you can eat rice and I'll eat the noodles.\"","Xu Xiuhe quickly denied: \"No, I was just thinking about some things. The noodles look quite delicious.\"","Then, the three of them ate their meals in silence. Shen Yin saw that Xu Xiuhe was putting dishes into Zhengzheng's bowl, so she didn't add any more to his.","\"What plans does this studio have next?\" Xu Xiuhe asked. In his eyes, Shen Yin's clothing studio could only be regarded as a hobby to pass the time doing things she loved. He didn't expect it to make money, and of course, he wasn't lacking money either.","\"The opening is tomorrow. I plan to set the starting point a little higher,\" Shen Yin said. At first, she hadn't thought about what kind of grade clothes she should make, but after Granny Su said her wedding dress was worth eight digits, Shen Yin decided.","\"You mean doing some custom-made, building a brand?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","That was Shen Yin’s intention, but she didn’t know how to express it. Unexpectedly, Xu Xiuhe had said it out.","\"The early stages may be more difficult. Everything is difficult at first. If there's anything you need, let me know and I'll have Liu Bo handle it,\" Xu Xiuhe had said this many times.","But Shen Yin would handle things herself if she could handle them instead of troubling others.","In the afternoon when Shen Yin was on the first floor with Zhengzheng, she felt a little uncomfortable physically with dizziness and blurred vision. Shen Yin touched her forehead, it was a little hot. Would she have a fever? The employees were going to start working tomorrow. She couldn’t fall apart at the critical moment.","Shen Yin took out her phone and called Xu Xiuhe. Xu Xiuhe was a little surprised to see Shen Yin's incoming call. Shen Yin rarely called him.","\"Hello, I'm feeling a little uncomfortable physically, maybe I have a fever. I'm afraid of passing it on to Zhengzheng. Can you come get him?\" Shen Yin said weakly.","When Xu Xiuhe heard this, he stood up directly from his office chair, \"Wait for me, I'll be right there.\"","Xu Xiuhe put on his coat and hurriedly left the office. Liu Bo walked over, \"What's the matter, Boss?\"","\"I have something urgent to attend to, won't be back tonight,\" Xu Xiuhe said without turning his head.","On the way, Xu Xiuhe stepped on the gas pedal. If it wasn't for obeying traffic rules, he would have wanted to run through all the red lights.","Finally, when he entered the small building, Xu Xiuhe saw Shen Yin sitting on the sofa with a pale complexion, still talking to Zhengzheng, telling him to play over there and not to come over.","\"Look at the time now!\" Xu Xiuhe didn't know why he was angry, but seeing Shen Yin like this inexplicably infuriated him.","He walked with large strides and went to Zhengzheng's side, picked up Zhengzheng and carried him out.","Seeing Xu Xiuhe carry Zhengzheng away, Shen Yin secretly breathed a sigh of relief. Now she didn’t have to worry about passing something on to Zhengzheng.","Shen Yin stood up with difficulty. She was worse now, her fever was probably higher now. There was no medicine here either. She went upstairs, intending to drink some hot water and take a nap.","Just as she was walking up the stairs, Xu Xiuhe's voice came from behind, \"Where are you still going upstairs to? I'm taking you to the hospital.\" His tone was a little worried.","Shen Yin didn't expect Xu Xiuhe to come back again. Shen Yin turned around, wanting to take a look. Unexpectedly, she became dizzy and her feet slipped back. Relying on her body's instincts, Shen Yin reached out to grab the railing.","Xu Xiuhe hugged Shen Yin from behind, \"Still not resting properly when you're sick!\"","This was Shen Yin’s first time being in such close physical contact with a man, and she felt a little uncomfortable at first. Just as she was about to say something, she was interrupted by Xu Xiuhe's words.","\"Don't move.\"","Shen Yin stopped and Xu Xiuhe picked her up, turned around, and asked, \"Is there anything else you need to bring from the room?\"","Shen Yin shook her head.","Xu Xiuhe carried Shen Yin towards the door of the small building. When they got to the door, Xu Xiuhe put Shen Yin down and said, \"Don't move.\"","Shen Yin really didn't dare to move. Xu Xiuhe locked the door of the small building swiftly, then picked up Shen Yin again.","\"What's going on here?\" Su Jin walked over from beside Small Building No. 4 and saw Xu Xiuhe carrying Shen Yin while asking.","Shen Yin spoke up in a small voice, \"Mother-in-law, I'm feeling a little uncomfortable physically.\"","\"Is it because you've been too busy recently and worn yourself out?\" Su Jin asked with concern.","Before Shen Yin could reply, Xu Xiuhe spoke up, \"Mother-in-law, I'll take her to see the doctor first, we'll get going now.\"","\"Okay, go see the doctor early, don't overexert yourself,\" Su Jin said as she watched Xu Xiuhe’s back.","Xu Xiuhe carried Shen Yin to the passenger seat, changed his position, leaned his body towards Shen Yin's side, quite close. The sides of Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin's faces were less than 10 cm apart.","Shen Yin was frightened, her spirits lifted in an instant, eyes wide open, holding her breath, not daring to move at all, \"What are you doing?\"","Xu Xiuhe turned his face, the two people were face to face, close enough to feel each other's breath, close enough for them to see themselves reflected in each other’s eyes.","\"Buckling your seatbelt for you.\" Xu Xiuhe found the seatbelt on the passenger side and pulled it over. In this position, it looked as if Xu Xiuhe was hugging Shen Yin.","Xu Xiuhe was truly handsome. Shen Yin felt her face become fiery hot, even hotter than before. How could it have gotten so bad so quickly? Shen Yin looked at herself in the mirror, her face was as red as a red apple.","She seemed to know why her face was burning. She was shy. Fortunately, she had a fever, otherwise she wouldn't have known how to explain and cover up why her face was so red.","\"How can you still come to work here when you're sick? I'll find another auntie to help you take care of the child too,\" Xu Xiuhe said while driving.","But Shen Yin just shook her head again. She wouldn’t feel at ease about anyone else taking care of Zhengzheng. During this time with Zhengzheng, Shen Yin felt her feelings towards him had deepened even more. After all, Zhengzheng was her own child that she gave birth to.","\"I may have caught a chill while sleeping last night. My head felt a little dizzy this morning, and I thought it was because I didn't sleep well last night. I didn't expect to feel even dizzier this afternoon, even with some pain, before realizing that I might be sick with a fever.\"","Xu Xiuhe stretched out his right hand and touched Shen Yin’s forehead, \"It’s so hot!\"","But Shen Yin’s point of attention wasn’t on how hot it was. She felt Xu Xiuhe's hand was very cool, feeling very comfortable on her forehead. Xu Xiuhe’s fingers were long and well-proportioned, his skin was fair to begin with, and the blood vessels on his hands were clearly visible. Shen Yin could even smell the masculine cologne scent on Xu Xiuhe’s arm."]},{"number":37,"title":"Chapter 37: Coaxing the Child","paragraphs":["Shen Yin's hand was attracted by Xu Xiuhe's hand, and her hand involuntarily touched Xu Xiuhe's hand.","Xu Xiuhe retracted his hand and focused on driving, saying, \"Rest if you're tired. I'll wake you up when we get to the hospital.\"","Shen Yin nodded. When she woke up again, she found herself lying in a hospital bed, with Xu Xiuhe peeling an apple next to her, but there was no Zhengzheng around.","The first sentence Shen Yin uttered upon waking up was, \"Where is Zhengzheng?\"","However, Xu Xiuhe did not answer this question, but said, “Do you still feel uncomfortable? With your high fever, how could you not know you were sick. Your temperature reached 39 degrees.\"","Shen Yin knew she was in the wrong, pursed her lips and asked again, \"Where is Zhengzheng?\"","When Shen Yin fell asleep in the car, Xu Xiuhe had messaged Chang Zhiyuan to come to the hospital to pick up Zhengzheng.","\"Chang Zhiyuan took him home. You just started your IV drip, which will probably take three hours to finish.\"","Xu Xiuhe booked a VIP ward that had everything. It was just Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe in the quiet hospital room. Knowing that Zhengzheng had gone home, Shen Yin felt at ease as she continued with her IV drip and fell asleep again.","Things were not quiet at Chang Zhiyuan's villa in Ziyueting. Earlier when he had watched Zhengzheng, Xu Xiuhe was also there. Now alone with a small child, the unmarried Chang Zhiyuan was distraught.","\"I want Mommy,\" Zhengzheng said innocently, looking pleadingly at Chang Zhiyuan.","In recent days, Zhengzheng had become very attached to Shen Yin. Clearly she had accompanied him to eat lunch this afternoon, but now she was not coming back.","“Zhengzheng, Mommy is sick and needs to see the doctor. Can you play with Godfather?” Chang Zhiyuan patiently coaxed.","Seeing it was getting late, Zhengzheng started crying. Chang Zhiyuan was in a frenzy, he had tried everything — giving Zhengzheng water, reading to him, playing blocks, even telling him stories. But Zhengzheng showed no signs of stopping.","\"Waa waa, I want Mommy.\"","Distraught, Chang Zhiyuan picked up the phone. “Brother, I can’t console Zhengzheng. He keeps crying.\"","When Xu Xiuhe saw Chang Zhiyuan's incoming call, he exited the hospital room and took the call. Then he heard Chang Zhiyuan's wailing voice.","“He probably misses her since it’s nighttime and he doesn’t know you well. Stay with him for two more hours. She'll come back after the IV drip.”","Two more hours? Chang Zhiyuan wanted to say more but Xu Xiuhe had already hung up. Doesn’t know his own Godfather well?","He couldn’t suffer this ordeal alone so he called Shu Yi.","A few seconds later, the call connected. “Mr. Chang, hello, what can I do for you?”","This rubbed Chang Zhiyuan the wrong way. Can he not call her if he doesn’t need something? But there were more pressing matters, so Chang Zhiyuan didn’t pick a fight. He simply said, \"Shen Yin is sick and currently getting an IV drip at the hospital. I’m at Xu Xiuhe’s house watching Zhengzheng by myself, he keeps crying. Can you come over and help console him?”","Getting straight to the point with a matter-of-fact tone wasn’t like him at all. Shu Yi was annoyed, but at that moment other thoughts flooded her mind — Was Shen Yin seriously ill? What will happen to Zhengzheng by himself at home? Before Shu Yi could think further...","She picked up her phone, put on a jacket. Fortunately when she first came, in order to easily visit Shen Yin, she had bought a small electric scooter. Shu Yi hopped on and arrived at Xu Xiuhe’s villa gate in five minutes.","As soon as she entered the living room, she saw an adult and a child on the sofa. One crying, the other also looking unwell.","“You’re finally here. Xu Xiuhe said he cries because he doesn’t know me well.”","Shu Yi rushed over to hold Zhengzheng. “Zhengzheng darling, don’t cry. Godmother will take you to find Mommy, okay?\"","After Shu Yi spoke, Zhengzheng actually stopped crying, but tears were still flowing down his cheeks.","“Get some tissue.” Shu Yi put out her hand toward Chang Zhiyuan standing next to her. Chang Zhiyuan hurriedly grabbed the baby wet wipes from the table and handed them to Shu Yi.","Shu Yi took the wipes and lovingly wiped Zhengzheng’s tear-stained face, consoling him, “Good boy, Zhengzheng. Don’t cry or Mommy will cry too.”","Seeing Zhengzheng’s crying had ceased, Chang Zhiyuan finally breathed a sigh of relief. “What should we do next?” he asked.","Looking at Zhengzheng, Shu Yi replied, “Let’s first feed Zhengzheng, then if his mom still isn’t back, I’ll bring him to find her. How’s that?”","Exhausted from crying, Zhengzheng was also hungry. Hearing about eating, he nodded slightly.","Looking at Shu Yi, Chang Zhiyuan asked, “Where’s the food?”","If Shu Yi remembered correctly, Shen Yin often prepared dumplings and wontons in the freezer for easy access when needed.","“Look in the freezer below the fridge.”","Chang Zhiyuan was puzzled. Could there be edible food in the fridge? He walked to the open kitchen and opened the freezer below. “There’s some shrimp here, should I cook?” Chang Zhiyuan was incredulous.","In all his years, seldom had he set foot in a kitchen, let alone cook.","“On the bottom shelf, see if there are any wontons.” Still holding Zhengzheng, Shu Yi headed over.","Chang Zhiyuan looked and surprisingly discovered that the bottommost rack in the freezer was full of wontons. “There really are some, but how do I cook them?”","Shu Yi was speechless. She should have expected that this pampered young master, always served hand and foot, would not even be able to boil wontons, the most basic cooking task.","“Fill the pot with some water and boil.” Shu Yi instructed, wishing she could make them herself if not for holding Zhengzheng.","After a few minutes, the water started boiling. Shu Yi continued advising, “Put in the wontons.”","“How many should I add?”","Looking at the amount, there should be enough for the three of them if all were cooked, Shu Yi said, “Put them all in, leave the dumplings for them.”","Chang Zhiyuan followed her directions. Seeing Chang Zhiyuan busying about in the kitchen, Zhengzheng actually stopped crying.","After a minute, the wontons started floating up. Shu Yi told Chang Zhiyuan to add some cool water, then after a few seconds to turn off the fire.","The wonton aroma had already permeated the air. Feeling hungry himself, Chang Zhiyuan asked “Can I eat now?”","“You have to dish them out first before you can eat them!” Though inexperienced at cooking, Shu Yi knew how to boil noodles and congee.","Chang Zhiyuan scooped the wontons onto three plates. Shu Yi wiped Zhengzheng’s little hands with a wet wipe before seating him in a high chair. After blowing on the wontons to cool them down, she began feeding Zhengzheng. Zhengzheng was indeed starving, the small wontons disappearing in two bites. Seeing Zhengzheng eating with relish, the shameless Chang Zhiyuan asked “Can I eat now?”","Shu Yi wanted to laugh. Did he need her permission? He was her boss after all, she certainly couldn’t let him starve.","Finally filled up, Zhengzheng's first words were “Find Mommy.”","Seeing this, Shu Yi prepared to carry Zhengzheng up. Chang Zhiyuan checked his phone, “They'll be back in an hour. Have your meal first, I’ll hold him.”","Worried about Shen Yin, Shu Yi had no appetite. She asked, “What happened to Shen Yin, is it serious?”","“Xu Xiuhe said she had a fever, getting an IV drip at the hospital. They’ll be back soon.”","Only then was Shu Yi relieved. She ate some wontons and saw Chang Zhiyuan awkwardly holding Zhengzheng, seemingly trying to find Shen Yin. Entering the kitchen, she tidied up the cooking utensils.","“Zhengzheng, we have to find Mommy. Should we dress nicely?” Chang Zhiyuan asked.","Zhengzheng nodded. Chang Zhiyuan continued placating, “Then let’s first wash our hands, use the bathroom, and change shoes, okay?”","Zhengzheng was reluctant and had a twisted expression on his face, but eventually agreed. Chang Zhiyuan dragged his feet through every next step - when washing Zhengzheng's hands, he cleaned each finger slowly, repeating the process two or three times. He also washed Zhengzheng's face in the same unhurried manner.","\"Does Zhengzheng need to use the bathroom?\" Without waiting for a reply, Chang Zhiyuan picked up Zhengzheng and brought him inside, directly taking off his pants."]},{"number":38,"title":"Chapter 38: What to Do If You Like it","paragraphs":["Chang Zhiyuan even deliberately dragged it out when helping Zhengzheng take off his pants, buying as much time as possible, thinking maybe Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin would come back soon.","\"Want to find Mom,\" Zhengzheng seemed to realize that stepdad Chang Zhiyuan was deliberately dragging things out and looked at him sadly with a bitter face. Chang Zhiyuan's conscience kicked in and he took out his phone to call Xu Xiuhe.","\"Hello, Xiuhe, when are you coming back? I can't stand my stepson's pitiful gaze anymore.\"","\"On our way,\" Xu Xiuhe replied. \"Is Zhengzheng there?\" Chang Zhiyuan handed the phone to Zhengzheng.","\"Zhengzheng, be good. Mom and Dad will be home soon. Can you wait a little longer for Mom and Dad?\" Hearing Xu Xiuhe's voice, Zhengzheng quieted down and said, \"Okay, Dad, come quickly.\"","Shen Yin, sitting in the passenger seat, heard this through the phone and smiled slightly. It hadn't been that long since they last saw each other, but she was already missing Zhengzheng.","Xu Xiuhe drove very steadily. Soon they arrived at Ziyue Courtyard. Xu Xiuhe parked the car neatly in the basement garage, pushed open the driver's side door with his left hand, while Shen Yin also tried to open her door only to hear Xu Xiuhe say directly, \"Don't move.\"","After getting out of the car, Xu Xiuhe walked around to the passenger side, opened the door, bent down, reached in, and lifted Shen Yin out princess style.","Shen Yin's eyes widened in surprise again. What the hell? Her fever was already gone thanks to the IV drip. Medical standards were so much more advanced in this era. The medicine worked fast. She could totally walk by herself now.","Xu Xiuhe carried Shen Yin very naturally. There was a slope leading up from the underground garage. He held her as if walking on flat ground, not even short of breath.","Why was this man so strong? She wasn't heavy at 168cm and 98 jin.","When Xu Xiuhe carried Shen Yin to the door, he shifted her to hold her like he held Zhengzheng, extending one hand to touch the fingerprint lock, the door opened.","In the living room, Xu Yunzheng sat obediently on the carpet. Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan looked at each other, not understanding how such a young child knew so much and kept asking if Mom was okay. After getting confirmation, he just sat there silently, without any other movement, blinking his eyes.","Probably hearing Xu Xiuhe open the door, Zhengzheng crawled up and ran to the entrance.","\"Mom!\" Zhengzheng called out.","Still held in Xu Xiuhe's arms, Shen Yin saw Zhengzheng come over and immediately struggled free and staggered. Xu Xiuhe reached out to steady her. Zhengzheng hurried over and hugged her legs.","Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan also came out from the living room. This was unexpected for Shen Yin, who only knew Chang Zhiyuan was watching Zhengzheng.","Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan had actually been sitting in the living room earlier and saw Xu Xiuhe carrying Shen Yin when he came in. Shu Yi felt it was normal for a husband to carry his sick wife. But Chang Zhiyuan knew about Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe's past!","At that moment, Chang Zhiyuan felt abandoned. Shu Yi went into the kitchen, cooked up the remaining dumplings and brought them to the table, calling for Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin to eat. The millet porridge was also done after she finished washing the bowls and chopsticks, and she figured the sick person should eat millet porridge.","\"Really thanks for your trouble,\" Shen Yin thanked Shu Yi.","Zhengzheng actually wanted Shen Yin to hold him but Shen Yin could tell and was afraid of passing the illness to the child. Children had weaker immune systems. If he caught it, the child would suffer and she didn't want that.","\"Zhengzheng, Mom is tired. Let Dad hold you, okay?\"","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe actually thought Shen Yin was tired, so he carried up Zhengzheng and sat down at the table.","That night, Shu Yi left first while Chang Zhiyuan stayed. After eating some millet porridge, Shen Yin went upstairs, quite sleepy. She simply washed up and fell asleep.","Xu Xiuhe still had some work to take care of and took Zhengzheng to the study, explaining to him that Mom was sleeping and to let her rest while Zhengzheng sat quietly on the sofa looking through picture books.","When Chang Zhiyuan came up he directly asked, \"Do you have feelings for Shen Yin?\" Although his words were phrased as a question, his tone carried certainty.","Chang Zhiyuan grew up with Xu Xiuhe since childhood and knew him too well. Popular with girls since young, Xu Xiuhe never paid those girls any attention, always rejecting them decisively. Chang Zhiyuan didn't know how Qi Yan managed to catch his attention after so much effort.","And Chang Zhiyuan clearly remembered that when Xu Xiuhe was with Qi Yan, other than trying to keep her once at the end, he never took initiative. In over a year together, the most intimate thing they did was hold hands.","Yet now, he actually saw Xu Xiuhe carrying Shen Yin so intimately. To say Xu Xiuhe had no feelings for Shen Yin seemed unlikely.","Xu Xiuhe looked up. He had been considering Chang Zhiyuan's question these past few days.","At first he only felt they were an arranged marriage. Later he grew annoyed and even wanted a divorce. And now, he would think of Shen Yin from time to time, unconsciously worrying over and caring for her. Just knowing she was sick, he wished he could fly directly to her side.","After Shen Yin recovered, she seemed to exude an indescribable temperament that made one subconsciously want to get to know her better. It was an aloof yet cold feeling. But when facing Zhengzheng, that feeling became warm. In the kitchen she was gentle and feminine, excellent cooking skills. Coming home at night and seeing her gave a sense of family.","He was probably attracted to and had fallen for Shen Yin after all.","\"What if I do have feelings for Shen Yin? What should I do?\"","This question left Chang Zhiyuan speechless. What did he mean what should he do if he had feelings for her? How would he know? It was Xu Xiuhe's own business, plus the woman he had feelings for was already his wife and they had a child together. Meanwhile, the woman he liked, Shu Yi, actively avoided him whenever they met, leaving him more and more upset the more he thought about it.","\"Why ask me? How would I know? The one I like hasn't even accepted me yet. Yours has given birth to your child and you're still not satisfied? Brother, seize the opportunity in front of you!\" Chang Zhiyuan patted Xu Xiuhe's shoulder.","\"Alright, I should get going. You rest early too.\" Chang Zhiyuan headed for the door.","Reaching the door, he turned back again. \"Zhengzheng, say bye to stepdad.\"","Zhengzheng put down his picture book, lifted his head, waved his little hand, and said in a milk voice, \"Bye bye.\"","Satisfied, Chang Zhiyuan left for real this time.","\"Zhengzheng, Dad will give you a bath then you can sleep with me tonight, okay?\"","\"What about Mom?\"","\"Mom needs to rest. Let's not disturb her. When she's rested up, we'll look for her, okay?\"","Xu Yunzheng nodded."]},{"number":39,"title":"Chapter 39: Wet Market","paragraphs":["That night, Xu Yunzheng slept in his own bed, and even taking a bath was given by Xu Xiuhe.","When Shen Yin woke up, it was 6 o'clock in the morning. Because she had gone to bed earlier than usual last night, she woke up especially early today.","Shen Yin turned her head and looked at the bed before reacting that since she was sick, Xu Yunzheng should not be sleeping in her bed. Today was the opening day of the studio, she had to get ready, after washing up, she picked a white suit, Shen Yin lightly applied some makeup, after applying lipstick, her whole temperament was different, her aura was extremely powerful.","When Shen Yin went out, she looked at Xu Xiuhe's room, the door was still closed, so she went downstairs to prepare breakfast. Just as she reached the first floor, she saw Xu Xiuhe wearing an apron, busy in the kitchen.","Xu Xiuhe was wearing a white shirt, black suit pants, tied with a pink apron, the outfit was extremely weird, making him look even more out of place in the kitchen, but these could not affect Shen Yin from appreciating Xu Xiuhe.","Very few men of high status, except those who cook for a living, would go into the kitchen, but the man in front of her had neither low status nor position, yet he was making breakfast in the kitchen.","Perhaps feeling Shen Yin's burning gaze, Xu Xiuhe turned his head and saw Shen Yin standing on the stairs.","\"You're up? Do you feel better?\" Xu Xiuhe stopped what he was doing and asked.","Looking at Shen Yin's outfit, he wondered if she was still going to work.","\"You're sick, why do you still have to go out?\" There was some imperceptible blame in Xu Xiuhe's tone.","\"Today is the opening day of the studio, I have to be there because some employees are going to report to the studio,\" Shen Yin explained.","\"Okay, go upstairs and see if Xu Yunzheng is awake first, breakfast will be ready soon.\"","Hearing this, Shen Yin turned and climbed the stairs to the second floor.","With one hand, Xu Xiuhe turned off the fire, and with the other, he took out his cell phone and dialed a number.","\"Liu Bo, I won't be going to the company this morning. If there are any documents, please handle them.\" After saying that, Xu Xiuhe immediately hung up, leaving Liu Bo alone in shock.","At 7:10, Shen Yin came downstairs again holding Xu Yunzheng. On the dining table, Xu Xiuhe had already served the food. Before Shen Yin approached, she could smell the aroma of the food.","Last night, Shen Yin only drank some rice porridge, and now she was already hungry. On the table were three bowls of shredded pork noodles which looked very appetizing. After putting Xu Yunzheng on the chair, Shen Yin sat down too.","Although Xu Yunzheng was small, he could use chopsticks. Xu Xiuhe sat opposite them, watching their similar way of eating noodles, feeling extremely satisfied in his heart.","Xu Xiuhe knew how to cook. After finishing high school, he worked part-time jobs, rented a small house, and cooked for himself to save money. Cooking noodles was the most convenient. So Xu Xiuhe was very good at cooking noodles. Although not as tasty as Shen Yin’s, she could guarantee that Xu Xiuhe’s noodle cooking skills had surpassed many, many people.","After the meal, Xu Xiuhe asked, \"Is everything packed and ready? Did you bring the bag?\"","\"Hmm? All set.\" Shen Yin did not understand.","\"Then let's go, I'll take you there.\" Xu Xiuhe put on his suit and carried Xu Yunzheng to the porch.","Shen Yin followed behind. Today was her first day as a boss, she had to face the employees and look a little sterner, so she chose a dark red lipstick and a pair of sharp white stiletto heels when putting on shoes in the porch.","Seeing Shen Yin's outfit and makeup this morning, Xu Xiuhe had guessed what she was up to, so he was not surprised at all that Shen Yin chose such high heels.","Xu Xiuhe held Xu Yunzheng all the way until he put Xu Yunzheng in the car.","\"Actually, you didn't have to send me, it's not on your way.\" Shen Yin said in the car.","\"The car didn't drive back yesterday. Also with your high fever yesterday, driving would be too dangerous.\"","Xu Xiuhe parked the car behind the small building on Qinghe Street. Shen Yin took Xu Yunzheng out of the safety seat and into her arms. Just as she stepped out of the car door, Xu Xiuhe walked over.","\"Let me hold him.\" Xu Xiuhe took over Xu Yunzheng and waited for Shen Yin to get out before closing the car door and heading towards the front door of the small building.","It was still early, none of the employees had arrived yet. Holding Xu Yunzheng, Xu Xiuhe entered the building after Shen Yin. She reached out her hand, \"You should go back to work, I can hold him.\"","\"I'm not working today.\"","Shen Yin was confused. What did he mean? Was Xu Xiuhe going to stay in this small building all day? Today was supposed to be her studio opening day. It was just a fever yesterday, there was no need for this. But she couldn't bring herself to kick them out either.","At the Andao Group, Liu Bo was very distressed. His workload today had increased a lot. The group chat was also gradually getting messages asking why the president hadn't come in today.","At this moment, Xu Xiuhe was wandering around a small vegetable market near Qinghe Street with Xu Yunzheng while Shen Yin was busy assigning tasks to the employees. He and Xu Yunzheng didn't want to disturb her, and there were not many vegetables left in the fridge either, so he figured he'd take Xu Yunzheng out for a bit.","There were vendors selling all kinds of food items in the small Qinghe Street market. Xu Xiuhe walking among the crowds with a little toddler in his arms was very conspicuous. Xu Xiuhe was over six feet tall carrying this little one, very much looking like a daddy with his kid.","However, their outfit was not really suitable for appearing here. The market had people every morning and the vegetables were freshly grown by the farmers themselves, both affordable and fresh.","Most of the people who came here to buy vegetables were local residents, as well as those who lived on Qinghe Street.","Xu Xiuhe was well aware that the stuff here was affordable and cheap. He had gone to similar markets when he was in college too, so he didn't find the place noisy or chaotic at all, but rather, full of down-to-earth vibes.","\"Oh it's you.\"","Hearing the voice, Xu Xiuhe turned his head. It was the silver-haired granny from yesterday.","\"Granny, granny.\" Xu Yunzheng called out.","\"Hello Granny, Shen Yin is busy, so I came to buy some vegetables.\" Xu Xiuhe greeted politely.","\"Good, good, good.\" Su Jin said good a few times. She had recognized yesterday that the man in front of her was the president of the Andao Group who often appeared on TV.","\"Not at work today?\" Su Jin asked.","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe told the truth: \"Shen Yin was sick yesterday but she insisted on coming over, so I came along.\"","Xu Xiuhe had been navigating the business world for years and was good at reading people. The old lady in front of him was definitely no ordinary person.","\"Young man, Shen Yin is a good girl in my eyes. Marrying her is your blessing, you must cherish her well.\" Su Jin spoke as one who had life experience.","\"Yes Granny, I will cherish her well.\"","After that, it was an old, a tall man and a toddler walking in this vegetable market. Seeing Su Jin greeting some vendors, Xu Xiuhe figured she must have been living here for years."]},{"number":40,"title":"Chapter 40: Dreams of Foreknowledge","paragraphs":["Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin had already bought groceries, so naturally Shen Yin would not be cooking lunch. Xu Xiuhe felt that Shen Yin was a patient and had to focus on work.","Xu Xiuhe was busy in Shen Yin's kitchen for most of the morning before finally preparing several dishes.","Shen Yin knew that Xu Xiuhe had gone to buy groceries. When she went upstairs to the third floor to prepare lunch, she saw that Xu Xiuhe was already in the kitchen and there were several dishes arranged on the table.","This was unexpected for Shen Yin. She didn't think that Xu Xiuhe would prepare so many dishes: tomato and egg stir fry, bell pepper pork shreds, stir fried vegetables, and a dish of sauerkraut beef.","She didn't expect that a man who could cook would be so charming. \"I was planning to come up and cook, but you've done it already.\"","\"My cooking definitely isn't as good as yours. Just bear with it for now and take a rest after eating,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"Actually, I'm not that busy in the afternoon. I've assigned tasks to the employees. Let them get familiar with things today and formally start work tomorrow.\"","Shen Yin had decided to raise her studio's level when recruiting employees. She already had plans to hire a fabric assistant, a public relations person, and two professional clothing makers.","The weather in early May could change suddenly. Even though it was sunny when they ate lunch, the wind started blowing after and the skies darkened.","\"You should go rest first. I'll keep an eye on the studio downstairs.\"","Shen Yin agreed. She really couldn't be too tired now. Once her health improved, during her free time from work, she wanted to start martial arts training with Xu Yunzheng. Her uncle would definitely be angry if he knew she hadn't been practicing her martial arts skills.","But she was already dead in Dashang. Her uncle's family must be so sad thinking about her. As Shen Yin thought about this, she fell asleep.","When she woke up again, the skies were even darker. Shen Yin checked the time - 5:05 PM. That meant she had slept for nearly four hours straight.","She had a long dream during those four hours, dreaming about her uncle's family and about the present. In the dream, it was raining heavily outside, just like now. She woke up frightened. In the dream, she also saw Xu Xiuhe driving her and Xu Yunzheng back to Ziyue Manor. Because the rain was so heavy and visibility was poor, a speeding truck approached them. Xu Xiuhe didn't have time to get out of the way and they got into a car accident.","Shen Yin was extremely scared. She shouted \"No!\" before waking up. The dream had felt so real that she broke out into a cold sweat and took a long time to calm down.","Xu Xiuhe opened the bedroom door while carrying Xu Yunzheng and asked, \"What's wrong?\"","\"I had a nightmare,\" Shen Yin replied.","Shen Yin put on her slippers and tidied herself up a bit before opening the curtains. The skies outside were dark, just like in her dream, and it was raining, though not as heavily as in her dream.","\"Where are the others?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"They were mostly done with things in the afternoon and it started raining, so I let them go back first,\" Xu Xiuhe explained.","\"I see.\"","\"Are you fully awake now? If so, let's head back to Ziyue Manor,\" Xu Xiuhe suggested.","\"Alright, let me grab my bag.\"","On the third floor entrance, the three of them changed shoes. Xu Xiuhe locked the front door of the small building from the inside. Then, he and Shen Yin left through the back door. Under the carport, there were two cars: Xu Xiuhe's and Shen Yin's.","\"I'll drive. Get in my car,\" Xu Xiuhe said as he opened the Bentley door. As Shen Yin got in the car, she seemed to feel that the rain outside the carport was getting heavier.","Their current positions were just like in her dream. Shen Yin became afraid. Would what happened in her dream come true? Why did she have such a dream? Was it just a coincidence or was it a message from heaven?","She hesitated, not daring to take the risk. After all, she had already experienced something even more outlandish like transmigration. What else would she not believe?","Just as Xu Xiuhe started driving the car out of the carport, Shen Yin quickly said, \"The rain is too heavy. Driving at night is unsafe. Why don't we just stay overnight at the villa tonight?\"","Xu Xiuhe hit the brakes and asked, \"Are you too tired to travel back?\"","\"Yes,\" Shen Yin replied.","\"Yunzheng, are you going back with Daddy or staying here with Mommy?\" Xu Xiuhe turned around to ask Xu Yunzheng.","Xu Yunzheng hadn't spent much time with Shen Yin for a whole day and night. He was afraid that Shen Yin wouldn't accompany him anymore or dislike him again like before.","\"Yunzheng is good. Yunzheng wants to accompany Mommy. But Yunzheng also wants Daddy.\"","Shen Yin spoke solemnly, \"Xiuhe, you have to stay here tonight too.\"","This was not a gentle suggestion like \"You're staying here tonight too, right?\" Rather, it was a firm \"You have to stay here tonight too\" that brooked no argument.","Xu Xiuhe looked into Shen Yin's eyes, not understanding why she was speaking so forcefully and not letting him go back. But he agreed.","Back on the third floor, Shen Yin felt that the small house was very warm and comforting. Outside, the rain was pouring down noisily while the wind howled. On the third floor of the small villa, there was the warm yellow light, the cozy sofa, and the babbling sound of the child's voice.","The TV was broadcasting Rongcheng's news. In the kitchen, Shen Yin busied herself making dinner while Xu Xiuhe accompanied Yunzheng in building block towers on the carpeted floor. At this moment, Xu Xiuhe felt truly happy.","\"Dear viewers, we're interrupting the program to bring you breaking news. At 7:38 PM tonight, a car accident occurred on Qingquan Avenue resulting in 1 death and 2 serious injuries...\"","The TV screen switched to show footage of the accident scene while the anchor continued explaining the cause.","\"The cause of the accident has been identified. Due to the heavy rain reducing visibility, the truck driver entered the wrong lane which led to a collision between the two vehicles. Relevant authorities are already investigating. We'd like to remind residents again that in adverse weather, go out less. If you must go out, please obey traffic rules, reduce your speed, and drive cautiously.\"","The footage of the accident scene on Qingquan Avenue was still being shown. Qingquan Avenue was on the necessary route from Qinghe Villa back to Ziyue Manor.","Looking at the location, Xu Xiuhe calculated that if driving at normal speed, he would have been right around the accident scene after 7:30 PM.","From the moment she heard about the car accident, Shen Yin had pricked up her ears. She walked to the kitchen entrance and watched the news being broadcast on TV, feeling both shocked and terrified. She didn't expect her dream to come true, just that the people involved had changed.","She didn't understand why she would have such a dream that predicted the future. At this moment, she felt extremely lucky that her dream had warned her and they avoided it happening to them. But she also couldn't comprehend why the accident still occurred even after they had avoided it. Was this the will of fate?","Seeing Shen Yin's reaction, Xu Xiuhe thought she was frightened and comforted her, \"Don't worry, it'll be alright.\"","At dinner, Shen Yin was lost in thought about her dream. Xu Xiuhe assumed she was still thinking about the car accident and said, \"Stop thinking about it, just focus on eating.\""]},{"number":41,"title":"Chapter 41: The Same Bed","paragraphs":["After dinner, things became awkward. With two bedrooms and one living room, there was only one bed. When Shen Yin furnished the place, she had only thought about taking a nap with Zhengzheng during lunch break. If it was inconvenient to go home at night, they could just stay over. She didn't consider this kind of situation!","One bed, one sofa. It rained today so it would be cold at night. There was no blanket on the sofa either.","The key issue was, there were no clothes here for Xu Xiuhe to change into. When Shen Yin prepared this place, she only brought pajamas and extra clothes for herself and Zhengzheng. So she and Zhengzheng had everything here, while Xu Xiuhe had nothing.","After giving Zhengzheng a bath, Shen Yin handed him over to Xu Xiuhe and went to take a shower herself.","While Shen Yin was showering, she saw a large pajama in the bathroom that she had gotten as a gift when buying pajamas for herself. If not for seeing it now, she would've forgotten about it completely.","So Xu Xiuhe should be able to wear it. He probably wouldn't mind, right?","The rain outside had lightened to a soft pitter-patter that allowed Shen Yin to clearly hear the flowing water from the creek along Qinghe Street. After blow-drying her hair, Shen Yin took the oversized robe out with her.","Xu Xiuhe was playing with Zhengzheng in the living room. He rarely had this much free time, let alone an entire day with Zhengzheng.","\"Here, this was a gift when I bought myself pajamas. It's a little big but you should be able to fit into it.\" Shen Yin handed the white pajamas to Xu Xiuhe. Afraid he would dislike it, she quickly added, \"I've washed this pajama before.\"","Xu Xiuhe accepted it and thanked her.","In the 20 minutes Xu Xiuhe spent showering, Shen Yin thought of several sleeping arrangements for the night.","Zhengzheng would definitely sleep on the bed. If she slept with Zhengzheng, where would Xu Xiuhe sleep? He couldn't possibly sleep on the sofa, could he?","No, no. Xu Xiuhe was too big, the sofa would be too cramped for him.","Finally, Shen Yin came up with the best plan - she would take the sofa while Xu Xiuhe and Zhengzheng slept in the bedroom. Now she regretted not buying an extra bed, more blankets and mattresses.","When Xu Xiuhe came out, Shen Yin picked up Zhengzheng and said, \"You and Zhengzheng take the bedroom tonight. I'll be fine on the sofa.\"","Xu Xiuhe's eyes showed disapproval. \"No, you've just recovered from an illness. The sofa would be uncomfortable to sleep on. You take the bed with Zhengzheng.\"","Shen Yin thought Xu Xiuhe was quite good - he could cook, was a great dad, and considered women's needs. What a good man.","What she didn't know was that in others' eyes, Xu Xiuhe was also fierce, domineering, strict with employees, and caustic.","Since Xu Xiuhe had considered her needs, and offered her the bed, she shouldn't blame him for being heartless.","\"Alright, don't complain if you feel uncomfortable.\" Only now did Shen Yin notice that the pajamas Xu Xiuhe wore were a bit tight, outlining his fit figure - a v-shaped torso with abs and...looking rather sexy at the waist.","Not daring to look further in case she blushed, Shen Yin's face had already reddened.","Anxious to escape Xu Xiuhe's presence, she hurried into the bedroom holding Zhengzheng.","\"Mommy, why didn't Daddy come in? Where is Daddy sleeping?\" Zhengzheng asked with wide eyes.","Shen Yin didn't know how to explain. Should she directly say Xu Xiuhe was sleeping on the sofa?","\"Find Daddy.\" Children stick close to whoever they spend the day with, and the same goes for nighttime. Despite being with Xu Xiuhe for only a short while since he arrived, Zhengzheng was asking for him again.","Left with no choice, Shen Yin opened the bedroom door, \"Your son is asking for you.\"","Xu Xiuhe had been sitting on the sofa drying his hair. Hearing this, he got up and walked into the bedroom, \"What is it, Zhengzheng?\"","\"Want to sleep with Daddy.\" Zhengzheng said, patting the bed with his little hand.","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe exchanged a look. Shen Yin said, \"Then I'll head out.\"","Before she even finished speaking, Zhengzheng was already extremely dissatisfied, shaking his head, \"No, no! Want Mommy and Daddy to sleep together.\"","Shen Yin swore those words did not come from her teachings. She glanced at Xu Xiuhe, and they communicated silently. Zhengzheng crawled out of bed and pulled one hand from each, \"Want Mommy and Daddy to sleep together.\"","Left with no choice, Shen Yin asked, \"Do you mind? If not, let's just sleep together. The bed is big enough.\"","How could the bed not be big? It was 2.2 by 2.2 meters. Shen Yin had deliberately bought a king size when purchasing it.","How could Xu Xiuhe possibly mind? Since realizing his feelings, all he thought about was how to get closer to Shen Yin.","Lying flat on the large bed, the pitter-patter of rain outside continued its soporific effect. Before long, Zhengzheng had fallen asleep.","Those preoccupied could not fall asleep even with lullabies. Like Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin now - eyes closed but minds racing.","Shen Yin did not expect to end up sleeping with an adult man, while Xu Xiuhe did not anticipate progressing this quickly. To him, after recognizing his feelings, he had to take action. Just this morning he was still wondering how to pursue Shen Yin.","Tossing and turning, Shen Yin felt a bit irritable, unsure of her current feelings.","She didn't dislike or resent Xu Xiuhe, and even felt goodwill towards him. Otherwise, how could she have agreed to let him into her home and bed?","Also, why did she blush? She clearly knew the flush yesterday in the car was not merely caused by a fever. And when she saw him in the pajamas earlier, her heart had inexplicably quickened.","The more she thought about it, the more upset she got. Could this be what liking someone feels like? Just what was this liking business anyway? She should've liked more people when she was young in Dasheng. That way, she would be more skilled in this area, and at least not be bothered to the point of insomnia.","\"Are you unable to sleep because I'm on the bed too?\" Xu Xiuhe suddenly spoke in the darkness.","\"No, I just slept too much during the day so I'm still energetic now.\" Shen Yin explained.","With divergent thoughts, who knew how long it took before they finally fell asleep.","The weather after a downpour is always exceptionally good. The first ray of morning sun shone in. Shen Yin felt something heavy on her waist, surely it was Zhengzheng asleep with his leg over her again?","As Shen Yin felt her waist, the texture didn't seem like Zhengzheng's leg. Opening her eyes, she found herself lying sideways with Xu Xiuhe's big hand draped over her waist.","Shen Yin was instantly fully awake. She realized she had squeezed Zhengzheng, who then squeezed Xu Xiuhe. Now it looked as if she and Zhengzheng were in Xu Xiuhe's embrace, almost shoving him off the bed. The other half of the bed lay completely empty."]},{"number":42,"title":"Chapter 42: Prepare the Dress","paragraphs":["This was too embarrassing, Shen Yin gently took Xu Xiuhe's hand away from her waist. As soon as she touched it, Xu Xiuhe woke up.","\"Sorry, I fell asleep and didn't know,\" Xu Xiuhe explained. He had slept extremely soundly tonight.","Shen Yin knew she was in the wrong, so she hurriedly got up and tidied up her pajamas before putting on her slippers.","\"I'll go make some food in the kitchen first,\" she said hastily before running out.","This is too embarrassing, Shen Yin thought to herself while cooking. Distracted, she had added the wrong seasonings.","At the dining table, Xu Xiuhe was thinking about a charity gala he had to attend tomorrow night. He was missing a female companion. At events like these in the past, he never brought a female companion. If he absolutely had to bring one, he would bring Qin Zhenzhen, a female assistant from his company.","Now that Shen Yin's identity had been made public as his wife, it wouldn't be unreasonable for her to accompany him.","Xu Xiuhe spoke up, \"Are you free tomorrow night?\"","\"What's going on?\"","\"A gala. I'd like to invite you to attend together.\"","Shen Yin's instinct was to refuse. \"Zhengzheng needs someone to look after him.\" Shen Yin realized using Zhengzheng as an excuse worked very well. Just as she was secretly delighted, she seemed to spot a problem.","So Shen Yin asked with ill intentions, \"What kind of gala is it?\"","Xu Xiuhe looked at Shen Yin's eyes blinking around suspiciously. He was a little worried that Shen Yin had changed her mind.","\"It's a charity gala hosted by Xue Jingui's mother,\" he explained.","Xue Jingrui's mother was in business, while his father Xue Kai was in politics. The two complemented each other well. This charity gala was initiated by Xue Jingrui's mother, Ye Rong. The money raised from the final auction would all be donated to welfare institutions, which would further raise Xue Kai's popularity and cement his position as the second highest leader in Rong City. Recently, there had been talks that the current top leader would be transferred out soon, making Xue Kai the most likely successor.","\"So there will be a lot of people attending?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Yes, from business and political circles.\"","\"I've changed my mind. Can I attend wearing clothes from my studio?\" Shen Yin looked expectant.","So that was her agenda - to take this opportunity of her first public appearance with him to promote her studio!","\"Sure, I'll head to work first then. You and Zhengzheng can head back to Ziyue Manor in the evening?\" Xu Xiuhe asked uncertainly.","Shen Yin nodded. It seemed Xu Xiuhe did not doubt her spur-of-the-moment decision to stay over last night after all. Of course, which normal person would believe prophetic dreams? If not for the news broadcasts, even she wouldn't have believed them herself. Let alone experiencing soul transmigration firsthand - that would never have crossed her mind before this.","\"What are your plans for Zhengzheng? Are you bringing him along?\" Now it was Xu Xiuhe's turn to ask.","Shen Yin had originally intended to bring Zhengzheng along, but thinking about the large expected turnout and how busy she and Xu Xiuhe would be, she decided otherwise after deliberation. \"I'll send Zhengzheng to my mother in the afternoon to look after him for the night.\"","Naturally, Xu Xiuhe had no objections.","Glancing at the time, Xu Xiuhe felt he really had to leave. After missing work all of yesterday, there were probably piles of documents waiting on his desk.","In the employee WeChat group of Wei Group, there was a flurry of discussion that the workaholic CEO still hadn't arrived this morning.","【What's going on? The CEO didn't come in at all yesterday.】","【It's time but he still hasn't arrived.】","【His wife hasn't been here to deliver lunch recently too.】","【I want candy, wah.】","【He's here, he's here!】The receptionist sent a message promptly when she saw Xu Xiuhe enter the company.","【What's his mood like?】","【Looks decent.】","【Tsk tsk, don't tell me he spent the whole day accompanying his wife yesterday!】","In her studio Qinghe Villa, Shen Yin was similarly swamped with work. With her employees in today, she had to draw out the designs for the gowns to allow her fabric assistant Chen Nuan to source for materials in the morning. She also had to get the studio's Weibo account set up.","To her few employees, it was virtually impossible to complete a gown in a day and a half.","The fabric assistant Chen Nuan had gone out to look for materials while Shen Yin worked on publicity and liaised with her two fashion designers.","\"Boss, isn't a day too rushed for making gowns? These aren't ordinary clothes.\"","\"Don't worry, I'll cut the patterns and fabrics in the afternoon. You guys just need to machine sew them tomorrow morning.\" Shen Yin assured.","Shen Yin would be very busy in the afternoon and couldn't watch Zhengzheng the whole time. With how sensible Zhengzheng was, he definitely couldn't be left alone without supervision.","Thinking about sending Zhengzheng to stay with Fang Yue for the night, Shen Yin figured she might as well have Fang Yue over this afternoon to accompany Zhengzheng. It would let her familiarize herself with him too.","Shen Yin took out her phone and scrolled through her short contact list consisting of Shu Yi, Xu Xiuhe, Ji Qingyan, Yan Yan, and Fang Yue. This was a new phone Shen Lv had given her after confiscating her old one. Out of hatred toward Shen Lv and Shen Tianzheng, she had deleted their contacts and blocked them.","Fang Yue had always treated her well - at least according to the original host's memories.","\"Hello, is this Yin Yin?\" There was a slight quiver in Fang Yue's voice. This was the first call from Shen Yin since her marriage.","\"Mom, it's me.\" Shen Yin replied.","\"Oh Yin Yin, did something happen? Did Xiuhe bully you?\" Fang Yue asked.","It was understandable she would ask that. She knew Shen Yin's stubborn temperament all too well. Since she married Xu Xiuhe, Fang Yue had been worried that Shen Yin's stubbornness would make her unpleasing to her husband and cause her grief. Her worries grew when Shen Yin developed mental health issues. She would call Xu Xiuhe periodically to understand the situation and observe his attitude toward Shen Yin.","\"No, Mom. Are you free now?\"","This was the first call from Shen Yin in so long. Even if Fang Yue was busy, she would make time.","\"Yin Yin, tell me what's going on. Have you run into some difficulty?\"","Hearing Fang Yue's words moved Shen Yin deeply. This was the first time in her life she had experienced a mother's love.","\"Mom, I'll be busy with some things in the studio at Qinghe Villa this afternoon. Could you come over to help look after Zhengzheng?\"","\"You're bringing Zhengzheng? Sure, of course, I'll head over now!\" Fang Yue was overjoyed. She looked forward to bonding more with her grandson.","\"Be careful on your way here, Mom,\" Shen Yin reminded caringly. This hard-earned familial love was now precious to her.","Hearing that brought tears to the corners of Fang Yue's eyes. Her daughter still cared about her.","After hanging up, Fang Yue called Shen Tianzheng to inform him she would be going out at noon."]},{"number":43,"title":"Chapter 43: Dress","paragraphs":["Shen Yin didn't expect that Fang Yue would come so quickly. Fang Yue drove over in her own car and parked behind the small building, the one she had bought for Shen Yin. She didn't expect to come here again.","To the left after entering was some finished clothing, including the wedding dress worth millions. To the right was a set of leather sofas. Fang Yue was attracted by those clothes, could they all have been made by Shen Yin?","\"Mom, you got here so fast.\" Shen Yin said, carrying Zhengzheng downstairs.","\"I was free at home too.\" Fang Yue held out her hand. \"Zhengzheng, can grandma hold you for a bit?\"","Zhengzheng looked at Fang Yue, blinked his eyes without reacting, then turned his head to look at Shen Yin.","\"Zhengzheng, this is grandma. Mom will be busy this afternoon, be good and stay with grandma okay?\" Shen Yin gently coaxed.","Zhengzheng nodded, \"Zhengzheng is very obedient.\"","\"Such a good boy.\" Shen Yin handed Zhengzheng over to Fang Yue.","Fang Yue was still a little cautious. \"Zhengzheng, do you still remember grandma? Grandma held you last time.\"","\"Remember grandma.\" Zhengzheng showed his little milk teeth, answering Fang Yue's questions.","\"This little mouth is so sweet, like he's eaten honey.\" Hearing him call her grandma made Fang Yue happy from the bottom of her heart.","\"Mom, I have to finish a dress today. Xiuhe and I are attending a charity gala tomorrow night, so I'll probably have to bring Zhengzheng over to your place again tomorrow night.\" Shen Yin explained.","What, she was bringing Zhengzheng over again tomorrow night? This was unexpected for Fang Yue. She thought just getting to hold him and see him today would be enough to satisfy her, she didn't expect to hear Zhengzheng call her grandma himself and that he'd come over again tomorrow. Happiness seemed to have come too suddenly.","\"Okay, okay, just come find me if you're busy.\" Fang Yue was a little excited.","After cutting the panels in the afternoon and sewing the next morning, a dress was finally completed.","The four employees simply couldn't believe that such a beautiful young woman had such mature design concepts, leading them to create such an outstanding piece.","The dress incorporated elements of the qipao, with a stand collar but no sleeves. Shen Yin adapted to the aesthetics of this era very quickly, so she was also able to grasp the essence of dressmaking so quickly. The sleeveless design made the whole dress look more distinctive.","\"Good job everyone, you worked hard. It's three thirty now. You can get off work early today.\" Shen Yin was very satisfied with these four employees.","Chen Nuan and the others didn't expect to get off work so early. As the four of them walked to the garage out back, they were still chatting about it.","\"I still can't believe I found such a good job!\" Chen Nuan said.","\"I know, the high salary is one thing, but the boss also provides housing and afternoon tea and fruit. \"","The girl in charge of publicity, Li Huanhuan, chimed in: \"The house the boss rented for us isn't far from here either, it takes less than ten minutes by bike. The housing prices there aren't cheap!\"","When Shen Yin was hiring, she had written that housing was provided. However, that house wasn't rented by her - she had bought it outright for 3 million.","\"Look at that car, it must have cost at least 5 million right?\" Chen Nuan said, pointing to Shen Yin's car in the garage.","The dressmaker Xu Ruping said, \"What if there's a possibility our boss is a rich widow, or a madam from a wealthy family, and she's out experiencing life?\"","\"You might be right. The day before yesterday, wasn't the boss's husband here giving us tasks? His aura was so powerful I didn't even dare look to see what he looked like.\"","\"He seemed quite handsome, I didn't dare look either, girl!\" Li Huanhuan felt like she had found a confidant.","Shen Yin put on some makeup in front of her dressing table mirror, changed into the dress, did her hair up and pinned it in place. When she was unmarried in Dashang she would put all her hair up and pin it with hairpins, but she still left some hair down around her temples and nape. So she had high standards for hairpins.","The quality of the one in her hair now was not as good as the ones she had in Dashang. One of these days she would have to go get a custom hairpin made.","\"Zhengzheng, let's go to grandma's okay?\" Shen Yin picked up Zhengzheng.","After spending half the previous afternoon with Fang Yue, Zhengzheng was no longer unfamiliar with grandma and knew she was very nice to him, so he happily nodded.","Fang Yue had been waiting eagerly at the door for Shen Yin to arrive. She hadn't stopped bragging to Shen Tianzheng last night after getting home - bragging that Zhengzheng called her grandma, bragging that she had played with him all afternoon.","Upon hearing this, Shen Tianzheng felt itchy on the inside. Knowing Shen Yin was bringing Zhengzheng over today, he got off work early in the afternoon to wait at home.","\"Zhengzheng, let grandma hold you.\"","After Shen Yin got out of the car, she followed Fang Yue into the Shen family villa. The Shen family villa was located in the Lanyuan Villa Area in the eastern part of Rong City, similar to Ziyue Manor with one house per yard.","The yard was full of all kinds of flowers and plants. Fang Yue seemed to be someone who loved life. The past two or three years while the original owner was sick must have been quite painful for her. Unknowingly, Shen Yin actually empathized.","Upon entering the house, Shen Yin saw Shen Tianzheng waiting expectantly. She almost wanted to laugh, but held it in.","\"Dad.\" Shen Yin called out.","Hearing her call him dad made Shen Tianzheng feel privileged. Although the misunderstanding between them was resolved, there was still estrangement that could only disappear slowly over time.","Shen Tianzheng consciously realized that his presence here would affect their mother-daughter conversation, so he took Zhengzheng out to the yard to play. Zhengzheng's laughter mixed with Shen Tianzheng's, and at that moment, Shen Yin felt the warmth of family for the first time in her two lifetimes.","Fang Yue chatted with Shen Yin about all kinds of family matters, from the changes happening around the house, to Shen Lv still not finding a wife. Seeing that Shen Yin didn't show any impatience at all, Fang Yue was even more satisfied. Her mouth didn't stop the whole time.","As the sun set over the mountains, early summer evenings were prime time. Fang Yue realized she may have talked too much, so she took Shen Yin for a walk around the yard. Zhengzheng sat on a swing in the yard while Shen Tianzheng rocked him back and forth behind him. In that moment, it was like Shen Yin could feel the warmth of family in her two lifetimes.","\"Shen Yin, mom and dad.\" Xu Xiuhe walked into the yard and saw this harmonious scene.","\"Xiuhe you're here!\" Fang Yue said. There's a saying that the more a mother-in-law looks at her son-in-law, the more satisfied she is. With how Shen Yin had been the past few years, Xiuhe still hadn't divorced her - what more could she be dissatisfied about?","\"It's time, I have to go now. I'll be back later to get Zhengzheng.\" Shen Yin said.","Still, Shen Yin couldn't resist going over to Zhengzheng: \"Zhengzheng, mommy is going out with daddy for a bit. Be good and listen to grandma and grandpa okay? No crying allowed, little men can't cry. Grandma and grandpa love you very much, so don't be scared. I'll come get you later alright?\"","\"Okay.\" Zhengzheng nodded. He would rather make himself unhappy than let mommy be sad.","\"Say bye bye to mommy and daddy.\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Zhengzheng waved his little hand. \"Bye bye!\" he said in his sweet little voice."]},{"number":44,"title":"Chapter 44: Charity Evening","paragraphs":["Shen Yin took off her flat shoes and put on a pair of high heels before getting into Xu Xiuhe's Bentley.","At the entrance of Qingfeng Mingyue, there were numerous luxury cars parked, and Shen Yin immediately noticed the abundance of cars and people, especially the media personnel.","It was expected that the organizers would invite many reporters to publicize the good deeds. As Shen Yin opened the passenger door and stepped out, the sound of camera shutters clicking filled the air. Facing so many lenses for the first time, it was impossible not to feel nervous or scared.","However, Xu Xiuhe went to park the car, and now Shen Yin felt embarrassed to enter the venue alone. She couldn't allow herself to be photographed looking unflattering. Absolutely not. She couldn't show any signs of weakness. Yes, she had to carry herself with poise and confidence.","As Shen Yin gave herself some pep talk, she adjusted her posture and expression. As the legitimate daughter of the Duke's Mansion, she had learned all these things.","When Xu Xiuhe emerged from the underground garage, he saw Shen Yin standing elegantly in place. The journalists only realized that they had just taken numerous photos of this woman when Xu Xiuhe walked up to her. It turned out she was the wife of the CEO of Yuan Group.","This trip was not in vain. If she remembered correctly, this was the first appearance of their couple after the previous trending official announcement. And the way they presented themselves was indeed grand.","\"Hold onto my arm,\" Xu Xiuhe raised his arm and adjusted his posture.","Shen Yin hesitated. Did the occasion require the woman to hold onto the man's arm? She glanced at some couples preparing to enter, and it seemed that it was indeed the case. The woman held onto the man's arm. Well then.","After a few seconds of hesitation, Shen Yin complied. She wasn't naive. In this kind of occasion, if she didn't hold on, it would give people something to talk about. For example, \"The CEO of Yuan Group and his wife made their first appearance at the charity gala, seemingly not getting along.\"","Xu Xiuhe wore a black suit that matched perfectly with Shen Yin's black evening gown. The two walked in sync, making their way into the venue.","\"Mr. CEO, your wife is on the third floor,\" the receptionist recognized their presence at first glance.","The journalists outside couldn't enter and could only speculate at the entrance of Qingfeng Mingyue.","\"I really want to go in.\"","\"Forget it, we're not major media outlets. We didn't receive an invitation. It's enough to capture photos of Xu Xiuhe and his wife here. We should be content.\"","\"How can there be such a perfectly matched couple? He's talented, and she's beautiful.\"","\"Did you see that? Their footsteps are synchronized.\"","Even the people inside paused and stared at them, overwhelmed by their presence. Shen Yin looked at the gazes of the crowd, a faint smile playing on her lips.","She had achieved her goal. Everyone here held exceptional status and identity. As long as they noticed her, noticed her attire, her trip wouldn't be in vain.","Her dress was a long gown. The black fabric was a high-quality material that Shen Yin had specifically asked Chen Nuan to find in the market. It was smooth and had a luxurious feel. The upper part incorporated exquisite vintage Chinese elements, delicate yet harmonious.","With a slight fishtail design, Shen Yin walked like a mermaid, and at the hem of her skirt, she sewed small white pearls, adding a sense of drape to the dress.","In the crowd, Shen Yin could be seen at a glance. She stood quietly beside Xu Xiuhe, not saying a word, but she was a sight to behold. Xu Xiuhe naturally knew that from the moment he saw Shen Yin at her house, he had noticed her.","As a person of Xu Xiuhe's status, there weren't many people who needed to greet him. On the contrary, people came in waves to talk to Xu Xiuhe.","\"Xiuhe, you're here? Wow, sister-in-law looks stunning today,\" Xue Jingrui said, walking up to Xu Xiuhe with his female companion.","\"Yeah, when do we start?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Xue Jingrui replied, \"We can start now. Let's go inside first.\"","It was then that Shen Yin recognized that Xue Jingrui's female companion was actually Qi Yan. It's no wonder she didn't recognize her at first, as Qi Yan had indeed changed quite a bit.","In the two previous encounters with Qi Yan, once at the doorstep and once when Qi Yan visited her home, Qi Yan looked fresh and different from today. Wearing a white knee-length evening gown, along with specially designed makeup, she looked cute yet sexy.","However, her gaze was not so cute. Even while walking, Qi Yan's eyes occasionally glanced at Xu Xiuhe. Wasn't she afraid of tripping? Shen Yin thought to herself.","After taking their seats, the venue became quiet. Xue Jingrui's mother, Ye Rongzai, stood on the auction platform in front, holding a microphone, and after adjusting her tone to a relaxed one, she said, \"Seeing that everyone is almost seated, let's begin. I, Ye Rongzai, promise that all the money raised from the auction will be donated.\"","Shen Yin was attentively listening to the rules set by the host when suddenly someone bumped into her from behind. Shen Yin turned her head and said softly, \"Shu Yi, why are you here too?\" Shen Yin was afraid of speaking loudly, so she whispered.","Shu Yi looked at her mouth and roughly guessed what Shen Yin was saying, so she pointed to her own phone, indicating that Shen Yin should take a look.","Shen Yin took out her phone from her white handbag and saw a message from Shu Yi.","[I was threatened by Chang Zhiyuan to come here. I just saw you when you came in. Chang Zhiyuan and I were right behind you.]","Shen Yin turned her head again and sure enough, she saw Chang Zhiyuan sitting with crossed legs next to Shu Yi, behind Xu Xiuhe. Shen Yin turned back and typed.","[I thought you were filming in the northern city.]","[Yes, we had a break this afternoon. I just got back home. I don't know how Chang Zhiyuan received the message and asked me to come and accompany him at the charity event.]","Shu Yi complained, but Shen Yin, who had spent some time with her, discovered that Shu Yi's aloofness and indifference were only for outsiders and were labels she intentionally created for herself. In reality, when she was with familiar people, she had no reservations and could even make people feel very happy.","[Who is the woman next to Xue Jingrui?] Women are naturally gossipy, and Shu Yi was no exception.","[Qi Yan.]","Shu Yi looked up and saw Qi Yan's figure, then glanced at her phone and began typing: \"Looking at it this way, it feels pretty good, quite cute. Sitting upright, watching the auction, unlike the two of us, secretly chatting.\"","Shen Yin saw the message Shu Yi sent and couldn't help but smile. Do her fans know that she acts like this? Since the auction was still ongoing, Shen Yin had to hold back and raised her head with a half-smile.","Xu Xiuhe, who had turned away from Shen Yin, noticed Chang Zhiyuan and Shu Yi behind him when he lowered his head to type. Auctions were actually quite boring, and Chang Zhiyuan was nearly falling asleep.","\"Have you found anything you like?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","In auctions like this, whether or not you can find something good depends entirely on luck. As for charity items, they generally don't have much value, but they become valuable after being auctioned by wealthy individuals. And these auction items are usually bought by the organizers from antique markets or collectors.","\"Not yet.\"","Just as Shen Yin finished speaking, the host said, \"Next, the item we are going to auction is the last one of today. Can you all guess what it is?\" The host deliberately left it suspenseful."]},{"number":45,"title":"Chapter 45: Shoot a Hosta","paragraphs":["The host didn't want to feel awkward, so he kept the suspense going and slowly opened the box in front of him, tilting it slightly so that everyone present could see the contents.","At the first glance of the item, Shen Yin's heart skipped a beat and she sat up.","Upon seeing Shen Yin's reaction, Xu Xiuhe also shifted his gaze to the box in the host's hand. The box was quite exquisite, and inside it was a hairpin.","The hairpin was made of jade. Although Shen Yin was sitting in the front row, she couldn't clearly see the patterns on the hairpin, but her intuition told her that it was of good quality and the color of the jade was strikingly similar to another hairpin she had before.","\"Now, we will auction this hairpin. It can be considered a fine piece in terms of craftsmanship and material. It has a long history and is said to have come from the palace.\"","Shen Yin could tell that the quality was indeed good, and it captivated her at first sight.","\"The starting bid is 1 million yuan. Let the bidding begin.\"","\"1 million,\" Shen Yin raised her paddle.","As soon as her voice fell, everyone's gaze converged on her. Shen Yin didn't really think about it and just raised her paddle. 1 million yuan wasn't a big deal for them, but they had never seen someone spend money so easily.","\"1.5 million,\" Qi Yan raised her paddle.","Many people in the audience knew Qi Yan. She was brought here by Xue Jingrui and they had grown up together. Qi Yan's father, Qi Shengwu, held a high position in the city government. Could it be that the two families had intentions of forming a marriage alliance?","\"2 million,\" Shen Yin spoke up again.","\"2.5 million,\" Qi Yan increased her bid.","Shen Yin glanced at Qi Yan. Although she really liked this hairpin, if Qi Yan wanted it badly, she could let it go.","To her surprise, Shen Yin saw a provocation in Qi Yan's eyes. Despite being several years older, why did Qi Yan always appear so childish? If it wasn't for the provocation, it would have been fine, but Qi Yan had to do that.","This was one aspect where Shen Yin fell short. She had a strong desire to win and couldn't tolerate others suppressing her. It was precisely because of this trait that Xu Zhen from the Xiang Mansion couldn't take advantage of her. \"5 million.\"","Shen Yin's tone was calm as she changed her posture, wearing an expression as if she could afford to play along.","Qi Yan's eyes were filled with anger, unwilling to back down she shouted, \"5.5 million.\"","No one in the room was a fool, and no one dared to interrupt. It was obviously a battle between two women. If this battle had levels, they would definitely be cannons against airplanes—one dared to fire, the other dared to deliver.","Xu Xiuhe and Xue Jingrui remained motionless for now. Xu Xiuhe wouldn't dare to intervene if Xue Jingrui dared to help Qi Yan snatch the item, he would immediately sever ties with Xu Xiuhe.","He didn't know about other things, for example, whether Xu Xiuhe really liked Shen Yin or not. But Xu Xiuhe was known for being protective, and he was well aware of that. No matter what, Shen Yin was his wife now, and he couldn't afford to speak up.","Very well, Shen Yin smiled. Qi Yan was probably getting worked up now, so she would raise the bid by another 500,000 yuan. That shouldn't be unreasonable, right?","\"8 million.\"","There were quite a few spectators in the venue who enjoyed watching the excitement. The most interesting part of an auction was when two people kept raising the bid. They couldn't miss such a good show and watched with relish, only missing some melon seeds and tea.","Shu Yi wasn't worried at all. She kept sending messages to Shen Yin, saying, \"Come on, Yin Yin, you can't lose. This is not just about the hairpin!\"","Feeling like her previous message wasn't enough, she added a cheering emoji package. \"If you don't have enough money, I'll pay half for you!\"","Shen Yin looked at the messages on her phone screen and found Shu Yi really adorable. She wondered why she hadn't noticed it before. So Shen Yin replied, \"Shu Yi, I don't think I'm poor either.\"","Upon seeing the message, Shu Yi realized that she had worried for nothing. Being the wife of the president of Yuan Group and the daughter of the Shen family, she couldn't possibly lack money. Shen Yin was much wealthier than her.","\"Yin Yin, please support me financially,\" she jokingly replied.","This statement made Shen Yin burst into laughter again. Her sense of humor was indeed peculiar.","\"I'll prepare for a divorce from Xu Xiuhe!\" Shen Yin jokingly responded.","Shu Yi was shocked when she saw the message. Could she really have that?","\"Please don't. I'm afraid Xu Xiuhe will blacklist me from the entire internet,\" Shu Yi replied.","\"Eight million once, eight million twice, eight million...\" The host was about to say \"three times\" and was ready to strike the gavel.","\"Eight million five hundred thousand,\" Shen Yin raised the bid.","Shen Yin thought 8.5 million was already a substantial amount. She was ready to back out. She could always go out more often in the future and find something else. There was no need to hang herself on a hairpin.","\"One million,\" Xu Xiuhe held up his sign.","Shen Yin didn't expect this move from Xu Xiuhe. The hairpin was precious, but it wasn't worth a million.","Qi Yan's expression of anger changed. Why did Xu Xiuhe treat her like this? He had never been like this before.","\"One million once, one million twice, one million three times, sold for one million!\" The gavel came down.","One million was the highest price of the night. Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin were invited to the stage because of it. Shen Yin held Xu Xiuhe's arm and, to be honest, Xu Xiuhe bid on the hairpin because of her.","Considering that she was still wearing her own studio's dress, Shen Yin immediately changed her expression, smiling gracefully without showing her teeth. Xu Xiuhe slightly moved to the side behind Shen Yin, and their posture together could be described as the epitome of a couple.","The journalists in the audience took pictures of this scene, and the headlines were ready: \"A Million Wager for Love and Laughter.\"","The happiest person in the audience was undoubtedly Shu Yi, who was so happy that she stood up. Xu Xiuhe was really handsome, and he exuded a sense of masculinity.","\"How about it? Do you like the hairpin too? Should I get you one as a gift?\" Chang Zhiyuan turned to Shu Yi and asked.","In just a split second, Shu Yi's expression changed faster than in a Sichuan opera. Chang Zhiyuan couldn't help but laugh. After getting to know her, he found Shu Yi even more interesting. She was completely different from how he knew her before.","\"Why do you change expressions so quickly and treat people differently?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked unwillingly.","Seeing Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe come down from the stage, Shu Yi ran straight to Shen Yin. \"Yin Yin, this dress is so beautiful. It's probably going to trend tonight.\"","Chang Zhiyuan facepalmed, saying, \"Public figures should be mindful of their image.\"","\"It's true. The effect was achieved. Our big star praised it, which means the dress is really good. I'll have one tailored for you another day,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Did you make it yourself? I forgot that you're the one who alters all of Zheng Zheng's clothes on the set.\"","Qi Yan, standing next to Xue Jingrui, was so annoyed that her teeth itched. She turned around and left the venue. In the darkness, Qi Yan was filled with unwillingness. Why should she always have to take it? One day, she would reclaim what belonged to her.","Xue Jingrui followed her outside. He didn't expect things to turn out like this today, but it's for the best. Qi Yan should finally give up.","Chang Zhiyuan thought it was enough and pulled Shu Yi towards the underground parking lot.","\"What are you doing? I haven't finished talking with Yin Yin yet.\"","\"You, silly, can't you give the couple some private space after they've just reconciled?\" Chang Zhiyuan explained."]},{"number":46,"title":"Chapter 46: Propaganda Studio","paragraphs":["\"For you.\" Xu Xiuhe handed Shen Yin the box containing the hairpin.","Shen Yin accepted it. She was about to say there was no need to buy it back for 10 million yuan. But Shen Yin then thought that money was nothing to Xu Xiuhe. 10 million to him seemed insignificant.","Moreover, the hairpin was a gift for her. If she said it out loud, wouldn't it make her seem unappreciative? Shen Yin secretly rejoiced. This meant Xu Xiuhe treated her quite well. Could it be that he liked her a little?","Shen Yin didn't dare think further. To use modern words, the revolution had yet to succeed. How could she talk about romance? Her career had just started and she couldn't let other things distract her. She had watched so many TV shows and concluded that women must have money and be financially independent!","She couldn't be tempted and bewildered by a small hairpin. She had to stay sober. Xu Xiuhe still had an ex-girlfriend eyeing him like a tiger watching its prey. Shen Yin reminded herself again mentally. Although she was mentally mature, she was still 24 years old physically with a 16-year-old soul inside.","Focus on making money!","\"Thank you. I really like it,\" Shen Yin said. She still had to be polite, or she would seem lacking in manners.","\"That's good if you like it. It's getting late. Go pick up Zhengzheng. He'll probably start crying if we wait any longer,\" said Xu Xiuhe.","\"Okay.\"","Lights filled the Shen family villa. In the living room, three adults busied themselves around Zhengzheng.","\"Zhengzheng, say 'uncle' and uncle will call for you,\" said Shen Lv.","Xu Yunzhang, lying on the floor, looked up. \"Uncle, uncle.\"","When Shen Yin came in, she saw Shen Lv coaxing her nephew.","\"Mommy.\" Xu Yunzhang didn't expect to actually see his mommy when he looked up. The longing in his eyes made Shen Yin's heart melt. The luckiest thing to happen since coming to this world was having a chubby, cuddly darling.","\"Zhengzheng, we have to go home now.\"","The little darling held out his two hands, asking to be hugged. Considering Shen Yin was still in high heels, Xu Xiuhe bent down and picked up Zhengzheng.","\"Mom, thanks for your hard work. I'll take him home tonight,\" Shen Yin said to Fang Yue.","\"No hardship at all. You didn't get too tired today, did you?\" Fang Yue asked caringly.","\"Not tired at all. It's getting late. We should head back first,\" said Shen Yin, looking at them as she spoke.","\"Dad, Mom, Bro, we're leaving first. Zhengzheng, say bye to Grandma, Grandpa and Uncle.\" Xu Xiuhe spoke.","\"Yinyin, you haven't eaten yet right? It'll be too late once you get home. Why not eat a little here?\" Fang Yue suggested.","Shen Yin thought it really was late. Zhengzheng seemed to have eaten already. That left just her and Xu Xiuhe. She still had things to do when they got home tonight. Her mom's suggestion was great, as expected of her mother.","At the dinner table sat just Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe. It was Xu Xiuhe's first time eating at his mother-in-law's house. He felt a little strange.","After returning home, Shen Yin immediately opened Weibo. Sure enough, she and Xu Xiuhe were trending with \"A wealthy lady's determined bid wins her husband's smile.\"","Looking at this trending topic name, Shen Yin thought, who came up with such an outlandish name? Was she smiling? She had maintained the studio's image.","Comments piled up under the Weibo post. Many cp fans rushed out to say the protagonists were showing affection. After scrolling for a long time, Shen Yin finally saw a few comments about the dress.","[This dress must be custom-made. It's so unique.]","[It looks so good, the retro style combined with modern style gives it a different feel.]","[It really shows off her figure and temperament when worn.]","[Is it possible her figure and temperament were good to begin with?]","Shen Yin immediately called the studio's PR person, Li Huanhuan. \"Huanhuan, did you see the trending topic?\"","Not only had Li Huanhuan seen it, she was shocked. She, Chen Nuan and two other dressmakers lived in the house Shen Yin bought. When they saw the \"A wealthy lady's determined bid wins her husband's smile\" trending topic, they couldn't believe their eyes.","No wonder the boss seemed a little familiar. It turned out Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe had trended before. The boss's husband they didn't dare look at was actually the CEO of Heyuan Group.","When Shen Yin called Li Huanhuan, the three pricked up their ears, wanting to hear what the boss would say.","Chen Nuan mouthed to Li Huanhuan, \"Speakerphone.\"","Li Huanhuan turned on the speakerphone.","\"Boss, we saw the trending topic,\" said Li Huanhuan.","\"Good. Next, post all our studio's work on the studio Weibo. Edit the custom inquiry number in too. Then tap the trending topic below to attract attention. I'll buy some trends.\"","\"Okay, Boss.\"","Shen Yin hung up. She then planned to buy trending topics, but having never done so before, she could only search Baidu. The internet age brought fast news. These things she didn't even dare dream of in Dasheng times she was now familiar with.","Shen Yin registered a Weibo account herself. Following Baidu's instructions step-by-step, she finally paid.","Soon after, Shen Yin saw her studio's name in the trending topics on Weibo: \"Dress of CEO's wife from Heyuan Group.\"","Shen Yin deliberately had Li Huanhuan edit the wording this way. She didn't want to expose having started a studio for now. Even though the studio name contained \"Yin,\" netizens would think Shen Yin was trending and brought attention to the dress studio too.","In no time, the trending topic ranked in the top five, just a few spots below that \"A wealthy lady's determined bid wins her husband's smile.\"","This trend seemed to be rising too quickly. Could trending topics be so cheap? She didn't spend much, barely enough to get on the trending chart.","Oh well, trending was a good thing. No need for more. Next she just had to see the feedback the studio got. If the effect was good, she could move on to her next venture.","Xu Xiuhe was giving Zhengzheng a bath. Shen Yin also intended to enter the bathroom. One thing she wasn't used to in this world was how everyone could stay up so late now. Sleeping by midnight was considered early. But it was understandable with so many entertainment options nowadays.","She couldn't do it. She got sleepy early. Despite having Shen Yin's body, could it be sleep habits were still related to past practices? Like in Dasheng times, after finishing reading, she would fall asleep by 9pm.","In the bathroom, Shen Yin seemed to vaguely hear her phone ring. Could it be Xu Xiuhe bringing Zhengzheng to her room, but she didn't hear him knock so he called instead?","Shen Yin hurried out and checked her phone right away. It showed a missed call from \"Shu Yi.\"","Calling so late, Shu Yi must have something urgent. Shen Yin called back.","\"Hey, Yinyin. Your studio bought trending topics right?\"","\"Mm-hm, you noticed huh.\"","\"It rushed into the top five! How could a newly registered Weibo with only a few posts gain traction so quickly unless it bought trends?\"","\"Shu Yi, I can buy them for you in the future. I found trending topics surprisingly cheap. I only spent 2000 yuan but the popularity was huge.\""]},{"number":47,"title":"Chapter 47: Studio Order","paragraphs":["\"No, Shen Yin, you said you only spent 2,000 yuan.\" Shu Yi asked back.","\"Yeah, isn't it a bargain? In the future if you need promotion, I'll buy hot searches for you.\" Shen Yin said.","\"Are you sure no one helped you buy it?\" Shu Yi was skeptical. She was in the entertainment industry after all. Although she had never bought one herself, that didn't mean she didn't know how much it cost to get into the top 5 hot searches!","Shen Yin started to doubt upon hearing this. Could it be that someone really did help buy it for her, Xu Xiuhe or Fang Yue?","\"Then I guess someone must have helped me buy it.\" Shen Yin said.","\"What if it was Xu Xiuhe? That would be so romantic! Oh, do you know I was browsing Weibo and saw you and Xu Xiuhe have a super topic. It was pretty interesting, everyone there was shipping you two. They went crazy tonight! You two aren't just giving out candy, you're pouring it all over. Ah ah, I've become a CP fan too.\"","\"Super topic?\" Shen Yin didn't pay much attention to things like that. This era was truly interesting.","\"There's something else. I really do need to come to your place to order a dress. Yan Xi's Legend needs promotion. I need to attend events but before I really hated taking endorsements so no sponsors gave me dresses!\" Shu Yi continued.","\"Haha, didn't I see online people saying you have a backer so you don't need to take endorsements to make money?\" Shen Yin teased.","\"I'm just lazy. I wanted to go out and play. There's no backer!\" Shu Yi pouted. Fortunately Shen Yin wasn't facing Shu Yi or she would have laughed again.","\"Okay, come to my studio tomorrow. I'll custom make one for you.\"","\"Knock knock knock.\" There was a knocking sound.","Shen Yin was about to open the door and said, \"Let me hang up first, see you tomorrow.\"","When she opened the door, it was Xu Yunzheng standing there. Seeing her, he immediately hugged Shen Yin's legs, \"Mama, sleep.\"","\"Are you sleepy?\" Shen Yin asked.","Xu Xiuhe was the one who replied first however, \"I just gave him a bath. He wanted to come find you as soon as he was done. He had another tiring day today so you should put him to bed early.\"","\"Okay, thanks.\"","\"Don't mention it. No need to thank me.\"","After closing the door, Shen Yin only just remembered she had forgotten to ask Xu Xiuhe about the hot search. Oh well, better not to ask. What if he didn't buy it? Wouldn't she seem full of herself then?","In the study, Xu Xiuhe received a call from Liu Bo.","\"Boss, I bought the hot searches. But why are we buying hot searches for a newly opened clothing workshop? I don't understand.\" In Liu Bo's impression, Xu Xiuhe never did things unrelated to his own interests.","\"Hm?\"","Sensing Xu Xiuhe's tone, Liu Bo immediately said, \"Got it boss, I understand now.\"","After hanging up, Liu Bo hit his own head. How could he be so stupid? Other people might not know Yunyin Clothing Workshop was opened by whom but he should know! One Yun, one Yin, it was obviously opened by either the boss or the boss's wife! If he had known, he would have bought more to get \"Heyuan Group Boss's Wife's Dress\" straight to #1 hot search.","Sure enough, Shu Yi came to Yunyin Clothing Workshop the next day. Downstairs there was only Chen Nuan and Li Huanhuan. Upstairs were two ladies busy stepping on sewing machines.","When Shu Yi first stepped into the workshop, she was attracted by the layout and decor. After taking off her sunglasses, Chen Nuan recognized her at first glance.","\"Are you Shu Yi?\" Chen Nuan had already recognized her but it was still more polite to ask first.","Shu Yi hadn't considered there might be other employees in the workshop. She also hadn't expected to be recognized immediately and it made her a little embarrassed. \"Is Shen Yin here?\"","Chen Nuan was a little excited. \"The boss is on the third floor.\"","Shu Yi nodded politely at Chen Nuan and Li Huanhuan then headed upstairs shyly.","It took Li Huanhuan a few seconds before realizing, \"Chen Nuan, did we just see a TV star?\"","Chen Nuan nodded and said, \"What great fortune did I have to be able to see my goddess in person today? See, I've always felt she was so beautiful and unique looking. If you look closely, you can feel she has a bit of a sweet girl image. Actually I don't think her features suit playing Yan Xi that well. She's more suited for playing gentle sweet characters. On the contrary, I feel our boss is better suited. Her features have that kind of striking impact. You could say very glamorous. Ah ah, as expected beauties make friends with beauties. Excellent people are always surrounded by excellent people.\"","\"Then let's strive to become excellent too! By the way, did you get any calls for custom dresses?\" Li Huanhuan asked.","Only then did Chen Nuan remember that she wasn't busy right now so she was helping Li Huanhuan handle current orders and business matters too.","\"I got one, a small time celebrity but not as famous as my goddess. There was another one, I wrote down her name, Qi Yan. Her tone wasn't very nice.\"","\"Okay, send those orders to the boss later.\"","Up on the third floor, Shen Yin was sitting in the living room. The living room of the small building wasn't small. Shen Yin had placed a desk inside where she could work while keeping an eye on Xu Yunzheng.","When Shu Yi came in, Xu Yunzheng noticed first as usual. A child's attention was easily caught after all.","\"Yunzheng, miss me?\" Sweetheart?\"","\"Miss.\"","\"Wow, so well behaved. Let auntie hug you.\" Shu Yi stepped forward and picked up Xu Yunzheng from the carpet.","\"You're here early.\" Shen Yin said.","\"I came to give you some face. I'm serious!\" Shu Yi said.","Shen Yin stood up and took a measuring tape. \"Put Yunzheng down first.\"","Shen Yin measured everything one by one, bust, waist, hips and leg circumference.","There was a beeping sound from the computer on the desk. Shen Yin was clever to begin with. After learning for a month or two she could grasp some basic office software.","When Shen Yin sat down to record the measurements she had just taken, she happened to glance at the computer. It was the orders Chen Nuan and Li Huanhuan had sent over. Qi Yan's name just so happened to be at the top and Shen Yin frowned slightly when she saw it.","\"What's wrong?\" Shu Yi asked.","\"Got some orders. They're coming this afternoon.\"","\"That's pretty good though.\"","Shu Yi leaned in to take a look at the computer screen.","\"She doesn't know this workshop is opened by you right? I guess after not winning the auction yesterday and you stealing her thunder, she must be annoyed now and wants to check out this workshop.\"","Shu Yi was worried Qi Yan would take out her anger on the workshop. She was even more worried Shen Yin wouldn't be able to handle it with Yunzheng here so she decided to stay with Shen Yin the whole day.","\"I'll keep you company. I'm free these few days anyway.\" There were still a few days until Shu Yi had to attend the launch event for Yan Xi's Legend.","\"That's good. You just want to freeload food right.\" Shen Yin said jokingly.","\"Oh, you know me best.\"","Actually Shen Yin knew Shu Yi truly cared for her as a friend. She was just considering how she should handle things when Qi Yan came over later. Should she not show herself or..."]},{"number":48,"title":"Chapter 48: Nightmare Again","paragraphs":["Qi Yan came to the studio in the afternoon with another girl by her side.","Shen Yin had specifically instructed Chen Nuan and Li Huanhuan to let her know when Qi Yan arrived.","So Chen Nuan notified Shen Yin right away. Shen Yin replied: [Just see what she says first, don't reveal my information yet.]","[Got it.]","\"I booked an appointment yesterday to come get a dress for a ceremony.\" Qi Yan said as she stood in front of the counter to the right of the studio entrance.","\"Of course, ma'am.\" Li Huanhuan replied professionally.","\"I want your studio's most expensive, finest dress.\"","\"Ma'am, our dresses are custom-made. What we have in the store right now are just samples. The most expensive one we have is that traditional Chinese wedding gown over there.\" Chen Nuan pointed to the Chinese wedding gown on the other side of the room.","Qi Yan looked in the direction Chen Nuan was pointing. It was a solemn, deep red Chinese wedding gown, quite elegant and exquisite indeed, but she wasn't getting married, so what would she need a wedding dress for?","\"Then I want a custom-made dress. Where is your manager?\" Qi Yan's tone was displeased.","Chen Nuan didn't know what to do. She replied to wait a moment and immediately sent a message lowering her head.","[Qi Yan is asking for the person in charge.]","When Shen Yin saw the message, she handed Zhengzheng over to Shu Yi and said, \"I'll go downstairs to take care of it.\"","Shen Yin strode down the stairs, pretending not to know Qi Yan was here. \"I heard you're looking for the person in charge?\"","Qi Yan immediately turned around, incredulously saying: \"You're the manager?\"","\"Qi Yan! I'm so sorry, I was dealing with something upstairs just now.\"","Hearing Shen Yin say this, Qi Yan's expression soured even more. Forcing down her anger, she said: \"Well, since that's the case, can I place a custom order now?\"","\"Of course. Does this lady also want to order a dress?\" Shen Yin asked, looking at the woman beside Qi Yan.","This woman was the budding starlet Chen Nuan had mentioned, but Shen Yin didn't recognize her. So when Shen Yin asked if she wanted a dress too, Gu Mengmeng's first reaction wasn't anything else - it was that Shen Yin didn't even recognize her.","She was a celebrity, after all. To not even recognize her... Gu Mengmeng's family owned a small company, and she was the only daughter, spoiled since childhood. She wanted to break into show business, so her family bought her resources. She was decently good-looking and hadn't been in the industry long, standing as a third or fourth-tier celebrity. So she had always been quite arrogant. Before even getting a good look at who the boss was, she was already angry.","\"What? You don't recognize me? For a newly opened shop, I can endorse for you guys for free.\" Gu Mengmeng said haughtily.","Before Shen Yin could respond, Shu Yi came down the stairs. Shen Yin's expression seemed to ask \"Why did you come down?\"","\"One endorser should be enough, right? And coincidentally, I got here before you.\" Shu Yi said, determined to provoke.","She hadn't even done any endorsements yet. And as for popularity, she seemed higher than Gu Mengmeng. Come on, how could Gu Mengmeng so shamelessly ask for free dresses?","\"Why are you here?\" Gu Mengmeng said in shock.","\"Me? I'm here to endorse for the studio.\" Shu Yi gave Shen Yin a look, signaling her to not worry and that Zhengzheng was napping upstairs.","Gu Mengmeng was rendered speechless. \"Nevermind, this studio is clearly lacking. You don't even have ready-made dresses. Let's go.\"","Qi Yan didn't know what to do either. She felt like a clown and took the opportunity Gu Mengmeng had given her to bow out gracefully. \"Alright, since you don't even have finished dresses, we'll come back another time.\"","Qi Yan said this, then turned and left the building with Gu Mengmeng.","\"Shu Yi, why did you come down?\" Shen Yin asked after they had left.","\"I suddenly remembered seeing Gu Mengmeng's name in the orders on your computer this morning. She has a notorious reputation for being unreasonable in the industry, so I was worried you wouldn't be able to handle her. Zhengzheng happened to be napping, so I came down.\" Shu Yi explained.","\"Thank you! Don't worry, I can handle it.\"","Shen Yin gave some more instructions and went back upstairs with Shu Yi.","Leaving Chen Nuan and Li Huanhuan staring at each other speechlessly.","Chen Nuan spoke first: \"My girl is so tough! I heard she comes from an ordinary family background. To actually stand up to Gu Mengmeng like that!\"","\"I know, right? I didn't expect Gu Mengmeng to be so arrogant in real life. It really is all fake on TV.\"","\"You're right about that. But it seems my girl also carefully crafts her image. Yet I prefer her true personality even more.\" Chen Nuan said.","\"Do you think this will negatively impact the studio at all?\" Shu Yi asked Shen Yin after going back upstairs.","\"No worries. I'll take care of it. I didn't do anything wrong. And we got quite a few orders this morning and afternoon, so that charity gala last night was great for me. The effect has been achieved.\"","\"What I need to do now is make sure your dress steals the spotlight at the press conference, shining brilliantly. If I can pull this off successfully, I should be able to start working on furniture.\"","At dinnertime, Shen Yin told Xu Xiuhe about Qi Yan's visit to the studio.","\"She didn't do anything bad, did she?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"No, the studio just didn't have any ready-to-wear dresses, so she left.\" Shen Yin said.","Shen Yin actually wanted to say she seemed to have some bad feelings towards Qi Yan, though she was oblivious when it came to relationships and didn't know why.","Was it because Qi Yan had provoked her, or because Qi Yan was Xu Xiuhe's ex-girlfriend? Shen Yin still hadn't figured it out.","\"Mama, mama, want to sleep sleep.\"","Shen Yin looked at the time - it was Zhengzheng's bedtime. He always got sleepy earlier than her. Like right now, he was already drowsy right after dinner.","\"I'll give Zhengzheng a bath tonight.\" Shen Yin said.","\"Then I'll clean up the dishes.\"","Their division of labor was so clear, they really seemed like an old married couple.","After Shen Yin finished bathing Zhengzheng, she went to bed early herself. To reward herself for the past few days of hard work, she drank a cup of warm milk to help her sleep, planning to get a good night's rest.","But she had another nightmare, except the protagonist wasn't her this time. She was startled awake, got out of bed to drink some water. Her previous nightmare had come true, so this one was probably real too."]},{"number":49,"title":"Chapter 49: See Spring Mountain","paragraphs":["Two days before what happened in the dream, so is there still a chance to remedy this time, just like the car accident dream last time, to avoid it.","Shen Yin was not sure. She couldn't fall asleep for a long time now. This matter was not up to her, so if she wanted to avoid it, it might be a little troublesome.","The next morning, Shen Yin woke up. Because she didn't sleep well, her whole body felt lazy. She forced herself to cheer up. There were so many orders that she had to draw many dress designs.","While working on the drawings, Shen Yin was still restless. She still hadn't thought of a comprehensive method to help Shu Yi avoid this accident.","In the dream, Shu Yi was attending the launch event of \"Yan Xi's Legend\". While speaking on stage, the stage frame suddenly collapsed. The large light happened to hit Shu Yi's head without bias. In an instant, bright red blood flowed from Shu Yi's head, and then she collapsed to the ground.","If the dream comes true, Shu Yi's life will be in danger. But that frame was fine, why did it suddenly collapse? And why did that light seem to target Shu Yi's head?","She must come up with a way to prevent this tragedy from happening. If she said the nightmare she had last time finally happened by coincidence, then if it happens again this time, it means her nightmares can really predict the future.","Shen Yin recalled the script of \"Yan Xi's Legend\" she watched before, and designed a dress based on the life experience of Yan Xi.","Because there were quite a few elements to consider, it took a long time to draw the design drawings. When making the dress form, Shen Yin asked two dressmakers to help out, and finally saw the finished product the next night.","\"My god, this dress is so beautiful!\" Li Huanhuan exclaimed.","Shen Yin was also very satisfied with this dress. She spent a whole day modifying it before finalizing the design. She was not very good at using computer software to draw, so her design drawings were all hand-drawn.","Because the dress she designed for herself last time was all made by her, and the two dressmakers only did the sewing without seeing the design drawings, when they saw these hand-drawn design drawings this time, they were incredulous. Hand-drawn design drawings were much more difficult and time-consuming than computer drawings. They didn't expect their boss, a rich young lady and the wife of a wealthy family's CEO, to be so capable.","The finished product was even more stunning than the dress she wore last time. Shen Yin was very happy, which meant her skills had improved.","\"It's too beautiful. Such a gorgeous dress should have a name,\" Chen Nuan said.","Shen Yin thought about it and did come up with one. If Yan Xi's life could be summed up in one sentence, it would be: \"The wastelands give way to spring mountains.\"","\"Let's call it Seeing the Spring Mountains,\" Shen Yin said.","What came next was more important business that she had to attend to.","These past two days, she had been thinking of ways to help Shu Yi avoid this accident. Today, she finally had an idea. She didn't know the exact time in the dream, so she couldn't tell Shu Yi directly not to stand on the stage at the press conference. That would not only make her seem unreasonable, but more importantly, it was simply unfeasible for Shu Yi as the leading actress to not appear on stage.","Therefore, the safest approach was for her to be there and respond as situations called for.","Shen Yin picked up her phone and called Shu Yi.","\"Hello, Shen Yin, is the dress ready?\" Shu Yi asked.","\"Yes, do you want to take a look?\"","\"I do.\"","\"Well I won't show it to you now then.\"","\"Fine, I'll come over to get it.\"","\"You're at Ziyue Manor right now. I'll bring it over after you get home tonight.\"","\"Shu Yi, can I ask you something? Can I attend your press conference?\"","\"Shen Yin, it would be wonderful if you could make it.\"","\"It's tomorrow morning at Qingfeng Mingyue, right?\"","When Shen Yin heard Qingfeng Mingyue, she became interested. Wasn't that Xu Xiuhe's venture? If she needed to investigate something, wouldn't it be very convenient?","\"Alright, I'm taking Yunzheng home now. Wait for me there.\" Shen Yin hung up after speaking.","On the drive back to Ziyue Manor, Shen Yin first went to Shu Yi's villa to deliver the dress before heading to her own villa.","When she pulled into the underground garage, Xu Xiuhe arrived right before her in his car.","After parking, Xu Xiuhe walked to the back seat of Shen Yin's car and carried Xu Yunzheng up.","\"Did Yunzheng miss his dad today?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Xu Yunzheng hugged Xu Xiuhe's neck, and patted Xu Xiuhe on the shoulder, saying \"miss dad\".","As Shen Yin locked her car door, she couldn't help retorting when she overheard Xu Xiuhe say, \"Why are you hitting dad when you missed me?\"","\"He was patting you to show he's happy and excited. It wasn't hitting you. And even if he did hit you lightly, could you actually feel any pain?\"","Xu Xiuhe felt a little embarrassed. So it was meant to show happiness. He felt a little inferior now that Shen Yin also had work every day yet took care of Yunzheng without complaint, while he had been with Yunzheng for over two years now, far longer than the two months Shen Yin had spent with him, yet understood Yunzheng less than Shen Yin did in her short time together.","Fortunately Shen Yin didn't know what Xu Xiuhe was thinking, otherwise she would have mocked him again. The two months she spent with Yunzheng was far more than his two years with the boy.","After changing into house slippers in the foyer, Shen Yin headed to the kitchen to start preparing dinner as usual, while Xu Xiuhe played with Yunzheng for a bit before the boy went to build block towers on his own in the living room.","Xu Xiuhe also walked into the kitchen. \"Why did you come in again?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Yunzheng is playing by himself in the living room. I'll help you out a bit so we can finish faster.\"","In actuality, Shen Yin realized he was afraid she might get tired since he had handled prep of all the ingredients himself, leaving only the stir-frying to her.","At this moment, Shen Yin felt this man was quite reliable and attentive, caring enough to not want her to overwork. So could she tell him about the nightmare and ask him to help investigate whether it was truly an accident or someone deliberately causing harm?","At dinner, Shen Yin was lost in thought, still unsure after much deliberation whether Xu Xiuhe would believe her or even suspect her.","\"What's wrong, something on your mind?\" Xu Xiuhe asked when he noticed Shen Yin wasn't concentrating on eating.","\"Do you believe in dreams?\" Shen Yin's tone carried a hint of probing. After all, dream premonitions were such a preposterous thing, how could anyone believe it?","Xu Xiuhe looked at Shen Yin and said, \"What happened? Did you have some dream you can't make sense of? If you really can't figure it out, don't dwell on it. But if you truly want to know, you can find someone to interpret dreams.\"","\"Mm-hmm,\" Shen Yin was surprised by Xu Xiuhe's response. Well then, she would have him interpret this dream!"]},{"number":50,"title":"Chapter 50: Interpretation of Dreams","paragraphs":["\"It's like this, I had a dream, dreaming that Shu Yi will have an accident at the press conference tomorrow.\" Shen Yin looked into Xu Xiuhe's eyes, hoping to see something in Xu Xiuhe's eyes.","Xu Xiuhe comforted Shen Yin, saying: \"Dreams and reality are opposites.\"","\"What if I say, that afternoon when we stayed at Qinghe Xiaolou, I dreamed about a car accident happening on the way back, do you believe it or not?\" She suddenly became serious.","Xu Xiuhe carefully recalled that day. Indeed, the car had already been driven out of the garage, then Shen Yin suddenly mentioned staying overnight at the small building. Xu Xiuhe became serious and looked at Shen Yin.","\"That afternoon, I don't know why I slept for so long. The dream was so realistic. In the dream, you were driving, Zhengzheng and I were sitting in the same positions as in reality. After waking up, I thought I was overthinking, but it was really raining outside.\"","Shen Yin said, getting a little excited, unwilling to recall it.","Xu Xiuhe gently patted Shen Yin on the back, as if to soothe her. Then he said, \"I believe you.\"","This comfort seemed to work. Did Xu Xiuhe really believe her?","\"Does anyone else know about your prophetic dreams?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"No one. I also know it's really hard to believe and no one will believe me if I say it. But it really happened. Only you and Zhengzheng know for now.\" Shen Yin said while helping Zhengzheng get some food.","Zhengzheng seemed to not hear Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin's conversation at all, eating deliciously without any distraction.","\"Then what else did you dream about?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"I dreamed that at Shu Yi's press conference tomorrow, the stage she was standing on collapsed, and the big light on the ceiling fell directly on her, blood all over her head, and then she fell down.\"","\"I don't know if it will really happen, but the dream was still very realistic, the same feeling as the car accident dream, only the time before it happens is a little longer than last time.\"","\"Where is the press conference?\" Xu Xiuhe asked. Based on his observations over the past two months, Shu Yi seemed to be Shen Yin's only friend.","\"At Qingfeng Mingyue. My purpose in telling you this is, if this really happens, can you check whether this is an accident or someone deliberately harmed her.\"","Xu Xiuhe looked at Shen Yin and said, \"If Qingfeng Mingyue wasn't my asset, would you not tell me about this at all?\"","Shen Yin thought for a few seconds, then nodded.","Xu Xiuhe was really angry. \"Why wouldn't you tell me?\"","\"If I told you, would you believe it?\" Shen Yin retorted.","Xu Xiuhe looked into Shen Yin's eyes firmly and nodded, \"I would.\"","Shen Yin's heart beat faster under his gaze.","Finally, Xu Xiuhe changed the subject, \"So what do you plan to do, if this dream comes true, how do you plan to stop it?\"","\"I'm going to the press conference tomorrow, to respond accordingly.\"","\"No.\" Xu Xiuhe directly refused.","\"I'll send Zhengzheng to my mom in the morning, and go by myself, it won't be dangerous.\"","After getting along for two months, Xu Xiuhe also discovered that Shen Yin was a very opinionated person, and it was difficult for others to change her mind once she decided on something.","\"Alright, pay attention to safety, call me anytime if anything comes up.\"","The next day, Shen Yin packed all the things Zhengzheng would need during the day in a bag. She wore a mask, hat, and sunglasses, then drove Zhengzheng to Yu Lan Garden.","Because she didn't tell Fang Yue in advance that she was coming over, when she was close, Shen Yin called Fang Yue.","\"Hello, mom, are you home?\"","\"I'm home, what's up?\"","\"It's like this, I might have something to do this morning and can't bring Zhengzheng with me conveniently. Could you help me watch him?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Of course, of course, should I go pick up Zhengzheng?\"","\"No need, Zhengzheng and I are almost there, just come open the door.\"","Fang Yue was delighted. It seemed like there was no longer any estrangement between her daughter and herself. She was free every day, tending flowers and drinking tea. Of course she would be happy to look after her grandson.","\"Zhengzheng, be good and stay with grandma this morning. Mommy has something to do and will come get you in the afternoon.\"","\"Okay, with grandma.\"","\"Zhengzheng is so good.\" Shen Yin picked Zhengzheng up from the back seat and handed him to Fang Yue.","\"Mom, thanks for the trouble.\" Shen Yin thanked her again.","\"What trouble? I'm overjoyed. Or should I just dedicate myself to looking after Zhengzheng for you from now on?\"","\"Sounds good.\" Shen Yin said with a smile. Of course she couldn't bear to be separated from Zhengzheng, unless she was too busy to take care of him. It was great that her own mother was willing to help look after her child, so she was happy to agree for now.","\"Say bye to mommy again, Zhengzheng.\" Shen Yin waved to Zhengzheng as she got in the car.","Seeing that, Zhengzheng shook his little head and waved his little hand. \"Bye bye.\"","Shen Yin was farsighted and fully armed. After all, she now bore the title of wife of the president of Yuan Group, she had to consider not just herself but Yuan Group as well.","Sure enough, as she expected, the entrance of Qingfeng Mingyue was surrounded by reporters and media. This time she didn't need to show her face or have the strictly required entry tickets from last time.","So Shen Yin went straight from the underground parking lot and took the elevator up to where the press conference was being held.","Because she was fully masked up, no one could see Shen Yin's face. Her figure and temperament were also unlike ordinary people, so the staff assumed Shen Yin was a lead actress and directly led her to the dressing room backstage.","Shen Yin looked around one by one until she finally saw Shu Yi's dressing room.","Knock knock knock, Shen Yin knocked three times.","Shu Yi opened the door and immediately recognized that the woman in front of her with even her eyes hidden was Shen Yin.","\"You're so late, I thought you weren't coming.\" Shu Yi said in a slightly complaining tone.","\"This is the first time you're wearing clothes I designed, how could I possibly not come? I had to send Zhengzheng to my mom first, didn't I. With so many people here, I was worried it would be unsafe to bring him.\"","\"True, look, your design is so gorgeous.\" Shu Yi spun around in front of Shen Yin.","Shen Yin looked it over. It was great, very striking and fitted perfectly, but it seemed to still be missing something."]},{"number":51,"title":"Chapter 51: \"Yan Xi Biography\" Press Conference","paragraphs":["\"Just the make-up and hairstyle left,\" Shen Yin said in realization.","\"Let me do it,\" Shen Yin pulled Shu Yi to sit in front of the dressing table. It had to be said, Shu Yi just trusted Shen Yin unconditionally, although she had never seen Shen Yin do make-up or style hair for others.","Yes, when had Shen Yin ever helped others with make-up and styling? From young to now, it had always been others waiting on her. However, when in Rome, do as the Romans do. It was the 21st century now, there was gender equality, everyone was equal.","The make-up Shen Yin did for Shu Yi, the eye shadow she applied, everything was intentionally matched to the gown. Even the hairstyle incorporated elements of Yan Xi's hairstyle, a modern gown naturally needed a modern hairstyle. Shen Yin also curled Shu Yi's hair ends.","After applying the lipstick, the overall look finally came together. Shen Yin dared to say, today's trending searches would definitely have Shu Yi's name. The original stylist by the side was already stunned, Shen Yin's make-up techniques were something she had never seen before.","What made her even more dumbfounded was that someone with such advanced beauty senses would actually be the wife of the CEO of the Distant Group. The stylist recognised her the moment she entered. She just did not expect that she would have such a close relationship with Shu Yi, even helping her with styling.","It looked like Shu Yi really had backing, they often mingled in entertainment circles, so naturally they knew what could and could not be said. So Shu Yi was not worried at all about the stylist exposing Shen Yin's identity.","\"Knock knock knock\"","There was another knock on the door.","\"Teacher Shu, are you ready? It's almost time for you to go on stage,\" Yan Yan entered.","\"Wow.\" Yan Yan was a little surprised, she did not expect to see Shen Yin here.","\"What's wrong, don't recognise me after not seeing me for so long?\" Shen Yin joked.","\"No no, I just didn't expect it.\"","At first, Shen Yin was worried that if she really had to go and stop anything when the time came, it would draw too much attention. But now that she saw Yan Yan, things became easier. If she needed Shu Yi to get away at the moment the lights fell, she could get Yan Yan to persuade Shu Yi to leave.","But now there was a problem, she did not know exactly when Shu Yi would get hit.","\"Shu Yi, how long will you be on stage?\"","\"10 minutes. Don't worry, it's not long, but I will definitely show off this gown, and make Yunyin Studio's name known.\"","10 minutes. To Shu Yi it was not long, but to Shen Yin, danger could happen on stage anytime during those 10 minutes.","\"Then I'll head out first. Do you want to go out and see?\" Shu Yi asked.","Shen Yin tied up her hair again and put on her cap, mask and sunglasses again.","\"Shu Yi, do you have any black pants and black tops here?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Yes, my usual clothes.\"","\"Bring them here, let me change into them.\"","Shen Yin changed into the pants and top. She removed her cap and sunglasses, then sat in front of the dresser and altered her eyebrows slightly. Her entire aura changed instantly.","\"Yin Yin, what are you trying to do?\" Shu Yi asked.","Shen Yin did not reply, only asking instead: \"Look very different?\"","Shu Yi and Yan Yan only nodded. The stylist at the side also nodded non-stop. Fortunately the person in front of her was a wealthy madam, otherwise she probably would have lost her job already. Was it just drawing eyebrows? She had used foundation and changed her looks. Now she just looked ordinary, not matching her delicate features from earlier at all. This was her first time seeing someone making themselves ugly and plain on purpose. But this skill was indeed powerful, it could pass off as special effects make-up.","\"Alright, let's go,\" Shen Yin still had her mask and sunglasses on, but not her cap. With similar build to Shu Yi, the black clothes fit very well.","\"Why are you dressed like a bodyguard?\" Shu Yi did not understand.","\"Does it look like one? That's the effect I'm going for,\" Shen Yin had just arrived in this world, but she had watched many TV shows, including one about a retired female soldier who became a bodyguard. Beautiful and cool while carrying out all kinds of missions.","Back then, she thought that if she really had no way out in the future, she could become a bodyguard to support herself.","Shu Yi went on stage. Shen Yin stood at the side of the stage, getting Yan Yan to stand nearby too. Shen Yin put both hands behind her back, completely looking like a bodyguard.","Shu Yi was on stage giving her speech, but the production team decided to add an impromptu interview.","Shu Yi talked about some experiences filming, some funny things that happened, and her understanding of the drama characters. With the director's consent, she even revealed some spoilers.","Next, she was about to steer the conversation to her gown, but before she could, the reporters took the initiative to ask.","\"Ms Shu, I heard you haven't accepted any commercials, so did you pay for this custom gown yourself? It must have been expensive.\"","This was exactly the kind of question Shu Yi wanted. She felt like giving the reporter a Like.","Shu Yi smiled and replied, \"Good question. This gown is indeed custom-made, and it's also my first endorsement of sorts I guess. Have you noticed anything special about this gown?\"","\"Very exquisite, very eye-catching, the design is also very novel. It should have been very expensive too.\" The reporters below commented.","\"The biggest highlight of this gown is actually how it incorporates Yan Xi's life journey,\" Shu Yi intentionally teased their curiosity.","The teaser was very successful, attracting a lot of attention. Even Wang Ming did not expect the gown to be related to the drama.","Shu Yi went on, \"Yan Xi's life was very bumpy, yet very successful. It was a process of gradual growth, giving different impressions at each period. So this gown incorporates the experiences from different periods - the innocence of youth, the maturity of marriage, and the gravitas of bearing a family legacy. This gown seems to give different impressions. At the same time, the designer gave it a great name. She felt that if Yan Xi's life were to be defined in one line, it would be: tranquility always lies beyond turmoil. So the gown is also named 'Seeing Spring Mountain'.\"","As Shu Yi slowly elaborated, the reporters and audience listened with great interest. Wang Ming was also very happy. With such a name, the gown would draw more anticipation for the drama.","The time had already exceeded 10 minutes, and Shen Yin started to worry. Could the dream have been false? Inaccurate?","Shu Yi bent down to bow, when suddenly there was a sound from below the stage. Shen Yin immediately looked towards the lighting equipment. The lighting rig was crashing down towards Shu Yi. Shu Yi did not notice at all, let alone dodge it. Time was tight. Shen Yin strode forward and kicked off the ground, kicking the rig to the right side of the stage where no one was standing, so as to not hurt anyone.","Now only Shen Yin and Shu Yi remained on the stage.","Seeing the stage about to collapse, the reporters also retreated backwards. Shu Yi was still wearing high heels, although the stage wasn't high, it was still dangerous as it was collapsing inwards from all sides. Shu Yi would not have been able to run off.","Although Shen Yin had not mastered lightness skill, it was still easy for her to get out. She grasped Shu Yi tightly by the waist with one hand, leapt upwards, then borrowed the momentum to land on the stage and leapt off in one smooth movement. The two of them landed safely on flat ground below."]},{"number":52,"title":"Chapter 52: Accident","paragraphs":["Shu Yi had not yet recovered, but the reporter had taken a photo of the scene that had just transpired. What was impressive was not only Shen Yin's action of steadily catching Shu Yi after she had fallen from the stage. There were also those few seconds when Shu Yi was suspended in midair, her dress billowing in the wind, looking like a fairy. Everyone present had seen it clearly. This was an unexpected accident, without any preparation, safety wires or anything. The two people who should have fallen into the hole in the stage were now standing perfectly fine before them, as if they had flown over.","When he saw the stage collapse, Wang Ming had taken out his phone, preparing to dial 120. But the outcome exceeded his expectations.","It was as if time had stopped; the atmosphere at the scene was exceptionally quiet.","Shu Yi did not have time to react to any of this, but she seemed to understand why Shen Yin had changed into this outfit.","After the initial panic, Wang Ming contacted the staff to deal with the stage. The host immediately went to the front to control the situation. \"Dear friends, there has been some accident on site. Today's press conference must come to an end now. Again, thanks to all the media and friends who have taken time out of your busy schedule to attend this press conference. To express our gratitude, the crew has prepared some souvenirs for everyone.\"","Backstage in the dressing room, Shu Yi looked at the plain-clothed Shen Yin and asked, \"Did you know beforehand that I would be in danger today?\"","Shen Yin smiled. \"Yes, guess how I knew?\"","Shu Yi paced back and forth in front of Shen Yin. Her right index finger on her chin and her left hand supporting her left arm. She sized up Shen Yin from time to time, as if thinking hard.","Shen Yin said jokingly, \"I dreamed it.\"","\"Impossible.\" Shu Yi did not believe it at all. Shen Yin had said it, precisely because she knew Shu Yi would not believe her.","\"I was thinking, there must be many people and many things going on at the press conference. And you're my studio's spokesperson. Shouldn't I come take a look, just in case something happens to you, so I can help?\" As for this outfit, aren't I giving you more exposure and trending searches?\"","Shu Yi thought, that was true. It's just that the accident did happen in the end.","\"Are you done for today?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"No, the crew still needs me this afternoon.\" Shu Yi answered truthfully.","\"Then I'll head back first. Zhengzheng is still waiting for me at my mom's place.\" Shen Yin said, changing her clothes at the same time.","Sitting at the dressing table, Shen Yin used a makeup removal wipe to clean off all the makeup on her face, instantly revealing fair and flawless skin. She then let down her hair and put on a fisherman's hat. It seemed like she had thought of something.","\"Shu Yi, stay safe. Yan Yan, keep by Shu Yi's side at all times.\"","Shu Yi felt something was off. \"Do you mean the accident earlier may not have just been an accident?\"","\"I don't know the specifics yet. But we must guard against dangers before they arise. I guess someone will investigate.\" Shen Yin was right. Xu Xiuhe had already notified Qingfeng Mingyue's person in charge earlier this morning. If something unexpected happens at the press conference for “The Legend of Yan Xi”, investigate immediately.","At this moment, Xu Xiuhe sat in the office of Heyuan Group’s CEO, reading the messages sent from Qingfeng Mingyue, deep in thought. Shen Yin’s dream had come true again. If it was a coincidence once, twice could hardly be explained away.","Xu Xiuhe seemed to have thought of something and immediately called Shen Yin. The few seconds as the call connected felt exceptionally long to him.","\"Hi, what's up?\" Shen Yin answered.","\"You okay?\" Xu Xiuhe only knew that Shen Yin had gone to the press conference, nothing else.","\"I'm fine. On my way to Yuelan Residence now.\" Shen Yin spoke on the phone while driving.","\"Don't ever tell others about the dream thing, including Shu Yi.\" Xu Xiuhe reminded.","\"Got it. I was just joking about it with Shu Yi earlier. She absolutely didn't believe me. Thank you for having such faith in me.\" Shen Yin did not want to get sentimental, but having someone who unconditionally trusted and supported you felt truly special.","\"Alright, take care and drive slow. No need to cook when you get back at noon. I'll ask Chen Siming to deliver food to you.\"","\"No need. Do you think my mom won't ask me to stay for lunch this late into the day? \" Shen Yin felt Fang Yue really loved her, no, she should say, Fang Yue really loved the original owner. Since the original was no longer around, she would enjoy this love on her behalf.","\"Okay, drive slowly.\" Xu Xiuhe still felt uneasy.","After hanging up, Shen Yin obediently followed Xu Xiuhe’s advice by slowing down and observing traffic rules.","On his news feed, Xu Xiuhe saw a video of a woman in black, wearing sunglasses and a mask, saving Shu Yi from the collapsed stage. Her movements were agile. Others could not recognize her as Shen Yin, but Xu Xiuhe knew with one glance—he had witnessed Shen Yin’s skills before. What surprised him was how strong she was, able to lift and leap with Shu Yi in her arms.","The comments below were diverse. Some praised Shu Yi’s beauty, some the stunning dress.","Upon seeing the dress, Xu Xiuhe called Liu Bo again. \"Buy hot searches for Yunyin Studio, target top 5.\"","The observant netizens had dug up the previous video of when Shu Yi trended.","[This is the same person right, mad skills.]","[Should be a bodyguard. The previous video was too far to see her face clearly, but you can in this one.]","[She's wearing sunglasses and a mask, still can’t see clearly.]","[Who cares, must be a bodyguard dressed like that.]","[So cool. This lady bodyguard trained at Shaolin Temple? Carrying my goddess and jumping so far.]","[With such a capable bodyguard, I can rest easy about my lady goose.]","It worked. Shu Yi trended again, bringing Yunyin Studio, “The Legend of Yan Xi”, the dress, and female bodyguard along. The top 5 trending searches were all related to Shu Yi.","Upon seeing these topics trending, Chang Zhiyuan called Shu Yi at once.","\"Not scared, are you? The one carrying you was Shen Yin?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"I’ll arrange two more bodyguards for you next. You’re famous now, top 5 searches related to you. Must be some envious ones out there.\"","\"Thanks for the arrangement.\"","No word of thanks for him? The more Chang Zhiyuan thought about it, the more annoyed he felt. He was the one who had arranged the bodyguards, yet she did not thank him?","Shu Yi did not care what Chang Zhiyuan thought. Hanging up, she opened Weibo. It was true, all related to her. So was she popular now? That was quick.","Shen Yin also received many calls from excited assistants at the studio, updating her about the influx of orders.","After lunch, Fang Yue still couldn’t bear for Zhengzheng to leave and persuaded Shen Yin to stay and play a while longer.","Shen Yin wanted to as well, but the studio was really busy. She also wanted Zhengzheng by her side to care for him anytime. Yet she aspired to be capable and contribute. What should she do?"]},{"number":53,"title":"Chapter 53: Ideals and Hopes","paragraphs":["\"Mom, I'm a bit busy with work, I may have to leave soon.\"","\"Why don't we hire more people. If it really doesn't work, we'll close the studio.\" Fang Yue persuaded.","Shen Yin had thought about this issue before. At Dasheng, apart from learning music, chess, calligraphy and painting, she had nothing else to do. She was pampered at her maternal grandfather's house, and was a young lady at the Xiangfu. She didn't need to worry about anything.","It was precisely because of this that when she encountered things, she would be so passive, and even resorted to schemes to seek help from her father.","The feeling of passivity was too painful. Coming here, she was still very passive. Fortunately, in this era, women could have many choices.","She was not short of money now, but that did not mean she would not lack it in the future. An ounce of prevention is worth a pound of cure. She must be independent and have her own career and her own assets.","\"Mom, I feel like the studio is a spiritual support for me. Life is not just about food and shelter, but also about ideals and hopes. I'm only 24 years old now. I don't want to just settle for the status quo. Maybe in 10 years, I'll be very satisfied with my current life, but right now, I just want to have a career of my own. When people mention the name Shen Yin, I don't want them to only think of me as a rich young lady of the Shen family, a wife of a prominent family and other labels like that. I don't know what the future will be like, but I know what I want now. Of course, I think I'm luckier than most people. I have your support and help, so I'm even less likely to give up. If one day, Xu Xiuhe and I get divorced, I hope that I have the ability to get full custody of Xu Yunzheng .\"","When Fang Yue heard Shen Yin say such things, she really felt that her daughter had grown up. She was over fifty years old herself, and had never thought about such complicated things.","\"Yinyin, your thinking is very mature. It's good to have dreams. Whatever you do, your mother will support you, but don't think too much. I see your relationship with Xiuhe now is quite good. I can see that Xiuhe is a good man. Let me tell you, my judgment of people is very accurate.\"","\"Don't look at your dad for having traditional and conservative stubborn thoughts, he's actually not a bad person. People say that when a man has money he turns bad. I see it depends on the person. I've accompanied your dad from when we had no money to where we are today. I understand him. After so many years, he hasn't done anything to betray me, although the things he did to you were indeed too much. But you have to believe that he really wanted the best for you. When he chose Xiuhe at the time, he also considered it from many aspects.\"","\"Okay, thank you Mom.\" What Shen Tianzheng did to the original owner was indeed too much, but compared to her father in Dasheng, Shen Tianzheng was much better. Shen Tianzheng would occasionally show regretful looks when facing her, which made Shen Yin very embarrassed because she was not the original owner after all.","\"Yinyin, what do you think, shall I go to work with you? Anyway, your dad and brother are at the company every day, and I feel very bored at home by myself. I'll go to the small building with you and help you take care of Yunzheng, okay?\"","Shen Yin was somewhat moved, her eyes brimming with tears. With just a blink, the tears would flow out. So this is what it feels like to have a mother. Shen Yin suddenly felt very lucky. She didn't say too much, but walked over to Fang Yue and hugged her, whispering in Fang Yue's ear, \"Mom, you're so nice.\"","With this gesture, the mother and daughter's feelings deepened. Fang Yue wiped Shen Yin's face and said, \"You're a mother now, still shedding tears. Look at Yunzheng, he's watching cartoons on the sofa without shedding a tear.\"","Hearing this, Shen Yin let out a \"pfft\" laugh and turned to look at Yunzheng. The little darling was so well behaved, watching the cartoon intently without making any fuss.","\"Then Mom, I have to go back for today. If you miss Yunzheng in the future, just go to the small building. I'll always be there.\"","\"Then I'll go see my girl and grandson every day.\" Fang Yue smiled very kindly.","\"Say goodbye to Grandma, Yunzheng. We're going back.\" Shen Yin picked up Yunzheng and waved his little hand with hers.","\"Bye Grandma.\"","\"Bye Yunzheng.\"","Shen Yin drove off, but didn't go home. Instead she drove to her studio at the Qinghe Small Building. There was still a pile of work waiting for her to deal with.","Chen Nuan and Li Huanhuan were busy in the studio. When they saw Shen Yin come in, they said, \"Boss, so many orders.\"","\"Good job, work hard. Send me the requirements, sizes and measurements of the orders. I'll give you a raise next month.\" Shen Yin's tone was gentle.","Carrying Yunzheng upstairs after that, Chen Nuan and Li Huanhuan's faces were filled with joy. They didn't mishear just now, did they? The boss was actually going to give them a raise. They already had quite a high salary of over 10,000 per month, plus lodging provided. Such treatment was beyond what they had ever imagined.","Passing by the second floor, Shen Yin went in to see the two clothing workers as well.","\"Jiang Meiyan, make the stitches here a little closer together.\" Holding Yunzheng in one hand, Shen Yin pointed at the work-in-progress in Jiang Meiyan's hand with the other.","\"Boss, take a look at mine.\" Fu Xingqi next to her showed Shen Yin the dress she was working in.","\"Yours looks good, keep up the good work. It may get a little tough over the next period.\" Shen Yin's tone was gentle.","\"Thank you Boss!\"","Shen Yin smiled, and went upstairs with Yunzheng. Sitting in front of the computer, she sorted out the order information Chen Nuan and Li Huanhuan had sent over, a total of 12 dress orders. Even if she drew non-stop, it would take her a week to draw out all the design drawings for the 12 dresses.","After roughly planning the follow-up work schedule, Shen Yin sketched a little more before stopping. Looking up, it was already quite late outside.","\"Mommy, need to pee.\" Yunzheng stood up from the carpet and looked at Shen Yin.","\"Okay, mommy will take you to the bathroom.\"","While taking off Yunzheng's pants, Shen Yin praised, \"Yunzheng, great job, another day without needing diapers.\"","\"Great, Yunzheng.\" Xu Yunzheng clapped his little hands after being praised.","Carrying Yunzheng, Shen Yin bid Chen Nuan and the others goodbye, then left with Yunzheng to go home.","On the way back, the setting sun cast a pink glow over the horizon, bathing the entire city in a particularly gentle hue under the pink shading.","The untimely ringing of the phone broke this beautiful scene.","\"Hello, this is Xu Xiuhe.\"","Shen Yin didn't get to check the screen before hearing Xu Xiuhe announce himself. Thinking that Xu Xiuhe had something to tell her, she said,","\"I'm driving home with Yunzheng. What's the matter? Are you home yet?\"","\"Not yet, I'll be home soon too. Nothing really, we'll talk when you get home.\" Considering he shouldn't be distracted while driving, Xu Xiuhe hung up.","Shen Yin was puzzled. What was the point of calling for nothing? Phone bills don't grow on trees."]},{"number":54,"title":"Chapter 54: Survey Results","paragraphs":["When Shen Yin got home, she found that Xu Xiuhe had already returned, and the lights in the room were all on.","Shen Yin was holding Zhengzheng and was about to open the door when Xu Xiuhe opened it from the inside first.","\"The investigation results are out. It was indeed man-made.\" Xu Xiuhe took Zhengzheng from Shen Yin's arms.","\"Let Zhengzheng play in the living room first.\" Shen Yin walked towards the kitchen. Xu Xiuhe understood that although Zhengzheng was still young, it would be better if he didn't hear about these bad things.","In the open kitchen, Shen Yin poked her head out to look at Zhengzheng in the living room while asking Xu Xiuhe about the investigation results.","\"The monitoring last night showed that someone had loosened all the screws fixing the stage. This morning when Shu Yi got on stage, someone hid under the stage, removed some screws, and then crawled out from behind. It looks like the same person. The number and position of screws removed were precalculated, so the stage collapsed towards the middle and the spotlight fell towards the middle.\"","\"So where is this person now?\"","\"At the police station. He took all the responsibility and said he wanted to destroy something he couldn't obtain.\"","\"This person is a pervert, right?\"","\"Probably not. Why didn't you let me stop this accident from happening last night?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"First, I wanted to confirm again whether what I dreamed would really happen. Second, I didn't want to alert the enemy. But now it seems it would have been better to stop it last night. However, if we had stopped it last night, we wouldn't know what would have happened instead.\" Shen Yin said.","\"He's not a pervert. Someone is behind him, he's just acting tough.\" Xu Xiuhe said.","While Shen Yin was cooking, she kept thinking about the person behind this. Her intuition had always been very accurate. If it was Gu Mengmeng, she felt very sorry for Shu Yi. It was because of her that Shu Yi offended Gu Mengmeng.","What they didn't know was that Chang Zhiyuan had already investigated and found that although there was no evidence, he could still blacklist Gu Mengmeng across the entire Internet over the argument she had with them at the studio.","Xu Xiuhe was washing vegetables at the sink. The sound of running water drowned out the knock at the door. Shen Yin was chopping vegetables and didn't hear it either. Zhengzheng in the living room was the one who heard the knock and got up, toddling towards the door on his little legs.","\"Zhengzheng, what are you going to do?\" Shen Yin noticed Zhengzheng running to the door and called out to stop him, putting down the knife in her hand.","Xu Xiuhe turned off the faucet. Only then did he hear the knock at the door. He put down the vegetables in his hands and picked up a nearby dry towel to wipe his hands, saying, \"Someone's knocking. I'll go open the door.\"","\"Good evening!\" Chang Zhiyuan poked his head in.","\"Why have you come again?\" Xu Xiuhe was already used to Chang Zhiyuan coming over to mooch dinner from time to time.","Chang Zhiyuan gave a mischievous grin. \"You go in first.\"","Xu Xiuhe thought Chang Zhiyuan was talking to him. He reluctantly moved back and said unwillingly, \"Just here to mooch food but still so demanding.\" After speaking, he picked up Zhengzheng and went into the living room.","\"I didn't mean you. I was talking to Shu Yi.\" Chang Zhiyuan turned his head.","Shu Yi was speechless standing outside the door. Chang Zhiyuan wanted to come and mooch dinner and insisted on dragging her along when she didn't want to appear with him at all. But Chang Zhiyuan kept threatening her.","Shu Yi was even more reluctant than Xu Xiuhe. \"Move aside.\"","Chang Zhiyuan's eyes widened in anger. Shu Yi was his boss! How dare she talk to him like that? It was simply outrageous. Chang Zhiyuan was very angry but had nowhere to vent it, making his expression as funny as it was ridiculous. If Xue Jingrui had been there, their WeChat sticker album would have gained another entry.","After Shu Yi entered the room, she headed straight for the kitchen.","\"Chang Zhiyuan made you come over?\" Shen Yin saw right through it with one line.","\"Yin Yin, you're so smart. But I missed you too.\" Shu Yi said coquettishly.","\"You just saw each other half a day ago. Must you be so lovey-dovey? And Shu Yi, look at your attitude towards me. Is this how an employee should behave? Can you not be so two-faced?\" Chang Zhiyuan said resentfully.","Shu Yi didn't even want to respond to Chang Zhiyuan. \"How can it be the same? Yin Yin has saved me several times.\"","What she said made it so Xu Xiuhe next to her wanted to cut in but couldn't. His wife was awesome and had a fangirl. What could he do? Maybe he should remind them of his presence.","\"Shu Yi, your accident today was man-made.\"","The atmosphere suddenly became heavy as it concerned Shu Yi's safety. Chang Zhiyuan immediately became serious.","\"Let's talk about it after eating.\" Shen Yin suggested.","During the meal, the topic was brought up again.","\"So you mean the suspect has someone behind him giving orders but he refuses to expose them?\" Chang Zhiyuan's expression was unusually serious.","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe said, \"Yes, that's what it means. The person behind this was very careful and didn't leave any evidence.\"","\"Shu Yi, take bodyguards with you from now on when you go out. I'll arrange two more for you.\"","\"No need, the two I have are enough.\"","\"Anyway, pay more attention to safety these days.\" Although Xu Xiuhe was speaking to Chang Zhiyuan and Shu Yi, his eyes were looking at Shen Yin.","Shu Yi noticed this small detail in Xu Xiuhe's gaze and felt she had discovered another cp moment. This kind of implicit stuff was too sweet! She would definitely become a cp fan leader sooner or later. The cp name she secretly gave Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin with her alt account in the cp fan club was so romantic―Galaxy Couple.","Shen Yin didn't notice Xu Xiuhe looking at her as she was thinking about the Gu Mengmeng matter. After the recollection just now, she was 80% certain this was Gu Mengmeng's doing.","It looked like she would have to take some action herself these days―not only to complete some design drafts for the studio but also to find evidence. Since this all started because of her, she should be the one to resolve it.","Shen Yin couldn't sleep, watching Zhengzheng sleeping soundly. She really envied him. Children had no worries and lived so blissfully and freely.","Shen Yin lay there tossing and turning, still unable to fall asleep. She was worried she would wake Xu Xiuhe and carefully and quietly got out of bed, gently opening the door.","As soon as she took a step out and turned around, she crashed into a wall of flesh.","\"Oh my god, that hurts so bad!\" Shen Yin covered her forehead with her hand, looking completely wronged.","\"Why aren't you sleeping this late into the night?\" Shen Yin had bumped into something and her tone was unhappy.","\"I went downstairs to drink some water. I just came back up and you crashed into me when I passed by here.\" Xu Xiuhe explained why he was at Shen Yin's door. Her head had banged right into his chin. Shouldn't he be the one shouting in pain?","But a man, a gentleman, how could he easily shout in pain? Xu Xiuhe pulled Shen Yin over, putting his palm on her forehead, \"Let me see if you're badly hurt.\"","Xu Xiuhe rubbed Shen Yin's forehead with his palm, \"Does it still hurt?\""]},{"number":55,"title":"Chapter 55: Intimate Shadows","paragraphs":["It hurt. But it wasn't hit by flesh, it was bone, okay. The pain from that one just now almost brought tears to her eyes.","Xu Xiuhe's hand moved over it, massaging it some more: Do you know, the effect of force is mutual?","The lights in the lobby were not on. The light from the stairwell shone down the hallway and through to them, allowing them to see each other clearly. They were face to face, extremely close. Shen Yin looked up at him while Xu Xiuhe looked down at her. Most importantly, Shen Yin was still in Xu Xiuhe's embrace.","The faint shadows were projected onto the white wall beside them. The two shadows seemed to be locked in a tight embrace. The taller shadow bowed his head, his hand caressing the forehead of the other shadow. At first glance, they looked like a sweet pair of lovers, hugging and kissing.","Shen Yin inadvertently saw the shadow on the wall. If she were to look at the light now, she would definitely find her entire face flushed red, because she felt her cheeks were burning hot now, accompanied by the thumping of her heartbeat. Shen Yin swallowed nervously and struggled free of Xu Xiuhe's embrace in embarrassment.","\"Ahem, it was me turning around and didn't see you when I came out.\" Shen Yin said, trying to conceal her awkwardness.","\"It's my fault, I should have turned on the light.\" Xu Xiuhe flipped on the hallway light switch.","Shen Yin's first reaction was to cover her face. It was still so hot. What to do? Should she go downstairs and get an ice pack?","\"Yeah, I'm going downstairs to the kitchen for some water.\" Shen Yin told a white lie. She had a high-end water dispenser in her bedroom, so there was no need for her to go downstairs for water.","\"Let me go with you.\" Xu Xiuhe said and headed downstairs without waiting for Shen Yin's consent.","Shen Yin had no choice but to follow behind, still covering her face with her hand. She looked extremely well-behaved. Suddenly, Xu Xiuhe stopped in his tracks. Shen Yin was still preoccupied with her own thoughts and didn't react in time. She bumped into Xu Xiuhe again.","Only this time, Xu Xiuhe didn't feel anything, but it was disastrous for Shen Yin. She really wanted to curse at Xu Xiuhe. He was walking just fine, why did he have to stop?","\"Why did you stop again?\" Shen Yin felt very wronged.","\"I was checking if you were following.\" Xu Xiuhe looked somewhat bewildered.","This time Shen Yin bumped her nose. It must be because of her tall and prominent nose bridge that also had drawbacks. She covered her nose and glared at Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe strode up a step and scooped Shen Yin up in his arms. Shen Yin panicked and struggled, trying to get down. However, although Shen Yin was very skilled in martial arts, she was no match for the difference in strength between men and women. Moreover, Xu Xiuhe had her locked tightly in his embrace now. If she insisted on getting down, Xu Xiuhe would definitely get injured.","\"Don't move around, it'll hurt more if you fall.\" Xu Xiuhe stared at Shen Yin's nose, feeling guilty.","\"Stop looking.\"","\"It's fine, your nose isn't bleeding.\"","Xu Xiuhe carried Shen Yin to the sofa and set her down. \"Sit still.\" Xu Xiuhe got up and went into the kitchen. He poured a glass of water and brought it to Shen Yin.","Shen Yin covered her nose with one hand and her forehead with the other. She looked at Xu Xiuhe innocently. Xu Xiuhe really couldn't stand that look.","\"Does it still hurt?\" Xu Xiuhe sat down, one hand holding Shen Yin's shoulder while the other held the glass of water to her mouth to get her to drink.","Shen Yin wasn't thirsty at all. She didn't intend to really go downstairs. She just had insomnia and was afraid of disturbing Zhizhi, so she wanted to come out for a walk. Who knew she would have such bad luck, injuring one spot wasn't enough, she had to injure two places.","Shen Yin shook her head.","\"Don't want anymore? Have a little more.\" Xu Xiuhe looked at Shen Yin expectantly.","Shen Yin pretended to drink a couple more sips. Xu Xiuhe could tell Shen Yin wasn't thirsty at all, so he finally couldn't resist asking, \"Why is your face so red? Do you have a fever again?\" He put the glass down and touched Shen Yin's forehead.","\"Your forehead isn't hot.\"","Please, Shen Yin was really anxious now. Her flushed face wasn't because she was uncomfortable, it was psychological. \"Got red from the bumps.\" Shen Yin didn't even believe her own excuse.","But Xu Xiuhe actually believed it. \"I'm sorry.\"","He rarely apologized to others. The words 'I'm sorry' hadn't been uttered for a long time.","Seeing that he was quite sincere, Shen Yin didn't dwell on it too much.","\"I actually just had insomnia.\" Shen Yin spoke up.","Xu Xiuhe looked intently at Shen Yin, waiting for her to continue. Why did she have insomnia? But Shen Yin didn't say anything else. She just sat there quietly.","\"Why did you have insomnia?\" Xu Xiuhe finally couldn't hold back and asked.","\"I don't know why these bizarre things keep happening to me.\"","Xu Xiuhe thought Shen Yin was talking about her prophetic dreams. But actually, Shen Yin knew she wanted to express more than just the dreams. Even more bizarre was that after she came here, she thought her original world was ancient times, namely the Song dynasty. Until recently, after looking through various materials, she realized the Song dynasty was not Great Prosperity. These two were of the same time period and had extremely similar lifestyles and customs. But there were no records of Great Prosperity in today's history. It was clearly the same time period, so why was there no mention of it? And most crucially, the Tang and Five Dynasties came before the Song dynasty.","Shen Yin had previously thought she had just crossed through time. But now it seemed it wasn't that simple. Perhaps it was a parallel world?","\"Sometimes things happen that we can't figure out or explain scientifically. But since it happened, it means this matter has come upon you. Everything and everyone in this world, all sorts of relationships, are intricately intertwined and ever-changing. We can't possibly understand everything clearly, so don't think too much about it. In the end, didn't the bizarre things you encountered help you? You avoided a car accident and other mishaps. There was no harm, and perhaps it's your superpower.\" This was the longest Xu Xiuhe had spoken as he tried to reassure Shen Yin.","Although what Xu Xiuhe said seemed different from what Shen Yin was thinking, she suddenly felt he made a lot of sense. She had no idea why she came here, but after coming here, she did continue living, made friends, received a mother's love, and became skilled in many abilities. Her dreams were also helping her. Xu Xiuhe wasn't unkind to her either. So why was she feeling anxious and unable to sleep? Take one step at a time. Next, she had to cheer up and work hard to protect her loved ones and friends.","\"I feel Shu Yi's accident may have been orchestrated by Gu Mengmeng.\" Shen Yin opened up. There were some things that Xu Xiuhe knowing could make handling easier.","\"Gu Mengmeng?\" Xu Xiuhe asked back.","\"She's a small-time celebrity, not as famous as Shu Yi, and has a bad temper.\" Shen Yin told Xu Xiuhe everything she knew about Gu Mengmeng.","Xu Xiuhe took note of this name and urged, \"I'll handle it. Don't take any rash actions. Knowing martial arts doesn't mean you should show off your strength. Be careful when going out. Let me know right away if you have any nightmares again.\"","Xu Xiuhe nagged on and on. When he lowered his head, he saw Shen Yin was leaning on his shoulder, fast asleep. Was she so at ease with him?","Xu Xiuhe picked Shen Yin up. The woman in his arms was so slender yet seemed to possess some mysterious power that drew him in."]},{"number":56,"title":"Chapter 56: Dislocated Jaw","paragraphs":["Xu Xiuhe's actions were very gentle, afraid of waking Shen Yin up. He sent Shen Yin back to her room, bent down and put Shen Yin on the bed. Looking at the big one and the small one sleeping soundly on the bed, Xu Xiuhe felt very satisfied. Recalling again that night at Qinghe Xiaolou, when he was also lying on the bed, Xu Xiuhe looked at them for a good while before leaving. He had hugged her already, so did Shen Yin know his feelings? What were Shen Yin's feelings towards him? The more he thought about it, the more upset he became. The more he thought about it, the more complicated things became. Xu Xiuhe couldn't sleep that night, thinking about how he could pursue Shen Yin.","So early in the morning, Xu Xiuhe got up early, oh no, it should be said that he hadn't slept well all night. Xu Xiuhe strode into the kitchen. Shen Yin hadn't woken up yet, so he would make breakfast first.","When Shen Yin came downstairs holding Zhengzheng, she was no longer surprised to see Xu Xiuhe making breakfast in the kitchen. After all, he had done it several times before.","\"Zhengzheng, let's eat breakfast, okay?\" Shen Yin said to Zhengzheng.","Xu Xiuhe turned his head, \"You're up, breakfast is ready, sit down first.\"","Shen Yin nodded, observed Xu Xiuhe today, and found that he was a little different today. When Xu Xiuhe brought the sandwiches to the dining table, Zhengzheng grabbed Xu Xiuhe's apron.","Only then did Shen Yin realize what was different. Xu Xiuhe was wearing her apron, a milk green apron. Worn on Xu Xiuhe's body, it looked small and out of place. Xu Xiuhe's usual clothes were dark colored, either black or gray, except for the white shirt inside.","\"You look quite good wearing this apron,\" Shen Yin said with a smile. Actually, she wanted to say that Xu Xiuhe wearing this apron looked so funny, but she euphemized it a bit so as not to hurt Xu Xiuhe's self-esteem.","\"Really?\" Xu Xiuhe took it seriously.","\"Yes, really. I think you can try other colors in the future. People can't just wear black, gray and white all the time,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Okay.\"","\"Let's eat first. After the meal, I'll take you to the studio.\" Xu Xiuhe also sat down.","\"No need, I can go by myself,\" Shen Yin's first reaction was to refuse.","\"It's okay, I have something to do over there in the afternoon, so I'll pick you up later. Let's just do it this way,\" Xu Xiuhe said. After he said this, Shen Yin couldn't refuse again. She always felt that Xu Xiuhe was a little strange today.","\"How did I get upstairs last night?\" Shen Yin's expression was a little nervous, and her tone was probing.","\"You fell asleep and climbed up by yourself sleepwalking,\" Xu Xiuhe didn't know where he got the interest to tease Shen Yin.","Shen Yin was eating a sandwich. Hearing this, her actions paused. She only remembered that her forehead and nose hurt last night, and she was in a bad mood. Xu Xiuhe said a long string of words to comfort her, and then she seemed to have fallen asleep.","\"Really? Do I really have a sleepwalking disorder?\" Shen Yin couldn't believe it. This was too unbelievable. The original owner had depression. She didn't realize there was also a sleepwalking disorder!","Seeing Shen Yin's self-doubting expression, Xu Xiuhe thought it was so cute. Alright, the purpose was achieved, so he wouldn't tease Shen Yin anymore. \"How did you get downstairs last night?\"","Hearing this, Shen Yin recalled that her nose had hit Xu Xiuhe's back last night, and she didn't want to lift her head instantly.","Seeing Shen Yin lowered her head with her face all red, Xu Xiuhe slightly hooked the corner of his mouth. This was shyness, right? Since it was shyness, it meant that Shen Yin didn't have absolutely no feelings for him.","Xu Xiuhe was in a great mood. \"Clean up and get ready to leave.\"","When Xu Xiuhe arrived at He Yuan Group, even his pace was brisk. He even felt that the weather today was better than usual, the breeze was not sultry, and the sunshine was just right.","\"Good morning, President,\" the front desk lady greeted Xu Xiuhe as usual when she saw him.","Only this time Xu Xiuhe was quite different from usual. \"Good morning,\" Xu Xiuhe nodded in response. He didn't seem to notice that he was not normal, and walked to the elevator by himself, his expression was almost whistling.","The front desk lady who was at the forefront of gossip couldn’t help but share this news. She took out her phone and started typing.","[Family, big news, the president is in a good mood today!]","[???]","[I want to know, the president's face is unchanged for thousands of years. How did you see it?]","[Family, you have to believe me, I saw it with my own eyes. Usually when I say hello, the president doesn't even turn his head and just responds with an \"um\", but today...]","[What happened today? Don't stop halfway, you're killing me!]","[I didn't stop halfway. Liu, the assistant just went up. I said hello, and today, the president replied \"Good morning\" to me. I was shocked.] The front desk lady tried her best to explain and prove that what she said was true.","[And it seems like he smiled, but I'm not sure ha]","Liu Bo opened his phone and saw this message. He laughed. No way, he had to confirm it.","But today, why did the president arrive earlier than him? Would he get scolded if he went in?","Liu Bo had just walked into Xu Xiuhe's office when he saw Xu Xiuhe holding a cell phone in one hand and stroking his chin with the other. Could it be that he was fascinated by his own beauty and admiring himself?","\"Ahem, President, why do you keep stroking your chin?\"","\"It hurts a little.\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"How can the chin hurt? Did it dislocate? President, I saw a news story earlier that someone's chin hurt, went to see the doctor, and the doctor said it was dislocated. In the end, the doctor snapped it back into place.\" Liu Bo said while gesturing the action of snapping a chin back into place. To prove that what he said was evidenced, he even took out his phone to search for the news and show Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe took a look and instantly felt the need to change assistants. That was obviously called dislocation when the mouth couldn't close, which of his eyes saw that he couldn't close his mouth?","\"Do you want to quit? Can you take a closer look at the news carefully?\" Xu Xiuhe looked at Liu Bo helplessly.","Liu Bo looked at the news again. It was about a woman who laughed so hard that her chin dislocated and she couldn't close her mouth. He instantly felt that the president was really in a good mood today, at least he didn't tell him to get lost.","Liu Bo smiled awkwardly and said, \"Then it's nothing, I'll go out.\"","Xu Xiuhe seemed to not have heard it at all, and continued to look at his phone, stroking his chin. When Liu Bo turned around to close the door, he took another look at Xu Xiuhe.","He felt that the president had gone crazy, and dislocating his chin was probably not far off, he was actually smiling at his phone.","Liu Bo tidied up his clothes and walked to the office area of the other assistants, saying, \"The president is indeed in a good mood today. Later, the plans we did before can be taken out.\"","When the assistants submitted the plans, they were all cautious, for fear that the president would scold them if they didn't do well. So every time they handed in the plans, they would ask Liu Bo to go instead of going themselves. But Liu Bo couldn't go for them every time either.","Hearing this information, the assistants all took out the plans they had made. Not going now would be foolish."]},{"number":57,"title":"Chapter 57: The Colors of the Rainbow","paragraphs":["\"Liu Bo, come in,\" Xu Xiuhe called Liu's assistant.","\"What color do you think suits me?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Damn, this is a question he can't answer. He's not an art student.","\"Boss, I need to use the restroom urgently. Can I go first?\"","Xu Xiuhe raised an eyebrow and said, \"You have 10 minutes. I expect an answer when you return.\"","Liu Bo rushed into the bathroom, walking and running at the same time.","The assistants in the office area had never seen Liu's assistant in such a hurry before.","\"Do you think Liu's assistant is also in the dominant and Yuan Group chat?\"","\"Impossible. We would have revealed too much information.\"","\"What information?\"","\"Sister, you forgot so quickly. You used to be the leader of Liu's assistant and the boss's couple, right?\" Yang Mo reminded.","\"Oh, that was in the past. Now I'm obsessed with the Silver River couple,\" Qiu Yiyi said.","\"Wait, Liu's assistant just said the boss's mood is indeed good. What does 'indeed' mean?\"","\"Damn, that's scary to think about, sisters.\"","The office area suddenly quieted down.","\"Check the group messages,\" Yang Mo reminded.","In the chat group of the Dominant and Yuan Group, a person named \"Whirlwind Little Prince\" sent a message.","\"[Family, I need your help. What color do you think suits the boss?]\"","\"Yellow!\"","\"Ahem, let's be serious.\"","\"The boss usually wears black, gray, and white clothes, giving off a cold and aloof vibe.\"","\"Oops, I misspoke, family. It's the arrogant and unyielding boss, not cold and aloof. Slip of the tongue.\"","\"Nonsense, he has children. How can he be cold and aloof?\"","\"Hey, do you think the boss is amazing?\"","Liu Bo looked at the discussion getting farther and farther off-topic in the restroom and started to panic. He could see that 10 minutes were almost up.","\"[Family, let's get back on track. What color suits him?]\"","\"Pink. I think that face with pink is absolutely adorable in contrast.\"","\"Red?\"","\"Blue is suitable, like a noble prince.\"","\"Why don't you mention green? He's a melancholic prince too.\"","Messages with all kinds of reasons and weird ideas kept pouring in.","The mobile phone rang on time, and Liu Bo answered the call.","\"10 minutes are up.\"","\"Okay, I'm coming, boss,\" Liu Bo hung up the phone and rushed into the boss's office. His footsteps were a bit loud, and his movements were exaggerated, attracting the attention of other employees who stopped their work.","Yang Mo spoke up, \"What's wrong with Liu's assistant today, so flustered.\"","\"Could he have provoked the boss? Is the boss still in a good mood? Should I go in and submit my proposal?\" Xiao Li'er asked.","\"Let's wait and see.\"","Inside the boss's office, Xu Xiuhe sat on the chair beside the desk, staring at Liu Bo with unwavering eyes. Liu Bo's current state of mind was even more nervous than defending his thesis during his postgraduate studies.","\"What color suits me?\"","\"Blue.\"","\"Tell me the reason,\" Xu Xiuhe's tone was calm, and it was hard to tell his emotions.","\"Blue looks noble,\" Liu Bo said.","\"Besides noble?\"","Xu Xiuhe continued to ask.","Liu Bo was completely at a loss. What kind of bizarre problem was this? Was this something a personal assistant should be dealing with? All he saw in the group chat was someone mentioning the color blue as being noble, but he had no idea about anything else. He discreetly glanced at his phone and only saw the word \"romantic.\" So he said, \"Blue is the color of romance.\"","\"What other colors?\"","\"Green as well.\"","\"Why?\"","\"Green gives a melancholic vibe.\" Liu Bo replied according to the answers given in the group.","\"Is melancholy a good word?\" Xu Xiuhe asked again.","Liu Bo was frightened and lowered his head once again, sneaking another look at his phone, hoping to find a reliable answer from the group.","\"Pass me your phone.\"","At this point, Liu Bo wasn't just shocked; he felt like his life was over.","Xu Xiuhe stood up and walked over to Liu Bo. He took the phone from Liu Bo's hand, and the group message from \"Chengba and Yuan Group\" kept coming in without stopping.","\"Chengba and Yuan Group?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Sir, that's just the name of the group.\"","Xu Xiuhe didn't pay attention to what Liu Bo said. His focus was entirely on the group message.","Xu Xiuhe scrolled through the messages and saw the one Liu Bo asked, \"What color do you think suits the CEO?\"","Xu Xiuhe became even more interested. He wanted to see what color would suit him. It would have been better not to look at all because the moment he did, his expression turned sour. Was he aloof?","And what were all these colors? They were asked about a color that would suit him, and the answers were red, orange, yellow, green, cyan, blue, and purple. It was like they were trying to piece together a rainbow.","\"Do I look like a rainbow?\"","Damn, what a bizarre question. Liu Bo was already numb and quickly replied, \"No, no, CEO, you definitely don't look like a rainbow.\"","Liu Bo was scared. Could it be that Xu Xiuhe saw the messages they sent earlier? He couldn't engage in a romantic relationship with the CEO. He was definitely straight and had normal sexual preferences.","\"Not like a rainbow? You managed to come up with all seven colors for me.\"","What? Liu Bo let out a sigh of relief. Thankfully, he had forgotten that the CEO was a workaholic and probably didn't know the other meaning of a rainbow. The CEO was purely talking about colors.","Xu Xiuhe continued scrolling, and he asked, \"Who sent this message?\"","Liu Bo had just breathed a sigh of relief, but now he was startled again. He had discreetly looked at his phone earlier and saw the word \"romantic,\" but it wasn't about colors.","Liu Bo checked the ID and replied, \"It should be Xiao Li'er from the Assistant Group.\"","\"Bring her in.\"","Liu Bo's inner turmoil at this moment could not be described. Could it be that the CEO wanted to create trouble for Xiao Li'er? Liu Bo was about to turn around and call Xiao Li'er when Xu Xiuhe spoke again.","\"Add me to this group.\"","Liu Bo was sweating. He now felt like he was the eternal sinner in the Chengba and Yuan Group chat.","\"CEO, I used my secondary account to join the group. My secondary account doesn't have you as a friend.\" Liu Bo tried to resist one last time, hoping to prevent Xu Xiuhe from joining the group.","\"It's alright, you can create a small account for me and then add me as a friend.\" Xu Xiuhe touched his chin again, whether he was thinking just now or because his chin was hurting.","Having failed to struggle free, Liu Bo left and approached Xiao Li'er with a guilty expression. He spoke softly, \"Xiao Li, the CEO is calling for you.\"","Xiao Li'er froze in place, unable to believe it. She looked left and right, realizing that Yang Mo and the others were also unaware.","\"Um, Assistant Liu, what does the CEO want with me?\" Xiao Li'er's words became somewhat unclear.","Assistant Liu was the supervisor of these assistants, and they usually had a good relationship. The other assistants also looked at Liu Bo, anticipating his answer.","\"Xiao Li, if you're ever out of a job, I'll marry you.\" Liu Bo couldn't fully conceal his remorse, but his words were particularly sincere."]},{"number":58,"title":"Chapter 58: What's Romantic","paragraphs":["Xiao Li'er was nearly frightened to tears upon hearing those words. She hadn't even brought in her proposal yet, but she was already being summoned. And what did Liu Bo mean by saying that if she loses her job, he would marry her?","\"Who would want you to marry me?\" Xiao Li'er said indignantly, blushing with shame.","Liu Bo knew this situation was caused by him, so he didn't dare make a sound.","When Xiao Li'er entered the office, she saw Xu Xiuhe standing with his arms folded in front of the massive floor-to-ceiling window, his back facing the desk. Upon hearing the knock, he said, \"Come in.\"","Xiao Li'er took small steps, feeling afraid as she didn't know what grave mistake she had made to warrant a personal summons from the CEO that could lead to her dismissal.","Xu Xiuhe turned around, walked to the sofa, and sat down, his weight visibly sinking into the leather couch.","Xiao Li'er was extremely nervous, her head lowered as she didn't dare look up. Her hands were tightly clenched together, her nails digging into her palms, yet she felt no pain.","\"Am I not romantic enough?\" Xu Xiuhe asked flatly, deliberately feigning indifference.","Upon hearing this, Xiao Li'er's mind went blank. Her high heels could no longer support her standing, and her legs trembled as she dared not speak.","\"You can sit down,\" Xu Xiuhe said, pointing to the sofa opposite him.","\"No, no,\" Xiao Li'er hurriedly waved her hands, her voice quivering.","\"Don't be nervous, just sit down,\" Xu Xiuhe said after taking a sip of water.","Xiao Li'er was still afraid, wondering if this was a final perk before being fired.","\"Answer the question from earlier - am I not romantic enough?\" Xu Xiuhe pressed, eager to know the answer.","After sitting down, Xiao Li'er finally regained her composure. Why would the CEO ask her this question? Suddenly, it dawned on her - the message she had sent.","\"I didn't mean it, Mr. CEO,\" Xiao Li'er said, no longer questioning how Xu Xiuhe knew about her message. She only wanted to explain, for talking behind her top boss's back and getting caught was truly a tragic event. She must not have read her horoscope before leaving home that morning.","\"You and Liu Bo are quite alike. Don't be nervous, just answer honestly. I don't hold grudges,\" Xu Xiuhe lied smoothly. If Chang Zhiyuan were present, he would have laughed his teeth out - a fine example of not holding grudges, when Xu Xiuhe gave him the cold shoulder for a month after Chang got him drunk at their wedding.","\"Here's what we'll do - tell me why I'm not romantic.\"","\"If I speak the truth...\"","\"Tell me.\"","\"In TV shows and novels, tyrannical CEOs would prepare all sorts of surprises for their wives, like placing citywide advertisements to publicly declare their love. Grand, public gestures. Our son is already two years old, but we didn't even know what the Madam looked like before.\"","Xiao Li'er spoke softly, occasionally glancing at Xu Xiuhe to see if he was angry.","Xu Xiuhe fell into contemplation. Could he use those methods? Wouldn't placing ads scare Shen Yin away when he hasn't even won her over yet?","\"So you're saying I should do things that would make her feel happy and joyful?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Then what should I do first?\"","\"You could buy her clothes, handbags, jewelry, and so on.\"","\"We already purchase the latest items every month at home,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Xiao Li'er felt like she was sitting on pins and needles, at a loss for words. Indeed, she didn't understand the world of the wealthy. Why did she send that message saying the CEO wasn't romantic enough? No, the bigger question was how the CEO found out she sent it.","\"Mr. CEO, it's not the same as you accompanying the Madam to shop for those things yourself.\"","\"Good, go draft a proposal on how to be romantic. If it's well done, you'll get a raise.\"","Xiao Li'er could hardly believe her ears. Didn't Liu Bo say she would be fired? But the next statement plunged her back into despair.","\"If it's not done well, we'll settle all new and old scores - you can leave the company.\"","Upon hearing this, Xiao Li'er immediately resolved herself, \"Mr. CEO, I will do my best.\" After leaving the office, she let out a deep breath at the entrance. She never wanted to experience that kind of oppressive atmosphere again in her life.","The office assistants, including Liu Bo, were all paying close attention. Seeing Xiao Li'er come out, they immediately asked what had happened.","Yang Mo was the first to speak, \"Xiao Li'er, what's going on?\"","\"The CEO is in our 'Conquer and Distant Group' chat room.\"","Instantly, the air froze again. The other assistants opened their phones to see a new person had joined the group. Yang Mo asked unnaturally, \"It couldn't be this, could it?\"","Xiao Li'er shook her head. The person had just joined, but the CEO had summoned her 20 minutes earlier.","Liu Bo sighed beside them, not only had the CEO just joined, but he had also been using a small account in the group for half a year.","\"Wait,\" Xiao Li'er gave Yang Mo and the other assistants a look, indicating that Liu Bo was still there.","\"Assistant Liu, were you in the 'Conquer and Distant Group' chat from the beginning?\" Yang Mo questioned him.","\"Stop, stop, it was my fault. I didn't mean to expose it.\" Liu Bo had no choice but to surrender and explain everything.","Xiao Li'er didn't hear anything else except that Liu Bo had told the CEO about her \"The CEO isn't romantic enough\" message. If looks could kill, Liu Bo would have been slain by Xiao Li'er several times over.","\"Xiao Li'er, so what's your situation now?\" Yang Mo asked cautiously.","\"I have to draft a proposal on how the CEO can be romantic,\" Xiao Li'er said dejectedly.","\"Oh my, the CEO is so adorably contradictory. I've never heard of having a proposal to learn how to be romantic. This is too funny, I can't take it anymore!\" Yang Mo roared with laughter.","\"Don't laugh, if I don't do well, I'll have to leave,\" Xiao Li'er said somberly.","The others stopped laughing, for leaving one's job was indeed a sorrowful affair.","Yang Mo spoke up, \"Assistant Liu, do your words from earlier still count? Xiao Li'er might lose her job because of you.\"","\"But she hasn't lost it yet,\" Liu Bo thought there was still hope. \"Xiao Li, let me help you with the proposal.\"","Inside the CEO's office, Xu Xiuhe recalled what Xiao Li'er had suggested - accompanying Shen Yin to shop for clothes seemed like a good idea.","With a plan in mind, he had to act swiftly. Seizing opportunities had always been Xu Xiuhe's guiding principle, whether it was starting a company or pursuing his wife.","As the sun's piercing rays gave way to the evening glow, the ever-changing western clouds caught Xu Xiuhe's gaze through the floor-to-ceiling window. He had never noticed how beautiful the office could be at this hour.","\"Assistant Liu, come in.\"","Upon receiving the call, Liu Bo hurriedly entered the office.","\"There are still a few documents left. Handle them. I'm going to pick up Zhengzheng,\" Xu Xiuhe said, grabbing his coat and car keys before leaving without turning back. What he wanted to say was, \"I'm going to pick up my wife.\""]},{"number":59,"title":"Chapter 59: Kiss","paragraphs":["Fang Yue came out of the studio and happened to meet Xu Xiuhe.","\"Xiuhe is here,\" Fang Yue asked.","\"Mom, you're here too. I've come to pick up Yin and Zheng to go home,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"Okay, it's getting late. I'll head back first. Be careful on your way home tonight,\" Fang Yue reminded them.","\"Sure, you drive slowly too when you go back.\"","\"Mm, got it. You go on up.\" Fang Yue walked towards the car shed at the back, with a smile spreading across her face. Xiuhe called her daughter Yin, meaning the two must be on good terms now. The more she thought about it, the happier she felt. As a mother, seeing her daughter happy is all she needs.","When Xu Xiuhe passed the first floor, Chen Nuan and Li Huanhuan finally saw his true appearance. Girls really are amazing—with just a glance, without saying a word, they can understand each other's thoughts.","Xu Xiuhe went up to the third floor. Zheng was still playing with the little building blocks that his grandma had bought him on the carpet. Shen Yin was sitting at the table, seriously drawing design sketches.","\"I just saw Mom heading back,\" Xu Xiuhe broke the silence.","Shen Yin looked up. \"She said yesterday that she'd come over to help me look after Zheng. I thought she was just saying it, but she really did come today.\"","\"Mm, she went out of her way. Are you done? Let's go to the mall,\" Xu Xiuhe suggested.","\"Go to the mall for what?\"","Xu Xiuhe felt a bit awkward about saying he wanted to buy her clothes, so he replied in a roundabout way, \"You said I could try out clothes in other colors, didn't you?\"","\"You really want to try?\" Shen Yin hadn't expected Xu Xiuhe to take her casual joke seriously.","\"I've never tried menswear before. Do you want to practice on me?\" Shen Yin's tone was probing. She had only done women's clothing before, but now it seemed that menswear could also be a lucrative path.","Xu Xiuhe: !! What a great opportunity. \"Sure.\"","Shen Yin picked up the tape measure from her table and said, \"Come over here, let me take your measurements.\"","Upon hearing this, Xu Xiuhe walked over to Shen Yin's table.","Shen Yin stood behind Xu Xiuhe. At over 1.8 meters tall, she had to raise her hand to be level with his shoulders. With the tape measure in her left hand and her right arm stretched out, his shoulder width was 46 centimeters—quite standard. Shen Yin made a note of it.","\"Turn around and stretch your arms out to the sides,\" Shen Yin instructed.","Xu Xiuhe obediently turned to face Shen Yin. Shen Yin picked up the tape measure to measure his chest circumference, but this position felt a bit awkward—from any angle, it looked like Xu Xiuhe had his arms open wide, waiting for an embrace.","Shen Yin's expression became a bit unnatural, but since she'd come this far, she couldn't just give up now. Xu Xiuhe could clearly feel Shen Yin's breathing.","When Shen Yin had stood behind him earlier to measure his shoulder width, he had felt her hand touch his shoulder. Wearing so little clothing in the summer, that touch of her hand on his shoulder had made him feel a ticklish sensation—he couldn't tell if it was his shoulder or his heart that was itching.","Now he understood: it wasn't his shoulder, it was his heart that itched. Xu Xiuhe lowered his head, bringing his face very close to Shen Yin's. Shen Yin slid the tape measure under one of Xu Xiuhe's arms with her left hand, then reached her right hand from the other underarm to grab the tape measure. Unable to quite reach, Shen Yin took another step forward.","Xu Xiuhe looked at this face right in front of him. If he lowered his head just a bit more, he could kiss Shen Yin's forehead. Her skin was fine and fair, without any makeup. Her lips were glossy and slightly parted.","Shen Yin raised her face a little as her right hand strained to reach, and Xu Xiuhe, looking at those lovely red lips, finally leaned down on an impulse and kissed her.","In that moment when their lips met, both of them were stunned. Shen Yin's eyes went wide, and the tape measure fell from her hand. Xu Xiuhe didn't know what had come over him to make such a bold move, but he found the soft, jelly-like feel of her lips quite nice, and wanted to deepen the kiss.","Shen Yin was completely caught off guard—how could she have expected Xu Xiuhe to do something so daring in broad daylight? In reality, she was still just a young woman who had never been this intimate with a man before.","Her instinctive reaction was to forcefully twist her right leg, using the momentum to spin and throw Xu Xiuhe over her shoulder and onto the sofa.","It was an awkward scene: Xu Xiuhe lying stunned on the sofa, his right hand touching his lips, his expression one of disbelief—he had just been shoulder-thrown!","Shen Yin stood by the sofa, awkwardly straightening her hair, pretending that nothing had happened. Yes, that's it—just keep telling herself that over and over.","The commotion had drawn Xu Yunzheng's attention from the moment Xu Xiuhe was thrown onto the sofa. He set down the building blocks and, completely unaware of what had just transpired, toddled over to the sofa with a plaintive look, saying, \"Daddy, hurt.\"","Xu Xiuhe recovered his composure, sat up, and stroked Zheng's face. \"Zheng, Daddy's not hurt.\"","\"Daddy fall down, Daddy hurt,\" Zheng persisted, reaching out to touch Xu Xiuhe's face.","\"Zheng, I'm sorry, it was Mommy's fault. Mommy was just playing a game with Daddy, he didn't fall down,\" Shen Yin explained, not knowing how much Zheng had seen. But she truly hadn't meant it—it was just an instinctive reaction, since she had never been kissed on the lips by a man before.","\"Zheng, Daddy's fine. Daddy was just playing a game with Mommy,\" Xu Xiuhe also explained. Although he had been quite embarrassingly thrown down, it did seem that he was the one at fault for kissing Shen Yin without her consent.","\"Game, Zheng want play game too!\" With that, Xu Yunzheng clumsily climbed onto the sofa and flopped down, motioning for Shen Yin to do the same.","\"The game is over, Zheng,\" Shen Yin said, not wanting to continue this kind of \"game.\"","\"I'm really sorry about that. It really was just an instinctive reaction,\" Shen Yin apologized again.","Xu Xiuhe had been about to apologize too, since he was the one who had initiated it, but hearing Shen Yin's explanation, he no longer felt like apologizing. Instead, he asked, \"Well, how can I avoid that kind of instinctive reaction?\"","This question touched on an area of ignorance for Shen Yin—she didn't know how to respond. Feeling her face grow hot again, she turned and fled to the bathroom.","The faucet was turned on, and cool water flowed as Shen Yin splashed her face repeatedly. Why had Xu Xiuhe kissed her? She touched her lips. Did he... like her?","Shen Yin was lost in a muddle of thoughts, staring at her reflection in the mirror, uncertain of how to face Xu Xiuhe going forward.","Xu Xiuhe came to the bathroom door with Zheng in his arms and said, \"We didn't finish taking the measurements earlier.\"","\"Oh, right. You go over first,\" Shen Yin replied.","Xu Xiuhe stood next to the sofa again. Shen Yin regained her composure, picked up the tape measure once more, and realized she couldn't remember the chest measurement from before, so she would have to redo it!","Shen Yin was a bit frazzled—what was even happening here? \"Raise your arms,\" she instructed curtly."]},{"number":60,"title":"Chapter 60: What's It Like to Kiss","paragraphs":["Things were going relatively smoothly. The two remained silent as Shen Yin carefully measured Zhengzheng's bust and waist circumference, jotting down the numbers. \"We're done, let's head home.\"","Xu Xiuhe was still feeling emotional. As a grown man, he had been brought down by his own wife—how humiliating would it be if word got out?","At dinner, to avoid awkwardness and show regret, Shen Yin kept piling food onto Zhengzheng's plate. \"Mom, I'm full. Zhengzheng has had enough,\" the little boy said, looking at the remaining food in his bowl, no longer hungry.","\"Okay Zhengzheng, you don't have to eat any more.\" Shen Yin's mind, however, was occupied with finding a way to escape the situation.","Sometimes, things happen just when you think of them. Shen Yin's phone screen lit up with a WeChat message. She opened it: [Yin Yin, want to go for a run?]","Shen Yin felt Shu Yi was her savior. \"Shu Yi's asking me to go for a run. Can you look after Zhengzheng for a bit after you finish eating?\"","\"Sure,\" Xu Xiuhe replied, his mood still sour.","Upon hearing his response, Shen Yin put down her chopsticks, grabbed a wet wipe, headed to the hallway, changed into a pair of running shoes, and left—all in one smooth motion.","The Ziyue Courtyard complex had a running track along the roads. With only five villas, there were few residents, and the place was usually deserted. Shu Yi, dressed in a sports top and shorts, was waiting near Xu Xiuhe's villa.","\"Shu Yi, I just had dinner. Let's take a stroll first,\" Shen Yin suggested.","\"Sure, let's walk for now. Yin Yin, what does kissing feel like?\" Shu Yi asked.","Shen Yin was stunned! How did Shu Yi know about this? Did she have some special power, or could she tell just from a kiss?","Slowing her pace, Shen Yin asked, \"Why are you suddenly asking this? How did you find out?\"","\"Find out what? I have an upcoming role with a kissing scene, so I wanted to know what kissing feels like beforehand,\" Shu Yi explained her reason for asking.","Shen Yin was relieved—she had thought Shu Yi was asking about her own experience. Perhaps this was a case of a guilty conscience.","\"Haven't you kissed before?\" Shen Yin inquired.","\"I'm a single mother by choice.\"","\"Huh?\" Shen Yin didn't quite understand what Shu Yi meant.","\"Oh, do I really have to spell it out? I've been single since birth,\" Shu Yi said in a cutesy voice.","Shen Yin wanted to laugh. She was in a similar situation, but it didn't seem appropriate to say so.","\"Haven't you had any kissing scenes before?\" Shen Yin continued.","Shu Yi's previous roles were mostly student dramas with no kissing scenes. In the hit drama The Story of Xian Xi, she was the lead, but that was a period piece with no such scenes either. And in her movie roles, she wasn't the main character.","\"No, I haven't. So this won't just be my first on-screen kiss, but my first kiss ever. I'm quite nervous,\" Shu Yi said as they strolled along, slowing her pace.","\"So, what does it feel like?\" Shu Yi was eager to know the answer.","\"I'm not really sure, haha.\" Shen Yin wanted to change the subject. She truly didn't know—that brief moment earlier had left her completely dazed.","\"What?? But you have a two-year-old! How can you not know? Unless... you two have a platonic marriage? Or could it be that Xu Xiuhe is... unable to? But that doesn't seem right, given your son and all.\" Shu Yi rambled on with her speculations.","Shen Yin didn't know what a \"platonic marriage\" meant, but she had an idea of what Shu Yi meant by \"unable to\"—how embarrassing! \"Where did you learn all this nonsense?\" she asked, flustered.","\"Haitang,\" Shu Yi replied.","Once again stumbling into unfamiliar territory, Shen Yin decided to skip over this topic. \"Zhengzheng was an accident. He was drunk, I was out of it, so I'm not too sure about the details,\" she explained vaguely.","Shu Yi looked as if she had discovered a shocking secret, covering her mouth with both hands. \"So you two don't have feelings for each other!\"","\"Yeah, I guess you could say that,\" Shen Yin affirmed.","Shen Yin's response piqued Shu Yi's curiosity further. \"Then what are your plans, Yin Yin?\"","Shen Yin pondered the question. Initially, she had thought about getting a divorce once Xu Xiuhe brought it up. But after that kiss, she was utterly confused about his intentions. It seemed she might have to raise the topic of divorce herself, who knew what else he might do. She did have feelings for him, but she was also afraid—afraid of what, only she knew.","\"I'm thinking about divorcing him,\" Shen Yin said in a small voice, admitting her desire to escape from these emotions.","\"Yin Yin, have you thought this through? I think Xu Xiuhe is quite a catch—young, capable, good-looking, and no scandals that I know of.\"","\"But we don't have any feelings for each other,\" Shen Yin reiterated. In the Dasheng Kingdom, women's status was still decent. If not for her wicked stepmother, she could have had a good life and maybe even married a suitable partner.","\"That's true. But I'll support whatever you decide to do,\" Shu Yi assured her.","\"What about you? I feel like Chang Zhiyuan is always taking advantage of you,\" Shen Yin joked.","Shu Yi's face turned gloomy. \"What can I do? I'm an artist under his company, and my contract isn't up yet. I want to escape so badly.\"","\"Then let me teach you some martial arts. If things ever get to the point of no return, you can give him a beating first and then we'll talk,\" Shen Yin said seriously.","\"That's not a bad idea. Yin Yin, you're so cool. Why don't you and I just get together? Then you can protect me,\" Shu Yi suggested playfully.","\"I don't think that's a good idea.\" The original owner of this body was into women, but Shen Yin wasn't. She couldn't just get divorced and then...","The moonlight was hazy, and to Shu Yi's delight, they could even see fireflies along the small path. Shen Yin, however, was unfazed—she had often caught fireflies with her little maidservants back in Dasheng Kingdom.","\"I thought fireflies were almost extinct. I didn't expect to see them here. Is it because of Ziyue Courtyard's great greenery and air quality?\" Shu Yi guessed.","\"Could be. I should take Zhengzheng out to see them in the evenings over the next few days,\" Shen Yin replied.","She was conflicted. She didn't know how to face Xu Xiuhe or deal with these feelings. Having never liked anyone before, she was at a complete loss. Whenever her heart grew restless, her first instinct was to avoid and escape, to distance herself from the situation.","But now, she couldn't bear to part with Zhengzheng. What would happen to the little one if they really did divorce? Shen Yin felt like Zhengzheng's real mother, having given birth to him from this very body, her own blood flowing through his veins. Moreover, during this time, it wasn't so much that she had been taking care of Zhengzheng, but rather that Zhengzheng had been keeping her company. Despite his young age, he was exceptionally sensible, often saying things that warmed her heart and made her feel less alone in this world. He had become her bond, her attachment. And a divorce wouldn't be good for Zhengzheng either. What should she do?"]},{"number":61,"title":"Chapter 61: Don't Know What to Do","paragraphs":["On the way back, Shen Yin kept wondering how to bring it up - whether to tell Xu Xiuhe tonight or tomorrow evening, or not to say anything and just bring Zhengzheng to live with her in the small house by the Clear River, acting as if she knew nothing?","Shen Yin was conflicted. She felt so vexed. After entering the house, she found that the table had been cleaned up by Xu Xiuhe, who must have given Zhengzheng a bath on it. Shen Yin changed her shoes in the cloakroom before going upstairs, turning off the downstairs lights as she climbed the stairs.","In the bathroom, Shen Yin soaked in the bathtub, the water temperature just right. She had been busy all day, designing three dresses, so she would think about the divorce tomorrow. Tonight, she would just sleep.","Zhengzheng had not come to her room yet, so in a while, Xu Xiuhe would surely bring him back. Learning from the previous lesson, after taking a bath and putting on a robe, Shen Yin went to the dressing room next door, changed into a modest nightgown, and then began to dry her hair.","At nine o'clock, it was Zhengzheng's bedtime. As expected, Xu Xiuhe knocked on Shen Yin's door, carrying Zhengzheng.","When Shen Yin opened the door, to avoid contact with Xu Xiuhe, she did not take Zhengzheng from him as usual but let Xu Xiuhe carry Zhengzheng onto the bed instead, keeping a distance herself.","\"Then I'll leave first.\" Xu Xiuhe wanted to say something more, but seeing Shen Yin's expressionless face and her unwillingness to talk, he gave up.","After Xu Xiuhe left, Shen Yin also lay on the bed. Zhengzheng's eyes kept blinking, and he rubbed them with his hands from time to time, apparently sleepy.","\"Zhengzheng, be a good boy. Go to sleep if you're tired. Mommy is going to sleep too.\" Shen Yin kissed Zhengzheng's forehead, then lay down, gently patting his little belly to lull him to sleep.","To Shen Yin, Zhengzheng was the most precious little treasure in the world.","The night was quiet. Xu Xiuhe lay in bed, recalling the unfinished kiss from earlier that day, and felt a surge of heat in his heart. Especially when he had just seen Shen Yin in her nightgown, her fair skin, her swan-like neck accentuated by her dark hair, making her even more alluring. Her hair was still dripping wet, droplets falling onto her nightgown. The loose nightgown revealed that she was not wearing any undergarments, and he could vaguely make out her full breasts, even more striking than the bathrobe she had worn before. His mind was now filled with this image, and he found himself unintentionally aroused.","The evening breeze blew gently through the summer night. Xu Xiuhe went into the bathroom and opened the window, letting the cool air in as the cool shower rained down on him, finally making him feel better.","Shen Yin decided to calm down herself first. In the morning, she had brought some clothes and important documents, so she wouldn't have to go back and forth for now since her work was also busy.","Xu Xiuhe sat in his office, unable to focus on the documents. This predicament was the first he had encountered in years, and he couldn't share his troubles with anyone else.","So Xu Xiuhe picked up his phone and googled \"How to win back your wife's favor.\"","There were actually some answers. Be her listener, hug her every day, compliment her in front of friends, participate in household chores, cook for her, praise her appearance, help her, and accept her for who she is. At the end of the article, there was a sentence about the \"Harmonious Family Course\" that explores issues and insights about life and family with you.","Xu Xiuhe felt that none of these applied to him, except perhaps the second point about hugging her every day. But for him, that seemed more difficult than ascending to heaven. It wasn't that he didn't want to hug her - it was that shoulder throw that had slammed him onto the couch. If he tried, she would just report him for harassment.","So he searched for another term: \"What to do if your wife knows martial arts.\" He wished he hadn't seen the search results - all sorts of ridiculous answers like \"learn to kneel and scrub clothes,\" \"learn to kneel on a durian,\" \"don't talk back, don't fight back,\" \"when you have time, massage her shoulders, feet, and legs.\"","\"Assistant Liu Bo, come in.\"","When Liu Bo received the direct call, he dared not delay, and as soon as he entered the door, he could feel the oppressive atmosphere in the room.","\"Sir, you called me?\" Liu Bo asked cautiously.","\"Tell Xiao Li'er to submit the proposal by 5:30 this afternoon.\" Xu Xiuhe sat at his desk, tapping his fingers rhythmically, exuding an overwhelming sense of pressure.","In the studio, Shen Yin had spent the entire morning designing Xu Xiuhe's clothing sketches. Originally, she didn't want to make clothes for Xu Xiuhe anymore, but she had promised yesterday, so it wouldn't be good to go back on her word now.","\"Yin Yin, are these clothes for Xiuhe?\" Fang Yue walked over from the kitchen to where Shen Yin was working and noticed the exquisite men's clothing design.","\"No, I'm just designing for fun.\" Shen Yin didn't want to admit that it was for Xu Xiuhe right now since she was still upset with him. She had apologized to Xu Xiuhe last night for throwing him, which was her fault, but it was clear that Xu Xiuhe was the one who had made the first mistake.","\"These clothes look so nice. Yin Yin has really grown up and done such an amazing job.\" Fang Yue praised her generously.","\"Thank you, Mom. When I finish these dresses, I'll make one for you too.\" Shen Yin said.","Fang Yue was pleasantly surprised. \"Really? That's wonderful. But come and eat first.\"","When Shen Yin arrived at the studio this morning, she found that Fang Yue had come again to help take care of Zhengzheng, just as she had promised. While Shen Yin was sketching, she would occasionally look at Zhengzheng and play with him during breaks. Sometimes, though, she became too absorbed in her work. With Zhengzheng being so young, having someone constantly watching over him put Shen Yin at ease. She was very grateful to Fang Yue for letting her experience a mother's love.","After finishing lunch, Zhengzheng let out a yawn.","\"Zhengzheng is sleepy. Grandma will take Zhengzheng for a nap, okay?\" Fang Yue said.","\"Okay, sleep and grow taller,\" Zhengzheng stretched out his arms, and Fang Yue carried him into the bedroom.","\"Yin Yin, why did you bring so many things here? Are you planning to stay here often?\" Fang Yue returned and asked after seeing the wardrobe full of clothes.","Shen Yin didn't know how to explain. If she said she wanted a divorce, Fang Yue would definitely disagree. \"I've just been really busy these past two days, so I'm not going back.\"","Fang Yue made a mental note of it.","Shen Yin felt she couldn't drag it out any longer. She took out her phone and found Xu Xiuhe's chat window.","[Let's get a divorce.] After much hesitation, Shen Yin sent the message.","In fact, she didn't know what she was doing - whether she was testing his feelings for her or wanted to end it quickly.","Seeing this message, Xu Xiuhe's expression darkened even further. Why so suddenly? Hadn't they been getting along well lately? Shen Yin was even going to make clothes for him.","\"Liu Bo, have Xiao Li'er come in.\" Xu Xiuhe made a call.","When Xiao Li'er entered, she was carrying an unfinished romantic proposal plan. \"Sir, it's not done yet.\"","\"Put that plan on hold for now. My wife wants a divorce from me. You watch a lot of TV shows and read novels, don't you? Think of a way to stop it.\"","Xiao Li'er was utterly shocked. Wow, what drama had she stumbled into? So the plot had changed from romance to the CEO pursuing his wife. How exciting!","\"What's the matter? Finding it too difficult to come up with an idea? Then resign immediately.\"","\"I'm thinking, I'm thinking, Sir. In novels, when the CEO pursues his wife, he's relentless and never gives up,\" Xiao Li'er quickly responded, her eyes scrutinizing Xu Xiuhe's expression.","Xu Xiuhe considered the feasibility of the approach. So the next step was to relentlessly pursue her? The phone on the desk rang just then, and Xu Xiuhe glanced at it before answering without hesitation."]},{"number":62,"title":"Chapter 62: Chasing My Wife","paragraphs":["\"Hey, Xu Xiuhe, I want to ask you something,\" Fang Yue said.","\"Mom, you can ask me anything,\" Xu Xiuhe turned on the hands-free mode.","\"Did you and Shen Yin have a fight? I saw her bring some clothes over, including Xiao's and hers, to the small house on this side. When I asked her why she brought so much, she said she was busy with work and didn't want to waste time going back and forth, so she'd stay here for a few days.\"","Xu Xiuhe was furious on his end. So this was what she had planned yesterday, and today she's packing up and leaving?","\"We didn't have a fight,\" Xu Xiuhe answered truthfully. Indeed, they hadn't fought; she just wanted a divorce.","\"Oh, that's good, that's good. But you two can't go on like this, you know. With a helpless mother and child staying in that small house, it's not safe,\" Fang Yue said worriedly.","Xu Xiuhe thought to himself, 'Shen Yin may be small, but she's far from helpless. She could probably take down five men single-handedly. So Fang Yue doesn't know her daughter's martial arts skills?'","Xiao Li'er, standing nearby, was almost dying upon hearing this. The CEO is getting a golden opportunity from his mother-in-law, and he's not cherishing it.","Xu Xiuhe noticed the resentful look on Xiao Li'er's face and said, \"Mom, I know what to do next.\"","\"Good, good, good. I'll hang up then,\" Fang Yue said \"good\" three times before ending the call.","Xu Xiuhe stood up and took two steps. \"What did that 'wishing for iron but getting steel' look on your face mean earlier? And why are you so persistent?\"","Xiao Li'er lowered her head and muttered softly, \"Didn't you say on the phone that you knew what to do?\"","\"What did you say? Speak louder,\" Xu Xiuhe couldn't hear her.","\"I said, didn't you tell your mom on the phone that you knew what to do?\" Xiao Li'er repeated the sentence a little louder, but still without much confidence.","Xu Xiuhe was rendered speechless. For a moment, he didn't know what to say. He knew he should go find Shen Yin next, but what if she turned him away?","\"What if she kicks me out when I go find her?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Then you just be shameless and refuse to leave. Say you're concerned about their safety,\" Xiao Li'er suggested. Then, reconsidering the wife's combat skills, she added, \"No, nevermind. Just say you miss your son. But don't you dare threaten the wife with custody rights. Women hate it when men threaten them the most. If you do that, she'll only resent you more. Don't blame me if that happens; I really don't want to quit my job.\"","Xu Xiuhe nodded understandingly. \"What if she doesn't let me see my son?\"","\"Then play the pitiful act. Women may appear tough on the surface, with impressive fighting skills. But when Mrs. Xu first came, I felt she had mellowed, gentle and kind.\"","\"Wooing a girlfriend requires effort and attention to details. Wooing a wife requires even more effort,\" Xiao Li'er continued advising.","Xu Xiuhe listened intently, almost ready to take notes.","\"Did you learn all this from watching TV and reading novels?\" Xu Xiuhe asked skeptically.","Xiao Li'er suddenly felt the CEO was a bit naive but didn't dare say it. \"Some things are just common sense if you think about it.\" She lowered her head after speaking.","\"Alright, you can leave now. If a third person finds out what happened here, you're fired immediately. Also, call Liu Bo in.\"","Xiao Li'er turned and left, feeling frustrated. He had just said not to threaten women, yet he threatened to fire her right after. She must have been cursed in her previous eight lives to be dancing on the edge of being fired every day. So what if he's the CEO? He still has to woo his wife back.","At the door, Xiao Li'er said in a harsh tone, \"Liu Bo, the CEO is calling for you.\" She'd remember this. Everything happening now was because of Liu Bo. If she got fired, she wouldn't let him off easy either.","\"Did the CEO say anything to you? How did the plan go?\" Liu Bo asked.","\"Just go in. The CEO's in a bad mood. And you'd better not quit again, or I might just have to marry you,\" Xiao Li'er said without turning back as she walked to her office area.","Her words made Liu Bo break out in a cold sweat. He hadn't done anything wrong, so why was the CEO calling for him?","Liu Bo entered quietly, trying not to provoke Xu Xiuhe in any way. \"CEO, you called for me?\"","\"Yeah, about the task of keeping tabs on Gu Mengmeng I gave you last time, any updates?\"","Liu Bo exhaled in relief; it was about this matter. \"There's nothing new with Gu Mengmeng. No new shows, only a new endorsement deal yesterday for a clothing studio called Qiyan Fashion Studio.\"","Xu Xiuhe paused his pen and looked up. \"Qiyan Fashion Studio?\"","\"Yes, CEO. You know it?\"","Xu Xiuhe sighed, realizing who it was. \"Any updates on the studio's progress?\"","\"Seems like they're planning to buy some hot search rankings.\"","Xu Xiuhe felt annoyed just hearing the studio's name. He had only wanted to check on Gu Mengmeng's activities to have an excuse to find Shen Yin, but now it had unexpectedly dragged Qi Yan into the picture.","\"Do everything you can to suppress those hot search rankings. Don't give this studio any chance to take off,\" he ordered.","\"Understood. Can I leave now, CEO?\" Liu Bo wanted to get out of there as soon as possible.","\"No, sit at that desk and process the remaining documents. You'll also chair the executive meeting this afternoon.\"","\"But that's...\" Liu Bo had chaired many meetings as a proxy, but never the executive meetings.","\"What's the problem? I have something to take care of.\" Xu Xiuhe grabbed his car keys and left the office.","The assistants in the office area were surprised to see the CEO leaving at this hour, knowing there was an important afternoon meeting.","\"Why did the CEO leave so early?\" They whispered among themselves. Only Xiao Li'er sat dejectedly, wishing she could share this huge gossip. Some news is only fun when shared; keeping it to herself was torture.","\"Hey Li'er, the CEO called you in to discuss a plan earlier, right?\" Yang Mo asked.","Xiao Li'er could only nod.","In the group chat for executives of Conquest Group and Far Group, others noticed the CEO's early departure and asked, [Why did the CEO leave so early? It's only 2:30 PM.]","One of the younger assistants, forgetting the CEO and Liu Bo were also in the group, shared the latest gossip: [The CEO went to be romantic.]","Xiao Li'er saw the message and panicked. \"Wan Jia, retract that! The CEO is in the group!\"","Wan Jia realized her mistake and quickly retracted the message, but many had already seen it, replying with questions like [Why retract it?] and [Wow, 'be romantic' is such an elegant phrase. What does it mean?]"]},{"number":63,"title":"Chapter 63: Cheeky","paragraphs":["Xu Xiuhe sat in the car, scrolling through his phone and feeling agitated as messages popped up in the group chat. He opened a smaller group with Xue Jingrui.","\"[Qi Yan has opened a studio, did you know?]\"","Within seconds, Xue Jingrui replied, \"[I'm not sure, I haven't been in touch with her.]\"","\"[Xue Jingrui, buddy, have you seen the light again? Is it for three days or forever?]\" Chang Zhiyuan had already warned Xue Jingrui that Qi Yan might have been okay before college, but things had changed since then. He had seen many women, so he knew exactly what Qi Yan was like, but unfortunately, Xue Jingrui was not reliable.","\"[My family arranged a blind date for me.]\" Xue Jingrui responded.","\"[What's up? Are you following Xu Xiuhe's path to an arranged marriage?]\" Chang Zhiyuan was just enjoying the drama.","Xue Jingrui typed, \"[Something came up. Let's talk about it when we meet.]\"","\"[The name of the clothing studio is Yanhe Clothing Studio.]\" Xu Xiuhe sent a message.","Xue Jingrui remained silent. It was Chang Zhiyuan who couldn't hold back: \"[Is Qi Yan seriously ill?]\" He didn't consider Xue Jingrui's feelings when he sent this message.","\"[Since you're planning to go on a blind date, you probably won't get involved in this matter afterwards, right?]\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"[Hmm, I won't interfere.]\" His relationship with Qi Yan might become even more complicated in the future.","\"[Alright, that's good.]\"","Xu Xiuhe drove towards Qinghe Street, planning all along how to start the conversation when they meet.","For the whole morning, Shen Yin worked on Xu Xiuhe's clothing design sketches, and now she was busy with her own formal wear orders. There were occasional customers coming into the shop for customizations. Shen Yin felt she might need to hire another clothing designer. She only designed haute couture. Clothing, like everything else, had different grades, and the style of dress varied for different occasions. Shen Yin had been pondering why so many people went abroad to study fashion design in this era. After reading some materials, she concluded that it was due to our lack of cultural confidence and innovation. Foreign luxury goods were so expensive, yet many people still rushed to buy them, while Chinese clothing had few luxury brands.","Why couldn't she create luxury brands in China? Rich, elegant, and noble, three different styles of clothing could be infused with Chinese culture. China's rich cultural heritage was definitely not inferior to any other country, even though there had been no great prosperity in history. She believed that given time, she could definitely create luxury brands unique to China that were not only fashionable but also more comfortable than foreign luxury brands.","When Zhengzheng woke up, Fang Yue carried him to the living room. Children couldn't stay indoors all the time; they wanted to play at this age.","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng wants to go out to play.\" Xu Yunzheng's speech was extremely slow.","\"Zhengzheng, can you wait for mommy for a while?\" Shen Yin replied.","\"Alright, how about I take him out for a stroll first? The environment here is nice, and it's good to go out for a walk. You can come find us after you're done with your work,\" Fang Yue suggested.","Shen Yin naturally agreed. It was almost four o'clock, and the sun was still shining brightly as Fang Yue walked with Zhengzheng from the shaded area.","\"Zhengzheng, we can't go near the water, it's deep and dangerous,\" Fang Yue pointed to a nearby stream.","Zhengzheng nodded and replied, \"Dangerous, won't go.\"","\"Ah, such a good child,\" Fang Yue patted Zhengzheng's head.","After parking the car, Xu Xiuhe and Fang Nuan went to purchase fabrics, leaving only Li Huanhuan on the first floor.","\"Is your boss on the third floor?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Yes, he is,\" Li Huanhuan replied.","Upon reaching the third floor, Xu Xiuhe only saw Shen Yin. Upon entering, his first question was, \"Where's Zhengzheng?\"","Shen Yin looked up, then lowered her gaze, asking calmly, \"Why are you here? Have you made up your mind?\"","\"What do you mean, made up what?\" Xu Xiuhe pretended to be clueless. He hadn't considered divorce since he made up his mind about his feelings.","\"Divorce,\" Shen Yin continued, her tone indifferent. It was hard to tell if she was happy or angry. In reality, she was nervous, surprised that she had actually said it in front of him. She had some courage.","\"Where's Zhengzheng gone?\" Xu Xiuhe changed the subject.","Shen Yin raised her head, walked to the sofa, and poured two glasses of water. \"My mom took him out to play. Are you here to agree now?\"","\"Agree to what, divorce? What if I don't agree?\"","This question caught Shen Yin off guard. She didn't expect Xu Xiuhe to ask her, but she felt a bit happy inside and deliberately continued, \"Then how can you agree? We have no feelings for each other.\"","Thinking of Xiao Lier's words, Xu Xiuhe, thick-skinned as he was, said, \"No matter what I do, I won't agree. Who said there are no feelings?\"","\"You—\" Shen Yin was interrupted by Fang Yue's return with Zhengzheng.","\"Daddy!\" Zhengzheng walked over, hopping a little.","\"Mom, why are you back so soon? Didn't you just go out?\" Shen Yin was puzzled.","\"Just went out, took a few steps, and Zhengzheng turned back and called for Daddy. I thought the child had made a mistake, but he insisted on coming back. Didn't expect Xu Xiuhe to really come,\" Fang Yue explained.","\"Yeah, Mom, I had something to do around here this afternoon, so I came to see you guys,\" Xu Xiuhe said smoothly, without needing to rehearse his words now.","\"Are you going back then?\" Fang Yue asked playfully. When he called, he had already mentioned knowing what to do.","\"Not going back, it's troublesome to travel back and forth,\" Xu Xiuhe said, glancing at Shen Yin. Didn't she tell Fang Yue that it was inconvenient to commute back and forth, wasting time? Then he could use the same reason, right?","Shen Yin had no other reaction, just felt for the first time that Xu Xiuhe was so shameless.","\"Okay, since you're here, I can head back now. Give Grandma Zhengzheng a kiss goodbye,\" Fang Yue said with a smile.","Xu Xiuhe stood on the ground, reached out his little hand, and touched his mouth, making a \"mua\" sound as he extended it.","\"Such a good boy. Grandma is leaving now. I'll come back tomorrow.\"","Fang Yue waved her hand, turned around, and walked downstairs.","\"Mom, let me walk you out,\" Xu Xiuhe followed.","\"Xiuhe, Yin Yin is still so young, and you're already a mother. If there's anything she doesn't understand, be patient with her. There's nothing in a marriage that can't be overcome,\" Fang Yue advised earnestly.","\"Okay, Mom, I understand. Take care and drive safely,\" Xu Xiuhe reminded.","\"Alright, stop here. Go back upstairs and keep them company,\" Fang Yue got into the car.","As Xu Xiuhe headed upstairs again, Shen Yin was in the bathroom with Zhengzheng.","\"Mommy, Daddy's back,\" Shen Yin turned her head and indeed saw Xu Xiuhe standing behind her.","\"Zhengzheng, focus when you're using the toilet,\" Shen Yin turned back to Zhengzheng, deciding to ignore Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe didn't mind at all. He decided to stay here today and see how Shen Yin would deal with him. Glancing at his watch, realizing it was getting late, Xu Xiuhe went into the kitchen."]},{"number":64,"title":"Chapter 64: The Wife","paragraphs":["In the kitchen, Xu Xiuhe washed various types of rice and placed them in the rice cooker, adding a lot of water.","Shen Yin came out of the bathroom carrying Zhengzheng, and saw Xu Xiuhe cutting potato shreds in the kitchen. Since he was cooking, she didn't go in. Zhengzheng in her arms said, \"Daddy cooking.\" Then he wanted to get down.","Shen Yin put Zhengzheng on the ground, and the little one toddled towards the kitchen. \"Daddy, Zhengzheng help you cook.\"","Shen Yin wanted to laugh at this. Zhengzheng was small but wanted to do everything, drive, write, and now that he had just been potty trained, he wanted to cook. \"Zhengzheng, cooking is dangerous, come here.\"","Zhengzheng turned around and looked at Shen Yin, who had a troubled expression and shook her head.","Just as Shen Yin was about to pick up Zhengzheng, she saw Xu Xiuhe wipe his hands and pick up Zhengzheng, walking to the sink and saying, \"Zhengzheng, help Daddy wash this tomato, okay?\"","\"Okay.\" Zhengzheng readily agreed, revealing two small milk teeth. He then took the tomato, and Xu Xiuhe turned on the faucet. Zhengzheng touched the running water with his hand before putting the tomato under it.","Shen Yin didn't know if he was really washing the tomato or not, but in her eyes, father and son were having a great time.","\"Zhengzheng, well done, thank you Zhengzheng. Daddy needs to cut the tomato now, why don't you go to Mommy?\" Xu Xiuhe coaxed, realizing that he wasn't as good at cooking as Shen Yin, and having a little kid interfering, they might not be able to eat dinner until the next morning.","Zhengzheng had gotten tired of playing, and when Xu Xiuhe put him down, he waddled towards Shen Yin.","\"Zhengzheng, wait until you're a little bigger, then you can cook for Mommy, okay?\" Shen Yin squatted down and coaxed Zhengzheng.","\"Okay, Zhengzheng will cook for Daddy and Mommy later.\"","Shen Yin rubbed her forehead, she hadn't mentioned Daddy just now.","In the living room, Shen Yin drew design sketches while chatting with Zhengzheng.","\"Mommy, hungry,\" Zhengzheng said.","Shen Yin sighed, usually at this time, she would have finished cooking at the Purple Courtyard, but now in the kitchen, Xu Xiuhe was still stir-frying dishes.","\"Zhengzheng, Mommy is hungry too,\" Shen Yin said. She could only say that.","Hearing Shen Yin's words, Zhengzheng frowned and walked back into the kitchen.","\"Daddy, Mommy's hungry,\" Zhengzheng told Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe, who was stir-frying, turned his head and smiled, \"Are you the one who's hungry?\"","\"Mommy's hungry, Zhengzheng's hungry too,\" Zhengzheng pouted.","\"Zhengzheng, go tell Mommy that dinner will be ready soon,\" Xu Xiuhe dished out the tomato and scrambled eggs.","The kitchen wasn't far from the living room, and Shen Yin had heard the whole conversation between Zhengzheng and Xu Xiuhe. My goodness, what was with Zhengzheng? \"Zhengzheng, why did you tell Daddy that Mommy is hungry?\"","\"Because Mommy told Zhengzheng that Mommy is hungry too,\" Zhengzheng blinked innocently. Shen Yin didn't know how to end this topic; children these days were so clever.","\"Daddy says we can eat now,\" Zhengzheng had just finished speaking when Xu Xiuhe came out with two plates of dishes, called out \"Dinner's ready,\" and went back to the kitchen.","One plate of tomato and scrambled eggs, one plate of potato shreds, a plate of stir-fried mushrooms and meat, followed by three bowls of porridge.","Shen Yin still felt awkward, she hadn't asked Xu Xiuhe to cook, and just a few hours ago they were discussing divorce. She didn't feel comfortable going over there.","\"Dinner's ready,\" Xu Xiuhe called out. Then he seemed to remember something and added, \"Zhengzheng, call Mommy to eat.\"","Zhengzheng obeyed and pulled Shen Yin's hand, \"Mommy, eat food.\"","Shen Yin sat at the dining table, feeling awkward and not knowing how to face Xu Xiuhe. The table had homemade dishes, but those potato shreds were cut so thick, Shen Yin could hardly look at them, they were almost as thick as Zhengzheng's little fingers. Could they even be eaten?","Xu Xiuhe noticed that Shen Yin kept looking at the dishes on the table but didn't pick up her chopsticks. He felt anxious, picked up a potato shred with his chopsticks, tasted it, and feeling satisfied, put some in Zhengzheng's bowl.","\"Wife, didn't Zhengzheng say you were hungry? Why aren't you eating?\" Xu Xiuhe had pondered for a while before speaking these words, and this was the first time he had called her \"wife.\"","Upon hearing this, Shen Yin was stunned. What did Xu Xiuhe mean by calling her \"wife\"? She froze, completely at a loss.","Zhengzheng used his own spoon to scoop up a few potato shreds and put them in the small plate in front of Shen Yin, \"Wife, eat potatoes.\"","When Xu Xiuhe heard this, his expression changed, and he turned to say, \"Xu Zhengzheng, she's my wife, my wife is your mother, you can't call her wife, understand?\"","\"Oh, I understand, then Zhengzheng wants a wife too.\" Zhengzheng nodded, seeming to understand but not really, and when he said he wanted a wife too, his face was filled with anticipation.","Shen Yin was troubled. One \"wife\" was too much, but every sentence had that word. The adult said it, the child learned it. She frowned and looked at Xu Xiuhe displeased, \"Xu Xiuhe, can't you watch what you say? Zhengzheng is at the age of learning to talk, and you're saying such nonsense.\"","Shen Yin was really scared by that word \"wife.\" What had gotten into Xu Xiuhe?","\"What nonsense did I say? You are my wife, that's a fact. What does Zhengzheng learning to talk have to do with me calling you wife? We're legally married.\" Xu Xiuhe felt he hadn't said enough, so he turned to Zhengzheng and said, \"Remember, you can't say that word randomly, you can't say it casually. Zhengzheng, when you grow up, you'll have a wife. From now on, you're not allowed to say the word 'wife'.\"","Zhengzheng looked at Xu Xiuhe speaking so seriously and nodded, \"I remember, Daddy.\"","Shen Yin was now so embarrassed by Xu Xiuhe's behavior that she didn't want to talk. She picked up the potato shreds, no, potato chunks, that Zhengzheng had put in her plate and ate them. They were cooked through, but the taste was just barely edible.","Seeing Shen Yin eat the potatoes, Zhengzheng scooped up some meat shreds from his own small bowl and put them in Shen Yin's plate.","\"Zhengzheng, eat your own food. Mommy can serve herself,\" Shen Yin said.","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe used his own unused chopsticks to put some mushrooms, potatoes, and tomatoes into Shen Yin's small plate.","\"I can eat by myself, you don't need to serve me,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Then why didn't you eat earlier?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Shen Yin was speechless, \"I didn't want to eat what you cooked.\"","\"But I still eat what you cook every day,\" Xu Xiuhe retorted.","Shen Yin felt this logic was flawed, \"It's not like I forced you to eat it.\"","\"You're my wife, if I don't eat what you cook, whose cooking would I eat?\" Xu Xiuhe understood and decided to fully commit to his thick-skinned approach."]},{"number":65,"title":"Chapter 65: How I Feel about Him","paragraphs":["Shen Yin felt that Xu Xiuhe must have gone crazy, no matter how she looked at him, he seemed a bit abnormal. \"Can't you be less shameless?\"","\"Ahem, Zhengzheng is here. The kid is learning to talk now, so we can't say bad words. He might be more mature than we think, so let's not bring up that topic from the afternoon. What if he understands?\"","Xu Xiuhe didn't know whether Xu Yunzheng understood what divorce meant, but he could use any excuse now.","Shen Yin was intimidated by Xu Xiuhe, so she didn't dare bring it up in front of Zhengzheng.","\"What is a topic?\" Zhengzheng suddenly raised his head while eating meat.","\"It's just a small issue,\" Xu Xiuhe explained.","\"There's no bed for you to sleep here tonight. You figure it out yourself. If it's really not possible, you can go back to the Purple Joy Residence,\" Shen Yin said.","\"It's okay, I told Mom I need to protect you two, and it's getting dark now anyway. Zhengzheng, don't you want Dad to stay?\" Xu Xiuhe turned to ask Zhengzheng.","\"It's dark, scary, Dad don't go, close the door,\" Zhengzheng replied.","\"The door is closed. Drink some porridge, don't choke,\" Shen Yin picked up Zhengzheng's small porridge bowl and fed it to his mouth.","After drinking about half a bowl, Zhengzheng felt full and said, \"Mom, Zhengzheng is full.\"","\"Okay, then let's take a bath,\" Shen Yin picked up Zhengzheng, intending to go to the bathroom.","\"You should eat a little more,\" Xu Xiuhe called out.","Shen Yin indeed hadn't eaten much, as she was annoyed by Xu Xiuhe.","After bathing Zhengzheng, when Shen Yin carried him out again, Xu Xiuhe had already cleaned up the dining room and kitchen, but he wasn't there. Shen Yin thought Xu Xiuhe must have gone back to the Purple Joy Residence.","\"Zhengzheng, you play on the bed for a while, okay? Mommy will take a shower. Stay on the bed and be good. Don't come down. Mommy will be back soon,\" Shen Yin said, handing a children's picture book to Zhengzheng.","Zhengzheng nodded in agreement, so Shen Yin felt reassured and went back into the bathroom.","After Xu Xiuhe took out the trash downstairs and came back up, he saw Zhengzheng alone in the bedroom and suddenly had an idea.","\"Zhengzheng,\" Xu Xiuhe called out as he entered the bedroom.","\"Dad,\" Zhengzheng happily called out.","Xu Xiuhe made a \"shh\" gesture with his hand. \"Zhengzheng, Dad wants to discuss something with you, okay?\"","\"Okay.\"","\"You see, Dad will be scared sleeping alone tonight, so can you keep Dad company and sleep with him?\" Xu Xiuhe feigned helplessness and pity.","Then he realized that the tricks Xiao Li'er had taught him not only worked on Shen Yin but could also be used on his son.","\"Dad, don't be afraid. Zhengzheng will keep you company,\" Xu Yunzheng said as he gently patted Xu Xiuhe, showing a protective attitude.","Xu Xiuhe estimated that Shen Yin would finish showering soon, so he quickly left the bedroom and sat on the sofa in the living room.","When Shen Yin came out, she saw him, and though she intended to ask him to sleep on the sofa, she felt it wasn't necessary.","She entered the bedroom, turned around, locked the door – her actions were quick and decisive, without any hesitation.","\"Mom, where's Dad?\" Xu Yunzheng asked when he saw Shen Yin come in.","\"Dad went to take a shower and sleep. Zhengzheng must be tired too, so go to sleep quickly,\" Shen Yin replied.","Xu Xiuhe entered the bathroom, and this time the feeling was deeper than the last time. The bathroom smelled more fragrant than his own bathroom – this was the scent he had smelled that night.","\"Mom, Zhengzheng wants to find Dad,\" Xu Yunzheng said, lying on the big bed and raising his hand to look at his small hand.","\"Dad needs to take a shower and sleep. You can find him tomorrow, okay? It's late. Zhengzheng should sleep now,\" Shen Yin coaxed.","\"No, Dad said he'll be scared sleeping at night,\" Xu Yunzheng shook his head.","Shen Yin had already cursed Xu Xiuhe several times in her heart. How could he be so shameless? He's an adult, yet he's still afraid? Was he just trying to make her feel bad for Zhengzheng, so she would let him into the bedroom? She wouldn't do that.","Although she was criticizing him in her heart, she couldn't show it in front of Zhengzheng, so Shen Yin said, \"Dad is so tall, he's an adult. He's not afraid. Doesn't he sleep by himself at home?\"","\"This is not home,\" Zhengzheng said.","Shen Yin really didn't know why such a young child's brain worked so fast. At the beginning, he couldn't even speak clearly, but now, after just over two months, he could argue with her.","\"Okay, how about this? You go sleep with Dad on the sofa, and I'll sleep on the bed myself,\" Shen Yin suggested. She wanted to see how Xu Xiuhe would handle it.","\"Okay,\" Zhengzheng readily agreed.","Shen Yin carried Zhengzheng out to the living room and put him down. She went into the bedroom herself, to be honest. She didn't want Zhengzheng to sleep on the sofa, she just wanted to see what Xu Xiuhe would do next.","The plot wasn't going the way he had expected, and Xu Xiuhe was dumbfounded. Shouldn't Shen Yin have let him into the bedroom? Why did Zhengzheng come out instead?","\"Dad, don't be afraid. Zhengzheng will keep you company.\"","Xu Yunzheng ran to the sofa and lay down next to Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe was thinking about what to do next when Shen Yin received a call from Shu Yi.","\"Yin Yin, how is it going? Any progress? Did you bring it up?\" Shu Yi asked.","\"No progress. I brought up divorce, but he pretended not to understand. It seems he doesn't agree with divorcing. He even cooked diligently and said some weird things. He's still staying here and not leaving. What's worse is that he keeps calling me 'wife',\" Shen Yin complained.","\"Wow, seriously? I didn't think he was that kind of person. He's so funny, hahahahaha,\" Shu Yi completely forgot that this was a serious topic.","\"Stop laughing. What do you think I should do?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Yin Yin, from my experience reading so many novels, it seems he has fallen for you. He likes you, but since he's a domineering CEO, he has a bit of an adorable contrast. In novels, those dominant CEOs usually take what they want forcefully. I didn't expect him to be so stubbornly persistent,\" Shu Yi analyzed.","\"What kind of novels have you been reading? I should read them too,\" Shen Yin said.","Shu Yi was about to blurt out the name of the novel she had mentioned before, but then worried that it might corrupt Shen Yin's mind.","\"It doesn't matter where I read them. What's important is how you feel about him now. What are your feelings towards him?\" Shu Yi said solemnly.","\"I don't know. When he calls me 'wife,' I feel my face getting hot,\" Shen Yin said haltingly. When she initially brought up divorce, her mind might have been confused, and she was just testing the waters.","Outside, Xu Xiuhe didn't know what to do with the current situation, so he sought advice from Xiao Li'er.","\"Boss, why don't you make Zhengzheng cry?\" Xiao Li'er had already gone home late at night but still received Xu Xiuhe's call, which was incredibly frustrating.","Xu Xiuhe was smart enough to understand what to do immediately. After hanging up, he said, \"Zhengzheng, sleeping on the sofa is uncomfortable. Can you cry for a bit? Then Mommy will let us go sleep on the bed.\"","\"Mom said real men don't cry or let the little pearls fall,\" Zhengzheng sat on the sofa, swinging his legs."]},{"number":66,"title":"Chapter 66: Talk About It","paragraphs":["Xu Xiuhe felt helpless, \"Zhengzheng, how can a man have such a good memory? A true man should be flexible and adapt to situations. Sometimes, being soft towards a woman is a strategy. You understand what tactics are, right?\"","\"What are tactics?\" Zhengzheng asked.","\"The current tactic is for you to act pitiful and cry. You see, this sofa is uncomfortable, isn't it? If you cry a little, mom will let us go inside,\" Xu Xiuhe persuaded gently.","Inside, Shen Yin was completely unaware of what was happening outside. She was perplexed by Shu Yi's few questions.","\"Do you dislike him? Did your heart rate ever increase when you saw him? After the divorce, if other men pursue you, would you agree? Most importantly, if, and I mean if, there is a woman by his side, would you feel a bit uncomfortable?\"","Shen Yin pondered the answers to these questions but didn't respond to Shu Yi.","\"Think carefully, if you're thinking carefully now, it means you've already been moved by him, or at least you have feelings for him, but you're unaware of it yourself. If you say you have absolutely no feelings for him and are determined to get a divorce, you would definitely answer firmly: I dislike him, my heart rate doesn't increase. Instead of seriously considering the few questions I asked, like you're doing now.\"","Shu Yi continued, \"Sometimes feelings aren't that complicated, we just overthink them. Look at you two, things are already great. If you truly like each other, you don't even need to prepare for marriage, and you even have such an obedient, handsome child. Do you know, nowadays many people who like each other eventually fail to make it to the altar due to reality?\"","Shen Yin sincerely felt that Shu Yi understood emotions well, \"What about you? I feel Chang Zhiyuan quite likes you, why are you avoiding him?\"","\"As for me, I don't know if he's just momentarily interested or has truly reformed. Even if he's a prodigal son returning, I dare not gamble easily. I'm afraid in the end, I'll be the only one hurt. All these years, I haven't dated for this reason - I overthink things, consider the outcome, and want a relationship that doesn't end in a breakup. Think about it, his family is wealthy and influential, would they agree for him to marry an ordinary woman from the entertainment industry?\"","\"Knock, knock, knock.\"","\"Is someone knocking on the door?\" Shu Yi vaguely heard a sound on the other end of the phone and asked.","\"Yes, it's probably Xu Xiuhe knocking,\" Shen Yin replied.","\"Then you should open the door. Oh, by the way, 'The Legend of Xian Xi' has been scheduled. It will air tomorrow night, so you can see Zhengzheng on TV.\" Shu Yi said before hanging up.","When Shen Yin opened the door, the first thing she heard was Zhengzheng's crying.","Xu Xiuhe was holding Zhengzheng, standing at the door waiting for Shen Yin to open it.","Hearing Zhengzheng's cries softened Shen Yin's heart, and she began to blame herself. Xu Xiuhe held Zhengzheng with his back towards Shen Yin; he dared not let Zhengzheng face Shen Yin, for his acting of crying without tears was too poor.","\"Zhengzheng, come to mommy,\" Shen Yin extended her arms to take Zhengzheng, but he shook his head.","Xu Xiuhe inwardly praised his son's excellent acting skills; he had indeed taught him well to remember not to go to mom but to go inside instead.","\"Zhengzheng, don't cry anymore, mommy was wrong, okay?\" This was the first time in so long that Shen Yin had heard Zhengzheng cry so intensely while caring for him.","\"Want to go inside,\" Zhengzheng said with a sob in his voice.","As soon as Xu Xiuhe heard this, he seized the opportunity and carried Zhengzheng into the bedroom without waiting for Shen Yin's approval. Not only did they enter, but they also sat on the bed.","\"Zhengzheng must be tired, daddy is tired too, let's sleep,\" Xu Xiuhe continued to deceive.","The duo, one big and one small, swiftly lay down, intentionally leaving space for Shen Yin.","Shen Yin stood dazed, watching their actions unfold. Only then did she realize that the father and son had come to take over the bed.","As she prepared to leave and open the door, Zhengzheng sat up with tears in his eyes, saying, \"Mommy, you don't want Zhengzheng anymore?\"","The pitiful expression, tinged with sadness, made it seem as though tears would fall any moment. Shen Yin couldn't bear it.","Beside him, Xu Xiuhe also sat up, inwardly praising his son's acting skills, which were so convincing that even he thought it was real.","\"No, no, mommy doesn't not want Zhengzheng, mommy won't leave,\" Shen Yin reluctantly returned to the bed and lay down.","She was still thinking about what Shu Yi had told her. It seemed true that she didn't dislike Xu Xiuhe and might even have feelings for him. Otherwise, she wouldn't have brought up divorce and would have continued living indifferently like before. But now that she had feelings, things were different, and she had to take it seriously.","Soon, Zhengzheng fell asleep. Shen Yin didn't know if Xu Xiuhe was asleep too. She got up from the bed and walked over to Xu Xiuhe's side.","Xu Xiuhe wasn't asleep either. Seeing Shen Yin's movements, he immediately pretended to be asleep, terrified that she might take advantage of Zhengzheng's slumber to drive him out of the bedroom.","It's probably true that you can never wake someone who's pretending to be asleep. Shen Yin called out to Xu Xiuhe several times by the bed, but he didn't respond.","Perhaps her voice was too soft, but if she raised it, would she wake Zhengzheng? To be honest, Zhengzheng and Xu Xiuhe did resemble each other; looking at them together, one could tell they were father and son.","Xu Xiuhe kept his eyes closed, relieved that Shen Yin had stopped moving. Had she given up? He secretly rejoiced.","Suddenly, Shen Yin leaned closer. Xu Xiuhe's face did look quite like Zhengzheng's. She couldn't resist and gently pinched his face, just like she did with Zhengzheng's.","Xu Xiuhe could no longer keep up the act and opened his eyes, locking gazes with Shen Yin. She didn't expect him to open his eyes so quickly; her action wasn't forceful, just a light pinch like she did to Zhengzheng, who hadn't woken up. Embarrassed, Shen Yin retracted her hand and took two steps back.","Xu Xiuhe closed his eyes again, pretending nothing had happened.","\"Since you're awake, don't sleep anymore. Let's go out and talk,\" Shen Yin cleared her throat and said.","Xu Xiuhe knew they needed to clarify things between them.","Shen Yin turned and went to the living room, with Xu Xiuhe following behind. On his way out, he quietly closed the door.","They sat on the sofa in the living room in silence for a moment before Xu Xiuhe spoke first, \"About what was said earlier, I disagree. I don't want a divorce, and it's not because you're the mother of my child, but because I have feelings for you.\"","Shen Yin was shocked by this sudden confession.","Xu Xiuhe continued, \"Why did you suddenly bring up divorce? Weren't we doing well just a few days ago? Weren't you going to make clothes for me?\"","As soon as Xu Xiuhe mentioned making clothes, Shen Yin remembered that he had kissed her without her consent.","\"You kissed me without my consent,\" Shen Yin muttered.","\"So if I had your consent, I could kiss you?\" Xu Xiuhe shamelessly said."]},{"number":67,"title":"Chapter 67: It's not what it used to be.","paragraphs":["Every time Shen Yin didn't know how to respond to Xu Xiuhe's out-of-sync words: \"It seems like I don't have any feelings for you.\"","\"Really, not even a little bit?\" Xu Xiuhe's eyes were fixed on Shen Yin, not missing any of the subtle expressions on her face.","Shen Yin hesitated for a moment and said, \"No.\" In reality, whether she had feelings or not, she knew in her heart. Of all her body parts, her mouth was the most stubborn, and she didn't know whose lead she was following.","\"It's okay, as long as I have feelings for you, I like you. As long as you don't resist me, we can slowly cultivate feelings. One day, there will be,\" Xu Xiuhe said confidently.","\"I'm not the Shen Yin I used to be,\" Shen Yin said.","\"I know,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","Shen Yin felt anxious and uneasy. How did Xu Xiuhe know? Did she reveal herself?","\"Don't be afraid, I like you as you are now,\" Xu Xiuhe recalled what Ji Qingyan had said, that the present Shen Yin was a different persona.","\"So from now on, I'll pursue you. Don't run away, and don't mention divorce again, unless I'm gone. Otherwise, in the spouse section, only my name can be there.\" Xu Xiuhe's tone was a little domineering.","He was domineering by nature. He was unwilling to say more to others, but after understanding his feelings, he couldn't wait to share everything with Shen Yin. This must be love.","In comparison, his feelings for Qi Yan could hardly be considered liking her. During the more than a year he was with Qi Yan, she took the initiative in many things. Now, looking back on his attempts to keep her, it was just the routine a boyfriend should go through when breaking up.","Shen Yin didn't know if she had revealed herself to him, but Xu Xiuhe's expression was very sincere. For a fleeting moment, she seemed to see a light in his eyes. If he liked her as she was now, did that mean she didn't have to be so cautious anymore?","\"I still don't know what to do,\" Shen Yin said. Everything was too sudden, she had never faced such a direct confession. At Dashen, she barely interacted with men.","\"Just give me time, leave the rest to me. Take your time accepting it,\" Xu Xiuhe's expression was serious and determined.","Shen Yin thought for a moment and nodded. At the same time, she felt she was overacting, but it didn't matter, at least she had an answer in her heart now.","Xu Xiuhe stood up, heading towards the bedroom: \"Let's go back to sleep then.\"","Before Shen Yin could say anything, he immediately said, \"Xu Yunzheng will be sad if he doesn't see me when he wakes up.\"","Shen Yin's words were stuck in her throat. Xu Xiuhe had anticipated this—Xu Yunzheng was her weakness, and now he knew how to handle her too well.","Shen Yin was exhausted from the day. Her biological clock told her she had to sleep.","The moonlight shone through the window onto the bed. The faint light allowed Xu Xiuhe to vaguely see Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng's faces. He looked up at the window. Tonight's moonlight was beautiful, and his mood was even more beautiful, to the point where he was too excited to sleep.","Xu Xiuhe lay on his side, facing Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng. The minute hand on his watch went around and around. A few frog calls sounded from outside before it became quiet again, so quiet that he could hear the ticking of his watch.","After a sleepless night, Xu Xiuhe got up the moment the sunlight shone through the window. He automatically covered Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng with a blanket, lowered his head, and kissed Xu Yunzheng's forehead.","Shen Yin opened her eyes groggily. She had slept later than usual last night and hadn't woken up yet.","Xu Xiuhe said softly, \"Sleep a little longer, I'll call you when the food is ready.\"","The breakfast Xu Xiuhe made that morning was more abundant than before. There was millet porridge, boiled eggs, and he had also bought some steamed buns and dumplings from the neighbors across the street. He suddenly realized that living here was more comfortable than at Ziyue Ting.","Xu Xiuhe was in a good mood. When he arrived at the company that morning, the receptionist noticed his good mood again.","Messages appeared again in the chat group for dominating Heyuan Group and Yuanji Group.","[The CEO is in a good mood today, but he looks like he has dark circles under his eyes.]","[Was he too vigorous last night? Couldn't sleep at all?]","[Hey, what nonsense are you saying?]","The group of assistants on the top floor saw the messages in the group and were scared. How could they speak so carelessly? They had completely forgotten that they used to be even more unrestrained, revealing the latest news every day.","When Xu Xiuhe entered his office, he saw that Liu Bo had already arrived. Liu Bo had also seen the messages and looked at Xu Xiuhe's face for a few seconds out of curiosity.","\"What's wrong? Is there something on my face? Have you finished processing yesterday's documents? Have you completed the meeting minutes?\"","Liu Bo immediately averted his gaze and replied, \"CEO, everything is done. It's on your desk. Nothing, I'll go now.\"","\"Hmm.\"","After sitting down, Xu Xiuhe opened his phone and saw a flurry of messages pop up in the group. Things like dark circles, physical vigor, how long each time lasted—you name it, it was all there.","Could his dark circles really be that bad? Xu Xiuhe opened the camera. It didn't seem that serious. If you didn't look carefully, you couldn't tell at all.","\"Liu Bo, come in here.\"","These days, Liu Bo's life was a living hell. His boss now often left work early and frequently asked questions beyond his ability, treating him like a search engine.","\"Do I have obvious dark circles?\" Xu Xiuhe asked. Shen Yin had said the same thing before.","Liu Bo took a few steps forward. He had actually noticed when he was inside earlier. The truth was, the CEO had fair skin, so any slight dark circles were noticeable. But these dark circles wouldn't be visible on an ordinary person's face.","\"It's not too bad. If you don't look closely, you can't tell,\" Liu Bo answered honestly.","\"Then who is this person, and how did he notice?\" Xu Xiuhe pointed to the ID in his phone.","Liu Bo had already revealed one person, so revealing another didn't matter. \"CEO, this is Chang Xue, the company receptionist. When we recruited her, the requirements included 5.0 naked vision, courage, attentiveness, and good communication skills. She's also a die-hard fan, so no pimple on anyone's face can escape her eyes.\"","Liu Bo thought Xu Xiuhe would have him summon Chang Xue again, but instead, Xu Xiuhe said, \"Go to Ziyue Ting this afternoon and sort out my clothes and daily necessities from my room, and send them to No. 5 Building on Qinghe Street. Oh, and take Flower Flower home to look after her for a few days.\"","\"Qinghe Street?\" Liu Bo asked.","\"My wife is there, so of course I have to go too.\" This time, Liu Bo was certain he heard a boastful tone in Xu Xiuhe's voice.","After Liu Bo left, Xu Xiuhe took out his phone and sent a message in the Heyuan Group and Yuanji Group chat: [I've had dark circles recently too, so how do I get rid of them?]","[Use eye cream.]","[Go to bed early, exercise and sleep in moderation.]","Xu Xiuhe directly called the most expensive luxury goods store in Rongcheng and ordered 10 bottles of high-end eye cream to be sent to No. 5 Building on Qinghe Street."]},{"number":68,"title":"Chapter 68: Early Summer Limit","paragraphs":["Shen Yin was interviewing new fashion designers. There were three young ladies and a rather feminine young man.","Shen Yin looked at their portfolios and thought they were decent. \"You have half a day to design an outfit with an early summer theme. The type of clothing is not limited.\"","There were a few tables upstairs where Shen Yin asked them to work on their designs. She was also sketching herself. If she could hire someone satisfactory, then she could focus solely on haute couture while leaving Li Huanhuan to handle the rest and increase publicity to raise the brand's profile. As for herself, she planned to develop another career.","\"Hello, I'm the delivery person from the luxury retail store. This is the order for Mr. Xu. Please sign for it.\" The delivery person spoke to Li Huanhuan downstairs.","Li Huanhuan didn't dare sign for it as the brand was unattainably expensive for her. She called Shen Yin: \"Boss, Mr. Xu's order has arrived.\"","When Shen Yin came downstairs, she called Xu Xiuhe: \"The items you ordered are here.\"","\"Please sign for them. I bought some eye cream since you said I had dark circles.\"","\"An entire box full of just eye cream?\" Shen Yin couldn't believe it.","\"Ten bottles, we can use them together,\" Xu Xiuhe happily said, delighted his wife had called him proactively. He decided to buy more gifts to be delivered to the little house.","Li Huanhuan stifled a laugh nearby. She had seen people hoarding items, but never to this extent. This brand was notoriously difficult to purchase, requiring VIP registration. Each tiny bottle of eye cream cost 5,499 yuan. Surely the boss's husband didn't think one bottle was for a single day's use?","\"That's too much. We should return some,\" Shen Yin suggested.","\"But we can't return items after purchase. We'll use them up, or give extras away as gifts,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Shen Yin was speechless. After signing, she politely thanked the delivery person.","Shen Yin opened the exquisite gift box and took out five bottles of eye cream, handing them to Li Huanhuan. \"You four can each have one bottle. I think we'll have a new member join today, so the remaining bottle is for her.\"","When Shen Yin had come downstairs earlier, she had decided to keep the short-haired girl while passing through the second floor.","Li Huanhuan stood dazed, thinking she had misheard. But the five bottles of eye cream were right in front of her – worth over a month's salary.","Shen Yin went upstairs and approached the short-haired girl. \"What's your name?\"","\"I'm Wang Nannan.\"","\"Okay, you're hired. Sorry, the three of you can leave. To compensate for the time, our studio will give each of you 200 yuan.\" Shen Yin had already transferred the money to Li Huanhuan's account.","Not only was Li Huanhuan stunned downstairs, but it was the first time she had seen unsuccessful interviewees receive compensation. The other three were stunned too, feeling awkward after realizing they likely wouldn't be hired after seeing Wang Nannan's impressive designs.","\"Wang Nannan, how long have you studied fashion design?\"","\"Four years in university, plus two more years of continuing education.\"","\"Not bad. Do you know why I hired you?\"","Wang Nannan shook her head.","\"Your design sketches show your experience. The dress you designed was clearly well-thought-out.\"","Wang Nannan's dress design was indeed thoughtful. For the early summer theme, she used green as the main color with red accents. Red and green together could seem gaudy, but Shen Yin sensed an elegance in this design.","The reason was that Wang Nannan had incorporated traditional elements, using an ancient V-neck style for the collar. It was a short dress in shades of cooling green, with lotus leaf edges on the skirt and a touch of red on the sleeves – perfectly balanced. With some modifications, it could be produced.","Shen Yin assigned Wang Nannan some orders from the studio and found her an office on the second floor. Next, Shen Yin would sketch out various furniture designs from Dasheng based on her memories.","As Shen Yin went to the third floor, she didn't forget to bring the eye creams.","\"Mom, here's an eye cream for you,\" Shen Yin said to Fang Yue, who was sitting on the sofa reading with Zhengzheng.","\"Why do you have so many bottles of eye cream? Did Xiuhe buy them?\" Fang Yue noticed the expensive brand up close.","\"Yes, he bought ten bottles,\" Shen Yin said.","\"But there are only five here. Where are the rest?\" Fang Yue asked.","\"I gave them to Chen Nuan, Huanhuan, and the others.\"","Fang Yue didn't know what to say. \"Yin, do you know how much each bottle costs?\"","Shen Yin shook her head, having no recollection from the original person's memories.","\"5,499 yuan per bottle,\" Fang Yue said, aware of Xu Xiuhe's wealth but surprised her daughter was so casual about money.","It was indeed expensive, Shen Yin thought, but she and Xu Xiuhe couldn't use ten bottles anyway. She might as well give them as employee benefits.","\"Oh, Mom, you take one too,\" Shen Yin offered.","Of course Fang Yue would accept a gift from her daughter and son-in-law.","\"Mom, I'm not busy. Let me cook lunch while you take Zhengzheng.\"","Shen Yin hadn't been in the kitchen for a few days. She skillfully sliced potatoes, meat, and prepped various ingredients. The fridge had plenty of vegetables.","While in the living room, Fang Yue's mind was in the kitchen. She had never seen Shen Yin cook before. At home, she rarely cooked herself, having a maid. Occasionally she felt like cooking, but only once in a while. Here in the small house, the third floor wasn't as spacious as a villa, so having an extra person would be inconvenient.","After some time, Shen Yin had prepared steamed pork balls, shrimp with phoenix tails, stir-fried vegetables with mushrooms, and shredded potatoes.","Fang Yue looked at the dishes, surprised. \"Yin, when did you learn to cook so much? Your mother didn't even know.\"","\"I learned abroad,\" Shen Yin lied.","Fang Yue tasted the food and found it better than what she had eaten at fancy restaurants, feeling both proud and guilty. \"Yin, you really struggled these past few years.\"","\"Mom, let's not dwell on the past. Let's eat,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Okay, okay, let's talk about something happier. I saw on social media that the show Zhengzheng acted in airs tonight. Is that right?\" Fang Yue turned and smiled at Zhengzheng.","\"Yes, Zhengzheng acted. Zhengzheng also acted yesterday,\" Zhengzheng happily said while eating.","\"Oh? Tell Grandma what play you acted in yesterday,\" Fang Yue curiously leaned in to ask."]},{"number":69,"title":"Chapter 69: My Wife","paragraphs":["\"Dad said a real man should be flexible and yield softly,\" Zhengzheng only vaguely remembered the words.","Huh? Fang Yue was slightly confused by the words she heard, wondering what it meant to be flexible and soft, and why Zhengzheng had to pretend to cry.","Shen Yin, however, realized what was going on. How pitiful she felt for him last night, blaming herself for a while. Little did she expect that it was all an act orchestrated by Xu Xiuhe, who, at his age, was teaching a little kid to fake cry. How shameless.","\"Zhengzheng, did your dad say that a real man should be flexible and yield softly? Did he ask you to pretend to cry?\" Shen Yin patiently asked.","After a moment of thinking, Zhengzheng nodded, \"Yes.\"","Fang Yue finally understood, \"But why did your dad ask you to pretend to cry?\"","\"Dad said...\" Zhengzheng started, pointing at the sofa, \"Dad said the sofa was uncomfortable.\"","As Zhengzheng was about to continue, Shen Yin quickly interjected, \"Zhengzheng, have a shrimp.\" She placed a shrimp in Zhengzheng's small bowl.","Fang Yue sensed something was off with Shen Yin's behavior. Could it be that Shen Yin wanted Xu Xiuhe to sleep on the sofa? She gave Shen Yin an inquisitive look, trying to read her expression, but Shen Yin's acting was too good to reveal anything.","In reality, Shen Yin could hardly keep up the act anymore. Just yesterday afternoon, she had told Fang Yue that there was no conflict between her and Xu Xiuhe. Now, if Fang Yue found out that Shen Yin had wanted Xu Xiuhe to sleep on the sofa last night, she would nag about it all day.","For now, Zhengzheng was Shen Yin's little buddy, and she couldn't let him spill the beans.","\"Yin, in a marriage, you need to be understanding and tolerant of each other. Be careful not to let ill-intentioned people take advantage of any misunderstandings,\" Fang Yue advised in a seasoned tone.","\"I know, Mom,\" Shen Yin replied. There was no misunderstanding between her and Xu Xiuhe. As for those trying to take advantage, it seemed there was one.","Shen Yin was furious. Why did she believe Zhengzheng and Xu Xiuhe's lies last night? Those two big liars.","After the meal, Shen Yin sent Xu Xiuhe a message:","[Be careful what you say to Zhengzheng in the future. Don't teach him to lie.]","Xu Xiuhe had already pinned Shen Yin's chat and set up message notifications. He had even changed her nickname to \"Wife\".","The moment he saw Shen Yin's message, without even thinking about how he was exposed, he immediately called her back in a lowered voice, \"Wife, I was wrong. I won't do it again. From now on, I'll obediently listen to you.\"","On the other end of the phone, Shen Yin was once again rendered speechless by Xu Xiuhe's unique way with words.","After a long pause, Shen Yin said, \"Be serious, I mean it.\"","\"I am being serious,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"Nevermind, I'm hanging up.\" Without any warning, Shen Yin abruptly ended the call.","On his end, Xu Xiuhe stared at the disconnected phone in a daze. That was fast. It was the first time someone had hung up on him in years. So this was what it felt like.","In the group chat with Chang Zhiyuan and Xue Jingrui, Chang Zhiyuan sent a message: [Are you guys free tonight? Let's meet up at 8 PM at Qingfeng Mingyue.]","Xu Xiuhe replied: [No, I need to go home and spend time with my wife and kid.] He had just made some progress and couldn't afford to slack off now. He had to strike while the iron was hot. Shen Yin would eventually develop feelings for him.","[Oh, showing off your hot and cozy family life, huh? Xue Jingrui and I will hang out then.] Chang Zhiyuan tagged Xue Jingrui.","[I'm not free either. My parents have arranged a blind date for me tonight,] Xue Jingrui replied.","[That was so sudden! Is marriage the next step then? Waaah, I'm the only single dog left.] Chang Zhiyuan sent a crying emoji after his message.","[Yeah, it's pretty fast. Who's the other party?] Xu Xiuhe asked.","[Qi Ji]","[What a strange name, like a miracle,] Chang Zhiyuan had never heard that name before.","[The youngest daughter of the Qi family from Yang City,] Xue Jingrui explained.","Chang Zhiyuan was intrigued, [Oh, so she's not from Rong City. Will you go to Yang City then?]","[No need. I heard she's already in Rong City. This is supposed to be a blind date, but it's pretty much settled. Just like you said, marriage might be the next step. We'll meet tonight,] Xue Jingrui said.","[Holy shit, that's so sudden! I'm the real clown now. Buddy, that's not cool. Once you get married, my mom will nag me about getting married every day,] Chang Zhiyuan was shocked.","[No way, I'm coming too tonight. I want to see what Xue Jingrui's future wife looks like,] Chang Zhiyuan sent another message.","[It's just a blind date, why do you need to butt in? Any progress with Shu Yi?]","[No progress yet, but I still want to see this 'miracle' girl. As long as she's better than Qi Yan, it means your good deeds from your past life are being rewarded,] Chang Zhiyuan had always disliked Qi Yan. Years ago, Xu Xiuhe had walked away, but now Xue Jingrui seemed to be falling into the same trap. Chang Zhiyuan couldn't understand what was so appealing about that woman that had Xue Jingrui so infatuated.","[Xiuhe, you really don't want to come and take a look?] The talkative Chang Zhiyuan asked again.","[No, you go ahead. I need to go home and watch my son's TV drama tonight,] Xu Xiuhe replied.","Oh right, Chang Zhiyuan suddenly remembered that Shu Yi's drama was airing tonight. He should show some support. No problem, he could both see the spectacle and watch the drama at the same time, he reassured himself.","Xu Xiuhe had been busy with work today and had some documents left unfinished. Since it was Friday, he figured he could work a bit longer today and take tomorrow off. Liu Assistant could handle any less important matters.","Liu Assistant was currently packing up Xu Xiuhe's things at Ziyu Courtyard. After receiving Xu Xiuhe's message, he felt the need to tell the CEO that he needed time to deal with personal matters. After all, he wasn't that young anymore. All these years, he had traded his time for money.","When Liu Assistant arrived at Qinghe Villa where Shen Yin was staying, she was shocked to see him, \"Aren't you Xu Xiuhe's assistant? Why are you here?\"","\"Madam, the CEO said that wherever his wife is, that's his home,\" Liu Assistant felt he had brilliantly conveyed and even elaborated on Xu Xiuhe's intentions. If the CEO knew about his reply, he would definitely give him a raise.","Upon hearing this, Shen Yin wished she could find a hole to crawl into. It was now quitting time, and the five young ladies were downstairs, barely holding back their laughter.","Holding Zhengzheng, Shen Yin turned around, intending to escape, \"Please take it upstairs.\"","Liu Assistant followed them up.","The five young ladies exchanged glances, with only Wang Nannan looking puzzled, unaware of the situation.","\"Here, one bottle each. It's a gift from the boss,\" Li Huanhuan took out some eye creams from behind the counter.","\"Wow, these are so expensive!\" Chen Nuan exclaimed.","Seeing Wang Nannan's confused expression, Li Huanhuan smiled, \"Don't be surprised. Our boss's husband is the CEO of Heyuan Group. They're a sweet couple every day. There's even a fan club for them on social media called 'Galaxy CP.' You should join and fangirl over them.\"","\"That's right, they're so shippable. The real-life CP is right in front of us. Oh my, I'm indulging in some sugar today,\" Jiang Meiyan eagerly promoted.","Unable to contain herself, Li Huanhuan said, \"Let me share some sugar. These eye creams were bought by the boss's husband. He bought 10 bottles. His spending power is just too strong.\""]},{"number":70,"title":"Chapter 70: Ying Ying Rode a Horse with a Smile","paragraphs":["When Xu Xiuhe returned to the small building in Qinghe, the employees in the studio had already left for the day. He parked his car and glanced at the lights on the third floor, instantly feeling a sense of belonging.","Upon entering, he went straight to the third floor after closing the door. Shen Yin had her hair tied in two low buns and was stir-frying in the kitchen, while Xu Yunzheng sat on the carpet in the living room, playing with building blocks.","Xu Xiuhe walked into the kitchen and said, \"Dear, sorry I'm late. You must be tired.\" He actually wanted to hug Shen Yin from behind, but was afraid her instinctive reaction might cause her to swing the spatula at his head, so he thought better of it.","\"Mm, dinner will be ready soon. Take Xu Yunzheng to wash his hands first,\" Shen Yin said.","Xu Xiuhe felt that his wife's words were commands now, so he immediately took Xu Yunzheng to wash his hands.","In the bathroom, Xu Xiuhe held Xu Yunzheng up to the sink so he could reach it. Xu Yunzheng played happily with the water, and Xu Xiuhe asked softly, \"Xu Yunzheng, did you tell your mom that you were pretending to cry last night?\"","Xu Yunzheng was too busy playing with the bubbles on his hands to pay attention to Xu Xiuhe. Helplessly, Xu Xiuhe rinsed the bubbles off Xu Yunzheng's hands, washed his own hands, and dried them both with a towel.","After dinner, Xu Xiuhe took the initiative to clean up the dishes and wash the pots in the kitchen.","Shen Yin sat on the couch with Xu Yunzheng, waiting for the broadcast of \"The Legend of Xian Xi.\"","At 8 o'clock sharp, \"The Legend of Xian Xi\" started on time. Xu Xiuhe sat on the couch, deliberately next to Shen Yin, their arms touching.","Xu Xiuhe wore a short-sleeved shirt, while Shen Yin had on a casual T-shirt. Sitting so close, their bare skin touched, and they could feel each other's warmth. Shen Yin felt awkward and uncomfortable, so she shifted away slightly. But Xu Xiuhe moved closer again, and Shen Yin shifted once more. Xu Xiuhe clung to her like a leech.","As Shen Yin tried to move again, Xu Xiuhe said domineeringly, \"Stop moving. If you keep shifting, Xu Yunzheng will fall off.\"","Shen Yin didn't dare move anymore. The TV played the opening theme, which Shen Yin found quite pleasant.","\"Mommy!\" Xu Yunzheng pointed at the TV.","\"Xu Yunzheng, that's not Mommy. You're mistaken. Mommy will be sad,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"It's Mommy!\" Xu Yunzheng insisted loudly.","The opening sequence included a clip of Xian Xi riding a horse with Jiang Yuce, their faces unseen but their silhouettes quite dashing.","Xu Xiuhe looked at Shen Yin and noticed her smiling and patting Xu Yunzheng's head. Could it really be Shen Yin?","If it was indeed Shen Yin, then he was in trouble for not recognizing his own wife and telling his son he was mistaken. Xu Xiuhe thought he might have to sleep on the couch that night.","As the first episode played, Xu Xiuhe's attention had drifted. He messaged Chang Zhiyuan, \"Has my wife ever appeared on TV before?\"","Chang Zhiyuan was eavesdropping on Xue Jingrui's conversation with Qi Ji, eager not to miss any gossip about their relationship. Seeing Xu Xiuhe's message, he dismissively replied, \"I think she rode a horse.\"","Boom, Xu Xiuhe really felt doomed. \"Send me her original video clip of that right now.\"","Chang Zhiyuan had to ask Wang Ming, who in turn requested the raw footage from the editing team. After much effort, Xu Xiuhe finally saw the unedited video from all angles, revealing the full beauty and grace of the scene.","If one had to describe it in a sentence: \"A gentle smile as she gracefully rode by, her natural beauty and poise caught every eye.\"","The untouched footage showed Shen Yin's determination and inner strength, as well as her gentle, graceful demeanor.","Xu Xiuhe turned to her. \"Dear, I was wrong. My eyes failed me. You can scold me however you want, but please don't make me sleep on the couch.\"","Shen Yin didn't know what was going on, but she felt an urge to laugh at how adorable Xu Xiuhe seemed.","\"No talking during the show,\" she replied.","Xu Xiuhe promptly fell silent. Since Shen Yin didn't say anything else, did that mean he could still sleep in their bed tonight? With that thought, his mood brightened instantly.","Seeing Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng both engrossed in the show, the latter occasionally calling out \"Mommy,\" Xu Xiuhe had an idea.","He suddenly kissed Shen Yin's cheek and quickly pulled away. Shen Yin was caught completely off guard and touched her face, thinking to herself, \"Scoundrel!\"","Unfortunately, Xu Yunzheng had witnessed the whole thing. Imitating his father, he seized the moment while Shen Yin was distracted and kissed her other cheek, then giggled mischievously.","\"Xu Yunzheng, you can't just kiss girls other than Mommy, understand?\" Shen Yin said gently.","Xu Xiuhe had drawn a bath and came to carry Xu Yunzheng in. \"Xu Yunzheng, Daddy's going to give you a bath, and then it's bedtime.\"","As Xu Yunzheng sat naked in the child's bathtub, Xu Xiuhe suddenly said, \"Xu Yunzheng, you're growing up.\"","\"Yes, Xu Yunzheng is a big boy now, a real man,\" Xu Yunzheng proudly slapped his hand on the water.","\"Real men can't just kiss girls, including Mommy. I'll give you one more year. When you turn three, you can't kiss Mommy or sleep with her anymore, got it?\"","Xu Yunzheng pouted and shook his head.","Having successfully stolen a kiss, Xu Xiuhe decided to let it go for now and teach Xu Yunzheng again when he turned three.","After bathing Xu Yunzheng, Xu Xiuhe put him on the bed in the bedroom and quickly showered himself before joining them.","\"Dear, I've drawn your bath. You can go ahead,\" he said cheerfully.","Seeing that Xu Yunzheng was almost asleep, Xu Xiuhe checked his phone and saw Chang Zhiyuan's messages in the group chat.","\"I seriously suspect Xue Jingrui is involved in child trafficking. That girl Qi Ji looks like a minor,\" Chang Zhiyuan commented.","\"No, she's 22, just graduated from university. She has a baby face,\" Xue Jingrui replied.","\"Oh, she does look really young. But she's pretty cute, and has a sweet way of speaking. Not bad, Xue Jingrui. You must have accumulated great virtue in your past life,\" Chang Zhiyuan said.","\"When's the wedding?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Getting the marriage license next Monday, wedding ceremony set for mid-next month,\" Xue Jingrui responded.","\"Damn, that's fast. Hard to believe. Does Qi Yan know?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","Xue Jingrui didn't reply, and Chang Zhiyuan furiously typed away.","\"Xue Jingrui, let me tell you, Qi Yan is not the right match for you. You need to let her go. Do you really think she genuinely likes Xu Xiuhe? You think she's after his money? Her family's not short on money either, so why is she pursuing Xu Xiuhe relentlessly? It's because what you can't have is the most desirable. She can't stand losing. A woman's pride and obsession can be terrifying sometimes. How could she not know you like her? But why hasn't she responded? Because having a rich and powerful man pursuing her, being his backup option, is something for her to be proud of and satisfies her vanity. But the moment you stop liking her, just watch, she'll definitely react. So it's best to cut ties cleanly. I think this girl Qi Ji seems quite nice.\""]},{"number":71,"title":"Chapter 71: Magical Dreams","paragraphs":["Chang Zhiyuan had sent messages to the group, which the two people saw.","Xu Xiuhe expressed his default and remained silent.","A moment later, Xue Jingrui sent a message [Okay, got it.]","Chang Zhiyuan was finally satisfied, [Brother, the road ahead is long and arduous. Not having feelings now doesn't mean you won't have them in the future. It's a long journey, you have to try. Look at Xiuhe, he's always talking about his wife and kids these days, isn't that great? Who knows, maybe by this time next year, you'll be able to hold your son too.]","When Xu Xiuhe saw that Chang Zhiyuan had cued him, he replied [Sleeping with my wife and child, you guys chat slowly.] Then he turned off his phone, lay down, and waited for Shen Yin to come in.","[Look at this guy, showing off again.]","Xue Jingrui [.]","After taking a shower, Shen Yin returned to the bedroom, only to see Xu Xiuhe lying next to Zhengzheng with his eyes closed. Since they had already slept in the same bed twice, she couldn't be so petty as to make herself sleep on the couch, right? Besides, they each slept on their own side, so it wasn't a big deal. Thinking this, Shen Yin slept on the other side of Zhengzheng.","Xu Xiuhe only felt at ease when he saw Shen Yin lying down. He secretly opened his eyes, looked at the mother and son, and then closed his eyes again.","The night became quiet again. Zhengzheng didn't sleep well and liked to snuggle up to people. Coincidentally, Shen Yin also liked to sleep snuggled up to Zhengzheng during this period. As a result, the two moved in the same direction.","Xu Xiuhe was squeezed to the edge of the bed again, in a position where he could fall off with just one turn. With no choice, Xu Xiuhe got up and slept next to Shen Yin. He was afraid that Shen Yin would go and snuggle up to Zhengzheng again, and what if Zhengzheng fell to the ground? That wouldn't do.","He pulled Shen Yin into his embrace, holding her in his arms. Sure enough, Zhengzheng moved a bit toward Shen Yin's side. Now no one would be squeezed off the bed.","But after a while, Xu Xiuhe regretted it. What sin had he committed? The bundle in his arms was soft and gave off a wonderful scent. As a grown man, he simply couldn't resist.","Shen Yin was dreaming, but this time her dream wasn't a nightmare. In the dream, she saw a girl, about sixteen or seventeen years old, with her hair tied in a high ponytail, sitting in a classroom.","For some reason, Shen Yin felt that this girl gave her a strange feeling, as if she had never met her before, yet she seemed so familiar. The girl in the dream was full of collagen and exuded the energy of youth.","It wasn't until the girl wrote in her diary, \"Today is the 30th day of Yinyin's transmigration. I wonder if my dad and mom miss me. Although my current dad and mom are very good to me, I still miss them a little.\"","It was then that Shen Yin realized that this girl was the original Shen Yin, who had transmigrated to another world. But her appearance, expression, and mentality didn't seem quite like the original host's. After all, the original host had been in so much pain before. Shen Yin was puzzled and moved a little in Xu Xiuhe's embrace.","Then the dream continued, and the girl wrote another passage: \"It's so strange, why did I end up here? I was taking an exam, felt sleepy and took a nap, but when I opened my eyes again, I was in an unfamiliar classroom with people I didn't know, and I had changed from Shen Yin to Tou Yu.\"","So the original host had also transmigrated to another world like her? Then what about the original host's memories? Why was it that she had fallen asleep during an exam and gone over? Shen Yin didn't understand, but seeing the original host's radiant smile, she suddenly felt at peace. She wanted to learn more, but it was as if a mysterious force suddenly pulled her out of the dream.","Shen Yin opened her eyes and her consciousness became clear. She felt that something was amiss, why was she in Xu Xiuhe's embrace, and so close too? She clearly felt something poking her thigh, and two seconds later she suddenly understood what it was. It seemed that all the TV shows, books, and paperbacks she had studied before weren't in vain.","Shen Yin hurried to struggle and get up.","\"Don't move.\" Xu Xiuhe could no longer hold back, but it wasn't time yet. Shen Yin hadn't accepted him yet, so he got up and went into the bathroom.","Shen Yin lay in bed for a long time, dazed. She opened her phone - it was 12:30 AM.","Shen Yin also got up and walked into the living room, drank some water, and then sat on the couch. She needed to sort out her thoughts, not only about Xu Xiuhe's reaction just now, but also about the dream she had.","Either of these things was enough to keep her awake tonight. She had to calm down.","More than half an hour later, Xu Xiuhe came out of the bathroom but didn't see Shen Yin in bed.","He panicked. His hair was still dripping wet, but he left the bedroom and saw Shen Yin sitting dazed on the couch. Xu Xiuhe walked over and said softly, \"Sorry, I scared you just now. I didn't mean it, it was just a physiological reaction of the body.\"","Shen Yin turned her face to look at Xu Xiuhe. He was wearing pajamas with a serious expression, his hair dripping water.","\"Do you know where the former Shen Yin went?\" Shen Yin asked calmly.","Xu Xiuhe was shocked. What was going on? Was it possible that he had just scared Shen Yin into some kind of mental disorder and she was now talking nonsense? Xu Xiuhe's expression changed from serious to suspicious.","Seeing that Xu Xiuhe didn't speak, Shen Yin continued, \"Sit down first.\"","Xu Xiuhe sat down upon hearing this.","\"We used to sit like this in the living room too. I said I wasn't the former Shen Yin anymore, and you said you knew. How did you know?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"You've recovered to normal,\" Xu Xiuhe replied honestly.","\"Hmm, there are indeed many things that can't be explained by science, like why I ended up here.\"","Xu Xiuhe still didn't know what to say and just looked at Shen Yin silently. He seemed to understand that Shen Yin's meaning of \"I'm not the former Shen Yin\" wasn't the same as his understanding.","Xu Xiuhe remained relatively calm, after all, Shen Yin's dream was predictive. \"So where are you from?\"","\"Oh, I'm from a dynasty that never existed in history. You might say it's incredible, but if I had to name a period, it would probably be the Song Dynasty. Our history is the same as the Song Dynasty, but there's no record of our Dasheng Dynasty in history.\"","Xu Xiuhe was very shocked, and then fear followed. He was afraid that the person in front of him would leave at any time, disappear from his sight at any moment.","\"Will you leave here?\" Xu Xiuhe asked in a trembling voice.","\"Do you know how I got here?\"","Xu Xiuhe shook his head.","\"I was originally the legitimate daughter of a wealthy family, destined to live a carefree life. But my stepmother thought I would hinder her path, so she planned to marry me off to a prince 21 years older than me. I didn't want that, so I tried to force my father to refuse by attempting suicide. I chose to jump into a lake. I had arranged for someone to rescue me, but it turned out that the person meant to rescue me was working for my stepmother all along.\""]},{"number":72,"title":"Chapter 72: Can't He","paragraphs":["A while ago, it made Xu Xiuhe even more heartbroken.","\"So I came here, and when I woke up, I was lying in the bathtub, while the original Shen Yin had drowned herself in the bathtub. I don't know how much courage she mustered to choose to leave in this way.\"","\"She chose to leave because she wanted to escape the pain. By the way, she didn't dislike you. She disliked her inability to do anything about that relationship. I later realized that in that relationship, she was the biggest victim, but she still doesn't know that. The person she liked is now married.\"","Xu Xiuhe was shocked. That was a lot of information to take in. No wonder Shen Yin didn't want to talk to him before and spoke coldly to him. Thinking about it now, her behavior wasn't unreasonable at all.","\"What about her now?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"I thought she had died, but I just dreamed of her. She has also gone to another world, seemingly having lost the memory of that painful experience, and is still in school now.\"","Xu Xiuhe processed this, then asked, \"Will you leave?\"","Shen Yin shook her head. \"The dream told me, since I'm here, I should stay.\"","Xu Xiuhe's anxious heart finally settled.","\"Does anyone else know about this?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Shen Yin shook her head again.","\"Good, don't let anyone else know, including your parents,\" Xu Xiuhe advised. No one would believe such a thing. They might even think she's mentally ill. And if someone did believe it, it could invite unnecessary trouble.","\"Okay, but I'm actually 16 years old. Could you please not...\" Shen Yin looked at Xu Xiuhe's lower body.","Xu Xiuhe rubbed his forehead. After all this, his wife was still a minor. Suddenly, an idea struck Xu Xiuhe.","\"Don't take advantage of me not being from ancient times. For you, 15 was the 'ji li' age, meaning you reached the age to wear a ji li hairpin. For girls, 15 was the most suitable age for marriage. I've already gifted you a hairpin, not to mention your body is already 24 years old. No matter how you look at it, I can do it, and it's not something I can control.\"","Shen Yin was dumbfounded by Xu Xiuhe's long-winded argument. Thinking about it carefully, what he said did seem to make sense.","\"So you told me all this because you trust me or have accepted me, right?\" Xu Xiuhe pushed further.","\"Who accepted you?\" Shen Yin's words lacked conviction, as if she did trust Xu Xiuhe now.","\"Do you still like me this way?\" Shen Yin asked seriously.","\"I do. Remember, I like you - the normal you, or rather the you from Dasheng. You'll always be the only one in my spouse column, understand?\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Shen Yin felt embarrassed and lowered her head. Such a direct confession was something she had never heard before.","\"Can you give me a timeframe for when you might accept me?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"I don't know,\" Shen Yin truly didn't know, but she felt like she had already accepted him.","\"Then in the future, can I hug you and kiss you?\" Xu Xiuhe asked again.","Shen Yin didn't respond.","\"Your silence means you consent,\" Xu Xiuhe said, then scooped Shen Yin up and carried her to the bedroom.","\"I can walk myself,\" Shen Yin said.","Xu Xiuhe ignored her and kept carrying her as Shen Yin didn't struggle.","Xu Xiuhe laid Shen Yin on the bed, then lay down himself.","The sober Shen Yin felt extremely uncomfortable lying in Xu Xiuhe's embrace. She could clearly smell his faint, pleasant scent.","\"Could you not hug me? I'm not used to it,\" she said.","\"My dear wife, if I don't hug you, my junior will get squished,\" Xu Xiuhe whispered in Shen Yin's ear in a low, sexy voice.","Shen Yin's ear tickled, and she wanted to change positions.","\"Don't move. I don't want another cold shower. If something really happens, you'll have to take responsibility,\" Xu Xiuhe said in a deep voice tinged with sensuality.","Over the years, Xu Xiuhe had only been intimate with his wife on their wedding night. His desire wasn't usually strong, and he could often take care of it himself, but not this time with the woman he liked in his arms. He was a little afraid he might lose control.","Shen Yin didn't dare move and stiffened, then fell asleep without realizing it.","The first rays of morning sunlight shone in again, and Shen Yin woke up. She tiptoed to the bathroom, brushed her teeth, and washed her face.","Then she cooked breakfast: steamed buns, soy milk, and egg soup. As usual, after eating, Xu Xiuhe went to work, and the company employees gradually arrived.","Shen Yin sat at her desk, continuing to write her next plan. Fengfeng sat on the carpet, scribbling in a notebook with a pen. Suddenly, her phone rang.","\"Hello,\" Shen Yin answered without checking who it was.","\"Yin Yin, Mom has something to do this morning, so I won't come over until the afternoon,\" said Fang Yue.","\"Okay, Mom, I'm not busy. You don't need to come today.\"","\"Alright,\" Fang Yue hung up.","Then a message popped up from Shu Yi.","[Yin Yin, did you watch my show last night?]","[What do you think?] Shen Yin replied.","[Hahaha, Yin Yin, you're so great. Xu Xiuhe really lucked out in his previous eight lifetimes. By the way, have you two made any progress?]","[I think I might like him a little now.]","[Oh, what stage are you at?]","[Last night he hugged me while we slept.]","[Wow, that's progressing fast. Was that all, or did you do other things?]","[No.] Shen Yin blushed at the message.","When Shu Yi saw Shen Yin's reply, her first thought was that Xu Xiuhe really had no reaction while holding such a beauty in his arms.","Shu Yi sent a video call, which Shen Yin hurriedly answered. \"Is he impotent?!\" Shu Yi's gossipy heart had never been stronger - this was even juicier than celebrity gossip about secret marriages.","Shen Yin suddenly remembered her situation upon waking from a dream last night, so she whispered, \"He's capable.\"","\"Hahahaha, no need to be shy. You're married, it's normal,\" Shu Yi had already imagined all sorts of scenarios.","\"Will it hurt a lot?\" Shen Yin shyly asked, truly afraid.","\"Based on my many years of reading novels, it should be bitter at first, then sweet. It's supposed to feel great,\" Shu Yi imparted her wisdom.","\"Come on, Yin Yin. You, a mother, are asking me, a virgin, this question. Don't you think that's a bit unreasonable?\" Shu Yi laughed.","Shen Yin thought about it - that was indeed unreasonable. \"Then who should I ask? You're my only friend.\""]},{"number":73,"title":"Chapter 73: The Untold Story","paragraphs":["In an instant, Shu Yi felt heartbroken. She had been there too, hadn't she? The entertainment industry was all about personal interests, and no one could speak their true feelings. So she chose to escape. When there were shows to film, she would act; when there were none, she would live her own life. Back in high school, she had a very good friend, but that friend eventually ended up with the person Shu Yi had secretly admired.","She pretended not to care, but deep down, she felt hurt. After entering university and getting busy with their own lives, Shu Yi let go of her feelings for that secret crush. But her friend had already made new friends. Shu Yi no longer had any close friends around her, so meeting Shen Yin was her great fortune.","Becoming friends with Shen Yin was quite miraculous. Before she knew it, they had become very close. Sometimes, fate truly works in wondrous ways. You never know what might happen the next second, nor can you predict what kind of person will click with you, until you meet them.","\"Yin Yin, although I can't experience it firsthand for you, I can look into the novel again. If that doesn't work, I can watch the movie adaptation for you. Wait for me, I'll let you know tonight,\" Shu Yi said casually.","\"That's too much trouble for you,\" Shen Yin replied.","\"We're close friends,\" Shu Yi's expression conveyed a sense of assurance.","After hanging up the call, Shu Yi did indeed open a novel website. Just as she was reading an intriguing synopsis, a message popped up.","Seeing that long-forgotten name, those two familiar words, felt strangely unfamiliar to Shu Yi.","The sender was Wei Yuan. [Yue Ru, it's June already. Are you coming to the class reunion?]","Shu Yi didn't reply.","[At the hotel across from Rong City No.3 Middle School, the time is set for tomorrow night. Please come this time, it's been years since we last saw each other,] Wei Yuan urged.","Shu Yi looked at the message. Since graduating, she had indeed never attended any class reunions. It wasn't because she was putting on airs as a celebrity but rather because she had never truly blended in with that class during high school.","After some thought, Shu Yi changed her clothes, grabbed her car keys, and headed to Qinghe Villa.","\"Is your boss on the third floor?\" Shu Yi asked Li Huanhuan on the first floor.","\"Yes, yes,\" Li Huanhuan nodded excitedly. For her, this wasn't just a job; she was also an avid fan.","Upon reaching the third floor, Shu Yi changed into a pair of slippers and peeked in, asking, \"Didn't your auntie come today?\"","Hearing her voice, Zhengzheng looked up and called out, \"Auntie mom.\" After that, she continued playing with her little building blocks.","Shen Yin raised her head, a bit surprised. \"Why did you come over now? Don't tell me you've figured out the answer to my question and rushed here to tell me.\"","\"I'm here to freeload a meal,\" Shu Yi said matter-of-factly.","\"You had me worried for a second there. I actually thought you had found the answer and came to share it with me,\" Shen Yin replied.","Hearing this, Shu Yi chuckled, \"How could I figure it out so quickly? I came to find you because there's something I want to confide in you about.\"","Shen Yin raised an eyebrow, concerned. \"Did something happen?\"","\"Let me show you what I looked like before,\" Shu Yi said, taking out her phone from her bag and opening the photo gallery. She flipped to a picture and handed the phone to Shen Yin.","Shen Yin looked at the photo, then at Shu Yi, and said, \"The change is quite significant, but if you look closely, it's not that different.\"","In the photo, Shu Yi's face was dark and red, with some acne. She looked rather chubby, wearing black-framed glasses with thick, old-fashioned lenses. Overall, she was nearly unrecognizable compared to her current self.","\"For the three years of high school, I pretty much looked like this,\" Shu Yi said, her expression showing her reluctance to recall that past. \"I got sick in middle school and took a lot of medication. Then, during military training, I got sunburned. My face became puffy, dark, and covered in acne. At that time, I was always very self-conscious, feeling like an ugly duckling unable to fit in with the group. I had a very low presence in class. There was only one friend, named Wei Yuan. She had a great personality, was beautiful, and had many friends around her.\"","Shu Yi leaned her head on Shen Yin's shoulder, and Shen Yin gently patted her back.","\"It's okay, that's all in the past now. Our Shu Yi is now a big star loved by so many people,\" Shen Yin comforted her, not expecting that the cool and aloof Shu Yi she saw on TV had such a past, so different from the open-hearted persona she showed in private.","\"My original name wasn't Shu Yi; Shu Yi is just my stage name. Only a few people know that my real name is Shu Yue Ru. Isn't it a bit rustic?\" Shu Yi asked with a laugh.","\"Not at all, it's a nice name,\" Shen Yin replied.","\"During the summer after the college entrance exams, my mom took me to get LASIK surgery. Every night, she would take me out for runs to exercise. With the medication having stopped for a few years, my body slowly regained its shape, and my skin became fairer. Luckily, I was in an experimental class, and my exam scores were decent, so I got into Rong City University of Science and Technology to study mechanical engineering. Acting was purely accidental for me. A film crew came to our university to shoot a movie, and the director selected me. Later on, thanks to some good luck, I acted in several low-budget youth dramas during college and got signed by the media company under the Chang Corporation due to my decent acting skills. Back then, I almost didn't graduate because of acting,\" Shu Yi suddenly straightened up as she spoke.","\"That's amazing, balancing work and studies so well,\" Shen Yin praised.","\"I actually had a secret crush on a boy in high school. When we graduated in our senior year, he got together with Wei Yuan. I instantly lost my feelings for him. Apart from Wei Yuan, I cut off contact with everyone else in the class. They probably don't even know that Shu Yi is actually Shu Yue Ru. After all, who would pay attention to an ugly duckling, right?\" Shu Yi's tone carried a sense of resignation.","\"Don't say that. The ugly duckling has now become a beautiful swan. Our Shu Yi is the most beautiful swan of all,\" Shen Yin said.","Shu Yi burst out laughing. \"Yin Yin, you're the best.\"","\"Now that you've talked about it, do you feel a bit better?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I do feel better, but there's one more thing. Next week, there's going to be a high school class reunion. Wei Yuan invited me, but I've never attended one before. She doesn't know that I'm Shu Yi,\" Shu Yi explained. \"So I'm not sure if I should go or not.\"","\"Go if you want to, or decline if you don't,\" Shen Yin advised.","\"Actually, I want to see what the person I liked back then looks like now. But I'm worried that if I go, my high school photos might get leaked online. There have never been any pictures of me from before my debut, and I have to say, Chang Zhiyuan has been really good at protecting the privacy of his artists.\"","\"Even if they get leaked, there's no need to worry. This is a story of our success and transformation. I've made a bit of money recently, so I can handle the public relations for you anytime,\" Shen Yin reassured her.","Shu Yi was deeply touched and hugged Shen Yin tightly. Seeing this, Zhengzheng came toddling over, jumping up and down, \"Zhengzheng wants a hug too!\"","\"Then let Auntie mom give Zhengzheng a kiss first,\" Shu Yi turned around and planted a kiss on Zhengzheng's little face."]},{"number":74,"title":"Chapter 74: Go to the Hospital","paragraphs":["\"Oh right, why didn't Auntie come?\" Shu Yi asked again as it was nearing noon.","\"My mom said she has something to attend to. I'll ask what it is later. Watch Zhengzheng for me, I'll go make lunch,\" said Shen Yin as she got up.","Having opened up about her troubles, Shu Yi knew the answer and felt much better. \"Zhengzheng, I'll play with the building blocks with you.\"","\"Okay,\" the two lay down on the carpet.","\"This triangle piece should go here,\" Shu Yi picked up a block, about to place it on the rectangle.","\"Ugly, put it here,\" Zhengzheng pointed to a curved block.","\"Hmm, so you know what's ugly now. But I want to put it here,\" Shu Yi acted a bit childish, teasing Zhengzheng.","Xu Yunzheng looked at Shu Yi, blinked his eyes, lowered his head to continue stacking his blocks, but said: \"A real man yields.\"","\"Ah hahahahaha, sweetie, who taught you that? You're cracking me up!\" Shu Yi, not looking like a celebrity at all, burst into laughter.","Shen Yin heard it from the kitchen and smiled too. Not far from the living room, she said, \"Xu Xiuhe taught him, always telling him weird things.\"","\"How nice, our Zhengzheng is such a gentleman. If I were ten years younger, Auntie would definitely wait for you,\" Shu Yi joked.","Shen Yin was shocked to hear such racy words. Shu Yi was around the same age as her, 24, so ten years younger would only be 14 - how could she wait for him? \"Ahem, don't corrupt the child now.\"","\"Just kidding,\" Shu Yi and Zhengzheng picked up the blocks again.","The phone on the desk rang. Shen Yin was cooking, so she turned and said, \"Shu Yi, can you get that for me?\"","Shu Yi got up, saw \"Mom\" on the caller ID and said, \"Yin, it's Auntie calling.\"","Shen Yin turned off the stove, wiped her hands, took the phone from Shu Yi and answered, \"Hello, Mom, what's up?\"","\"Yin, I can't make it over this afternoon either,\" Fang Yue's voice sounded solemn.","Shen Yin detected something off in Fang Yue's tone and asked, \"Mom, did something happen?\"","\"Nothing major, just that your dad's not feeling well and needs to stay in the hospital for a few days,\" Fang Yue said.","Shen Yin froze for a moment. \"Is it serious?\"","Regarding Shen Tianzheng, she wasn't sure how she felt. He was stubborn and conservative, patriarchal and traditional. But she couldn't change the fact that he was the original host's father, though the memories of the original self seemed to have faded in this dream.","\"Not serious. He had surgery last night and should be able to go home in a few days. I need to look after your dad these few days, so I won't be able to come over. Don't overwork yourself,\" Fang Yue advised.","Shen Yin felt an inexplicable pang of sadness. \"Mom, which hospital is he at? Have you eaten? I can bring you some food.\"","\"No no, your brother bought food already. You have Zhengzheng with you, it's inconvenient. No need to come over,\" Fang Yue said.","\"Okay. Mom, don't overwork yourself either,\" Shen Yin reminded her. Truth be told, she wasn't close with Shen Tianzheng at all, having only met him a few times. The last time was seeing him, a man in his 50s, smiling as he pushed a swing in the sunset. After some thought, Shen Yin decided to visit the hospital that afternoon.","\"What's wrong?\" Shu Yi asked.","\"Nothing,\" Shen Yin replied.","At lunchtime, Shen Yin didn't have much appetite despite the delicious food. She didn't have feelings for Shen Tianzheng after all.","\"Shu Yi, if your father treated you really badly, completely controlled you, but later you realized he did it all for your own good, would you still hate him?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I would, but love and hate aren't mutually exclusive. I'd still hate him, but he's my father who did it for me, so I'd also love him. It's quite a contradictory feeling,\" Shu Yi said.","After lunch, Shu Yi left to go shopping for tomorrow's costume. Shen Yin wished her luck with a smile.","In the afternoon, after handling orders for her studio, Shen Yin called Fang Yue again to ask which hospital and room number Shen Tianzheng was in.","Knowing hospital environments could be unpleasant and the food not very appetizing, Shen Yin prepared some light dishes suitable for patients. She didn't know what illness Shen Tianzheng had, but if he couldn't eat it, Fang Yue could.","Around 4pm, Shen Yin finished cooking and called Xu Xiuhe to let him know she was going to the hospital and might be back late, so he shouldn't wait for her.","Xu Xiuhe thought something had happened to Shen Yin and immediately asked, \"What's wrong? Are you not feeling well?\"","\"No, it's my dad who's hospitalized. I'm going to see him,\" Shen Yin said.","After hanging up, Xu Xiuhe immediately had his assistant Liu look up which hospital and room Shen Tianzheng was in. In the past, he might have thought it wasn't his business since they were just business partners. But now it was different - that was his father-in-law. Even if Shen Yin wasn't the original Shen Yin anymore, in the eyes of others, these relationships were very real.","\"Get some fruit and nutritional supplements and put them in my trunk,\" Xu Xiuhe instructed.","After getting off work, Xu Xiuhe didn't return to the Qinghe Villa, but went straight to Rongcheng First Hospital. When he arrived at the ward, Shen Yin and Zhengzheng were already there.","It was a two-room ward, with the sickbed inside and a bed for caregivers outside, along with a sofa and cabinet.","Xu Xiuhe put the items he bought in the cabinet and asked, \"Is it serious? What did the doctor say?\"","\"Liver cancer. It wasn't detected too late. He had surgery last night and may need chemotherapy after,\" Fang Yue's spirits were low and she looked haggard.","\"Don't worry too much, he'll recover,\" Xu Xiuhe comforted her.","In her past life in Da Sheng, Shen Yin had no concept of cancer. But after being here for over two months, she had some understanding of it.","\"Mom, don't worry, medical treatments are so advanced nowadays,\" Shen Yin consoled her too.","Zhengzheng in Shen Yin's arms didn't fully understand, but could sense his grandma's sadness, so he reached out to pat Fang Yue's shoulder.","Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin stood by the door to the inner sickroom. Shen Tianzheng lay on the bed, eyes closed, looking much thinner. Shen Yin didn't know if it was a psychological effect, but for a fleeting moment, she felt a pang in her heart.","\"Where's my brother?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"He went to the company this afternoon. Probably won't be here until later,\" Fang Yue replied.","\"Mom, have something to eat first,\" Shen Yin put Zhengzheng down and took the dishes out of the lunchbox.","\"I'm not hungry,\" Fang Yue had zero appetite at the moment.","Xu Xiuhe spoke up, \"Mom, you still need to eat something. If you starve yourself, who will look after Dad?\"","This was the scene Shen Lv walked in on when he arrived."]},{"number":75,"title":"Chapter 75: Fragile Life","paragraphs":["This time when Shen Yin saw Shen Lv again, she felt that Shen Lv had changed, though she couldn't pinpoint exactly what had changed, but she just felt he was different from before.","\"Yin Yin is here?\" Shen Lv asked.","\"Mm-hmm.\"","\"Is Dad awake?\" Shen Lv turned his head to look at Fang Yue.","Fang Yue shook her head, looking exceptionally weary. Cancer is something that is difficult to detect in the early stages. Fortunately, the Shen Group has a physical examination every six months, and it was discovered in yesterday's examination. Shen Lv had immediately contacted experts for surgery, but the liver is such a vital organ. Shen Tianzheng lay there, pale and looking extremely weak.","For most of his life, Shen Tianzheng was Fang Yue's everything. She had been through thick and thin with Shen Tianzheng, tasting both the bitterness and sweetness, but she never expected him to suddenly fall ill. Fang Yue couldn't accept it at first, and she hadn't slept since learning the news yesterday.","\"What did the doctor say about when he might wake up?\" Xu Xiuhe asked from the side.","\"Tonight at the latest,\" Fang Yue said, looking at the bed inside with worry in her eyes.","The room fell silent again for a while, then Zhengzheng walked over to the bedside, pointed at the bed-ridden Shen Tianzheng, and turned to look at Shen Yin, saying, \"Grandpa sick.\"","Hearing Zhengzheng's words, Fang Yue couldn't hold it together anymore. She had been holding back her sorrow since last night, forcing herself to remain calm and not panic. But at Zhengzheng's words, she broke down, tears streaming down her face in front of her son, daughter, and son-in-law.","Zhengzheng ran up to Fang Yue, who was sitting in a chair, and reached up with his little hands, trying to touch Fang Yue's face. \"Grandma no cry.\"","\"Mm-hmm, Grandma won't cry,\" Fang Yue said, wiping the tears from her face with her hand.","\"Mom, have something to eat and get some rest. Dad will feel bad if he sees you like this,\" Shen Lv said.","\"I'll rest after your father wakes up,\" Fang Yue insisted. How could she sleep if Shen Tianzheng hadn't woken up?","Shen Lv didn't persuade her further, knowing full well the depth of feeling between his parents after all these years. He turned to Shen Yin and said, \"Yin Yin, it's getting late. You should head back. Zhengzheng is still little, and the hospital is no place for him.\"","Shen Yin finally realized what was different—Shen Lv now seemed much more mature.","\"Cough, cough.\" The sound came from the hospital bed, instantly drawing everyone's attention.","Shen Tianzheng opened his eyes with difficulty, glanced around the room, and finally settled his gaze on Fang Yue. \"Why are you crying? Can't you see I can still talk?\"","Shen Tianzheng's voice was still quite weak. Hearing it made Fang Yue feel even worse—just yesterday he had been fine, but now...","\"Don't cry anymore. Your eyes are swollen, and it doesn't look good,\" Shen Tianzheng tried to sit up.","\"Dad, don't move,\" Shen Lv stepped forward and adjusted the height of the bed so that Shen Tianzheng could see them.","\"Yin Yin and Xiuhe are here too,\" Shen Tianzheng finally noticed the couple.","\"Dad,\" Xu Xiuhe called out.","\"Grandpa,\" Zhengzheng called out too.","Seeing Zhengzheng call him Grandpa, Shen Tianzheng smiled a little, but it seemed the smile might have pulled at his wound, as his expression showed a flicker of pain before he suppressed it again.","Fang Yue's tears flowed even more, and seeing this, Shen Yin felt a pang of heartache.","\"Dad's fine now. You take the child and head back first,\" Shen Lv said.","Shen Lv and Fang Yue both looked at the family of three.","\"Then Dad, Mom, Brother, we'll head back first. We'll come again tomorrow,\" Xu Xiuhe said, holding Zhengzheng in one arm while putting his other hand on Shen Yin's shoulder.","After leaving, Shen Yin still felt a little dazed. Is this what marriage is like? She felt moved. In the prosperous era, women took their husbands as their everything, but most men had multiple wives and concubines. Yet Shen Tianzheng's first reaction upon waking was to look for Fang Yue.","\"What's wrong?\" Xu Xiuhe noticed Shen Yin seemed a little off and asked.","\"Nothing.\"","Shen Yin was dreaming again. In the dream, she saw the original Shen Yin again, but this time the original Shen Yin didn't seem happy, sitting in the classroom with a furrowed brow. She didn't know why the original Shen Yin was unhappy, but just seeing the original Shen Yin unhappy made her feel uneasy in the dream too.","Xu Xiuhe, who had light sleep, heard Shen Yin's groaning and turned on the light. Shen Yin's expression was one of pain, and a hint of heartache flashed across Xu Xiuhe's eyes. \"Wife, wake up,\" he said gently, shaking Shen Yin.","Shen Yin opened her eyes, and Xu Xiuhe got out of bed to pour her a glass of water, which he handed to her. After taking a sip, Shen Yin shook her head when Xu Xiuhe asked softly, \"Did you dream about something again?\"","\"I dreamed about the original Shen Yin again. She seemed unhappy.\"","\"It's nothing,\" Xu Xiuhe said, not knowing how to comfort Shen Yin, gently patting her shoulder.","Shen Yin didn't have any more nightmares after falling back asleep. The next afternoon, after much thought, Shen Yin decided to put down her work at the studio and drove to Rong City No.1 Hospital.","When she entered, only Fang Yue and Shen Tianzheng were in the room, with no sign of Shen Lv. \"Mom, where's my brother?\"","\"With your father's illness, all the company's affairs have fallen on your brother's shoulders. He went to the company early this morning,\" Fang Yue said, looking at Shen Yin.","\"You're so busy at work. Why did you still come? It's not convenient with Zhengzheng either. Yin Yin, have you forgiven your father?\"","Shen Yin didn't say anything. She wasn't the original Shen Yin, and the past was in the past.","\"Mom, you should have something to eat. Did you hire a caregiver? How will you manage everything by yourself?\"","\"I don't trust caregivers. I've been taking care of your father for most of my life—he's not used to others. Your brother and I will take turns at night.\"","Shen Yin stood in the hospital room for a long time, just looking at the bed-ridden Shen Tianzheng. She suddenly felt how fragile life was.","\"Mommy,\" Zhengzheng had been standing on the ground for a while, reaching up for Shen Yin to carry him.","Shen Yin picked up Zhengzheng, and after repeated persuasion from Fang Yue, she left the room with Zhengzheng. The older generation believed that hospitals weren't good places, and that children shouldn't go in if they didn't have to, lest they encounter something unpleasant.","When Shen Yin returned to the little building, she happened to run into Shu Yi coming out of the studio and getting into her car. \"Why are you here?\"","\"Yin Yin, you're back! How do I look?\" Shu Yi spun around. She had an afternoon class at Rong City No.3 Middle School and was passing by, so she thought she'd let Shen Yin take a look to see if her outfit was appropriate.","Shu Yi had long hair styled in big, wavy curls, with delicate makeup and a pink, puffy dress paired with cute white shoes.","As someone who designed clothes, Shen Yin naturally knew that this shade of soft pink and style was very particular about who could pull it off. But Shu Yi wore it well—her face had an innocent, first-love kind of look without being overtly aggressive. Her long, curled hair cascaded down her back, and when Shu Yi casually flipped her hair, Shen Yin was struck by how she suddenly looked like a little temptress.","The short dress accentuated Shu Yi's perfect proportions, making her look lively, sexy, and radiant.","\"You look so beautiful. Our Shu Yi is truly the most beautiful swan.\"","Shu Yi stood on her tiptoes, posing in a dance move. This was her official farewell to her youth."]},{"number":76,"title":"Chapter 76: Then say a good goodbye.","paragraphs":["\"Be careful when you go, and make sure to protect yourself. Call me anytime if something happens,\" Shen Yin advised.","\"Okay, got it. I'll head over now.\"","It had been many years since she had been to Rong City No.3 Middle School. That area was the old town. After she graduated from university, her parents sold their house there and rented an apartment near her university to live with her. Later, when she started making money from acting, she bought her parents a new house.","If there was anything that kept her going through those insecure years of her life, it was the company of her parents.","When Shu Yi arrived at the hotel across from Rong City No.3 Middle School, it was already quite late. Wei Yuan kept messaging her to hurry up.","She wanted to hurry too, but she had to avoid being recognized. In the past few days, Shu Yi's drama \"Yanxi Biography\" had become a huge hit, propelling her to the ranks of A-list celebrities. She didn't want to be recognized before she even made it to the private room.","Shu Yi put on her bluetooth earpiece and called Shen Yin. She felt that hearing Shen Yin's voice would give her more confidence.","\"Shu Yuerou, don't be afraid. Believe in yourself,\" Shen Yin encouraged her.","After parking, Shu Yi looked around to make sure there were no paparazzi. She then put on an oversized pair of sunglasses, a fisherman's hat, and a face mask, grabbed her bag, and headed towards the private room. As she approached the door, Shu Yi took a deep breath and said, \"It seems like no one has recognized me. I'm going in now.\"","Shu Yi opened the door to find a large round table with around thirty people inside, all of whom had graduated six or seven years ago. It was unlikely that everyone from their class would be present.","\"Hello, did you come to the wrong private room?\" the class president from high school asked.","Shu Yi recognized him and replied softly, \"No, I didn't.\"","\"So I guess everyone who's coming has arrived?\" the class president turned and asked the other classmates behind him.","Before anyone could answer, Shu Yi took off her hat and said, \"Hello everyone, I'm Shu Yuerou.\"","The chatter in the private room fell silent instantly. Everyone's reaction was: \"What? Shu Yuerou? I don't really remember her... Oh, wait, wasn't she that dark-skinned, chubby girl in our class?\"","Wei Yuan stood up from her chair and walked over to Shu Yi, asking uncertainly, \"Are you Yuerou?\"","Shu Yi removed her hat, mask, and sunglasses.","\"Oh my god, Shu Yi!\" the class president exclaimed in shock.","The others were naturally drawn to the commotion. Everyone knew Shu Yi now – she had been the campus goddess from the moment she debuted, even if her career wasn't particularly hot. But her recent hit drama \"Yanxi Biography\" had propelled her into the A-list. What they couldn't believe was that this beautiful A-list celebrity was their high school classmate.","Even Wei Yuan couldn't process the situation. She was probably the only one in the class who had kept in touch with Shu Yuerou, but even their contact was limited to a sentence or two per year. She had no idea that Shu Yuerou had changed so much.","\"Have a seat, have a seat,\" the class president said eagerly, adjusting a chair for Shu Yi.","The private room remained silent. Shu Yi sat down and smiled at Wei Yuan, \"Wei Yuan, you should have a seat too.\"","Wei Yuan was still in a daze. A table full of food, but no one had started eating yet.","This was supposed to be a reunion, but in reality, many reunions were just occasions for classmates to compare their achievements. Everyone in this class had done well academically, and they now worked in various professions – some were teachers, lawyers, doctors. And now, one of them was even a celebrity.","The comparisons were indeed quite intense. Everyone in the room was well-dressed, with the men wearing luxury watches and the women carrying expensive handbags, all signaling that they were doing well in life.","Only Shu Yi wore unbranded clothes and carried an ordinary bag.","\"Is Zhai Minghao still in the restroom?\" one of the male classmates asked.","Upon hearing that name, Shu Yi felt a pang of nervousness. She had moved on, but she could never completely forget her old crush.","\"He's back,\" Zhai Minghao had just opened the door when he heard someone mention his name.","All two or three dozen people turned to look at him, including Shu Yi.","Zhai Minghao was taken aback when he saw Shu Yi. He hadn't come to the wrong place, but the woman in front of him seemed to be a celebrity. What was going on? Who had brought her?","\"Minghao, do you remember Shu Yuerou from our class? She's a big celebrity now,\" the class president explained.","Zhai Minghao paused, feeling a sense of familiarity with the name Shu Yuerou. Wasn't she the girl who had a crush on him back then?","Shu Yi responded with a smile. \"Long time no see.\"","When they met again, she had truly let go of her feelings. Shu Yi greeted him casually. What had drawn her to him in her youth – was it his good grades, his fair looks, or the fact that he seemed like the ideal literary young man? In any case, Shu Yi had completely moved on.","\"Dr. Zhai is back!\" one of the male classmates called out to him.","A doctor, Shu Yi thought to herself. It seemed her taste in men back in high school wasn't bad after all.","Messages flooded the class group chat:","[Oh my god, the change is insane!]","[Did she get plastic surgery?]","[I heard the entertainment industry is not a clean place.]","[Wei Yuan, have you been in touch with her all these years?]","[No.]","Seeing the awkward atmosphere, the class president spoke up loudly, \"Everyone's here now, let's eat.\"","Shu Yi wasn't in the group chat, so she was unaware of the messages. From time to time, someone would try to get her to drink alcohol, but she politely declined.","\"Shu Yi, don't drink. Don't trust anyone,\" Shen Yin warned her through the earpiece.","\"Sorry, I can't drink because I'm driving,\" Shu Yi told the person offering her a drink.","\"It's okay, it's been so many years since we last saw each other, and you're a big celebrity now. We've never had a chance to dine with a celebrity before. Just have a little drink, we can always get a designated driver later,\" one of the men said.","\"Yeah, exactly. Aren't you people in the entertainment industry always drinking with others? If you can drink with them, why not with your old classmates?\" another man chimed in rudely.","Their words and tone made Shu Yi uncomfortable. Shen Yin regretted letting Shu Yi go alone. She was still too young and naive about the ways of the world. Shen Yin had wanted Shu Yi to follow her heart and bid a proper farewell to her old classmates, to stand before them without feeling inferior. But some people's hearts were just impure, not worth bidding farewell to, not even worth meeting.","\"Yuerou, it's been so long since you've been here. Have a drink?\" Wei Yuan spoke up.","Shu Yi felt torn, as if she had been transported back to high school and was experiencing that same sense of inferiority all over again.","\"If she doesn't want to drink, then she doesn't have to,\" Zhai Minghao interjected.","\"Oh, look at the top student trying to play the hero and shield the celebrity from drinking. What about our class beauty Wei Yuan then?\" the rude man retorted, glancing at Wei Yuan.","Wei Yuan was fuming with embarrassment. She and Zhai Minghao had broken up a long time ago, shortly after entering university.","Zhai Minghao was at a loss for words.","Shu Yi hadn't expected some people to be so vulgar. It was an awkward situation – leaving would be rude, but staying wasn't ideal either.","\"Just have a drink,\" Wei Yuan said again. She wanted to see Shu Yi make a fool of herself. Wei Yuan had always been the most beautiful girl in their class, so how dare Shu Yuerou come in and steal the spotlight?"]},{"number":77,"title":"Chapter 77: I Like You","paragraphs":["From the moment Shen Yin heard the urging to drink, she grabbed her car keys. If anything happened to Shu Yi, she would never forgive herself.","\"What's wrong? Are you going out?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Shen Yin looked anxious, changing her shoes and putting on a mask. \"Shu Yi might be in danger. I'm going to find her. Give Zhengzheng a bath and don't wait up for me tonight.\"","Xu Xiuhe felt uneasy, so after cleaning up the bowls and dishes on the dining table and washing his hands, he picked up Zhengzheng from the high chair. \"I'll go too.\"","Shen Yin didn't stop him. After leaving, Xu Xiuhe insisted on driving since his driving experience was much more extensive than Shen Yin's.","Shen Yin sat in the backseat with Zhengzheng, and her Bluetooth earpiece was still on, allowing her to clearly hear the conversation on the other side. Shu Yi wanted to leave, but some women asked for her autograph, others asked how she transformed into her current appearance. Some men urged Shu Yi to drink, others asked how she became a celebrity. One man with a lecherous voice even asked how much she charged for a night.","Shen Yin felt disgusted by these people once again. Shu Yi replied, \"Can you afford a billion?\"","\"Stop pretending to be so high and mighty. Aren't you all promiscuous in the entertainment industry?\" the lecherous man said unabashedly.","\"Moon.\" Wei Yuan called out in an unsatisfied tone, feeling that Shu Yi's words were too unpleasant.","\"What's wrong? Is there a problem?\" Shu Yi glared at Wei Yuan with an unpleasant expression.","Wei Yuan was too afraid to speak, recalling that Shu Yi had a bodyguard capable of taking on five men.","The lecherous man took two sips of his drink, feeling a bit tipsy, but still insisted on urging Shu Yi to drink. \"Just have a little, it won't kill you. Drink it for me.\" He even tried to reach out and touch her.","Shu Yi took a step back, and others intervened, saying, \"Yang Meng, just let it go.\"","\"Let it go? She has to drink today, or else her ugly high school photos will go viral on social media tomorrow.\"","\"Let's see who dares to post them. For every one posted, I'll take one down.\" Shen Yin entered and spoke in a clear, emotionless voice. Everyone looked over, recognizing her but unable to immediately recall who she was, though they were all stunned by her presence.","\"Yin Yin, why are you here?\" Shu Yi asked.","Shen Yin gave Shu Yi a reassuring look. A few girls seemed to recognize Shen Yin, whispering, \"Isn't she the wife of the CEO of Yuanjituan Corporation?\"","After recognizing her, they didn't dare speak anymore, not wanting to provoke the CEO of Yuanjituan Corporation. So Shu Yi really did have someone behind her, even if it was a woman.","Several people furiously signaled to the class leader and Zhai Minghao. The two realized the person before them was likely not ordinary, and they pulled Yang Meng aside, telling him to sit down.","\"My apologies everyone, I shouldn't have come.\" Shu Yi said, having seen Zhai Minghao and feeling a sense of closure.","\"No, no, it's our fault,\" the girls and the class leader apologized, acknowledging their mistake. What started as a pleasant class reunion had been ruined by those with impure intentions.","Shu Yi smiled, a relieved and letting go expression. She had seen Wei Yuan's true colors, so this trip wasn't in vain. From now on, she would be a white swan, facing the future bravely and bidding farewell to all her insecurities.","\"You all continue,\" Shu Yi said, pulling Shen Yin out of the private room.","Shen Yin handed Shu Yi a hat. \"Sorry, I shouldn't have let you come.\"","Shu Yi shook her head, her eyes filled with tears as she smiled and said, \"Yin Yin, I finally had the courage to stand in front of them. Even if it didn't go as expected, I feel like I've grown. Some people and events will teach us lessons. The person I once secretly admired is now very successful, and I feel good about myself too.\"","\"Yes, a confident girl is the most beautiful. Our Shu Yi is the most beautiful goddess.\"","Shu Yi hugged Shen Yin and said, \"Yin Yin, I feel like meeting you is my greatest fortune.\"","Shen Yin patted Shu Yi's shoulder. \"Me too, but I think you need to learn some self-defense now.\"","Shu Yi burst out laughing. \"What about Zhengzheng since you came?\"","\"Zhengzheng and Xu Xiuhe are in the car. I originally thought that if I needed to take action, it wouldn't be good for the child to see, so I didn't let them come. Haven't you eaten?\"","Shu Yi shook her head.","\"Put on your mask and go to the parking lot. I'll drive and take you to eat.\"","In the parking lot, Chang Zhiyuan leaned against Shu Yi's car, glancing at Xu Xiuhe in the opposite car. This man had called him, saying Shu Yi was in the old town area and asking him to come, but then not letting him enter or get in the car. He could only stand by Shu Yi's car door, brooding.","[Why won't you let me in?]","[You'll just cause trouble if you go in.]","[???]","[Shen Yin is inside], Xu Xiuhe replied.","Upon hearing Shen Yin was there, Chang Zhiyuan felt relieved since he wouldn't have to worry with her present. His presence would indeed be disruptive.","\"What do you want to eat?\" Shu Yi asked.","Hearing her voice, Chang Zhiyuan immediately closed his phone and looked over at the two women.","\"Why is he here?\" Shu Yi noticed Chang Zhiyuan and asked again.","Shen Yin shook her head, already knowing the answer in her heart. So Shu Yi would go with him instead? She wouldn't be a third wheel.","With that thought, Shen Yin got in the car and asked, \"Did you tell him?\"","Xu Xiuhe didn't dare hide it from his wife's question, so he nodded honestly. \"After all, she's an artist under his company. It's better for him to handle any issues that come up.\"","\"Shu Yi hasn't eaten yet. I was going to accompany her to eat, but it seems unnecessary now. I wonder what Chang Zhiyuan is thinking? Is it a passing fancy, a lustful impulse, or a reformed playboy? Shu Yi is quite sensitive, and she can't afford to gamble.\"","\"I think he's sincere. Although he's been with many women over the years, it was all just acting. Sometimes in life, people can't help but be swayed. But with you, I've been absolutely sincere. It's not a passing fancy or lustful impulse, but a decision I made after careful thought. I like you.\"","Xu Xiuhe didn't miss any opportunity to express his feelings. In his view, Shen Yin no longer resisted him, but that didn't mean she liked him, so he had to keep trying. One day, Shen Yin would develop feelings for him.","\"Zhengzheng is still here?\" Shen Yin noticed Xu Xiuhe's sincere gaze and felt a bit embarrassed.","\"He's asleep.\"","Shen Yin turned to see Zhengzheng asleep in his car seat, his head tilted to one side, snoring with bubbles coming from his nose.","\"Chang Zhiyuan is here, so don't worry. He won't let Shu Yi go hungry. Zhengzheng is sleeping uncomfortably in the car, so let's go home.\""]},{"number":78,"title":"Chapter 78: He's Pure.","paragraphs":["\"I didn't drive, you'll have to take me home,\" Chang Zhiyuan insisted stubbornly.","Shu Yi was speechless. She was hungry too, so she opened the car door and sat in the driver's seat. What could she do? The man in front of her was her boss; she couldn't just abandon him there.","\"Get out and sit in the passenger seat. I'll drive,\" Chang Zhiyuan said.","Shu Yi obediently followed his instructions. She was indeed exhausted and hungry, thinking of going home to cook some noodles to tide herself over.","But to her surprise, Chang Zhiyuan parked the car in front of a private cuisine restaurant.","\"Let's get out. Since you haven't had dinner, we can eat a little here,\" Chang Zhiyuan opened the passenger door for Shu Yi.","This was unexpected for Shu Yi. She followed Chang Zhiyuan inside, and since he was a regular, the manager recognized him immediately.","\"Mr. Chang, shall we take the private room upstairs?\" the manager asked.","Chang Zhiyuan nodded and inquired, \"Is Chen Siming here?\"","Chen Siming had just entered from the door when he heard Chang Zhiyuan call his name. \"Here, bro. It's been a while since you last came.\"","Chang Zhiyuan calculated the days and realized it had indeed been several days. \"That's because I found a new place to freeload, and the food there is even better than yours.\"","Shu Yi nodded in agreement. Indeed, Shen Yin's cooking was fantastic.","Chen Siming noticed Shu Yi standing beside them, a famous celebrity. So Chang had found a new girlfriend. Running a media company was really great.","Before Chen Siming could wonder where Chang Zhiyuan had been eating food better than his private cuisine, he was already eager to gossip about Chang Zhiyuan's new girlfriend.","\"You two go to the private room on the far left upstairs. It's late, so there aren't many people, and no paparazzi around,\" Chang Zhiyuan said to Shu Yi.","Shu Yi didn't act coy and went upstairs. It seemed Chang Zhiyuan was a regular here, with his own private room.","\"Bro, you changed again?\" Chen Siming's gossip-loving heart had reached its peak.","\"What do you mean 'changed again'? The previous ones don't count. I'm a virgin! This time, I'm serious. Watch your words and looks from now on. The way you looked at me earlier, you were just short of blurting out, 'What the hell is going on?'\" Chang Zhiyuan said disdainfully.","\"What the hell! What the hell! Bro, really? You're a virgin? I don't believe it. If you're a virgin, then everyone in this world must be a virgin,\" Chen Siming looked doubtful.","\"What's wrong with that?\" Chang Zhiyuan said proudly, with an expression that said, 'I'm a virgin, and I'm proud of it.' His reputation was just a result of circumstances. In reality, he was pure.","After saying that, Chang Zhiyuan went upstairs, leaving Chen Siming in shock. How could this be possible? If it was true, he felt he could believe that the Chinese national soccer team could win.","When Shen Yin arrived at Qinghe Street, she was once again amazed by the beautiful environment. If someone asked her what summer meant, she would say summer was the brilliant starry sky, the flickering fireflies in the winding streams, the gentle breeze sweeping across the creek beside the small houses on Qinghe Street.","\"I went to the hospital today,\" Shen Yin began.","\"How's Dad?\" Xu Xiuhe asked, carrying Zhengzheng from the back seat.","\"Still very weak.\" She had searched online for information about her father's surgery. It had been done relatively early, and the cancer cells had already been removed, so as long as the cancer didn't recur, he would not be in danger of losing his life.","So what she needed to do was nourish her father's body and improve his immunity by preparing medicinal cuisine for him.","Xu Xiuhe was carrying the sleeping Zhengzheng. \"Why don't you take him upstairs and give him a bath? We went to the hospital this afternoon, so he should get cleaned up,\" Shen Yin suggested.","Xu Xiuhe carried Zhengzheng upstairs, with Shen Yin following behind. He took off his shoes and carried Zhengzheng into the bathroom without being told. Shen Yin tidied up the living room and soon heard Zhengzheng's whining.","\"What's wrong?\" Shen Yin entered the bathroom.","She found Xu Xiuhe's white shirt was soaked, clinging to his body, with an innocent expression on his face. Zhengzheng was still asleep in the baby bathtub, but he seemed even more restless than when awake, tossing and turning. His body was coated with bath gel, slippery like a little mud eel. Xu Xiuhe was squatting by the tub, at a complete loss.","This scene amused Shen Yin again. She squatted down and said, \"Use one hand to support him and the other to wipe his body with a towel.\" Shen Yin soaked the towel in water, wrung it out, and gently wiped Zhengzheng's back.","Xu Xiuhe helped, and they finally managed to bathe Zhengzheng.","\"You go ahead and shower. I'll take him out to sleep,\" Shen Yin said, carrying the dried Zhengzheng and dressing him in his pajamas. But Zhengzheng showed no reaction, still sleeping soundly.","Shen Yin bent down and kissed Zhengzheng's forehead, calling him a \"little lazy bug.\"","But when she turned around, she found Xu Xiuhe had come out of the bathroom shirtless. If Zhengzheng hadn't been asleep, she might have screamed. What was he playing at, shirtless like that?","Shen Yin covered her eyes and said, \"Why did you come out without your shirt on?\"","Xu Xiuhe didn't understand her overreaction. Was his physique that scary? He looked down but saw nothing unusual. He worked out regularly and maintained a decent figure—slim when clothed but muscular when shirtless, with just a hint of abs, not too prominent.","\"I didn't bring my pajamas,\" Xu Xiuhe walked over to the walk-in closet.","Shen Yin opened her eyes a crack and saw no one in the bedroom, assuming Xu Xiuhe had gone back into the bathroom. But then he came straight out of the closet and stood right in front of her. \"What's wrong? Don't you like it? Do you like it or not? Have I gotten fat or thin? Tell me what you prefer, and I'll change.\"","Shen Yin backed away a little, caught off guard by his words. She knew this era was more open, with shirtless men on TV, but having a real person standing right in front of her, asking if she liked it or not, was quite a shock.","\"No need to change. Just right,\" Shen Yin turned her back to Xu Xiuhe.","Satisfied with her answer, Xu Xiuhe smiled slightly before returning to the bathroom.","Shen Yin patted her face, reassuring herself, \"It's fine, it's normal. He's just shirtless, not pantless.\"","After her shower, Shen Yin found Zhengzheng sleeping at the edge of the bed, and Xu Xiuhe was staring at her intently, leaving a space next to him for her.","Shen Yin didn't want to go over, so she said, \"Move over a bit. You're about to push Zhengzheng off the bed.\"","Xu Xiuhe shifted inward, and Shen Yin bent down to scoot Zhengzheng further in before lying down beside him on her side.","She thought they could just turn off the lights and sleep, but Xu Xiuhe picked up Zhengzheng and placed him on his other side. Then he lay in the middle, even putting his arm around Shen Yin's waist and pulling her closer. \"Move in, or you might fall off,\" he said.","Shen Yin tensed up. \"I think we're moving too fast.\""]},{"number":79,"title":"Chapter 79: Made You Suffer","paragraphs":["Was it fast? No, it wasn't fast, Xu Xiuhe thought to himself, \"I won't do anything else, I'll just sleep obediently.\"","Shen Yin froze, not daring to move. Xu Xiuhe naturally knew his wife was tense, \"I promise, don't worry and go to sleep.\" When would his wife be able to let down all her guard around him?","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe fell asleep, but Shu Yi couldn't fall asleep for a long time. It was all because of her simple thinking that got Shen Yin entangled in this situation, going to find him late at night, even alarming Chang Zhiyuan.","\"Knock, knock, knock\" someone was knocking on the door. Shu Yi regretted that she shouldn't have softened and agreed to let Chang Zhiyuan take him in. With a single man and a lone woman, what if Chang Zhiyuan really did something to her? As a woman, she would have no way to resist.","Shu Yi got out of bed, put on her slippers, and reluctantly went to open the bedroom door. She didn't open the door all the way, but left a small crack and asked, \"It's so late, what's the matter, Mr. Chang?\"","\"Something came up, should I come in or you come out?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","Shu Yi thought for a moment, then decided she should go out. After saying that, she closed the door and went into the dressing room. She couldn't possibly go out to see Chang Zhiyuan wearing her pajamas.","Downstairs in the living room, Chang Zhiyuan was sitting and waiting for Shu Yi to come down. Shu Yi wore an oversized T-shirt and came downstairs to sit on the sofa.","Now Chang Zhiyuan felt he couldn't look at her enough, \"Are you so afraid of me? Why?\"","Shu Yi lowered her head, \"Afraid you'll keep me as a mistress.\" After saying that, she was afraid Chang Zhiyuan would get angry, so she quietly observed his expression.","Chang Zhiyuan was amused and annoyed, \"What's wrong with this woman? When did I ever say I wanted to keep you as a mistress? Do women's thought processes work in such strange ways?\"","Shu Yi heard the questioning tone in Chang Zhiyuan's voice and felt he didn't understand. But wasn't that the case? No one would be kind to someone for no reason. Many relationships had ulterior motives. She couldn't possibly think Chang Zhiyuan was being good to her out of true love. She didn't think she had that kind of charm.","Those involved often lose perspective while onlookers see clearly. Right now, she felt that Xu Xiuhe's love for Yin Yin was true love. Buying her a hairpin, although a bit silly, showed how much he valued Yin Yin. If that Cha Sister had really taken away the hairpin, she would have thought Xu Xiuhe wasn't a real man. To pursue his wife, giving up living in this grand Ziyue Manor villa to move into a small room, Xu Xiuhe did well on that.","Now, this playboy in front of her, was he just after her body?","\"Mr. Chang, let me tell you the truth, I was an ugly duckling in high school.\" Shu Yi showed Chang Zhiyuan her ugly photos from the past. She was prepared to be exposed and leave the entertainment industry at any time.","\"Still quite cute, chubby,\" Chang Zhiyuan said as he looked at the photos, his interest piqued further.","Shu Yi looked a bit doubtful. Could Chang Zhiyuan have gone blind? With so many artists under his company, how could his taste be so strange?","Shu Yi went upstairs, still unable to process what had happened.","The next day, Shen Yin woke up early and prepared some breakfast to take to the hospital, thinking that since Fang Yue didn't want Xu Yunzheng to go to the hospital, Shen Yin hesitated. It really wasn't very good to always bring a child to the hospital.","Xu Xiuhe stood by, seeing Shen Yin's pensive expression, and said, \"Why don't Xu Yunzheng go with me to the office? Your mom doesn't have time now, and you have work too. It's inconvenient to bring Xu Yunzheng to the hospital.\"","Shen Yin looked at Xu Xiuhe's expression for a few seconds, then said, \"Is that okay?\"","Xu Xiuhe nodded. Of course it was okay, Xu Yunzheng was his child too, wasn't he?","Shen Yin crouched down, stroked Xu Yunzheng's little face, and said, \"Xu Yunzheng, do you want to go with Daddy? Mommy has to go see Grandpa.\"","Xu Yunzheng nodded but said he also wanted to go see Grandpa. Shen Yin smiled and promised to take Xu Yunzheng next time. She then gathered some of Xu Yunzheng's things and put them in a large bag.","Xu Xiuhe took the bag from her. He picked up Xu Yunzheng from the ground and said, \"Xu Yunzheng, say goodbye to Mommy.\"","Xu Yunzheng's expression was full of reluctance. He had been with Shen Yin for the past two months, and his dependence on her was evident. \"Bye, Mommy,\" he said, leaning towards Shen Yin.","Xu Xiuhe didn't know what he was trying to do, but he walked the two steps towards Shen Yin holding Xu Yunzheng, who turned around in his embrace and kissed Shen Yin's face.","Shen Yin suddenly smiled, looking fully satisfied. Watching Shen Yin's smile, Xu Xiuhe felt blissful at that moment. This was the warmth of a family, wasn't it? It would be even better if he could also kiss Shen Yin.","After Xu Xiuhe left with Xu Yunzheng, Shen Yin went into the kitchen and portioned the glutinous rice porridge from the pot into a lunch box, then added a few light side dishes.","At the hospital, Shen Tianzheng had already woken up, and Fang Yue was wiping his face. When Shen Yin arrived, she happened to meet Shen Lv at the door. \"Brother, you didn't go to the company today?\"","\"No, there wasn't anything important at the company today,\" Shen Lv replied.","Shen Yin looked at Shen Lv. People do grow through experiences. Seeing Shen Lv this time, Shen Yin clearly felt he seemed much more composed than before, no longer that unreliable and careless manner.","Shen Yin held a lunch box in her left hand and a large bunch of sunflowers in her right. Shen Lv reached out to take the sunflowers, saying, \"Next time, don't buy these again. The room is already full of them.\"","Shen Yin entered the sickroom and indeed, all kinds of nutritional supplements, fruits, and fresh flowers were placed under the cabinet. Of course, for the director of a large group falling ill, friends and employees would definitely come to visit.","Fang Yue came out from inside the sickroom and saw Shen Yin, saying, \"Where's Xu Yunzheng? You have a child and work, how can you come here every day?\"","\"It's fine, Xu Xiuhe took Xu Yunzheng to the office,\" Shen Yin said as she went inside and looked at Shen Tianzheng. She noticed Shen Tianzheng's condition was much better than yesterday and the day before. \"What did the doctor say?\"","\"The test results came back last night. They said it's under control now, and there won't be any life-threatening risks as long as there are no relapses,\" Fang Yue said, looking at Shen Tianzheng with a sigh.","\"Brother, bring the lunch box in.\"","Hearing this, Shen Lv brought the lunch box inside and handed it to Shen Yin. Shen Yin opened the lunch box and took out the few side dishes and glutinous rice porridge.","\"Mom, they're all quite light. You and Dad should have some,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Alright,\" Fang Yue replied as she took them.","However, Shen Yin sat by the bedside and held the glutinous rice porridge. Seeing this, Shen Lv raised the head of the bed a bit. Shen Yin spooned the porridge into Shen Tianzheng's mouth, one spoonful at a time.","As Shen Tianzheng sipped the porridge, tears streamed down from the corners of his eyes. \"Yin Yin, all these years, Dad wronged you and made you suffer,\" he said in a small voice that Shen Yin could hear clearly.","Seeing this, Shen Yin's heart couldn't remain unperturbed. The spoon in her hand stopped, and she had fed him almost all the porridge in the bowl. Shen Yin was about to say something when her father spoke again."]},{"number":80,"title":"Chapter 80: Baby Baby","paragraphs":["\"Your father indeed went too far back then, but you had a marriage agreement. If you were not married by the age of 20...\" Shen's Father had barely spoken when Fang Yue started coughing violently beside him.","\"Mom, let Dad finish speaking,\" said Shen Lv. He too was unaware of his younger sister having a marriage agreement until his 27th year.","Shen's Father glanced at Fang Yue, who did not stop him this time. \"When Yin was born, we had gone bankrupt. With you being a boy, having Yin would be considered having an extra child, for which we had to pay a fine. But we didn't have the money then. To have Yin, I had to take your mother to our hometown in Yangcheng next door. On the night Yin was born, your mother had a difficult labor. There was a renowned midwife in the village whom I fetched. However, she had a condition - she said the one-child policy had led to more boys being born, so girls were few. If Yin turned out to be a girl, she would have to become her grandson's wife in the future. I didn't agree, but seeing your mother's life in danger, the midwife said that if Yin was not married by 22, she would marry her grandson.\"","Shen Lv listened, perplexed. He was three years old then and had been staying at his grandmother's to avoid the one-child policy restrictions, so he knew nothing about this. \"But how did the midwife know Mom was carrying a girl?\"","This was the very question Yin had wanted to ask too.","Fearing Shen Tianzheng might get tired from talking too much, Fang Yue took over to answer Shen Lv's query. \"Back then, seeing me in a critical condition, your father thought the baby might not necessarily be a girl and agreed to the midwife's condition. When Yin was born a girl, the midwife was overjoyed, claiming she had never been wrong in her decades of delivering babies and could tell the gender just by looking at the belly.\"","To Yin and Shen Lv, it seemed like they were listening to a story. Yin felt the midwife from Dasheng was quite impressive, but Shen Lv was more shocked. \"So Yin had a child marriage fixed even before her birth?\"","With a worried look, Fang Yue continued, \"It wasn't a big deal initially. After your father's fortunes revived, the midwife brought her son and daughter-in-law when Yin turned 18, since we had promised her. They were poor, but we could have supported them. However, when your father investigated the boy, he found that he had just been released from prison for intentional theft and assault. How could we let Yin marry him? With only three to four years left until Yin turned 22, your father started looking for grooms for her. This, coupled with the incident involving Zhou Man, led us to compromise and allow Yin to study abroad - something we would never have agreed to otherwise.\"","Yin recounted how the original owner had indeed led a ill-fated life - a difficult birth, a child marriage, being deceived, and being unaware of her parents' efforts for her wellbeing. If anyone was to be blamed, it was the twists of fate and the wicked people involved.","\"Yin, I'm sorry. It was my fault. I was afraid I might not get another chance, so I told you today,\" said Shen's Father in a low, regretful voice that sounded quite sad.","Hearing this, Fang Yue's tears began flowing again as she wiped them, saying, \"What nonsense! Didn't you have the surgery?\"","Shen Lv agreed wholeheartedly. \"Yes, you'll recover fully after proper recuperation.\"","Shen's Father looked at Shen Lv. Although this son was often unsatisfactory, he was not a bad person apart from his fondness for beautiful women. \"Shen Lv, you're not young anymore either. It's time for you to settle down. Pay more attention to the company's affairs and focus.\"","\"Dad, don't you manage the company? I'm still young,\" Shen Lv replied.","Shen's Father laughed. \"When is Xiu He coming?\"","\"Dad, why are you talking like you're making your final arrangements? The surgery was successful, so don't overthink it. Just recuperate properly, and you'll be able to return soon,\" Shen Lv said with a forced smile.","Yin took the opportunity to hold Shen's Father's wrist and check his pulse, which seemed fine. With proper care, he still had many years ahead.","\"Dad, don't lose heart. With modern medical advancements, don't worry too much,\" Yin consoled him.","\"Alright, I'll recuperate properly. Don't worry about me. Yin and Shen Lv, you two focus on your work. Your mother will be here,\" said Shen Tianzheng, waving his hand.","Yin and Shen Lv exchanged a glance, then left the room. Yin picked up her bag and bid farewell to Shen Lv before heading to Xu Xiuhe's company, Heyuan Group. However, her navigation app had some issues and gave her a wrong route, so she had to circle back before reaching the familiar Heyuan Group building she had visited several times.","When the receptionist, Xiao Li'er, saw Yin, she immediately sent a message to their group chat: [The wife of the CEO has arrived. Fans of the Yin He Couple can have some sugar now.]","Yin responded warmly to the employees' greetings. Upstairs, Xu Xiuhe was puzzled by the constant stream of [Sugar time] messages flooding the group chat. After checking, he realized Yin had come and was delighted that his wife had come to see him. Perhaps it meant Yin liked him a little more now.","\"Zheng, Mommy's here. Let's go and greet her,\" Xu Xiuhe said to Xu Yunzheng.","Xu Yunzheng, sitting on the sofa and playing with his feet, was overjoyed to hear this. He turned around, trying to get down, slowly placing his feet on the ground and stepping off the sofa. He ran towards Xu Xiuhe with small steps.","Xu Xiuhe picked up Zheng and lifted him over his head, eliciting gleeful laughter from the child that could be heard throughout the assistant's office area.","Carrying Zheng, Xu Xiuhe went to the elevator to wait for Yin.","In the office area, a few young ladies were discussing, \"Who would have thought the cold-faced King of Hell would be such a doting father?\"","Yang Mo said, \"He's only cold towards us. Of course, he'd be different with his wife and child, right, Xiao Li'er?\"","When Yang Mo asked her, Xiao Li'er replied, \"Yes, the CEO must be different behind the scenes.\" She had been on tenterhooks recently, fearing she might inadvertently get fired by the CEO. But now that the wife had come to see the CEO, did it mean he had won her over and they wouldn't divorce?","Liu Assistant had just come out of the restroom when Xiao Li'er approached him proudly, saying, \"You don't need to marry me. I'll stay here through my abilities.\"","Liu Assistant was perplexed. \"That's great. I don't want to marry you either.\"","\"I don't want to marry you either, you big straight man. You're probably made of steel rebar with how straight you are!\" Xiao Li'er retorted angrily. She was beautiful, educated, and good-looking - who was Liu Assistant to look at her with disdain?"]},{"number":81,"title":"Chapter 81: Has it Never been in Your Heart","paragraphs":["As soon as Shen Yin stepped out of the elevator, she saw Xu Xiuhe holding Xu Yunzheng in his arms, standing at the elevator door.","\"How did you know I was coming?\"","\"A mutual understanding of the heart,\" said Xu Xiuhe, not caring about his image in front of the employees. He took Shen Yin's handbag from her. Carrying the bag in one hand and holding Xu Yunzheng in the other, he followed Shen Yin into her office.","After entering, Xu Xiuhe set the bag on the desk and placed Xu Yunzheng on the sofa. He turned and poured a glass of water.","\"Mommy, hug,\" Xu Yunzheng stretched out his arms, gesturing for Shen Yin to hold him.","\"Xu Yunzheng, you've grown up. Mommy just got here and is too tired to carry you,\" said Shen Yin.","Xu Xiuhe's tone was somewhat stern. Xu Yunzheng looked at him, pouted, then turned his gaze back to Shen Yin, his face crestfallen, his eyes almost turning red. Unable to bear it, Shen Yin walked over and picked Xu Yunzheng up.","\"He's still little, why are you being so harsh?\" Shen Yin held Xu Yunzheng and gently patted his back.","\"Mommy,\" Xu Yunzheng rubbed his eyes and whined.","\"I was just afraid you'd get tired,\" said Xu Xiuhe.","Shen Yin was momentarily at a loss for words, wondering why he was acting like this, regardless of the setting.","\"Mommy, hungry,\" Xu Yunzheng didn't want to stay any longer and wanted to go out.","\"Little greedy cat, didn't you just eat?\" Shen Yin playfully pinched Xu Yunzheng's nose, and the baby giggled.","Fearing his wife might get angry, Xu Xiuhe brought their son back home shortly after arriving. He glanced at his watch and said, \"It's getting late. Let's have lunch at the company.\"","Shen Yin thought about it – it was so hot outside, and Xu Yunzheng was hungry too. If they went back, she'd have to cook. So she agreed.","Xu Xiuhe was delighted inwardly. This meant that his wife had accepted him a little more.","At the company cafeteria, there were private dining rooms specifically for high-level executives. When the manager learned that the CEO was bringing his wife to eat, they prepared the best room. However, Xu Xiuhe said, \"No need for a private room, we'll eat out here.\"","His wife had finally come to see him after so long, and he had to show off a little, letting everyone see that he and his wife were on good terms.","The effect was indeed achieved. Many employees enviously watched the family of three eating together, gossiping about how the CEO acted with his child – even the CEO had to obediently serve his son food.","[Holy crap, this is the first time I've seen the CEO eating. Turns out even a handsome guy looks charming while eating.]","[Stop, stop, the CEO is a married man.]","[If I could find a husband like that in the future, I could make my ancestors' graves sprout greenery.]","Messages flooded the group chat incessantly, but Xu Xiuhe had no time to check them – his wife was talking to him.","\"Do you know about Chinese-style furniture?\" Shen Yin asked.","Xu Xiuhe nodded. He knew about it. Could it be that his wife was homesick? Then he'd order a whole set of furniture and transform Ziyue Manor into a Chinese style.","\"I've realized that Chinese-style furniture is so expensive, much more than regular furniture,\" Shen Yin continued.","Xu Xiuhe thought it was nothing – how expensive could it be? He had more money than he knew what to do with. It was just a set of furniture. He took out his phone and sent a message to Liu Bo.","[Order the most expensive set of Chinese-style furniture, have it delivered to Ziyue Manor this afternoon.]","After sending the message, he said to Shen Yin, \"No matter how expensive, your husband can afford it. The furniture will be delivered to Ziyue Manor this afternoon.\"","Shen Yin sighed and said, \"I haven't finished speaking. What I meant was, I want to make and sell this kind of Chinese-style furniture.\"","Xu Xiuhe was stunned. He had never expected this reason. Could it be that he had made Shen Yin feel insecure? \"Wife, I can support you. You don't need to do so much. Or is it that you've been thinking about divorcing me all this time, and I've never truly reached your heart?\" Xu Xiuhe's expression suddenly turned cold.","He was too sensitive. Having lost his mother at a young age, he hadn't felt the warmth of family for a long time. After confirming his feelings, he had always been cautious, worried that Shen Yin would abandon him, worried that she would divorce him and leave.","Noticing Xu Xiuhe's expression shift, the company employees quickly distanced themselves from the scene, shocked by what they had just overheard. Could it be that all this time, the CEO's wife had been the one in control of their relationship!","[Holy crap, what a shocking scandal! The wife wants a divorce.]","[Family, I heard it too.]","[So handsome, so wealthy, so capable, yet still worried his wife would leave him. I suddenly feel it's normal that I haven't married after all these years.]","Shen Yin didn't expect Xu Xiuhe to react so strongly, especially in a public setting. \"That's not what I meant. Let's eat first, and we'll talk about it later upstairs.\"","But how could Xu Xiuhe eat after that? Seeing that Xu Yunzheng had eaten enough, he picked him up and walked out of the cafeteria. Shen Yin followed behind him, and the passing employees kept their distance, afraid of accidentally offending the CEO and getting fired, unable to find another job.","Xiao Li'er was now so scared that she was about to cry. Ever since the assistants found out the CEO was in the group chat, they dared not speak in it, usually discussing the group's happenings offline during breaks.","Xiao Li'er hid in the restroom, wiping away tears as she looked at her reflection, her face forlorn. She hadn't told anyone, including her closest friend Yang Mo, about the CEO's wife wanting a divorce. She had never been this tight-lipped before, so why did everyone in the group know?","With one hand wiping her tears and the other turning on the faucet, Liu Bo came out of the restroom and was startled when he went to wash his hands. \"A ghost!\"","If he hadn't called out, it would have been fine, but his exclamation only made Xiao Li'er feel worse. Not only was she about to be fired, but she was also being called a ghost. \"Wah wah wah.\" Xiao Li'er looked at her smeared makeup in the mirror, and indeed she did look like a ghost, unable to stop crying.","\"Auntie, why are you crying? I haven't done anything inappropriate to you,\" said Liu Bo, the Special Assistant, who was most afraid of seeing women cry.","Xiao Li'er continued to sob, \"I... I'm going to be fired.\"","Liu Bo thought for a moment. He hadn't heard any news, and the CEO had been in a good mood lately. How could she suddenly be fired?","Liu Bo took out a tissue from his pocket and handed it to Xiao Li'er, but she was too busy crying to take it. On the principle of not being able to bear seeing a woman in tears, Liu Bo used the tissue to wipe Xiao Li'er's eyes himself.","\"Auntie, don't cry. What's going on?\"","\"It hurts,\" she said.","Liu Bo realized he was being too rough and lightened his touch. It wasn't his fault – he had never wiped a woman's tears before.","His phone in his pocket started ringing. Liu Bo took it out and saw it was the CEO calling. He put a finger to his lips, gesturing \"Shh\" to Xiao Li'er.","Xiao Li'er also saw the caller ID on the screen and immediately stopped crying.","\"Special Assistant Liu, come to the office for a bit,\" said the CEO before hanging up.","Liu Bo didn't dare delay and said to Xiao Li'er, \"Let me go see what's going on first. Wash your face and don't cry anymore.\""]},{"number":82,"title":"Chapter 82: Wait for Me in the Evening","paragraphs":["After Liu Bo entered the office, Xu Xiuhe instructed him to take Zhengzheng out. Liu Bo understood - when the wife was here, having the son around would be a nuisance.","The atmosphere seemed a bit off, but he didn't dwell on it now. Such an adorable child, why not play? Liu Bo took the child and left the office, not wanting to disturb the married couple.","\"Now that Zhengzheng is out too, tell me, are you still thinking about divorcing?\" Xu Xiuhe's tone had an accusatory edge.","Shen Yin was a bit unhappy. How dare he ask like that? \"I just said I wanted to do furniture, and you got so angry.\"","Shen Yin sat on the sofa, acting like she had done nothing wrong, sitting upright. She hadn't said anything else.","\"So have you thought about divorcing these past few days?\" Xu Xiuhe's anger subsided a bit as he stood there speaking.","Shen Yin felt awkward. Ever since she decided to accept Xu Xiuhe, she had never thought about divorcing. But to admit out loud that she didn't want a divorce, she couldn't bring herself to do it yet.","\"What do you think? I've already been sleeping in the same bed as you at night, and I've allowed you to stay at the villa. What more do you want from me?\"","Upon hearing this, Xu Xiuhe suddenly bent down, embracing Shen Yin's shoulders with one hand and cupping the back of her head with the other. His right leg went up on the sofa as his left leg pinned down Shen Yin's legs, not giving her room to react, pressing his lips against hers.","Their eyes met, and this time, Shen Yin didn't resist.","The sensation was soft. Since their brief kiss before, Xu Xiuhe had been constantly thinking about this feeling. Even in his midnight dreams, he would recall it. Now, he had finally attained his desire.","He had been waiting for her to accept him. Her lack of resistance this time, did it mean she had accepted him? That she didn't want a divorce anymore?","As their lips touched, the soft sensation drove Xu Xiuhe even crazier. He wanted more, and he did just that.","He overcame Shen Yin's lips and teeth.","Shen Yin had no time to resist. Even with her martial arts skills, there was still a significant difference in strength between men and women. Xu Xiuhe held her tightly, leaving her powerless to resist.","Finally, Xu Xiuhe got his wish.","Enveloped in the man's presence, Xu Xiuhe lost himself in the passionate kiss, gradually becoming immersed in it.","Shen Yin's body had gone limp, unable to break free. With Xu Xiuhe's face just inches away, his exquisite features left Shen Yin no chance to think of anything else. Shen Yin let out a soft moan, her voice sounding alluring.","Xu Xiuhe suddenly felt that something was off about his body. He paused, and Shen Yin seized the opportunity to bite his lip. Xu Xiuhe winced in pain, releasing his mouth as he leaned towards Shen Yin's ear and whispered softly, \"Wife, I'll be waiting for you tonight.\"","After getting up, Shen Yin touched her own mouth, wiping away the lip gloss at the corners. She had mixed feelings - how could Xu Xiuhe do this to her, in the office of all places, acting so unreasonable? Especially those last words whispered in her ear, utterly suggestive, her face instantly flushed red.","Looking at Xu Xiuhe, he wore an expression of someone whose schemes had succeeded, smiling slyly, quite different from usual. \"Wife, you weren't uncomfortable just now, were you?\"","\"How could you do that?\" Shen Yin said resentfully.","\"What did I do? Kissing my own wife is very normal, isn't it? Didn't you say you've allowed me into your bed? Can't I kiss you?\"Xu Xiuhe was in a great mood. His wife didn't want a divorce, and he had an intimate moment with her too. Not bad at all.","\"You call that just a kiss?\"","...","\"One minute.\"","Shen Yin was annoyed and left the office. As she was leaving, she heard Xu Xiuhe's words:","\"Wife, drive slowly on your way back. I'll be waiting for you tonight.\"","Shen Yin's face stayed flushed red. Outside in the assistant area, a group of young ladies surrounded Zhengzheng, each utterance of \"Sister\" from him making them laugh endlessly.","Only Xiao Li'er sat at her desk, staring blankly at the computer in front of her, seeming dazed. Liu Bo standing nearby felt there was something off about her too.","\"The wife is here,\" Yang Mo called out.","With her face still burning, Shen Yin picked up Zhengzheng, telling them she had to leave before heading towards the elevator.","\"Why is the wife's face so red?\" Yang Mo asked.","No one answered, but Liu Bo had noticed - not only was Shen Yin's face red, but her lips were too. It was pretty much as he had imagined.","\"Xiao Li, come here for a bit,\" Liu Bo called out.","Xiao Li'er didn't hear him, still lost in her own world. She had been thinking that after being fired from this big company, no other company would want to hire her. If it really came to that, she might have to set up a street stall or work in a factory tightening screws.","\"Little Li, what are you spacing out for? What's wrong, you look gloomy,\" Yang Mo patted Xiao Li'er's shoulder.","\"The special assistant is calling you.\"","Only then did Xiao Li'er snap out of it and head to Liu Bo's office.","\"Still thinking about getting fired?\" Liu Bo looked at Xiao Li'er as he asked.","Xiao Li'er didn't have the energy to spar wits with Liu Bo like before, simply nodding glumly.","\"Tell me, why does the CEO want to fire you? Didn't you already submit that romance proposal?\"","\"The CEO's wife wanted a divorce, and I found out about it. He said if a third person knew, he would fire me. But today, everyone in the company knows about it.\" Xiao Li'er still didn't know how this incident had leaked out.","\"What, a divorce? That's impossible, how come I didn't know?\" Liu Bo hadn't checked the group messages on his phone, so he had no idea what had happened in the group.","\"It's true. Before, I was even helping the CEO come up with ideas to pursue his wife. But today, the news that the CEO wanted a divorce spread through the group, and a few hundred people know about it.\"","Liu Bo opened his phone and scrolled through the messages in the group. Sure enough, there were messages like \"Don't believe rumors, don't spread rumors. How could this be made up? You must have heard wrong. The group messages are fake too. Didn't you see Zhengzheng being taken out by me? The husband and wife's relationship is good. How could they be getting divorced?\"","\"Really?\" Xiao Li'er didn't believe it.","\"Really. Didn't you see how red the wife's face was when she came out? Even her lips were more vibrant than usual. Their relationship is clearly good, don't overthink it. You won't be fired.\"","\"Really?\"","\"Yeah, really. I've never been wrong about this before.\"","\"But the timing seems too short, doesn't it?\"","...","Liu Bo didn't know how to respond to that.","When Shen Yin returned to Qinghe Villa, she couldn't focus on work, her mind filled with thoughts of that afternoon's kiss and those words. What if tonight... how would she deal with that?","The more she thought about it, the more agitated she became. That kiss really made her body feel different from usual. Shen Yin could only start cooking to distract herself from her disorderly thoughts.","When Xu Xiuhe came back and saw Shen Yin in the kitchen with Zhengzheng in the living room, he was no longer afraid of Shen Yin beating him up. He took off his shoes, went to the kitchen, and embraced Shen Yin from behind, placing his hands on her stomach.","Shen Yin froze, halting her movements. Xu Xiuhe took advantage and kissed her nape, softly asking, \"Wife, are you ready?\""]},{"number":83,"title":"Chapter 83: The Husband","paragraphs":["Shen Yin didn't dare look at Xu Xiuhe, she always felt that Xu Xiuhe was now looking at her in a strange way, like looking at prey, certain to obtain it.","Shen Yin wanted to escape, but Xu Xiuhe was too close to her, she could feel his exhaled hot breath, her neck feeling itchy.","\"Step back, I'm cooking,\" Shen Yin said.","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe smiled, his thin lips lightly brushing past Shen Yin's ear, gently biting it: \"Mm, I know, wife.\"","After saying this, Xu Xiuhe reluctantly let go, turned and left, his mood greatly improved, going to the living room to play with his son Zhengzheng.","Leaving Shen Yin alone in the kitchen, her heart pounding, she didn't know what this reaction was, but her body seemed to no longer resist him.","Her ears were red, as if dripping blood, Shen Yin touched them, scorching hot. Xu Xiuhe in the living room would occasionally turn his head to look towards the kitchen, seeing Shen Yin like this, finding it even more interesting.","At dinner, Shen Yin was too embarrassed to raise her head, silently eating rice, Xu Xiuhe realized his wife was shy, putting some vegetables on Shen Yin's plate, \"Don't just eat rice, it's easy to choke, eat some vegetables.\"","After dinner, Xu Xiuhe was considerate, cleaning up the kitchen dishes, taking out the trash downstairs, when he came back upstairs he saw Shen Yin and Zhengzheng sitting on the sofa watching 'Yan Xi's Legend'. These episodes happened to feature Xu Yunzheng.","\"Mom, the actor is bad,\" Zhengzheng said very seriously to Shen Yin, pointing at the TV.","\"Zhengzheng is great, but eating vegetables is good for the body, so Zhengzheng can't be picky, understand?\" Shen Yin coaxed.","\"Xu Yunzheng, time to take a bath.\"","Hearing this, Zhengzheng got off the sofa, walking with his little legs towards Xu Xiuhe.","While giving Zhengzheng a bath, Xu Xiuhe chatted with him, \"Zhengzheng, after your bath you need to go to sleep quickly, sleeping will help you grow taller.\"","Zhengzheng heard he could grow taller and agreed very readily. By the time Xu Xiuhe carried him to bed, Zhengzheng was already drowsy, children's sleep is enviable.","Quietly closing the door, when Xu Xiuhe came to the living room, he asked: \"Wife, would you like to take a bath with me?\"","Shen Yin hurriedly shook her head.","\"Alright, you go to the bathroom in the bedroom, I'll use the one outside, that saves time.\" Xu Xiuhe thought, in the end they would bathe together later, no need to rush.","Hearing this, Shen Yin got up and went into the bedroom, locking the door from the inside, after locking it, she pulled hard to make sure the lock was sturdy before going into the bathroom.","After her bath, Shen Yin lay on the bed, thinking the weather was nice so she didn't need a blanket, she could make do sleeping on the sofa outside.","Xu Xiuhe took a very thorough bath, when he was done and found Shen Yin had locked the inside door, he felt like a bucket of cold water had been poured on him.","Shen Yin kept listening for sounds at the door, it made a noise earlier, but now it had stopped, Xu Xiuhe must have given up.","But it seemed she was wrong, the lock turned a few times and the door opened.","Xu Xiuhe walked up to the bed, Shen Yin was still in a daze, clearly all the keys were in the drawer of the bedside table, so how did he open it?","\"How did you get in?\"","Xu Xiuhe lowered his head, saying quietly, \"From the day I moved into the small building, I was afraid you'd lock me out of the bedroom, so I secretly made a copy of the key.\" He showed Shen Yin the key in his hand.","Shen Yin hadn't expected Xu Xiuhe to do something like this: \"You're a rascal.\"","Xu Xiuhe bent down: \"There are more mischievous things, want to try?\" With that, he covered Shen Yin's lips with his own.","Shen Yin lay on the bed, wanting to speak, but her mouth was already sealed, this kiss was different from the one in the afternoon, Xu Xiuhe's movements were gentle, gradually exploring.","\"Don't drift off now.\" Xu Xiuhe's hand fell on Shen Yin's waist, pinching it. Then it moved up in position.","Suddenly, Shen Yin felt her whole body go numb, shuddering, a muffled moan escaping her red lips.","\"Zheng... zheng is still here,\" Shen Yin said with difficulty.","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe got up from Shen Yin. \"Then let's carry him to the sofa in the living room.\"","Shen Yin shook her head.","Xu Xiuhe bent down again, this time not to kiss, but to pick Shen Yin up, \"Then we'll go out.\"","Shen Yin had been kissed breathless just now, her breathing rapid, and now Xu Xiuhe was carrying her. As they left, Xu Xiuhe grabbed a thin blanket off the bed.","The sofa was large, but with the two of them on it, it felt extremely small.","Shen Yin lay on the blanket, Xu Xiuhe continuing where they had left off, this time his hands were even more unrestrained, moving from above to below.","Soon, Shen Yin succumbed, utterly spent.","Xu Xiuhe felt it was enough, saying: \"Don't overthink it, don't be afraid, don't be nervous.\"","A muffled moan, \"Call me husband.\"","Shen Yin's voice was already abnormal, at this moment suffering terribly, especially that feeling of unfulfillment, making her truly frenzied, arms tightly hugging Xu Xiuhe's shoulders, digging in hard enough to leave red marks, but Xu Xiuhe felt nothing. \"Husband.\"","Hearing \"husband\", it was as if Xu Xiuhe was encouraged, the first time hearing the woman he liked call him that, truly satisfying.","Xu Xiuhe's actions told Shen Yin,","The rest was bearable, but Shen Yin was already exhausted, seeing this, Xu Xiuhe picked up Shen Yin and went into the bathroom.","Shen Yin had no strength to stand, completely depending on Xu Xiuhe, she regretted it, wishing she didn't have to take this bath, the more she washed the more tired she became.","The next morning, Shen Yin woke up in Xu Xiuhe's embrace, he wasn't wearing a shirt, her face against his chest, suddenly recalling what had happened last night.","\"Good morning, wife.\" Xu Xiuhe kissed Shen Yin's forehead.","Shen Yin suddenly covered her face with her hands.","\"Don't cover up, I've seen everything. We should buy a bed for the neighbors, let Zhengzheng sleep over there.\"","Shen Yin got up, looking at the marks on her body, giving Xu Xiuhe a glance: \"I'm going to take out the trash. You clean up the rest.\" With that she went into the closet, changing into fresh clothes.","The trash cans in the living room and bathroom held evidence from last night, Shen Yin tied the two trash bags securely before throwing them into the large trash bin.","Xu Xiuhe got up obediently following Shen Yin's words, putting away what hadn't been used, can't let Zhengzheng see it.","After changing clothes, he went to the living room, seeing Shen Yin had just come upstairs, saying: \"You were too tired last night, let me make breakfast, you go rest some more.\"","If he hadn't said anything it would've been fine, but mentioning it made Shen Yin want to beat Xu Xiuhe, last night he said it was okay, but Xu Xiuhe still didn't stop, and first thing this morning he brought it up again.","Embarrassed, angry, Shen Yin's face reddened, she felt this man was shameless. Furious with shame, Shen Yin went into the bedroom, but she had already seen Xu Xiuhe put the blanket from the sofa into the washing machine."]},{"number":84,"title":"Chapter 84: Buying a Bed","paragraphs":["Shen Yin entered the bedroom, and Zhengzheng was lying on the bed with her eyes open. When she saw Shen Yin come to the bedside, she said in a childish voice, \"Mommy's face is red.\"","Shen Yin touched her own face and said shyly, \"Mommy just went out. It's very hot outside, and the sun made mommy's face red. What should Zhengzheng wear today? Let me find something for Zhengzheng.\"","Shen Yin went into the dressing room and found a little fisherman's hat in Zhengzheng's wardrobe. She took it in her hand, then grabbed a pair of khaki overalls shorts and a yellow T-shirt.","After dressing Zhengzheng and helping her wash up, when they came out, Xu Xiuhe had already prepared breakfast and placed it on the table.","\"We can eat breakfast now.\"","\"Eat food, grow tall, eat meat, get fat,\" Zhengzheng hummed to herself.","Xu Xiuhe heard her and said, \"You can grow tall, but you can't just eat meat. Come and eat some vegetables.\"","Xu Xiuhe picked up Zhengzheng and put her in the high chair, then pulled out a chair for Shen Yin to sit. They ate the meal quietly. After finishing, when Xu Xiuhe was about to leave, he brazenly asked Shen Yin to kiss him. Shen Yin couldn't refuse and gave him a kiss on the cheek.","\"Call me husband.\"","Zhengzheng, who was watching from below, looked puzzled and asked, \"What is a husband? Zhengzheng also wants mommy to kiss.\" She stretched out her arms, signaling Shen Yin to pick her up.","\"Zhengzheng, you've grown up. Mommy can't carry you anymore,\" Xu Xiuhe brought up this issue again.","\"Wife, don't spoil him. You worked so hard last night, get some rest today.\"","\"Stop.\" This man still had the nerve to say that.","\"Stop, bad daddy,\" Zhengzheng chimed in, her little expression stern.","Xu Xiuhe just stared at them...","Zhengzheng called him bad, but he could be even worse. An idea crossed his mind, and he looked at Zhengzheng meaningfully, saying, \"Yeah, daddy is bad.\"","Shen Yin didn't understand what Xu Xiuhe meant until later that morning when a furniture company truck stopped in front of Qinghe Villa. That's when Shen Yin realized the meaning behind Xu Xiuhe's look.","A brand new set of children's furniture – a wardrobe, nightstand, but Shen Yin was stunned when she saw the bed. Could Xu Xiuhe not afford a bigger bed? That bed was truly a child's bed. Shen Yin estimated it was only about 1.5 meters long and 1.2 meters wide.","As Shen Yin was directing the movers to take the furniture up to the third floor, her phone rang. She looked at the caller ID and was surprised to see \"Husband\" displayed.","When did she set that contact name? Or was this a scam call?","After much hesitation, Shen Yin answered.","\"Wife, the furniture should have arrived.\"","\"Xu Xiuhe?\"","\"Call me husband,\" Xu Xiuhe said with a smile from his office, twirling a pen in his hand.","\"Why did you buy such a small bed?\" It was too small. Did he think Zhengzheng wouldn't grow taller? This bed really opened Shen Yin's eyes.","\"Children should sleep in children's beds,\" Xu Xiuhe replied. He definitely wouldn't admit that he had looked at several options before choosing this one intentionally. He wasn't foolish – if he bought a bigger bed, he might end up having to sleep in it himself. So a small bed it was, only big enough for Zhengzheng.","Shen Yin hung up the phone.","Xu Xiuhe...","Shen Yin was really tired. Last night was exhausting, and she woke up early this morning. Walking was uncomfortable too, and she really wanted to sleep for a bit.","The phone rang again with an unfamiliar number.","\"Yin Yin, how have you been after all these years?\"","Shen Yin paused, \"...Who is this?\"","\"Yin Yin, don't you remember me? It's Man Man. I've missed you so much these past two years.\"","\"Sorry, I'm not Shen Yin. You have the wrong number,\" Shen Yin said calmly.","\"That's impossible! This is the right number.\" The woman on the other end questioned her skeptically.","\"I'm sorry, ma'am, but you really have the wrong number,\" Shen Yin said before hanging up. She wasn't lying – she truly wasn't the original Shen Yin. Zhou Man was looking for the original owner of this body, not her.","But why did Zhou Man know her phone number? And what was the relationship between Zhou Man and Yang Cui? Why did Zhou Man call her? Question after question came to Shen Yin's mind, and she knew she needed to be more vigilant.","\"Boss, do you think this fabric is suitable for making this dress?\"","Chen Nuan held up a length of silver fabric and asked.","Shen Yin took the fabric and felt it. It was quite smooth. \"Yeah, it'll work. Just tell Jiang Meiyan and the others that this fabric might be a bit tricky to cut and sew, so they should be extra careful.\"","\"Be careful,\" Zhengzheng imitated Shen Yin's words, making everyone laugh.","Shen Yin held Zhengzheng's hand and started walking up the stairs. Her inner thighs were still uncomfortable, so carrying Zhengzheng up the stairs was a bit difficult.","\"Zhengzheng is a little man. Why don't we practice climbing the stairs together?\"","Before, either Xu Xiuhe or Shen Yin would carry Zhengzheng up the stairs. But now Zhengzheng could already run on flat ground, so climbing stairs shouldn't be a problem.","Zhengzheng tightly gripped one of Shen Yin's fingers with her hand. \"Zhengzheng, slow down. Let's take it one step at a time. Don't try to skip steps, okay?\"","Chen Nuan and Li Huanhuan saw them reaching the second floor and commented, \"Look, the leading actress from Yanxi Biography is also playing the role of Zhengzheng.\"","\"So young, and she's already earning money for milk powder. Zhengzheng is amazing.\"","\"I wonder why they agreed to let Zhengzheng act, given how wealthy Xu is.\"","\"Who can understand the world of the rich?\"","\"That precious Zhengzheng is so adorable in the show. I really love her. I wanted to pinch those rosy little cheeks - she probably still has that milky scent. She's too cute, I couldn't control myself.\"","\"Huan Huan, if you can't control yourself, go ahead and pinch her cheeks next time.\"","At the top floor office of Huanyuan Group, Xu Xiuhe was in a cheerful mood as he called Xiao Li'er.","Xiao Li'er was startled when she saw the caller ID and didn't dare breathe.","\"Li'er, why aren't you answering?\" Yang Mo reminded her from the side.","Xiao Li'er took a deep breath and answered the call.","\"Come in for a bit.\"","As Xiao Li'er passed by Liu Bo's office, he looked puzzled about why she was being summoned again. He then started blaming himself, feeling that this whole situation was probably his fault.","\"About the divorce last time...\" Xu Xiuhe had barely started speaking when he saw Xiao Li'er's tears streaming down her face.","\"I haven't finished talking. Why are you crying?\"","Startled, Xiao Li'er swallowed the rest of her tears.","\"The divorce from last time is in the past. I'll give you a raise.\"","Xiao Li'er was stunned. Was she dreaming? A second ago, she was teetering on the brink of being fired, and now she was getting a raise?","\"There's one more thing you still need to think about - what can I do to gain my wife's favor?\" As soon as Xu Xiuhe finished speaking, Xiao Li'er felt dejected again.","Mustering her courage, she said, \"Boss, could you please stop threatening to fire me all the time? Assistant Liu said that if I get fired, he'll marry me.\"","\"Oh, is that so?\" Xu Xiuhe immediately became interested."]},{"number":85,"title":"Chapter 85: Constellations","paragraphs":["Xiao Li'er looked at Xu Xiuhe's gaze, instantly feeling that something unpleasant might happen.","\"CEO, it's nothing, I'll be going now.\" Xiao Li'er pointed towards the door, tentatively asking.","\"It is something. Don't you have a boyfriend? Liu Assistant has also been single for so many years. I think you two would be quite suitable.\" Xu Xiuhe's tone didn't seem like he was joking.","Xiao Li'er stood in her place. This CEO, what is he up to? He hasn't even sorted out his own affairs, yet he's playing matchmaker for others.","Xiao Li'er hurriedly waved her hands: \"We're not suitable for each other, CEO. Liu Assistant and I are not astrologically compatible, and our star signs don't match either. Truly, we're really not suitable for each other.\"","Xu Xiuhe: \"......\"","\"Star signs are deceiving, they have no scientific basis. Alright, you can go back now.\"","After Xiao Li'er left, Xu Xiuhe opened his computer and searched for a star sign chart. He cross-checked it and found that he was a Capricorn.","He then searched for the star sign most compatible with Capricorn: Taurus.","He knew that the original host, Shen Yin, was born on April 24th. On that day, he had Liu Bo buy some branded bags and send them to Ziyue Manor. But he didn't know what Shen Yin's current birthday was. If her current birthday was also April 24th, then he and Shen Yin would be the most compatible.","Xu Xiuhe dialed a number: \"Wife.\"","Xu Xiuhe's voice was very pleasant, deep and magnetic. When he called her \"wife\", it was filled with utmost tenderness.","On the other end, Shen Yin picked up the phone and heard the word \"Wife\".","\"What is it?\"","\"When were you born during the Dasheng Dynasty?\"","\"April 23rd, I think.\" Shen Yin didn't know why Xu Xiuhe was asking, but she answered truthfully.","Upon hearing that they were just one day apart, Xu Xiuhe wondered if this was the fate between the original host and Shen Yin.","So Shen Yin was a Taurus, and he and Shen Yin were the most compatible. After reaching this conclusion, Xu Xiuhe became even happier. Whoever invented star signs, and whoever researched them, was truly great.","While staring at the screen, suddenly an advertisement popped up for a compatibility testing app. Xu Xiuhe became curious and downloaded it on his phone.","A few seconds later, Xu Xiuhe opened the app, which had horoscopes and compatibility readings. He entered his and Shen Yin's birthdays, names, and residence, and found that their compatibility score was an incredible 96.","He had to show off a bit, so he took a screenshot of their compatibility score and the star sign compatibility chart from his computer, and sent them to the group chat with the other two.","[My wife and I are the perfect couple, our star signs are the most compatible.]","Chang Zhiyuan [............]","Xue Jingrui [. . . . .]","[It's been a long time since we got together. Why don't we meet up, and I can introduce you all to Qi Ji before the wedding?]","[What? With our partners?] Chang Zhiyuan was shocked.","[Sure, tonight at Qingfeng Mingyue? I might be a bit late though.]","Chang Zhiyuan: [?]","[I need to pick up my wife and kid.]","Chang Zhiyuan [, , ,] So one of them is bringing his wife and kid, the other his fiancée, and he's the only single dog?","[Yes.]","[You're right.]","After the other two replied, they each went back to work.","Chang Zhiyuan couldn't sit still anymore. He got up and drove to Ziyue Manor.","When Shu Yi opened the door, she still felt incredulous. She thought she had made it clearer, yet Chang Zhiyuan still didn't understand.","\"President Chang, what's the matter?\"","\"Nothing, I just didn't have a place for lunch, so I came to mooch a meal from you.\" Chang Zhiyuan said it as if it was natural.","Shu Yi...","He's a big CEO, and he's saying he had nowhere to eat? Shu Yi didn't believe it at all.","\"Yue Ru, I really didn't have anywhere to eat.\" Chang Zhiyuan leaned against the door frame, his tone much softer.","\"I'm not called Yue Ru!\" Shu Yi was terrified of anyone mentioning her previous name.","\"Yue Ru sounds nice.\" Chang Zhiyuan said earnestly. He felt that Yue Ru did sound nice. He even felt that Shu Yi's previous appearance was also quite pretty. That night, he had dug up all of Shu Yi's information and looked through it. He didn't feel any disdain, but rather more pity.","\"Come in then, I'm not a great cook, but it's edible.\"","Chang Zhiyuan got what he wanted and entered, changed into slippers, and went straight to the dining room as if it were his own home.","On the dining table, there were only two dishes, one meat and one vegetable.","\"Just this little bit?\"","Shu Yi was speechless. It was just for herself, how much could she make? She didn't know Chang Zhiyuan would come over.","\"Yes, just this little bit. If you don't want to eat it, the kitchen is over there, you can go make your own.\"","\"No, no need.\" Chang Zhiyuan sat down.","Shu Yi brought another pair of chopsticks and a bowl, and Chang Zhiyuan started eating.","Shu Yi could cook simple dishes. As for the taste, it was just very ordinary home cooking. The taste was quite average.","\"I have something to ask you.\" Chang Zhiyuan said as he ate.","Seeing that Shu Yi didn't react, Chang Zhiyuan continued: \"Can you accompany me to a dinner gathering tonight?\"","\"What if I say I can't?\" Shu Yi looked at Chang Zhiyuan.","Chang Zhiyuan had already guessed this response. \"You can't say you can't, it's work.\"","At the company, Xu Xiuhe had a simple lunch, and then made another call to Shen Yin.","Shen Yin really couldn't have imagined that Xu Xiuhe would be so clingy now, calling her several times a day already.","\"Wife, don't cook dinner tonight. I'll come pick you and Zheng Zheng up in the evening to eat out.\"","\"Okay.\"","Xu Xiuhe was satisfied and called Liu Bo into his office.","\"I heard you're going to marry Xiao Li'er?\"","\"???\" Liu Bo was caught off guard by the question. How did this get to the CEO?","\"No, no. I said that before because I felt guilty about worrying that she might get fired.\"","\"Just out of guilt? You don't like her?\"","Liu Bo hurriedly waved his hands: \"No, no, I don't like her.\"","\"Liu Assistant, you're not that young anymore, almost 30. You should take care of your life's big matters too.\"","Hearing this, Liu Bo inwardly lamented. So the CEO also knew he wasn't that young anymore? Yet he still overworks him every day. Liu Bo is so busy with work, when does he have time to deal with his own marital affairs?","\"CEO, I don't think I have enough time.\"","Xu Xiuhe thought for a moment and said, \"What time?\"","\"Personal time to find a partner.\"","\"Finding a partner needs time? I didn't need any. I'm a year younger than you, and my son is already two years old.\"","Liu Bo was speechless: \"That's because you're impressive.\"","\"Here's what we'll do. Our company has quite a few single young ladies too. You take a look and see if you like any of them. If so, I'll have them transferred directly to the top floor. Proximity breeds affection.\" Xu Xiuhe stroked his chin, feeling it still wasn't enough, and continued, \"Marriage is a big deal after all. Xiao Li'er is also getting on in years. How about this? This weekend at Qingfeng Mingyue, we'll hold a large-scale matchmaking event. Any singles from our subsidiary companies can sign up. I'll have you handle this.\"","Liu Bo was so shocked he couldn't speak. Had the CEO taken the wrong medicine? Or was he so blessed in his own marriage that he wanted those around him to enjoy marital bliss too?"]},{"number":86,"title":"Chapter 86: Having a Second Child","paragraphs":["In the evening, though the sun had not yet set over the western hills, Xu Xiuhe was in a good mood and did not ask Liu Assistant to continue processing the unfinished files, perhaps out of a pang of conscience. He felt that Liu Assistant had been working a bit too hard.","When he drove back to the small building, the other employees had already left. Xu Xiuhe climbed up to the third floor, where Shen Yin was sketching design drafts.","Xu Xiuhe walked up to the desk, bent down and kissed Shen Yin's hair, and asked while looking at the draft, \"You really want to make furniture?\"","\"Zhengzheng is here,\" Shen Yin replied.","Xu Xiuhe turned to see Zhengzheng playing in the living room, and said with his head lowered, \"He's having a great time playing.\"","\"I think this furniture is quite interesting. The Chinese-style furniture on the market nowadays always seems to be lacking something. I wanted to recreate the furniture from my memory of the Dasheng Dynasty, with more exquisite decorative patterns. I've looked at the furniture in stores, and while the styles are largely similar, the carvings aren't delicate enough,\" Shen Yin explained.","\"So you want to make it yourself?\"","Shen Yin nodded.","\"Won't it be too tiring for you?\" Xu Xiuhe was genuinely concerned about Shen Yin overworking herself.","\"I'll just draw the designs, and have someone else make them. It won't be too tiring,\" Shen Yin assured him.","\"Hmm, okay. But when you're pregnant, you should stop, alright?\"","\"???\" Shen Yin didn't quite understand.","Xu Xiuhe stood up, walked over to the carpet, picked up Zhengzheng and asked, \"Zhengzheng, do you want a daddy?\"","Zhengzheng waved his hands, \"Want daddy.\" Then he planted a kiss on Xu Xiuhe's face.","\"Daddy will take you out for dinner tonight, okay?\"","Zhengzheng grinned, squirming in Xu Xiuhe's arms with delight.","\"Go to your mom, daddy needs to get ready.\" Xu Xiuhe put Zhengzheng down.","Zhengzheng stood on the ground, swinging his arms and strutting over to Shen Yin in a hilariously exaggerated manner. Once he reached Shen Yin, he hugged her legs and said, \"Mommy, eat food go.\"","Xu Xiuhe went into the bedroom, grabbed Zhengzheng's cup from the bedside table, packed Zhengzheng's go-bag, then went to the closet to fetch a bag for Shen Yin.","\"Wifey, I'm all set. Let's go,\" Xu Xiuhe said, standing in the living room holding a bag in each hand.","For some reason, the sight struck Shen Yin as hilarious, and she struggled to hold back her laughter as she said, \"Alright then, let's go.\"","Xu Xiuhe drove steadily, with Shen Yin and Zhengzheng sitting in the back seat. He kept glancing at them through the rearview mirror.","Shen Yin felt a bit shy under his gaze, as she was still quite flustered - after all, just last night the two of them had...","\"Focus on driving,\" she said.","\"Mm-hmm, got it, wifey,\" Xu Xiuhe replied with a smile.","\"Wifey, have you thought about what I mentioned earlier?\"","Shen Yin was puzzled, unable to recall what Xu Xiuhe had said.","\"Having a second child,\" Xu Xiuhe stated bluntly.","Shen Yin's heart skipped a beat. What did he just say?","\"What's having a second child?\" Zhengzheng piped up, his curious face the picture of innocence.","\"It means giving Zhengzheng a little brother or sister, so Zhengzheng can be the big brother,\" Xu Xiuhe patiently explained.","\"Oh,\" Zhengzheng nodded, half-understanding.","\"Does Zhengzheng want a little brother or a little sister?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Zhengzheng put a finger to his mouth, appearing deep in thought. After a few seconds, he said, \"Zhengzheng wants a big brother.\"","By this point, Shen Yin could no longer bear to listen. What was this all about? Leaving aside the fact that she had no plans for another child yet, how could she give Zhengzheng an older brother?","\"Stop, Zhengzheng, you're too young. Let's talk about this again in a few years, okay?\" Shen Yin said softly, her head lowered.","\"You don't want to have another one?\" Xu Xiuhe's tone was unreadable, but Shen Yin's instinct told her he was a little unhappy.","She knew Xu Xiuhe well enough to realize that if she didn't explain, his brooding nature would lead him to overthink things, perhaps even assuming she wanted a divorce again. \"No, it's just that Zhengzheng is too young, only two years old. Let's reconsider when he's a bit older. Don't read too much into it, I have no thoughts of divorce,\" she clarified.","Upon hearing this, Xu Xiuhe suddenly broke into a smile so bright that Shen Yin could see it clearly in the front mirror. She rarely saw him smile so happily. From what she learned about his family history and upbringing from Auntie Song, she knew his past could not have been easy.","\"Am I so good-looking that you're staring at me so intently?\" Xu Xiuhe asked in a low voice.","\"Who's staring at you? You're so full of yourself,\" Shen Yin replied sheepishly, her voice lacking conviction.","\"Daddy looks like Zhengzheng, just as handsome,\" Zhengzheng chimed in.","Shen Yin burst into laughter at this. Little kids really did say the funniest things when they started talking.","\"Zhengzheng, I'm your daddy. You can only say you look like me, not that I look like you. Understand?\" Xu Xiuhe corrected.","\"Understood, but I'm saying you look like me, not that I look like you,\" Zhengzheng argued, not comprehending the issue. He turned to Shen Yin, hoping his mother would take his side.","\"Hahahahaha!\" Shen Yin couldn't hold it in any longer. The logic of children really was hilarious.","\"Ahem.\" Xu Xiuhe cleared his throat loudly, and Shen Yin finally calmed down. A few seconds later, she leaned towards Zhengzheng and said, \"Zhengzheng, you can't say daddy looks like you. You have to say you look like daddy, okay?\"","Zhengzheng nodded obediently, \"Zhengzheng looks like daddy.\"","Only then was Xu Xiuhe satisfied.","Watching the father and son interact, Shen Yin felt deeply moved. Zhengzheng was sure to grow into a sunny, lively, kind, and cheerful boy, because he was growing up surrounded by love.","The car pulled up to the entrance of Qingfeng Mingyue restaurant. Shen Yin wanted Xu Xiuhe to stop so she and Zhengzheng could get out first.","\"It's fine, just drive straight down to the underground parking. We'll take the elevator up to the private room,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","The private room was spacious and elegantly decorated. When Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin entered, Chang Zhiyuan and Shu Yi had already arrived.","Chang Zhiyuan had only told Shu Yi about a dinner gathering, without specifying what kind. From the moment they entered the private room, Shu Yi had been feeling anxious and afraid.","She had already envisioned the worst-case scenario - that Chang Zhiyuan was making her come to provide drinking company because she had been disobedient. She clutched her bag tightly, having placed a can of pepper spray inside just in case. If anything untoward happened, she would spray both Chang Zhiyuan and herself, then escape.","But it turned out to just be Shen Yin, which instantly put Shu Yi at ease. She let go of her bag, walked over to Shen Yin, and said, \"I didn't expect we were dining together.\"","Xu Xiuhe gave Chang Zhiyuan a meaningful look, then asked, \"You didn't tell her who we were dining with?\"","Chang Zhiyuan shrugged. \"How could I? If I told her it was a family dinner, she definitely wouldn't have come.\"","\"Zhengzheng, let auntie give you a kiss.\"","Shu Yi took Zhengzheng in her arms, and he planted a kiss on her cheek.","Chang Zhiyuan looked on enviously, wishing he could kiss those cheeks too.","\"Jing Rui hasn't arrived yet?\" Xu Xiuhe asked."]},{"number":87,"title":"Chapter 87: Belle Sister","paragraphs":["\"I'm here,\" Xue Jingrui said as he pushed open the door to the private room.","The eyes of the four people inside were drawn toward him. Xue Jingrui held the door open but didn't enter. Instead, he turned and spoke to someone outside, \"You come in first.\"","A young woman entered the room. She had fair skin, a cute and adorable doll-like face, and a petite figure of about 160 cm tall. Her sweet and lovely appearance made her look like a quintessential \"sweet girl.\"","\"Hello everyone, I'm Qi Ji,\" she introduced herself.","As Chang Zhiyuan heard her voice, he realized that Xue Jingrui was right—this young lady did indeed have a doll-like, sweet voice.","Xue Jingrui walked over and stood next to Qi Ji, announcing, \"Qi Ji, my wife.\"","Shen Yin and Shu Yi exchanged glances, with Shu Yi looking particularly shocked. In her eyes, Xue Jingrui had already hit rock bottom, yet he was married. Why did he act so attentive toward that waitress they had encountered twice before? What a dog of a man. Indeed, there was no good man to be found, and she started feeling disdain even toward Chang Zhiyuan, who was standing nearby.","This introduction stunned not only Shen Yin and Shu Yi but also Chang Zhiyuan, who asked in disbelief, \"Wife?\"","Xue Jingrui rubbed his nose and said, \"Yes, we just got our marriage certificate this morning, on Monday.\"","Chang Zhiyuan thought to himself, \"Good heavens.\" He had forgotten that Xue Jingrui had mentioned getting married on Monday, so the gathering Xue Jingrui had organized today was to introduce his new wife to them. The two brothers next to him were both married men.","\"Come and sit down,\" Xu Xiuhe said, arranging the chairs around the table.","\"Beautiful sister, may I sit here?\" Qi Ji stood next to Shu Yi and politely asked, her eyes blinking sweetly.","At first, Shu Yi didn't want her to, as she had intended for Shen Yin to sit next to her. However, she couldn't resist Qi Ji's soft, sweet voice that sounded like a natural, unaffected plea. More importantly, Qi Ji had called her \"beautiful sister.\" In contrast, the waitress Qi Yan seemed even more uncouth.","Shu Yi pulled a chair over for Qi Ji. \"Sure, sure,\" she said, noticing Qi Ji looking at her. She immediately averted her gaze, thinking to herself that she had been rude to stare at someone like that.","The six of them sat down, with little Zhengzheng also seated in a baby chair.","\"Qi Ji, let me introduce you,\" Xue Jingrui said, pointing to Chang Zhiyuan and Xu Xiuhe. \"These are my two brothers. We've been friends since childhood—Chang Zhiyuan and Xu Xiuhe.\"","He then looked toward Shen Yin and Zhengzheng. \"This is Xiuhe's lover and their child.\"","\"Hello, beautiful sister. Hi there, little one,\" Qi Ji greeted them with a smile.","Shen Yin smiled slightly and replied, \"Hello.\"","Next to her, little Zhengzheng shyly said, \"Hello, big sister.\"","\"Big sister\"—what a unique way to address her! Qi Ji blushed. Although people had commented on her youthful appearance before, even likening her to a minor, this was the first time a child had called her \"big sister.\"","Xue Jingrui continued with the introductions, but when he looked at Shu Yi, he hesitated, unsure how to introduce her role. \"This is the famous superstar Shu Yi, she is...\" He suddenly realized he didn't know how to describe Shu Yi's relationship.","Seeing Xue Jingrui stumbling over his words, Chang Zhiyuan turned to Shu Yi with a deep, affectionate gaze and said, \"She's my future girlfriend.\"","Shu Yi didn't dare look at Chang Zhiyuan. What was with that deep, affectionate gaze of his? When had she agreed to be his girlfriend?","Qi Ji glanced between Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan, her expression suggesting she had encountered something puzzling.","\"Let me introduce myself,\" Qi Ji said. \"I was born extremely small, so small that when I cried as a newborn, my father found it miraculous and named me 'Qi Ji,' which means 'miracle.' I'm 22 years old now, already an adult. I just graduated from university this year, and I'm currently an illustrator. Normally, I'm quite reclusive and rarely go out. It's a pleasure to meet all of you.\"","Qi Ji spoke at length. As a child, she was physically frail, so she received homeschooling through elementary and middle school, with private tutors hired by her parents. It wasn't until high school that she entered a regular school, and she had difficulty adjusting at first, suffering from social anxiety. In university, she lived alone off-campus, making very few friends, and she eventually learned to converse with herself.","Shortly after graduating, Qi Ji's family arranged for her to marry, which she initially didn't want. However, her parents said that Jingrui was a good man and that a marriage between their powerful families would be beneficial for both companies' development. She relented, as her parents had treated her well over the years, and she felt she should do something for them.","When she met Xue Jingrui, Qi Ji found him to be a decent person, just as her parents had said. He was tall, fair-skinned, with a sunny disposition and pleasant appearance. He was also very gentlemanly and didn't make her feel uncomfortable. She felt satisfied. One shouldn't be greedy, she had thought. If she couldn't find a suitable partner, she would remain single for life. As for marriage, as long as the two people could get along without discomfort, that would be enough. Her expectations weren't high, but now her mindset seemed to be changing, as if the heart that had been sealed for over 20 years was stirring again.","\"It's a pleasure to meet you,\" Shu Yi said first.","\"Let's eat first and chat while we're at it,\" Chang Zhiyuan suggested.","A waitress knocked on the door of the private room and entered, carrying a large bottle of chilled watermelon juice. She poured it into glasses and passed them around the table.","\"Thank you,\" everyone said.","Shu Yi picked up her glass, about to drink, when Shen Yin coughed loudly, \"Ahem, ahem, ahem.\"","Shu Yi put down the glass with an embarrassed smile.","The others didn't understand the reason. \"What's wrong? Doesn't it taste good?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","Shu Yi shook her head. She couldn't very well say that she couldn't drink anything cold because she was about to get her period.","Shu Yi gave Shen Yin a knowing look, and only then did Shen Yin feel reassured.","\"Have some meat. Look, you're too thin,\" Chang Zhiyuan said, using the shared chopsticks to place a slice of beef on Shu Yi's plate.","Shu Yi thought to herself, \"...\" She needed to control her figure for her on-screen appearances.","\"What's wrong? You're not eating what I served you?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","Shu Yi shook her head again. \"I need to watch my figure.\"","\"Health is most important. Even if you gain weight, it's no big deal. I'll take care of you.\"","\"You...\" Shu Yi didn't want to continue the conversation.","\"Zhiyuan, I saw Sister Ning Jing downstairs earlier,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"Yeah, she probably has some business to attend to here,\" Chang Zhiyuan replied.","\"Haven't you been home in a while?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"No, if I go home, my mom will nag me about getting married. My sister is older than me, yet she's pressuring me first.\" As he spoke, he looked directly at Shu Yi, making his intentions clear to everyone present.","Shu Yi turned her head away, pretending not to have heard him. She couldn't afford to take that gamble, nor did she dare.","\"You really can't bear to let Sister Ning Jing handle such a large company all by herself?\" Xue Jingrui asked again.","\"What else can I do?\" Chang Zhiyuan replied. He didn't want his sister to work so hard, but secretly, he had been helping Ning Jing a lot behind the scenes."]},{"number":88,"title":"Chapter 88: Let's Fall in Love","paragraphs":["\"Let's not discuss this topic any further,\" Chang Zhiyuan said.","The others heard it too and naturally didn't pursue their curiosity further.","\"Jingrui, how are the wedding preparations going? Let me know if you need anything,\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","\"It's going quite smoothly. About 10 days left now, and everything looks good so far. We're just short two bridesmaids,\" Qi Ji said a bit sheepishly. \"Sorry, I don't have many friends.\"","Her words made Shu Yi's heart ache for the girl. Why was she like Shu Yi herself, with no friends? Such a sweet, pretty girl shouldn't be friendless.","\"Qi Ji, I can be one of your bridesmaids,\" Shu Yi offered.","\"Really, beautiful sister?\" The girl's eyes lit up at the prospect of having friends to usher her into marriage, like a princess.","\"Really.\"","\"That's wonderful. We still need one more. We can hire someone then.\"","\"Mm hmm.\" Qi Ji nodded obediently.","\"Let Yan Yan and Shu Yi be the bridesmaids. It'll be safer that way, and it'll be easier if anything comes up,\" Chang Zhiyuan suggested. He still didn't feel completely at ease with Shu Yi being a bridesmaid alone.","\"Need a groomsman? I can do it!\" Chang Zhiyuan added.","\"Ha ha ha ha ha ha, sure!\"","The meal finished quite quickly. Worried that Qi Ji might be too tired, Xue Jingrui said, \"Qi Ji and I should head back first. We need to return to the family compound early today.\"","Qi Ji smiled, her eyes crinkling. \"Goodbye, pretty sisters and little friend,\" she waved.","Shen Yin and Shu Yi waved back with smiles.","\"Full?\" Xu Xiuhe asked, tilting his head towards Shen Yin.","\"Full, Dad.\" Little Zhengzheng was still struggling with the chicken on his plate, small fork in hand.","\"I didn't ask you. If you're full, why are you still eating?\" Xu Xiuhe asked his son.","Xu Yunzheng blinked at his father, then lowered his head and continued eating.","\"Wife, are you full?\" Xu Xiuhe turned to Shen Yin.","\"I'm full.\"","\"It's getting late, and this meal took a while. Let's head back too.\" Xu Xiuhe's voice was louder so that Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan could hear him too.","\"Let's go. I'll drive you,\" Chang Zhiyuan said, picking up Shu Yi's bag.","\"I can carry it myself.\" Shu Yi tried to take the bag from Chang Zhiyuan, but he pulled it back. Their hands brushed, and Shu Yi quickly withdrew hers.","\"Let's go.\" Xu Xiuhe picked up Zhengzheng, grabbed their bags, and walked behind Chang Zhiyuan and Shen Yin.","Chang Zhiyuan led the way, with Shu Yi in the middle and Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin side by side behind her. But as soon as they left the private room, their positions changed.","Chang Zhiyuan and Shu Yi walked side by side.","\"Zhiyuan?\"","They turned to see a black-haired woman in her late twenties, dressed in a black business suit, standing behind them.","\"Sister, you're done?\" Chang Zhiyuan spoke first.","\"Mm, you came out for a meal too?\" Chang Ningjing noticed the bag in Chang Zhiyuan's hand, then looked at Shu Yi.","Chang Ningjing's gaze was an unabashed appraisal, without a shred of tact. \"Got a new girlfriend?\"","Shu Yi felt awkward and wanted to clarify that she wasn't his girlfriend.","\"Sister, she's not my girlfriend. I'm still pursuing her,\" Chang Zhiyuan replied nonchalantly.","Chang Ningjing's gaze intensified. \"I don't care about your romantic affairs. Just go home so Mom and Dad don't worry. Learn from Xiuhe.\"","Chang Zhiyuan didn't take it seriously. These were just typical remarks. Whenever he went home, they'd nag him to get married, so he tried to avoid going back as much as possible.","\"Xiuhe, this must be your wife,\" Chang Ningjing turned to Shen Yin and extended her hand.","Shen Yin hesitated for a moment before realizing Chang Ningjing wanted to shake hands. \"Hello, I'm Shen Yin,\" she said, reaching out.","\"Hello. I'm older than you, so just call me Sister Ningjing.\"","\"I need to hurry back to the office now. I'll get going first.\" With that, Chang Ningjing turned and left briskly.","Shu Yi retrieved her bag from Chang Zhiyuan's hands and walked ahead.","Seeing Shu Yi's dampened mood, Chang Zhiyuan quickly went after her.","\"Will there be any trouble?\" Shen Yin asked with concern.","\"No, Zhiyuan's quite reliable. Let's head back too.\" Xu Xiuhe shook his head.","Shen Yin nodded, but her thoughts lingered on Chang Ningjing. That woman gave off a cool, powerful vibe.","After dinner, Xu Xiuhe drove, with Shen Yin in the backseat and a sleeping Zhengzheng. The wide road was occasionally dotted with pedestrians on the side paths.","Now and then, they passed young couples strolling hand-in-hand. Envious, Xu Xiuhe slowed the car to a crawl under the warm orange glow of the street lamps, savoring the gentle summer night.","\"Are they siblings?\" Shen Yin asked, sensing an odd dynamic between Chang Ningjing and Chang Zhiyuan.","\"Yes, biological siblings. Zhiyuan has always refused to take over the family business to bolster Ningjing's standing at home.\"","\"What do you mean?\"","\"Their family values sons over daughters. Ningjing was treated differently from Zhiyuan growing up, despite being very good to him. But Zhiyuan couldn't do much. A few years ago, the family wanted to force Ningjing into an arranged marriage, but she refused. Zhiyuan felt bad, so he started slacking off and not managing the company, generating all sorts of scandals. Ningjing is capable herself and gradually established a firm foothold at the company, earning respect at home through sheer grit and perseverance.\"","Shen Yin considered Chang Ningjing in a new light after hearing her past struggles.","Xu Xiuhe watched the young couple outside, holding hands and strolling under the streetlights. The girl was smiling happily, saying something to the boy, who affectionately patted her head and led her onwards.","This, Xu Xiuhe realized, was romance—simple, filled with laughter and chatter, their eyes only for each other.","He hadn't had that with Shen Yin. He hadn't given her much at all. This girl had been busy taking care of the child since she arrived. Working so hard every day. A pang of guilt overcame him. \"Wife, let's date.\"","\"Huh?\" Shen Yin didn't understand what was going through Xu Xiuhe's mind. They were already married with a two-year-old son. How could they date now? Who dated after marriage?","\"Focus on driving,\" was all she said.","Xu Xiuhe took that as tacit agreement and sped up. If Shen Yin didn't object, then he would start dating her tomorrow night.","Xu Xiuhe parked the car, got out, opened the rear door for Shen Yin, and carried a still-sleeping Zhengzheng out after she exited.","\"Wasn't today tiring?\" he asked solicitously.","\"Do you really need to ask?\"","\"Then we'll start dating tomorrow night.\""]},{"number":89,"title":"Chapter 89: Flower Flower","paragraphs":["Xu Xiuhe had Shen Yin go take a shower first, while he took little Xu Yunzheng to another bathroom.","It wasn't Xu Xiuhe's first time bathing the sleeping Xu Yunzheng, so he was more at ease this time around. He was feeling a bit proud of himself when suddenly, Xu Yunzheng opened his eyes in the tub.","\"Papa, find Mama,\" Xu Yunzheng said sleepily.","\"Good boy, Mama is also taking a shower. You can find her after she's done,\" Xu Xiuhe reassured him.","Xu Yunzheng closed his eyes again and dozed off in the tub. Xu Xiuhe quickly steadied him, worried that he might fall into the water if he slept too deeply.","After Shen Yin had showered and dried her hair in the bedroom, Xu Xiuhe finally brought Xu Yunzheng out of the bathroom.","\"You two go to sleep first. I'll take a shower now,\" he said.","After Xu Xiuhe went in, Shen Yin tucked Xu Yunzheng in with a light blanket and lay down beside him.","Perhaps from exhaustion, before Xu Xiuhe even came out, the mother and son were sound asleep on the bed.","It was a tranquil night, with no moon outside, only twinkling stars visible through the window. After closing it, Xu Xiuhe quietly lay down beside Xu Yunzheng.","How fortunate he was, this cold and aloof man, to have such warmth around him. How fortunate he was to have found such a good wife.","They slept well through the night, and surprisingly, little Xu Yunzheng was the first to wake up in the morning.","\"Flower, flower,\" he said, lying in bed and looking left and right, his big eyes playing with his own fingers.","Suddenly, his hand smacked Xu Xiuhe's face with a pat.","Xu Xiuhe opened his eyes, dazed and confused as to why he had been slapped first thing in the morning.","\"Flower, Xu Yunzheng wants flower,\" the little one declared.","Understanding, Xu Xiuhe got up, changed his clothes in the closet, then came back and grabbed Xu Yunzheng to take him in too.","\"Xu Yunzheng, you can't just hit people, you know,\" he scolded, holding the boy under his armpits with both hands, Xu Yunzheng's body dangling uncomfortably as he kicked his legs.","\"What clothes do you want to wear?\" Xu Xiuhe asked, freeing one hand to point at Xu Yunzheng's little wardrobe.","\"Wah wah wah, want Mama,\" Xu Yunzheng cried.","\"A little man doesn't cry. Mama is sleeping, we can't bother her now,\" Xu Xiuhe said firmly.","Xu Yunzheng stopped crying. \"Papa, want flower.\"","\"Alright, Papa will get the flower first, but before that, you need to get dressed.\"","Not waiting for Xu Yunzheng's preference, Xu Xiuhe grabbed a white t-shirt and black cargo pants from the wardrobe and put them on the boy.","After getting dressed, Xu Xiuhe carried Xu Yunzheng out, tiptoed to the living room, took out his phone and called Liu Bo.","\"Liu Bo, bring Xu Yunzheng's flower to Qinghe Villa.\"","Hanging up, Xu Xiuhe took Xu Yunzheng downstairs. There were many breakfast stalls on this street, so he bought some food.","On the way back, they ran into Mrs. Su.","\"Xu Yunzheng, say good morning to Grandma,\" Xu Xiuhe instructed.","\"Good morning, Grandma,\" Xu Yunzheng said sweetly.","\"Good morning. Out buying breakfast?\" Mrs. Su asked.","\"Yes, just bought some, heading back now,\" Xu Xiuhe replied coolly, as he did with unfamiliar people.","\"What about your wife?\" Mrs. Su inquired further.","\"Still sleeping,\" Xu Xiuhe answered shortly.","\"Oh, a young lady came looking for your wife last night. She seemed familiar, like that Zhou Man from before,\" Mrs. Su recounted with a smile.","Zhou Man? Xu Xiuhe vaguely recalled Shen Yin mentioning her before but wasn't clear on who she was or why she would be looking for his wife now. He grew concerned that Shen Yin might not be able to handle it alone.","When they arrived at Qinghe Villa, the studio staff were already there. Xu Xiuhe carried Xu Yunzheng upstairs to find Shen Yin coming out of the bedroom.","\"Why didn't you wake me up?\" she asked groggily.","\"Didn't want you to be tired. Sleep in a bit more,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"I'm awake now.\"","\"Alright, come eat first then.\"","After breakfast, Liu Bo called to say he had delivered the flower and tied it to the door handle before leaving.","\"Aren't you going to work today?\" Shen Yin asked, as Xu Xiuhe would normally be at the company by now.","\"I said we're dating today,\" he answered playfully, making Shen Yin blush.","\"What's dating? Xu Yunzheng wants to date too,\" the little one chimed in.","\"Xu Yunzheng, you're too young for dating. Dating is being together with someone you like. You can only date when you're 18,\" Xu Xiuhe explained patiently.","\"Xu Yunzheng likes Mama, Xu Yunzheng wants to date Mama,\" the boy declared innocently.","Xu Xiuhe's face darkened. \"Xu Yunzheng, dating is not for children. And you can't date Mama - Mama can only date Papa, understand?\"","Shen Yin gave Xu Xiuhe a kick under the table, but he just smiled at her in response.","After the meal, Shen Yin started painting while Xu Xiuhe watched over Xu Yunzheng beside her.","\"Don't you have work to do? You're the CEO, shouldn't you be busy?\" Shen Yin asked, feeling self-conscious being watched.","\"Not busy, I have Assistant Liu,\" Xu Xiuhe brushed it off nonchalantly.","The phone on the table rang, and Shen Yin answered it.","\"Boss, there's a dog outside our door that keeps barking. Whose dog is this?\" the person on the other end questioned.","Shen Yin looked puzzled. \"A dog?\" Then her gaze turned to Xu Xiuhe.","\"Xu Yunzheng wanted his flower, so I had Assistant Liu bring it over,\" he explained.","Shen Yin spoke into the phone, \"It's the dog I'm raising. Why is it barking so much? I'll go down and check.\"","Hanging up, she told Xu Xiuhe, \"Li Huanhuan said the flower keeps barking. I'll go take a look.\"","Shen Yin put on shoes to head downstairs, but the cautious Xu Xiuhe followed with Xu Yunzheng in his arms.","Downstairs, Li Huanhuan stood by the door. \"This doggy won't stop barking. I didn't dare go out since it's tied to the door handle.\"","Xu Xiuhe carried Xu Yunzheng out and looked around. To the right of the villa, a woman was peeking out from behind the wall.","\"Come out,\" Xu Xiuhe ordered coldly.","The woman cautiously emerged from behind the wall.","\"What's your business here?\" he asked bluntly, guessing this sneaky woman could be Zhou Man, which made his tone unfriendly.","Intimidated by the large dog, Zhou Man slowly approached.","The flower started barking more aggressively and louder than before, sounding quite fierce now.","The woman, in a tight black dress, came closer. \"Hello, this is my friend's shop. I want to know if she's here,\" she said tentatively, clearly afraid to get closer because of the dog. It was quite a comical sight.","Shen Yin also came out and saw Zhou Man, unsurprised since she had anticipated Zhou Man might come looking for her after the call last night."]},{"number":90,"title":"Chapter 90: Map Your Feelings","paragraphs":["\"Yin, it's me, Manman.\" Zhou Man ran up, no longer afraid of the dog biting her.","Shen Yin still pretended not to recognize her, \"Who are you looking for?\"","Zhou Man suddenly pounced on her, trying to grab Shen Yin's arm. Xu Xiuhe was quick to react, untying the rope that secured Huahua to the door.","Huahua was no ordinary pet dog. It was large in stature, with a fierce appearance. Gentle and kind towards its owner, but extremely vicious towards strangers who behaved suspiciously.","Xu Xiuhe closed the main door. Now free, the energetic Huahua dashed around joyfully.","\"Woof, woof, woof woof.\" Huahua barked chaotically, charging towards Zhou Man.","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe stood by the window of the small building, watching the chase unfold outside between the woman and the dog.","Huahua seemed to be catching up, but then slowed its pace, stepping forward and closing in on Zhou Man.","\"Woof woof woof.\"","At first, Zhou Man backed away, but after a few steps, realizing retreating was too slow, she turned and ran towards the end of Qinghe Street. Her posture was awkward, drawing the attention of people from the small houses lining the street.","\"Mom, Huahua, Huahua.\" Zhengzheng watched from the window, pointing at Huahua as he spoke to Shen Yin.","Zhengzheng clapped his hands, slightly excited by the sight of Huahua chasing and barking at Zhou Man. Since moving to this small building, he hadn't seen Huahua, and today, the dog was far more lively than he had ever seen at Ziyue Manor.","Xu Xiuhe was also surprised, not expecting the usually gentle large dog to be so energetic today. If he hadn't witnessed this wild behavior, he would have thought they had turned the Tibetan mastiff into a little white rabbit.","Only when Zhou Man had fled far enough did Huahua saunter back, sitting obediently at the entrance, as if it weren't the same dog from moments ago.","Huahua's leash was still on, and it sat calmly at the door, panting but well-behaved. Shen Yin was worried that Huahua might be thirsty after all that barking.","\"Xiuhe, why don't we bring Huahua upstairs and give it some water?\"","No sooner had she said that than Zhengzheng went over, patted Huahua's head, and said, \"Huahua is cool!\"","Neither Shen Yin nor Xu Xiuhe had expected those words.","Zhengzheng then approached and hugged Huahua, saying, \"Huahua barked today.\"","Xu Xiuhe put his hand to his forehead, realizing the child had thought Huahua was a little white rabbit all along, rarely hearing it bark.","Xu Xiuhe took hold of the leash around Huahua's neck and led it upstairs to the third floor.","Shen Yin found a bowl, poured some water into it, and set it down in front of Huahua.","Huahua lapped up the water, making slurping noises as it drank a few gulps. It then looked up, and Zhengzheng approached, asking, \"Huahua, want some meat?\"","Huahua blinked its eyes, gazing at Zhengzheng with a gentle expression.","Xu Xiuhe went into the kitchen, found a steak, put it on a plate, and set it down next to Huahua's water bowl.","Seeing Huahua happily eating, Zhengzheng was delighted, bouncing around the dog.","Xu Xiuhe turned to Shen Yin and said, \"This morning when I bought groceries, Granny Su said she came here last night.\"","Shen Yin replied, \"She called me yesterday. My understanding of her is limited to the original Shen Yin's memories – that she was very dependent on Shen Yin, extremely kind and caring towards her, always looking out for her and acting spoiled to get Shen Yin's attention. That's why Shen Yin liked her a lot.\"","Xu Xiuhe sighed, \"Sometimes, liking someone can be very simple and have nothing to do with gender.\"","\"So, the original host might not have been exclusively attracted to the same gender, but just happened to develop feelings for someone who shared her gender?\" Shen Yin was always a bit slow on the uptake when it came to emotions.","\"Perhaps because Zhou Man was so good to Shen Yin, Shen Yin fell for her. But she didn't realize that all that kindness was deception. No one is good to someone for no reason – they either want affection or personal gain. It's clear that Zhou Man was after personal gain, while I want your affection.\" Xu Xiuhe's voice took on a suave, flirtatious tone towards the end.","Shen Yin felt that Xu Xiuhe now was like a completely different person from when she had first transmigrated here. Back then, he was cold, heartless, devoid of human warmth. She could still remember his harsh tone and stern warnings, delivered with as few words as possible. Now, Xu Xiuhe shamelessly flirted every day, frequently throwing out lines and never missing a chance to call her \"wife.\"","\"Is that so? I don't recall who had a grim look and told me I wouldn't have an easy time.\" Shen Yin said nonchalantly.","A hint of embarrassment flashed across Xu Xiuhe's eyes as he quickly apologized, \"Sorry about that. I didn't know it was you back then, and I did do a lot of things that harmed Zhengzheng.\"","\"The original host probably didn't want to do those things because of her mental issues, but she couldn't control herself. It's good that she's in another world now, without those memories and still young.\" Shen Yin sighed.","\"Yeah, I hope she meets someone in that other world who truly loves her, spoils her, whether male or female.\" Xu Xiuhe then remembered Zhou Man and asked, \"What's the deal with Zhou Man? I only know she deceived Shen Yin.\"","It was only then that Shen Yin recalled she had only briefly mentioned to Xu Xiuhe that Zhou Man had lied to and stolen money from Shen Yin. She hadn't told him the specifics.","Well, she didn't know the details either. She had learned about it from Shen's Father, Shen's Mother, and Shen Lv.","Shen Yin relayed the information she had obtained from Shen's Father, Shen's Mother, and Shen Lv to Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe fell silent for a few seconds. \"You mean she married Guo Wei from Pei City?\"","\"Yes, that's what Father said. He said Guo Wei might even be older than him.\"","\"Guo Wei is no ordinary man. He has a shady background and a harem of women.\" Xu Xiuhe commented, realizing he might be difficult to deal with down the line.","\"Then why did she suddenly come looking for me? She already scammed 2 million from Shen Yin. With her current status, she shouldn't be short on money, right? Why do you think she came looking for Shen Yin?\"","\"It's never enough for the greedy. Even though you know martial arts, you should still be careful. I'll buy a few more Tibetan mastiffs.\" Xu Xiuhe felt the mastiffs were really impressive – gentle as lambs towards their owners, but vicious as wolves towards bad people.","\"Ah?\" After some thought, Shen Yin agreed. Since Zhengzheng liked them, and they could protect him, it was fine.","\"What kind of person do you think Shen Lv is?\" Shen Yin asked.","Xu Xiuhe didn't know why she was asking, but after considering, he answered, \"He seems like a playboy, but he's alright to deal with. Not a bad person. He has some capability and is quite decisive in handling matters, though his flaw is not really considering the consequences of his actions. Like when he drugged Shen Yin and got me drunk – his intentions were good, for Shen Yin's sake, but it ended up causing her a lot of pain.\" As he spoke, Xu Xiuhe felt a twinge of envy for Shen Lv, who had a loving family and a carefree life.","\"Yes, we often hurt others under the pretext of doing things for their own good.\""]},{"number":91,"title":"Chapter 91: The First Thing about Falling in Love","paragraphs":["\"Why suddenly ask about Shen Lv? You must have some impression of him in your memory,\" Shen Yin pondered and said.","\"Father's health is not good now, and Shen Lv may have to take over the company in the future. He seems to treat Shen Yin quite well, always doting on her. But sometimes he bullies her. There's not much age difference between them, so Shen Yin often gets bullied by him and then runs to our parents in tears,\" Shen Yin searched her memory and suddenly remembered that Shen Lv had a close friend who confessed to the original owner. However, the original owner, afraid that Shen Lv would manipulate her if he found out, rejected him. Then that friend went abroad. Shen Lv still doesn't know about this incident.\"","\"Oh, I see,\" Xu Xiuhe nodded in understanding.","\"Your brother is so old, and he still doesn't have a girlfriend?\" Xu Xiuhe became curious. Now that he has a wife, he finds it strange and incomprehensible that others don't have girlfriends or aren't married, even feeling anxious for them.","\"Huahua is full!\" Zhengzheng shouted from the living room.","Xu Xiuhe walked over, tidied up the bowls and plates, and put them at the bottom of the stairs on the third floor.","Turning around, he saw Zhengzheng standing beside Huahua, pouting, one hand clutching the other, looking at Xu Xiuhe with a particularly innocent expression, saying, \"Daddy, Zhengzheng is hungry too, Zhengzheng wants to eat meat.\"","Seeing him like this, Xu Xiuhe found him too cute and couldn't help teasing him, \"All the meat has been eaten by Huahua, there's none left.\"","Upon hearing this, Zhengzheng looked at Zhengzheng, his pout turning into a frown, his expression even more innocent than before, as if saying, \"Bad Huahua, stealing my meat.\"","Huahua, looking at the little master's expression, felt helpless, sitting on the ground, blinking, and yawning, as if saying, \"It's none of my business.\"","\"Don't tease him,\" Shen Yin entered the kitchen, poured a pot of milk, and handed it to Zhengzheng.","\"Meat.\" Although Zhengzheng said it with his mouth, his hands were honest, taking the milk bottle and holding it with both hands, gulping it down.","Afraid that Zhengzheng would blame her for not giving him meat, Shen Yin explained, \"It's almost lunchtime. If you eat meat now, you won't be able to eat lunch later.\"","Hearing that there would be meat for lunch, Zhengzheng nodded happily, holding the milk bottle and drinking it, his feet not idle, taking small steps, swaying back and forth, swaying to the side of the sofa, looking at Xu Xiuhe, holding the milk bottle, and showing it to Xu Xiuhe.","Shen Yin really feared that Zhengzheng would stumble and fall again.","\"Aren't you going to the company?\" Shen Yin asked again.","Xu Xiuhe replied, \"Just thinking about chasing your husband away, huh?\"","Here it comes again. Every time he said something like this, Shen Yin didn't know how to respond.","Originally, Xu Xiuhe didn't go to work because he heard from Su Jin that Zhou Man had come over and he was worried. He had just thought that Zhou Man had been scared by Huahua and probably wouldn't dare to come over again for a while. He had decided to go to the company. After all, he couldn't always rely on Liu Tezhu.","But when Shen Yin asked, he suddenly didn't want to leave. Beauty is in the eye of the beholder, and now he feels that Shen Yin looks good all the time, even her unwillingness to talk to him is charming.","Xu Xiuhe stood up and walked to Shen Yin's side, saying, \"When you're in love, the first thing to do is to go to the supermarket with your lover.\"","\"Let's go,\" Shen Yin hadn't reacted yet, but when Xu Xiuhe picked up the baby bag and lifted Zhengzheng, who was standing at the stairwell, Shen Yin followed suit.","\"Mommy, let's go,\" Zhengzheng said.","Upon hearing this, Shen Yin changed her shoes and joined them at the stairwell.","\"Flower wants to come too,\" Zhengzheng said.","\"Flower doesn't want to come. Darling, you hold Flower for a while and leave it on the first floor,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Shen Yin carefully picked up the leash. It was the first time she had held Flower like this. Before, she would have been afraid of such a big dog, but her perspective changed when Flower chased after Zhou Man and bit her earlier.","She felt that Flower always treated her as one of its own, never barking at her. This was the first time she had seen Flower being so fierce.","The three of them and the dog went downstairs.","Before leaving, Shen Yin explained to Li Huanhuan again, asking her to tell the woman she had just seen at the door not to let her in.","Li Huanhuan nodded.","After Xu Xiuhe put down Zhengzheng, took the leash from Shen Yin, and reattached it to the door, he went to the back of the building to get the car.","In the car, Shen Yin asked, \"Which supermarket are we going to?\"","\"Ziyue Manor's,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","Shen Yin had a thousand question marks in her mind. Did they have to go so far just to shop at a supermarket?","Seeing Shen Yin's confusion, Xu Xiuhe explained, \"Ziyue Manor's supermarket is not small. Most importantly, this supermarket only provides offline services for Ziyue Manor residents. For other places, they deliver to your door.\"","\"Are you saying outsiders can't enter Ziyue Manor's supermarket?\" Shen Yin asked.","Shen Yin hadn't lived in Ziyue Manor for long, so she had no idea.","\"Ziyue Manor is a project of Heyuan Group, and the supermarket also belongs to Heyuan. What's wrong? Can't I build a supermarket for myself?\"","Shen Yin was speechless for a moment. It was really ridiculous. Last time she went to the supermarket, she indeed noticed that there were more sellers than buyers.","\"Zhengzheng is a little celebrity now, so it's safer to go to Ziyue Manor,\" Xu Xiuhe added.","Actually, Xu Xiuhe wanted to suggest moving back to Ziyue Manor sometime, but he was afraid. There were more beds in Ziyue Manor, but he couldn't sleep in the same bed as Shen Yin.","When they arrived at the supermarket, the person in charge had already recognized Xu Xiuhe. It wasn't surprising that it took him a while to recognize him. After all, it had been so long since this top boss had come to the supermarket.","\"Yinyin?\"","Shen Yin heard a familiar voice and suddenly turned her head.","\"Yinyin, you moved back to Ziyue Manor?\" Shu Yi seemed a bit surprised.","\"No, I just came to shop at the supermarket. When will your next drama start filming?\" Shen Yin asked, curious.","\"I was originally planning to join the crew the day after tomorrow, but now that they're saying they've changed the male lead actor, it's postponed until 10 days later. It just so happens that I can be Qi Ji's bridesmaid,\" Shu Yi said, rambling on. \"Having more vacation time isn't a bad thing, right? I was still thinking of going on a trip with my parents these days.\"","\"Yeah, sounds good,\" Shen Yin wanted to say more, but Shu Yi noticed Xu Xiuhe's expression and didn't dare to take up more of Shen Yin's time.","\"Okay, let's talk about it later. Qi Ji heard that you design dresses, and he wants to ask for your help in designing the toast gown,\" Shu Yi almost finished her shopping, busy bidding farewell.","Xu Xiuhe pushed a shopping cart over and put Zhengzheng in it, pushing it himself while Shen Yin followed beside.","Suddenly, Xu Xiuhe said, \"Darling, you should push too.\"","Xu Xiuhe had done his homework, read the dating manual, and knew that shopping with his girlfriend, pushing the cart together, could bring them closer.","Seeing Shen Yin not moving, Xu Xiuhe pushed the cart with one hand, moved closer to Shen Yin, and with the other hand, he took Shen Yin's hand and placed it on the other handle of the shopping cart."]},{"number":92,"title":"Chapter 92: Too Good a Boy","paragraphs":["Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe walked side by side, their arms touching. Xu Xiuhe even wanted to pull Shen Yin into his embrace.","Shen Yin appeared calm on the surface, but her heart was already turbulent.","\"Shu Yi just said that Qi Ji wants to commission me for her wedding attire. Let's head back soon after we're done shopping.\"","\"We've just started, no rush. Their wedding is still nine days away, they probably won't have time to find you today,\" said Xu Xiuhe.","\"Why?\"","\"Qi Ji and Xue Jingrui got their marriage certificate yesterday, you know?\"","Shen Yin blushed.","\"I want chocolate! I want cheese sticks!\" little Zhengzheng murmured from the shopping cart.","Although Xu Xiuhe didn't approve of Zhengzheng eating too many snacks, he still grabbed some chocolates and cheese sticks from the snack aisle.","\"Honey, do you want anything?\" Xu Xiuhe turned and asked.","Shen Yin shook her head. She really didn't have any cravings.","Xu Xiuhe added a few more snacks to the cart. When they reached the vegetable section, Shen Yin finally started picking items.","Shen Yin placed her selections in the cart, and Xu Xiuhe followed closely behind, staying near Shen Yin to ensure she could easily put items in the cart when she turned around.","As the cart was almost full, little Zhengzheng sitting inside wore a disdainful expression, prompting Shen Yin to stop.","\"Let's go, we're done. Time to check out.\"","Xu Xiuhe pushed the cart to the cashier, where the store manager hurried over to greet them and arranged for employees to load the groceries into Xu Xiuhe's car outside.","As Xu Xiuhe paid with WeChat, he noticed an unread message in their group chat with three people. Opening it, he saw a message from Chang Zhiyuan.","[Jingrui, how was the wedding night? ;)]","[Ahem, nothing happened. She fell asleep.] Xue Jingrui replied. Indeed, as he had never had a girlfriend before, he wasn't prepared and worried about disappointing her on their first time. But last night, after Qi Ji came home and took a shower, she fell asleep in the bedroom.","She was still at home drawing illustrations now.","[Be good to the little lady.] Chang Zhiyuan advised, fearing that Xue Jingrui might still be hung up on that other woman.","[I'm treating her well.] Xue Jingrui replied before calling Qi Ji.","\"Hey, brother Jingrui,\" the sweet voice of the young lady greeted him.","Xue Jingrui's heart fluttered at being called 'brother.' He doted on her, \"I'll pick you up for lunch.\"","\"Okay.\"","The young lady's voice remained sweet, betraying no particular emotion.","When Xue Jingrui first met Qi Ji, she struck him as obedient, younger, and he still felt that way. The young lady was compliant with him, her voice forever sweet, agreeing to whatever he said.","At noon, when Xue Jingrui returned to the residential compound, Xue's Father and Xue's Mother were already seated in the living room.","\"Mom, Dad, you're home early today. Usually, you come back later than me,\" Xue Jingrui remarked.","Xue's Father lowered his newspaper. \"Didn't you take the day off?\"","\"Take off for what?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","Ye Rong chided, \"Jingrui, you just got your marriage certificate yesterday. Shouldn't you be taking Qi Ji out today, going places, nurturing your relationship?\"","Xue Jingrui was taken aback, scratching his head.","Ye Rong continued, \"Qi Ji has been pampered at home too. She's so much younger than you; you need to learn to be considerate. I didn't say anything before when you liked Qi Yan, but now it's clear you and her aren't meant to be together. Cut ties cleanly for both your sakes. Most importantly, remember that you're a married man now. You've started a family. After the wedding, you and Qi Ji will move out. I'm afraid she might not get used to living with us.\"","\"Got it, Mom. I'll take Qi Ji out for lunch.\"","Ye Rong was delighted, relieved that her son and daughter-in-law would get along well.","Upstairs, Xue Jingrui entered the bedroom first, finding the bed neatly made and Qi Ji nowhere in sight. Puzzled, he searched around until spotting her at the study desk.","Sensing his presence, Qi Ji looked up from her tablet. \"Brother Jingrui, I used your desk for a bit.\"","\"No problem, you can use anything in the house.\"","\"Let's go.\" Xue Jingrui stood by the study door, waiting for Qi Ji to close her tablet and come over before leading her out and closing the door behind them.","\"Anything you need to take with you?\"","Qi Ji shook her head.","\"Then let's go.\"","As Qi Ji and Xue Jingrui descended, Xue's parents were still on the sofa. Ye Rong advised, \"Qi Ji, let me know if you're adjusting okay. Jingrui has never dated before, so he may not know how to be gentle with a lady. He went to work this morning, but you mustn't follow his example.\"","Qi Ji shook her head hurriedly with a smile. \"Mom, brother Jingrui has been great.\"","Ye Rong smiled and nodded. \"Good, good. If he mistreats you, tell us, and we'll stand up for you.\"","Xue Kai chimed in, \"Yes, we'll stand up for you.\"","\"Thank you, Dad and Mom. Brother Jingrui hasn't mistreated me.\"","\"No need for thanks among family. You two go on now, before you get hungry.\"","As Xue Jingrui drove, Qi Ji sat in the passenger seat. He felt a bit unaccustomed and struggled to find a topic.","\"Qi Ji, what would you like to eat?\"","\"Anything is fine with me.\"","Xue Jingrui didn't press further, driving them to an upscale Western restaurant.","\"Is Western food okay?\"","The young lady nodded again.","At noon, the restaurant wasn't crowded, with only a few occupied booths. Xue Jingrui chose one near the window and let Qi Ji take a seat.","\"Take a look and order,\" he handed her the menu.","After perusing it, Qi Ji ordered a steak, a fruit salad, a pizza, then asked, \"Brother Jingrui, what would you like?\"","\"Same as you is fine.\"","Qi Ji then added another steak order.","As they waited, Xue Jingrui broached a topic, \"Were you bored at home this morning?\"","Qi Ji shook her head. \"No, I'm used to being alone. My work involves drawing illustrations, so I have flexibility with time and location.\"","\"Mom said after our wedding, we'll move out. I have a place near the court with a good environment and security. I'll take you to see it this afternoon. If it's not suitable, we can find another.\"","\"Okay, sounds good.\"","Qi Ji was so obedient that Xue Jingrui felt she would agree to anything he said, either nodding or replying with \"okay.\"","\"Which university did you attend?\"","\"In Rong City, Rong City Art Institute.\""]},{"number":93,"title":"Chapter 93: No Need to Apologize","paragraphs":["\"The Rong City Art Institute?\"","Qi Ji nodded again, and Xue Jingrui didn't ask further.","The waiter brought over the red wine and the dishes they ordered.","\"Can you drink wine?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","\"I'm of age, so I can have a little bit.\"","Qi Ji picked up the wine glass and took a small sip. Xue Jingrui cut the steak on his plate into pieces.","After cutting it, Xue Jingrui switched their plates. Qi Ji was a bit surprised, realizing the steak was cut for her.","\"Thank you, Brother Jingrui.\" Just as her parents said, Brother Jingrui was indeed a good person.","\"Jingrui, you're here too?\"","Xue Jingrui and Qi Ji both looked up upon hearing the voice.","Xue Jingrui's expression suddenly changed, sounding unsettled, \"You're here for dinner too.\"","\"Yeah, I'm here with Mengmeng for dinner.\"","It was only then that Xue Jingrui noticed the person standing beside Qi Yan.","Qi Ji was already socially anxious, and encountering strangers while eating made her even more anxious. She lowered her head and ate the steak that Xue Jingrui had cut for her.","Gu Mengmeng saw someone disregarding her status again, naturally feeling displeased. Her expression changed as she stood beside Qi Yan with her arms crossed.","\"Jingrui, is this your younger sister? She's so young,\" Qi Yan asked.","Qi Ji looked up and smiled faintly at Qi Yan when she saw the woman asking about her.","\"She's not my sister, she's my wife.\"","\"What!\" Qi Yan was directly stunned into silence, standing still.","\"Wife?\" Qi Yan still couldn't believe it, wondering why she had no information about this.","\"Is she an adult? Little girl, are you eighteen yet?\" Gu Mengmeng also couldn't believe it from the side.","\"Hello, I'm 22,\" Qi Ji said before lowering her head again.","Why? Just a while ago, Xue Jingrui was still obedient to her, following her around. But now, just a few days later, he's married. One after another, why are they treating her like this?","Qi Yan was unwilling to accept it, her expression extremely unsightly. \"When did you get married?\"","A woman's sixth sense is keen, and Qi Ji was no exception. Although young and inexperienced in romance, she wasn't stupid. She clearly sensed something off between Xue Jingrui and this woman. Could they be a couple?","If so, did that make her the third party? Qi Ji felt a bit guilty. She didn't mean it. If she had known Xue Jingrui had a girlfriend, she definitely wouldn't have agreed to the arranged marriage.","\"Sister, I'm sorry,\" Qi Ji apologized sincerely.","But to Qi Yan, her expression and words could only be seen as flaunting and provoking her.","\"Don't apologize with that fake demeanor,\" Qi Yan said displeasedly.","Qi Ji felt a bit wronged. She really didn't know.","Suddenly, Xue Jingrui stood up and said to Qi Ji in a relatively gentle tone, \"Why are you apologizing?\"","\"She didn't do anything wrong, there's no need to apologize. It's you, what's with that expression?\" Xue Jingrui said to Qi Yan in a completely different tone from how he spoke to Qi Ji.","This was a tone Qi Yan never expected from him, as he had never been so harsh with her before. Just a few days apart, and he had changed so much towards her.","\"It's nothing, you should leave first. My wife and I still have to finish our meal,\" Xue Jingrui sat back down.","Qi Yan was so angry that she cried, pulling Gu Mengmeng to leave.","The atmosphere at the table was awkward.","\"You don't need to apologize, this is my issue,\" Xue Jingrui spoke first, breaking the eerie silence.","Qi Ji took a bite of the small piece of steak, not saying a word, thinking about how to handle this situation.","\"I'm sorry.\" Xue Jingrui apologized again. It was all his fault. This time, he truly saw Qi Yan's true colors, even more deeply than before.","He never made any promises to Qi Yan. He had only been silently protecting her before. What right did she have to accuse him and Qi Ji like a victim now? Chang Chiyuan was right, this kind of woman is truly too full of herself and terrifying.","Qi Ji still felt guilty. On the way back, she took the initiative to sit in the back seat.","Seeing this, Xue Jingrui said, \"Come sit in the front.\" He opened the passenger door and waited for Qi Ji to get in.","After a while, Qi Ji still didn't move. She was so obedient before, but now she was being so stubborn.","Xue Jingrui didn't force Qi Ji. He closed the car door and started the car.","\"Just drop me off first. I still have work left to do.\"","Upon hearing this, Xue Jingrui could only head back.","When they arrived home, Xue Jingrui's parents were a bit surprised that the two had returned so quickly from just going out for a meal.","Qi Ji was in low spirits and went straight upstairs to her room, locking herself in. She really didn't expect this outcome. If she had known about their relationship, she definitely wouldn't have agreed to the marriage yesterday, no matter what.","She wanted to confide in someone, but it seemed like she didn't have any friends.","Downstairs, Xue Jingrui's parents stopped him. His mother asked, \"What happened? Qi Ji seems a bit off. Did you two have a fight?\"","\"We ran into Qi Yan while eating,\" Xue Jingrui told the truth.","Upon hearing this, Ye Rong was furious and smacked Xue Jingrui's head. \"Did you relapse into your old habits again? What did I tell you before going out to eat?\"","Xue Kai was there too, disappointed and stamping his feet.","\"Mom, Dad, I'm going out for a bit. I have something to take care of,\" Qi Ji said as she came downstairs.","\"Okay, there's a driver at the entrance. Go slowly and be careful,\" Ye Rong reminded her.","\"Mm.\"","As soon as Qi Ji left, Xue Kai immediately told Xue Jingrui, \"Hurry up and go after her!\"","Xue Jingrui rushed out and grabbed Qi Ji's arm. \"I'm sorry.\"","\"It's me who should apologize. I want to go for a walk. Don't follow me.\"","Qi Ji hailed a cab. \"Where to, Miss?\"","\"Ziyue Manor.\"","Qi Ji suddenly thought of Shu Yi. She wanted to confide in someone, and just saw Shu Yi message her asking when she wanted to have her wedding dress tailored.","So Qi Ji casually asked about Xue Jingrui's and her situation.","Upon hearing it, Shu Yi realized this wasn't good. The poor, innocent girl, how could she possibly handle that dramatic woman? After reading the message, Shu Yi wanted to come over and teach Qi Ji how to confront the dramatic woman.","But Qi Ji said she would go to Shu Yi instead.","Xue Jingrui followed behind until the car reached Ziyue Manor, only then feeling reassured, truly worried that the young lady might do something rash if she felt too disheartened. He wanted to explain, but it seemed like this was just the reality - he used to like Qi Yan. Explaining would just be an excuse, wouldn't it?","When Qi Ji arrived at Shu Yi's place, Shu Yi felt a bit heartbroken seeing the wronged look on the young lady's face, wishing she could scold Xue Jingrui and kick Qi Yan a few times to vent.","\"Beautiful sister, I feel like I'm the third party,\" were Qi Ji's first words upon entering, shocking Shu Yi."]},{"number":94,"title":"Chapter 94: I'm Not Worried","paragraphs":["\"What do you mean by that? Did Xue Jingrui say something?\" Shu Yi sounded a bit indignant.","Qi Ji shook her head, \"At lunchtime, I met a woman named Qi Yan. She didn't look at me in a very friendly way, and I felt that Jingrui looked at her in an odd manner too. Were they in a relationship before?\" Qi Ji said as tears fell from her eyes.","Shu Yi pulled Qi Ji to sit on the sofa, took some tissue from the table to wipe Qi Ji's tears, and poured her a glass of water. \"Don't cry now, have some water. You didn't do anything wrong in this.\"","Qi Ji took the glass of water, drank a few sips, and her tears were wiped away as she obediently sat on the sofa.","\"Beautiful sister, you know about their history, right?\" Qi Ji's eyes were already big, and with the tears she had just shed, her eyes glistened like a doll's. If the situation wasn't so serious, Shu Yi would have wanted to pinch Qi Ji's cute little cheeks.","\"I don't know much, but it's enough. That Qi Yan was Xu Xiuhe's ex-girlfriend, who is the husband of one of the sisters from yesterday.\"","Qi Ji was stunned, clearly not expecting such a situation, wondering how things had become so complicated, even involving another sister.","\"It's like this, Qi Yan and Xue Jingrui were childhood friends. They met Xu Xiuhe in high school, and Qi Yan stubbornly pursued Xu Xiuhe for a long time until she finally got him. But in college, she became materialistic and dumped the poor Xu Xiuhe, going abroad. When she came back, Xu Xiuhe had lost interest in her. She couldn't accept it, often coming to show her presence, but Xue Jingrui liked her. She always knew but pretended not to notice and never responded to him. So, you see what's wrong, what did that b*tch say to you?\"","This information Shu Yi got from Chang Zhiyuan, while the more detailed parts were from her own observations.","Upon hearing this, Qi Ji thought for a moment and said, \"She glared at me. I thought she and Jingrui had been together, so I apologized to her. But she told me not to pretend to apologize.\"","\"That green tea b*tch, who is she pretending for? You should have slapped her. How dare she speak to you like that?\" Shu Yi felt angrier the more she thought about it, even wanting to confront that b*tch herself.","\"What about Xue Jingrui, what did he say?\" Shu Yi asked further.","\"He told Qi Yan to leave, then said sorry to me,\" Qi Ji replied.","\"Didn't he say anything else?\"","Qi Ji shook her head.","Shu Yi fell silent for a while, unsure of how to explain to Qi Ji that things between her and Xue Jingrui had progressed too quickly before she could fully comprehend the situation.","\"Look, don't take that b*tch seriously. If she bothers you again, let me know and I'll deal with her for you.\"","Xue Jingrui had been waiting outside for Qi Ji to come out.","\"Jingrui, what are you doing here?\" It turned out to be Chang Zhiyuan.","\"What about you? I'm waiting for my wife,\" Xue Jingrui answered.","Chang Zhiyuan didn't immediately realize Xue Jingrui was married, so he said, \"Why are you waiting for your wife at my future girlfriend's place?\"","Xue Jingrui looked puzzled.","That's when Chang Zhiyuan realized, \"Oh, Qi Ji.\"","\"What's going on? You just got your marriage license yesterday, how does it feel? Why aren't you going in if Qi Ji is inside? Don't tell me you've already been rejected on your first day as a newlywed, or did you not perform well last night and Qi Ji is unsatisfied?\" Chang Zhiyuan spoke bluntly without restraint as usual.","Xue Jingrui was used to Chang Zhiyuan's habit of teasing him.","\"Qi Ji and I had lunch together and ran into Qi Yan,\" Xue Jingrui explained truthfully.","\"Damn, that's juicy! What happened? Fill me in on the details!\"","Xue Jingrui gave Chang Zhiyuan a blank look. \"You just want to watch the drama unfold, don't you?\"","\"So did something really happen?\" Chang Zhiyuan couldn't wait to go inside and join the discussion.","When Shu Yi opened the door, she saw the two men standing motionless like pillars.","\"CEO Chang? What brings you here?\"","Chang Zhiyuan pushed Xue Jingrui forward, saying, \"Isn't he here to apologize?\"","Xue Jingrui peeked inside and saw Qi Ji sitting on the sofa, peeling a tangerine one by one.","\"Come in.\"","The two men's entrance made some noise, causing Qi Ji to pause peeling the tangerine and turn to see Xue Jingrui.","\"Qi Ji, it's my fault for not explaining things clearly to you. I was blind before and liked her,\" Xue Jingrui said.","Qi Ji didn't demand much. As long as they were married, she wouldn't interfere with other relationships out of principle. Now that she understood the situation, she was fine as long as she didn't intrude. With this thought, she felt relieved, \"It's okay, I was just angry at myself earlier for not figuring things out. I'm sorry for making you come all this way to find me.\"","Upon hearing this, Chang Zhiyuan was confused. What was going on? How did everything get resolved as soon as he arrived without him knowing the details?","\"Beautiful sister, I disturbed you when you had a guest over. I'll head back now. I was rude to my parents earlier when I left, so I'll go apologize to them.\" Qi Ji looked at Shu Yi, sweet and obedient like a doll. If the current issue wasn't so serious, Shu Yi would have wanted to pinch Qi Ji's cute little cheeks.","But was Chang Zhiyuan really her guest? If they left, it would just be her and Chang Zhiyuan, which felt too awkward.","Xue Jingrui was relieved to see Qi Ji return to her usual self, fortunately not staying angry. Otherwise, he might have been kicked out by his parents.","In the car, Qi Ji still chose to sit in the back seat. She had a strong sense of boundaries. Since Xue Jingrui had someone he liked, even if his taste was poor and she was a b*tch, Qi Ji had to respect Xue Jingrui and maintain a distance from him.","Xue Jingrui looked at Qi Ji through the rearview mirror several times. Didn't she just calm down? Why was she still sitting in the back seat?","\"Jingrui, I know marrying me was inevitable, but this involves two families, so divorce is not an option now. So don't worry, I absolutely won't interfere with anything you do. There's also a significant age gap between us, which isn't very appropriate. From now on, just treat me like a younger sister. I promise I won't hinder you.\" Qi Ji's voice was sweet.","Xue Jingrui's first reaction upon hearing this was: Does Qi Ji think he's old? He's not that old, is he? It's just a six or seven-year age gap.","\"Am I that old?\" Xue Jingrui couldn't help but ask as he turned his head.","\"No, no, Jingrui, focus on driving,\" Qi Ji was truly afraid of an accident happening.","Xue Jingrui was quite puzzled. So according to Qi Ji's words, he had married a younger sister?","\"It's my fault for not explaining things clearly to you. If you don't understand something in the future, just ask me directly, and I'll answer you. And as for Qi Yan, there's absolutely no possibility between us. You don't need to worry.\"","\"I'm not worried. At lunch, I just thought I had interfered with your relationship.\""]},{"number":95,"title":"Chapter 95: Five Dogs","paragraphs":["At Qinghe Villa, Shen Yin accompanied Zhengzheng as they read a book together. Recently, she had handed over most of her work to Wang Nannan, who was skilled and eager to learn. Wang Nannan understood things quickly after Shen Yin explained them.","Shen Yin had drawn several designs for furniture and was just waiting to contact a woodworking factory. After registering a trademark, she would be able to sell her designs.","\"Mommy, moon,\" said Zhengzheng, pointing at an illustration in the book depicting a bright, crescent moon in the blue night sky.","\"Yes, it's the moon. Zhengzheng, tell me if the moon is round or curved.\"","Zhengzheng studied the illustration and said, \"The moon is curved like a little boat.\"","Shen Yin was impressed that Zhengzheng could use such vivid descriptions at his age. \"And what does a round moon look like?\"","Zhengzheng thought for a moment, his eyes darting around, until he spotted a ball under the TV cabinet. \"A round moon is like a ball,\" he exclaimed, scampering over to grab the ball.","\"Mommy, I'm giving you the moon,\" Zhengzheng said, presenting the ball to Shen Yin.","Shen Yin accepted the ball with a smile. \"Thank you, Zhengzheng.\"","Delighted, Zhengzheng raised one foot and swayed like a penguin as he waddled over to Shen Yin and planted a kiss on her cheek.","\"Since Zhengzheng is being so good, should Mommy give you a little reward?\"","Zhengzheng's eyes lit up at the prospect of a reward. \"Yes!\"","\"Then how about learning this poem as your reward?\"","Not understanding what \"learning a poem\" meant, Zhengzheng assumed it was a game and grinned eagerly.","\"I'll recite one line, and you repeat after me, okay?\"","\"Okay.\"","Shen Yin held Zhengzheng close and opened the book. \"The bright moonlight before the bed,\" she said, pointing to each character.","\"The bright moonlight before the bed,\" Zhengzheng repeated.","\"Resembles frost upon the ground.\"","\"One-four frost upon the ground.\"","\"Zhengzheng, it's not 'one-four,' it's 'resembles.' Why don't you say 'resembles' instead of 'one-four'?\" Shen Yin gently corrected his pronunciation.","\"Mommy, why don't I say 'one-four'? What does 'one-four' mean?\" Zhengzheng asked, tilting his head.","\"Well, 'resembles frost upon the ground' means that the moonlight looks like frost on the ground. The moonlight by the bed seems like frost. Do you understand?\" Shen Yin tried to explain, unsure if Zhengzheng could fully comprehend the metaphor.","Zhengzheng nodded, looking somewhat puzzled. \"I understand. Zhengzheng wants to see frost.\"","Shen Yin was pleased by Zhengzheng's curiosity but pointed out, \"Zhengzheng, it's summer now, so there's no frost. We'll have to wait until late autumn. But we can see the moon tonight if you'd like.\"","\"Okay, bright moonlight before the bed.\"","\"It's 'The bright moonlight before the bed, resembles frost upon the ground. Raising my head to gaze at the bright moon, I lower it, thinking of my hometown.'\"","Shen Yin recited each line, and Zhengzheng repeated after her. Their peaceful moment was soon interrupted by Shen Yin's ringing phone.","\"Hello, Huan Huan, what's up?\"","\"Boss, there are suddenly a lot of dogs at the entrance.\"","\"Okay, I'll be right down.\"","Xu Xiuhe really did as he said - he had bought dogs, just like that.","Shen Yin carried Zhengzheng downstairs, and they could hear the barking as they approached the entrance. When she peeked outside, she saw a row of large dogs standing beside Huahua, their imposing presence quite intimidating.","\"Mommy, Huahua,\" Zhengzheng pointed at the group of dogs.","Shen Yin felt a little afraid. Huahua was obedient and gentle because they had raised him for so long, but the other four were unfamiliar. What if they hurt someone?","Shen Yin called Xu Xiuhe.","He answered immediately, \"Hello, wife, is something wrong?\"","\"No, but you really bought four more dogs?\"","\"Yes, like we agreed. We need more dogs to protect you and Zhengzheng.\"","\"I don't think that's necessary.\" Shen Yin felt confident in her ability to defend herself.","\"Consider them for Zhengzheng then, to keep him company.\"","\"But they haven't been around children before. What if they hurt Zhengzheng?\"","\"I carefully selected these four. They won't harm Zhengzheng. Just feed them for a few days, and they'll be as gentle as Huahua. Oh, and they don't have names yet. Why don't you name them?\"","\"Okay, then.\"","Shen Yin hung up and looked at the dogs, worried about how much food they would need to eat.","Seeing their eager expressions, she carried Zhengzheng upstairs. \"Huan Huan, come up and help me bring some things down.\"","Li Huanhuan remained on the third-floor landing, not entering but taking a peek at the cozy interior decoration of the CEO's home.","Shen Yin put Zhengzheng down and went to the kitchen, gathering some beef and pork before handing it to Li Huanhuan. She also brought bowls and plates from the landing.","\"Huan Huan, you go downstairs first. I'll be right there.\"","Holding the food in one hand and Zhengzheng's hand in the other, Shen Yin asked, \"Zhengzheng, can you go down the stairs?\"","\"Yes.\"","Although they moved slowly, Zhengzheng managed to navigate the stairs without being carried.","Shen Yin placed the bowls and plates at the entrance and had Li Huanhuan fill some bowls with water while she put the meat on the plates.","Soon, the dogs gathered around, happily devouring the meat.","\"Zhengzheng, let's name the four new dogs.\"","Zhengzheng stood at the entrance, one hand on his mouth as he pondered. \"Moon... Ball.\"","Shen Yin smiled. \"You have such a good memory. Can you recite the poem we just learned?\"","\"The bright moonlight before the bed, resembles frost upon the ground. Raising my head to gaze at the bright moon, I lower it, thinking of my hometown.\" Zhengzheng flawlessly recited the lines, only stumbling slightly on the pronunciation of \"resembles,\" but Shen Yin was impressed nonetheless.","\"Zhengzheng is so smart. Let's name the dog drinking water 'Moon,' and the one yawning can be 'Ball.' How's that?\"","\"Okay.\"","\"And for the other two, how about 'Zai Zai' and 'Shuang Shuang'?\"","\"Okay.\"","Zhengzheng was overjoyed to see so many dogs for the first time. He reached out to pet Moon, but Shen Yin was worried the unfamiliar dog might hurt him.","\"Zhengzheng, let's wait a few days before petting them. For now, you can only pet Huahua. Huahua, come here!\"","Obediently, Huahua trotted over and sat beside them, roughly at Zhengzheng's eye level. Zhengzheng stroked Huahua's head, then turned and beamed at Shen Yin."]},{"number":96,"title":"Chapter 96: Look at the Moon","paragraphs":["That evening, when Xu Xiuhe arrived at Qinghe Villa, he felt relieved to see a dog sitting at the entrance.","Shen Yin was in the kitchen, and when Xu Xiuhe went upstairs to the third floor, Shen Yin was just setting the dinner on the table.","\"I'm sorry I couldn't come back earlier to help you with the cooking, there was some business at the office that held me up.\"","\"It's fine, work is important, let's eat first,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Aren't you going to ask what the matter was?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Huh? Shen Yin didn't understand, she didn't know anything about his company's affairs, so what was the point of asking?","Xu Xiuhe walked to the living room and picked up Zhengzheng, heading to the washroom. \"Did Zhengzheng behave well this afternoon?\"","\"Yes, Zhengzheng fed Huahua, the moon, and the ball,\" Xu Yunzheng suddenly forgot the names of the other two dogs.","\"What else?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Xu Yunzheng thought for a while and said, \"And Zai Zai and Shuang Shuang.\"","\"Who named them?\"","\"Me and mom, mom even played a game with me and made me recite a poem.\"","\"Oh? What poem?\"","Xu Xiuhe glanced at Shen Yin outside, who didn't seem to notice the father-son conversation in the washroom.","\"The bright moon before my bed, its brightness seems like frost on the ground. Lifting my head, I see the bright moon; Lowering my head, I think of my home,\" Zhengzheng's voice was soft and sweet.","\"Zhengzheng is so great, he can already recite poems, tonight I'll reward Zhengzheng with some meat.\"","\"Mom said she's going to take Zhengzheng to see the moon tonight.\"","Xu Xiuhe carried Xu Yunzheng out of the washroom and placed him in the baby chair at the dining table.","Then he walked up to Shen Yin and said, \"You're taking Zhengzheng to see the moon tonight, but not your husband?\"","Xu Xiuhe's voice was soft and a little teasing as he leaned in close to Shen Yin. Shen Yin took a step back and said, \"Let's eat.\"","On the dining table were four dishes and one soup.","\"Really, you're not going to ask what the matter was?\"","Shen Yin shook her head. \"Our work is fundamentally different, I don't understand your work, so I don't ask. So I'm going to open another studio next, is that okay? Don't try to stop me.\"","\"Okay, but you have to make sure to rest and not overwork yourself.\"","\"Let's see the moon!\" Zhengzheng said, having finished most of his meal and looking up.","\"Okay, after you finish eating, the moon isn't out yet.\"","Zhengzheng looked out the window, blinked his eyes, and then turned back to ask, \"Why hasn't the moon come out yet?\"","\"Because the moon sleeps during the day, it only comes out to work after the sun sets.\"","\"But why does Zhengzheng only sleep at night?\"","This was a question Shen Yin really couldn't answer, so she turned to Xu Xiuhe, signaling him to respond.","\"Because you get sleepy at night, and the moon sleeps during the day when it's had enough sleep, understand?\"","\"Pfft.\" Shen Yin couldn't help but laugh, Xu Xiuhe sounded so serious in his explanation.","\"Then I want to sleep with the moon,\" Zhengzheng responded just as seriously.","\"No no, Zhengzheng has to go to bed early and wake up early to grow big and strong,\" Shen Yin definitely couldn't let Zhengzheng stay up late with the moon.","After dinner, Xu Xiuhe cleared the table as usual, and Shen Yin picked up Xu Yunzheng and wiped his mouth.","Holding Zhengzheng's hand, they went downstairs.","\"Aren't you waiting for me?\" Xu Xiuhe had just finished cleaning up and followed them downstairs.","The wind was gentle, and the night was clear. The streets of Qing River were full of lively atmosphere, with some elderly people on the benches fanning themselves.","On the street, there were many people taking an evening stroll, the pace of life here was already slow, and it was even more leisurely at night. The sound of flowing water was melodious and pleasant. Zhengzheng held Shen Yin's left hand and Xu Xiuhe's right hand, walking with a cheerful pace, attracting praises from the grandparents on the benches.","Zhengzheng was a bit proud of the praises, his mouth becoming sweetly smiley, making the grandparents on the benches burst into laughter. Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe felt a bit awkward, they didn't know these people, and their child was so familiar with strangers.","\"A family of three out for a stroll!\" an older auntie asked.","\"Yes, out for a stroll.\"","\"This child is so handsome, just like the little star I saw on TV the other day,\" another auntie said.","\"You know, he really does look like him, big eyes, so handsome, I've never seen such a handsome child before.\"","\"Of course, just look at the child's parents.\" As one of the aunties' gaze turned to Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe, the other grandparents sitting on the benches by the stream also looked over.","Xu Xiuhe was tall, and from their seated position they had to tilt their heads up to look at the couple. Xu Xiuhe had a refined and angular appearance, giving an impression of being no ordinary person.","\"Young man, do you have a younger brother? I have a daughter who just graduated.\"","Shen Yin lowered her head, trying to hold back her laughter.","Xu Xiuhe inadvertently noticed Shen Yin's struggle to keep herself from laughing, finding it quite adorable. He couldn't help but curve his lips slightly.","\"Auntie, my mom only had me.\"","\"My mom only had me too,\" Zhengzheng echoed.","\"Hahaha, child, you shouldn't call me auntie, you should call me grandma.\"","\"Hahaha\" The others couldn't help but laugh as well, this chubby child was too amusing.","\"With such good genes, you shouldn't waste them, child, have your parents ever talked about giving you a younger brother or sister?\"","Xu Yunzheng looked up, glanced at Shen Yin, then turned to look at Xu Xiuhe and asked, \"Dad, are you going to give me a younger brother or sister?\"","Xu Xiuhe squatted down: \"Zhengzheng is still too young, in a few years you can have a younger brother or sister. Say goodbye to grandma and grandpa, we should go now.\"","\"Bye bye grandma and grandpa!\" Zhengzheng waved his little hand.","\"Bye!\"","After the family of three left, the grandparents were still discussing animatedly.","\"Zhengzheng, look, the moon is out,\" Shen Yin pointed to the moon in the west.","Xu Yunzheng immediately looked up, seeing the full moon suspended in the sky.","\"The moon is round, like a ball,\" Zhengzheng pointed at the moon, his voice sweet and soft.","\"Yes, like a ball.\"","\"Are you tired from walking?\" Xu Xiuhe asked, since Zhengzheng had been walking for a long time and had just been playing a bit, he was probably tired.","Zhengzheng nodded.","Xu Xiuhe picked up Zhengzheng, and despite Zhengzheng's restlessness, twisting and turning in his arms, Xu Xiuhe's strong physique was able to hold him securely.","It wasn't long before Zhengzheng fell asleep.","Walking beside Xu Xiuhe, Shen Yin saw that Zhengzheng had fallen asleep, and suggested, \"Let's head back, carrying him like this while walking will tire you out.\"","\"I won't get tired, you know how strong I am,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","Shen Yin thought of that night, blushed, and didn't want to talk to Xu Xiuhe anymore, turning to walk back without waiting for him.","\"Slow down, I'm still carrying the child, wait for me,\" Xu Xiuhe called out softly from behind.","But Shen Yin could still hear him, and slowed her pace, saying, \"Didn't you just say you were strong? Now you can't even keep up?\"","Xu Xiuhe caught up and said, \"Hmm? Want to try again tonight to see how good it is?\""]},{"number":97,"title":"Chapter 97: The Moon is Beautiful","paragraphs":["Shen Yin still had her head down.","\"Today is our second date. Let's watch the moon together.\"","Shen Yin's heart raced again. During the Dasheng Dynasty, the moon represented purity, completeness, and fidelity in love. Generally, when a man and a woman watch the moon together, it carries the meaning of being together for life. Because in Dasheng, women's status was not like today, and love could often not be expressed directly. Personal feelings were only conveyed through music, poetry, and the moon. So the moon became a symbol of lovers, a witness to love. It was deeply meaningful and thought-provoking.","So did Xu Xiuhe know what it meant for a man and a woman to watch the moon together?","\"The moonlight is beautiful tonight,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Shen Yin nodded in agreement.","\"Now you say it too.\"","\"Say what?\" Shen Yin did not understand. Were they supposed to compose a poem about the moon on the spot?","\"Say the moonlight is beautiful tonight.\"","\"The moonlight is beautiful tonight,\" Shen Yin said.","\"The breeze is gentle too,\" Xu Xiuhe replied, then laughed. This was the first time Shen Yin had seen Xu Xiuhe laugh like this.","Xu Xiuhe's laughter was youthful, like that of an 18- or 19-year-old boy. There was no trace of his usual coldness, only a pure, heartfelt joy.","Shen Yin was a bit puzzled. She had just said the moonlight was beautiful, so why was he so delighted, acting like a carefree youth?","After hearing the satisfactory answer, Xu Xiuhe walked forward, and this time it was Shen Yin who followed behind, baffled.","Shen Yin took out her phone and searched, \"the moonlight is beautiful tonight.\" The screen displayed a lot of information about this popular phrase: it was a romantic expression, a translation from a Japanese love phrase, and a literary way of saying \"I love you,\" originating from Natsume Soseki's work.","So just now, Xu Xiuhe was so happy because Shen Yin had said the equivalent of \"I love you\" in a gentle, subtle way?","\"What's wrong? Are you tired too?\" Xu Xiuhe noticed that Shen Yin was walking slower and turned around to ask.","Shen Yin caught up to him. \"That just now didn't count, I didn't know what it meant.\"","\"You don't need to know, as long as I understand,\" Xu Xiuhe replied, still very happy, as if all the gloom had dissipated.","Shen Yin thought to herself: She didn't say it, she didn't know. Even now, she still didn't understand how this workaholic, straightforward man could say such romantic words so naturally and know all these internet terms.","\"How do you know these, these phrases?\" Shen Yin asked in a more tactful way.","\"I'm just naturally gifted.\" Xu Xiuhe would never admit that since hearing Xiao Li'er's advice, he had read several romance novels and boss novels. Now he dared to say that he was better than Chang Zhiyuan, no, he had already surpassed Chang Zhiyuan. Chang Zhiyuan still hadn't made a move.","\"That just now didn't count,\" Shen Yin said, walking beside him, her voice soft and hesitant.","But Xu Xiuhe still heard it.","When they got home, Xu Xiuhe bathed Jingjing, and Shen Yin went downstairs, closed the door, and checked the first floor before going up to the third floor.","Xu Xiuhe was bathing Jingjing, and Shen Yin consciously went to another bathroom to take a shower. When she returned to the room, she found Jingjing was not there.","She suddenly realized that the bed in the next room had been made by Xu Xiuhe the day before, and sure enough, Jingjing was sleeping soundly on the small bed.","\"Darling, are you done with your shower?\"","Shen Yin turned around and saw Xu Xiuhe standing behind her, shirtless, with water dripping from his head.","Shen Yin took a step back.","\"Your hair is still dripping wet. Come to the bedroom, I'll dry it for you,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Shen Yin found that the freshly bathed Xu Xiuhe looked especially handsome, and his voice was more magnetic than during the day. Inexplicably, Shen Yin obediently followed him into the bedroom.","Xu Xiuhe held a towel, \"Sit down first.\"","Shen Yin sat on the sofa by the bed, and Xu Xiuhe walked up to her, wrapped the dry towel around her hair, and said, \"Wait a moment, I'll get the hair dryer.\"","Xu Xiuhe retrieved the hair dryer from the cabinet under the bathroom vanity and returned to the bedroom, approaching Shen Yin again.","\"I'll do it myself.\" Shen Yin had never had anyone else dry her hair before, and in Dasheng, people usually let their hair air dry.","\"Your hair is long, it's inconvenient for you to do it yourself. From now on, I'll always dry your hair for you.\"","Xu Xiuhe turned on the hair dryer, tested the temperature with his hand to ensure it was suitable, and then started blowing Shen Yin's hair.","His movements were gentle, and Shen Yin could feel his fingers caressing her hair.","Xu Xiuhe was not wearing a shirt, and Shen Yin couldn't help but steal glances at his physique, which was truly impressive.","To divert her attention, Shen Yin said, \"Xu Xiuhe, I feel like you've changed a lot.\"","\"In what way?\"","\"You used to always have a cold, serious expression, never smiled, and were kind of scary. But now you seem different.\"","Xu Xiuhe smiled, \"When you like someone, it shows. The coldness was for the others, but for you, it's different.\"","\"So your changes towards me are also quite significant.\"","\"Well, I didn't like you before.\"","Shen Yin didn't expect Xu Xiuhe to be so direct.","\"I'm done.\" Xu Xiuhe ran his fingers through Shen Yin's hair, feeling its smoothness, and was reluctant to leave.","Shen Yin's hair quality had improved significantly since she arrived in this world. She had been living a regular life and taking various supplements, even adding some medicinal ingredients to her shampoo.","\"Actually, you shouldn't have washed your hair just now,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"Why?\"","\"Because you'll need to wash it again later.\"","Xu Xiuhe put down the hair dryer, picked up Shen Yin, and laid her on the bed, then lay down beside her.","This time, Shen Yin did not resist, as she had quite enjoyed the previous experience. But she also didn't take the initiative, as the lead was still in Xu Xiuhe's hands.","Xu Xiuhe kissed Shen Yin's lips, and this kiss was particularly gentle.","Xu Xiuhe's lips gradually moved downward, and with both of them freshly bathed and lightly dressed, the atmosphere became...","Amid Shen Yin's trembling, Xu Xiuhe asked, \"Darling, is the moonlight beautiful tonight?\"","\"It's... beautiful,\" Shen Yin replied in a slightly shaky voice.","\"Then does that thing you said earlier count?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"It... counts,\" Shen Yin said, a bit uncomfortable.","Xu Xiuhe got the answer he wanted and said, \"Wait a moment, after all, it's you who doesn't want to have a child too early.\"","Xu Xiuhe's voice was also a bit unsteady. After putting on protection, Shen Yin could no longer hold back and let out several soft moans.","\"Okay, let me in,\" Xu Xiuhe soothed.","Hearing this, Shen Yin tried to relax.","\"Can I?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","At this moment, Shen Yin suddenly realized the meaning of Xu Xiuhe's words. Earlier, he had said on the street that he would let her try it tonight."]},{"number":98,"title":"Chapter 98: Who to Introduce","paragraphs":["\"Hold me tight.\"","Shen Yin did as she was told, tightly embracing Xu Xiuhe's upper body, but she had no strength left.","Throughout, it was Xu Xiuhe who was in control.","\"I can't anymore, I'm tired,\" Shen Yin said in a still broken voice.","To Xu Xiuhe, Shen Yin's words now sounded coy, and he not only didn't slow down, but instead increased his pace.","\"It's over.\" Xu Xiuhe took a deep breath, his panting a bit loud.","Moonlight streamed in through the window, making the bed, the blanket, and the sheets look so gentle. A pool of moonlight, a lake of spring water.","After a few positions, Shen Yin lay on the bed.","\"I'm sorry, my dear wife, I really didn't mean to.\" Xu Xiuhe coaxed her.","Shen Yin turned her head to the side.","Xu Xiuhe scooped up Shen Yin and carried her into the bathroom.","Afterwards, the two lay on the bed.","Shen Yin was truly too tired, and fell asleep in Xu Xiuhe's embrace.","Early the next morning, Shen Yin came out of the bedroom, and Xu Xiuhe had already prepared breakfast.","\"Aren't you going to ask me why I came back late yesterday?\"","\"Why?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Have you ever seen the lively young assistant in the executive assistant department?\"","Shen Yin thought for a while, and there was indeed one. But why would Xu Xiuhe tell her, could it be that this young lady liked Xu Xiuhe, and Xu Xiuhe was showing off in front of her?","\"Mm, I remember, a pretty cute young lady.\"","\"This weekend, I plan to hold a matchmaking event at Qingfeng Mingyue, and all the single employees under Remote Flag can sign up, so I signed up all the young ladies from the assistant team.\"","Hearing this, Shen Yin was shocked, she never would have thought Xu Xiuhe was this kind of person.","\"Then what?\" Shen Yin started to get curious, because she didn't know what other outrageous things Xu Xiuhe might do.","\"Then this one called Yang Mo, after getting off work, came to my office to see me.\" Xu Xiuhe paused for a bit.","\"She asked me to cancel her registration. She told me she has a boyfriend.\"","\"You just signed them up without asking?\" Shen Yin said incredulously.","\"I had Liu Assistant compile the registration, and the personal information of the assistant department members was already listed that way in his records.\"","\"Maybe she just got a boyfriend recently.\" Shen Yin replied.","\"Later, another assistant came in, one I'm more familiar with, who I've often gone out with for various occasions, I think her name was Zhen Zhen, and she also told me she has a boyfriend.\"","Shen Yin really felt that Xu Xiuhe was a bit abnormal now, what CEO cares about his assistants' love lives every day.","\"So then what?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I asked to see their boyfriends' photos.\" Shen Yin was at a loss for words, \"Why are you always so concerned about other people's love lives?\"","Xu Xiuhe didn't answer, \"They said they didn't have any, so I told them to get their boyfriends to provide the photos.\"","Shen Yin facepalmed, she felt that Xu Xiuhe would be better suited to opening a marriage introduction agency, just with this spirit of asking employees for their partners' photos, he could make the marriage introduction business thrive.","\"Later they brought the photos, guess who it was?\"","Shen Yin really didn't know, she wasn't part of their company.","\"Who was it?\"","\"It was each other.\"","Wait, Shen Yin digested this information for a bit. Another couple.","\"What happened next?\" Shen Yin was still quite interested in the subsequent developments.","\"I then canceled their registrations, and promised to keep it confidential for them.\"","\"Mm, that's good.\" Shen Yin replied.","While they were chatting, they had already finished breakfast, \"Go to work first, and when Zhengzheng wakes up, I'll prepare something for her to eat. This morning I'll go to the hospital to see my dad, and this afternoon I'll go to register the trademark for the furniture studio.\"","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe said, \"Have Liu Assistant accompany you this afternoon. I'm afraid it will be inconvenient for you to take Zhengzheng by yourself.\"","\"Okay.\"","At the hospital, Shen's father was already able to get out of bed. When Shen Yin arrived with Zhengzheng, Fang Yue started again: \"Didn't I say you shouldn't come? The hospital is not a good place.\"","\"We're just coming to check on you, how have you two been doing recently?\"","Fang Yue had been pampered by Shen Tianzheng all her life, and in this period of caring for Shen Tianzheng, she could clearly be seen to have more fatigue on her face, and more white hair on her head.","\"About the same, I had a checkup yesterday, the doctor said I can be discharged in a couple more days.\"","Seeing that Shen Yin had brought Zhengzheng, Shen Tianzheng smiled at them, then returned to his own hospital bed.","Shen Yin sat on the sofa outside, and Fang Yue sat down as well, Zhengzheng was running around on the floor. \"Grandma, look at the sunflowers.\"","Zhengzheng took out a bunch of sunflowers that Shen Yin had just bought. Fang Yue smiled, \"Although you've changed a lot, one thing hasn't changed, which is that you still like sunflowers.\"","This was quite a coincidence, Shen Yin didn't know why the original host liked sunflowers, but she liked sunflowers purely because not only do they bloom large and brilliantly, making people feel good, but they are also edible. She planned to plant the whole courtyard of Ziyue Manor full of sunflowers when she got back.","\"Yinyin, actually your father has always been worried about you and your brother. Now that he sees you living well, he has fulfilled one of his wishes. Next it's your brother's turn. The check-up shows his body has recovered, but who knows about cancer, if the cancer cells relapse and spread again one day, he really can't have surgery again. These few days, he hasn't said much, but I understand him, he's been thinking about arranging his will after he's gone.\" Fang Yue's voice was very soft, and her eyes started to shed tears again.","\"Mom, don't worry, it'll be fine, listen to the doctor, he can recover.\"","\"Mm mm, let's not talk about this anymore, let's talk about something happy. I'm planning to arrange a blind date for your brother after your father is discharged, so your father can rest assured.\"","\"Okay.\" Shen Yin responded. In fact, her memories of Shen Lv were not bad, although he would sometimes bully Shen Yin, but he was still very fond of her.","\"You've been here for a while, take Zhengzheng and go back.\" Fang Yue said.","Shen Yin realized that every time she came, she was chased away by Fang Yue, who didn't want her to stay in the hospital too long. If possible, no one wants to go to the hospital.","Shen Yin naturally agreed, she wasn't afraid, but Zhengzheng was still young, with weaker resistance than adults.","When Shen Yin took out her phone to check the time, she happened to see the message Shu Yi had sent her.","[Yinyin, something bad has happened, I'm on the hot search, or rather, we're on the hot search.]","Shen Yin didn't reply, but directly opened Weibo, the hot search was \"Top Actress's Horse Riding Outfit\".","Shen Yin returned to WeChat and replied, [What's wrong, this hot search doesn't have any bad effect.]","[But this isn't me, it's you, I always feel this praise should belong to you, but now it's arranged on my head, which isn't quite right.]","[It's fine, I'm not in the entertainment industry anyway, I don't need this kind of praise. By the way, have you practiced the martial arts I taught you last time?]"]},{"number":99,"title":"Chapter 99: Seal","paragraphs":["[\"I've practiced enough, I think I can now take on a woman single-handedly.\"]","Shen Yin was speechless.","[\"Then do you want to challenge me?\"]","Shu Yi didn't dare, as she knew Shen Yin's abilities.","When Shen Yin returned to Qinghe Villa, she played with Xu Yunzheng for a while before preparing lunch. At the Yuangroup, Xu Xiuhe summoned Liu Bo to his office again and asked him about the progress of the marriage banquet preparations and whether the detailed plan was ready.","Liu Bo was truly surprised that the president was serious and asked him for the plan. Fortunately, he was diligent in his work and efficient in handling matters, so the plan was already finalized.","After receiving a satisfactory answer, Xu Xiuhe told Liu Bo to send him the plan later.","Liu Bo readily agreed.","\"This afternoon, go to Qinghe Villa and take my wife and child to the industrial and commercial bureau.\" Then, as if Xu Xiuhe had thought of something, he said, \"Never mind, just handle the remaining documents, I'll go back myself.\"","Liu Bo looked at the pile of documents on the desk, feeling a bit panicked. The president was becoming more and more unreasonable, having just arrived and his butt was still warm, and he was already leaving.","It must be said that Xu Xiuhe timed his arrival at Qinghe Villa perfectly. When he got home, Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng were having their meal.","\"Mommy, Yunzheng got up this morning and slept in his own room,\" Xu Yunzheng said, pointing to the bedroom next to theirs.","\"That's because Yunzheng wanted to sleep in the small bed last night, and your father carried you to that room,\" Xu Xiuhe said, changing his shoes in the stairwell.","Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng both turned their heads: \"Daddy.\"","\"Have you missed me?\" Xu Xiuhe said the words to Xu Yunzheng, but his eyes were on Shen Yin.","\"Yes.\"","Shen Yin: \"Why are you back?\"","\"The company isn't busy.\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","Shen Yin was now a bit suspicious. The news online about him being a workaholic and a young outstanding talent in Rong City seemed to be false. She didn't see any of that. Just based on the fact that he went to inquire about his employees' personal relationships, Shen Yin felt that Xu Xiuhe did not match the image of a president.","Shen Yin half-jokingly, half-seriously said, \"Your company, the employees earn money to support you, right?\"","After washing his hands, Xu Xiuhe went to the kitchen to serve the food and sat down at the table, saying, \"I suppose so, but my wife is very capable, she can support me.\"","\"Alright, let's just eat.\"","Xu Yunzheng thought for a while, but still couldn't remember when he had said he wanted to sleep in the small bed last night. His little face was full of confusion. \"Yunzheng can't remember saying he wanted to sleep in the small bed last night. Yunzheng wants to sleep in the big bed with Daddy and Mommy tonight.\"","Xu Yunzheng said this in one breath three times, and Shen Yin was afraid the child would get mad at himself. She glanced at Xu Xiuhe: \"You're already a grown-up, why are you still bullying your son?\" Shen Yin picked up a piece of green vegetable and put it in Xu Yunzheng's bowl.","Xu Yunzheng's eyes were still on the meat in the plate, reluctantly eating the green vegetable.","\"Are you saying I'm old?\" Xu Xiuhe asked seriously.","Shen Yin didn't say anything.","\"I'm only four years older than you. Xue Jingrui is six years older than Qi Ji, and Qi Ji doesn't think Xue Jingrui is old,\" Xu Xiuhe replied, not knowing that Qi Ji now treats Xue Jingrui like a sister.","\"How are they doing? They said they'd come to me to have their wedding attire custom-made, but they still haven't come. Is Xue Jingrui still interested in Qi Yan?\" Shen Yin didn't finish the question, but was observing Xu Xiuhe's expression, after all, Qi Yan was his ex-girlfriend.","\"He probably doesn't like her anymore. Of course, I lost interest in her a long time ago. I was young back then, so I might not have been able to tell if it was real love.\" Xu Xiuhe looked very serious, almost as if he was taking an oath.","\"I didn't ask you,\" Shen Yin's expression was a bit uncomfortable. Xu Xiuhe's response made her seem overly concerned.","\"But I still have to answer you. I heard from Zhi Yuan that Jingrui and Qi Ji went out to eat and ran into Qi Yan, and Qi Yan acted like Jingrui's girlfriend, and Qi Ji even suspected that he had interfered in someone else's relationship.\"","Shen Yin also knew about this. Shu Yi had told her, and she had told her a lot, so she probably knew more details than Xu Xiuhe, especially Shu Yi's criticism of Qi Yan, which she felt could be made into a book.","When Xu Xiuhe drove Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng to the industrial and commercial bureau, it was the hottest time of the day. Xu Xiuhe took out a large umbrella from the car and stood next to Shen Yin.","Worried about Shen Yin's health, Xu Xiuhe picked up Xu Yunzheng, holding the child with one hand and holding the umbrella with the other. In fact, he could have simply asked someone else to help handle the production license, but Shen Yin didn't want to bother others and didn't trust anyone else, so he just accompanied her.","Xu Xiuhe accompanied her the entire time. In the end, the documents were submitted to the staff for stamping. After waiting for a long time, they still hadn't gotten the documents back.","Just as Xu Xiuhe was about to call the head of the industrial and commercial bureau, the person came out and said that the furniture factory did not qualify for the production license, the reason being that the provided information was incomplete.","Xu Xiuhe didn't know when getting a certificate had become so strict.","Xu Xiuhe made a phone call. Shen Yin didn't know who he called, but soon the person responsible for stamping the documents hurriedly came out, apologizing profusely, serving tea and water. They also stamped the documents.","Xu Xiuhe's tone was not very good, and now everyone in the office recognized Xu Xiuhe, and no one dared to speak.","On the way back, Shen Yin thanked Xu Xiuhe. Shen Yin didn't understand, thinking it was because her documents were incomplete that the industrial and commercial bureau didn't issue the license, but Xu Xiuhe knew that with the materials they had, they should have been able to get the license easily, unless someone had interfered.","\"Hey, look up the details of the person in charge of the industrial and commercial bureau and the staff on duty today.\"","A few minutes later, a bunch of messages were sent to Xu Xiuhe's phone. He looked at them, and his expression became even worse.","\"Make it so that her studio can't get any business.\" Xu Xiuhe said on the phone.","Shen Yin didn't know what was going on, only hearing the studio asking, \"Did something happen?\"","\"No, don't worry about it.\" Xu Xiuhe replied, but in his heart he was thinking that this might still be too light, as he still had a lot of leverage.","\"Xiuhe, can I discuss another thing with you?\" Shen Yin said cautiously.","\"Go ahead.\"","\"I'm going to Yang City tomorrow. I found a furniture craftsman whose family has been woodworkers for generations, and his skills are quite exquisite. I want to invite him to do the work, but he's usually not easy to get and has a very peculiar personality, so I want to go there in person to invite him.\"","\"How long will you be gone?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Shen Yin was still unsure if one day would be enough, so she replied, \"I'm not sure yet, maybe one day.\""]},{"number":100,"title":"Chapter 100: Kang Guopeng","paragraphs":["\"I'll come with you,\" Xu Xiuhe suggested.","\"The company still needs you, and it's not convenient for you to leave. Yang City is not far, it's only a three-hour drive. Why don't you take Zhengzheng, and I'll try to come back in the afternoon,\" Shen Yin replied.","Xu Xiuhe considered for a few seconds and agreed. He now had a slight understanding of Shen Yin, and once she decided on something, he couldn't change it.","On the way back, Shen Yin kept comforting Zhengzheng.","\"Zhengzheng, would you like to go with your father tomorrow? Mommy has something to do and needs to go out for a day.\" Shen Yin patiently coaxed. She had originally wanted to take Zhengzheng with her, but Zhengzheng was too young, and she was worried it would be inconvenient to bring him to Yang City, where he had never been.","Zhengzheng was happily playing with his own fingers, but when he heard what Shen Yin said, he looked up and said, \"Wherever Mommy goes, Zhengzheng goes too.\"","Shen Yin's heart softened, and she almost agreed to take Zhengzheng with her, but Xu Xiuhe spoke up first.","\"Zhengzheng, Mommy has to go to work, and she won't be back until the afternoon. Don't you like your father? Why don't you want to go with him?\"","This worked well on Xu Yunzheng, who immediately said, \"I like Daddy. Mommy, please come back soon.\"","\"Okay, Mommy promises Zhengzheng that I'll come back early tomorrow.\"","Early the next morning, Shen Yin got up and laid out the clothes Zhengzheng was going to wear today, so that Xu Xiuhe could dress him as soon as he woke up.","\"Maybe I should go with you after all. I'm still a little worried about you going alone.\" Xu Xiuhe suggested again, but was ultimately rejected by Shen Yin.","\"You take care of Zhengzheng. Zhengzheng hasn't woken up yet, and there's nothing to worry about. I have navigation, money, and I can even fight off any intruders if needed. I'm leaving now. If anything happens to Zhengzheng, give me a call.\"","Shen Yin had already found the address of the carpenter online, but she wasn't sure if she could actually find him or convince him to help her with the furniture.","On the way, Shen Yin kept thinking about what she would say. The online information said this Master Kang was over 50 years old, had an eccentric personality, and generally didn't take on new projects, as he only focused on teaching his two apprentices.","This was exactly what Shen Yin was counting on, as the rarity of his services made him highly sought after. She had already prepared several draft contracts, in case she couldn't hire him, she could try to collaborate with him instead.","Shen Yin drove slowly, following the navigation. By around noon, she arrived in Yang City.","Yang City was a bit different from Rong City. Shen Yin's impression of Yang City was that it was hotter, even hotter than Rong City. The scorching sun beat down as she followed the navigation and drove through the entire city to the outskirts.","After several more turns according to the navigation, she parked in front of a courtyard.","By this point, Shen Yin could clearly feel that the location was quite remote, already starting to have a more rural feel.","Shen Yin got out of the car, opened her umbrella, and walked into the courtyard.","There was a well in the courtyard, half of it was filled with vegetables, and the other half had a shed, with a lot of wood materials and various tools Shen Yin didn't recognize.","\"Auntie, hello, is this Master Kang's place?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Master Kang?\" An older woman who was picking vegetables in the courtyard looked up.","Shen Yin just realized that \"Master Kang\" might not be the right way to address him.","\"Auntie, is this Kang Guopeng's home?\" In fact, Shen Yin was already certain she had the right place after seeing the wood materials in the courtyard, but she still chose to ask politely.","The older woman stopped her work and stood up, looking at Shen Yin and asking, \"Miss, do you have something to discuss with our family?\"","Shen Yin approached, and since she was taller than the woman, the umbrella also shielded the woman from the sun.","The older woman's eyes were full of confusion as she carefully examined Shen Yin, who clearly wasn't an ordinary person, and she didn't recognize this kind of person.","\"Auntie, I'm here to discuss some business with Mr. Kang Guopeng,\" Shen Yin answered.","\"Okay, come in with me,\" the woman led Shen Yin into the bungalow.","The house was very clean, and all the furniture was made of solid wood. Out of politeness, Shen Yin only took a brief look around without exploring further.","\"Dad, someone is here to see you,\" the woman shouted loudly.","\"Who is it? Didn't I say not to let them in? I'm not taking on any more furniture work now,\" a man's voice came from inside the house.","Soon, a man came out holding a cup of tea.","When Shen Yin saw Kang Guopeng come out, she was momentarily stunned. He looked so much like her late grandfather, as if he were ten years younger. Shen Yin's mind immediately flashed to the scenes of her grandfather teaching her martial arts, and her eyes became a little moist, almost letting out a cry.","\"Dad, there's a young lady here who wants to discuss business with you, not about taking on any furniture work,\" the older woman said.","\"Miss, what can I do for you?\" Kang Guopeng asked.","Shen Yin composed herself and said, \"I'm from Rong City, and I'd like to invite you to be an operations consultant for our furniture workshop.\"","Kang Guopeng didn't answer the question, but instead took a sip of his tea and said, \"How did you know about me?\"","\"I saw a post online that said you have exceptional craftsmanship and unique artistry in your furniture,\" Shen Yin answered honestly.","\"I haven't done furniture work for a long time. You should go back,\" Kang Guopeng replied.","Shen Yin didn't expect Kang Guopeng to refuse so directly, and without even giving a reason. The man was clearly eccentric.","\"Mr. Kang, would you at least take a look at some information about the furniture workshop?\" Shen Yin took out the materials she had prepared.","Kang Guopeng shook his head and went back inside.","Shen Yin was stunned. There was no room for negotiation at all? She had prepared several proposals, but it seemed like she would have to leave just like that.","Shen Yin felt frustrated. This man not only looked like her late grandfather, but his temperament was also the same - he would turn and leave at the slightest disagreement.","Shen Yin sighed, picked up the umbrella on the ground, and walked out of the bungalow.","In the courtyard, the older woman was squatting in the shade, processing the vegetables she had just picked. Seeing Shen Yin leave, she stood up and said a little embarrassedly, \"Miss, would you like to stay for lunch? It's noon, and you've come all this way. Our family has an eccentric personality, please don't take it personally.\"","Shen Yin felt a little awkward. This was the countryside, and she didn't know where she would have her lunch.","\"Okay, Auntie, if it's not too much trouble,\" Shen Yin agreed."]}]);
